1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
﻿Ayu: "Alright, everybody! Are you having a good time?!"

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Crowd: "YEAH!!!"

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Ayu: "Yay! Hearing that makes me super happy! Thank you for your continued support, from the bottom of my heart! ☆"

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Judge: "And that's game to Williams! She's taken the championship! Williams wins, with a score of 6-2! Williams wins!"

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Hazel: "Alright!"

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Ayu: "Thank you, everybody! Thank you so much!"

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Ayu: "When I was still a beginner, I knew I couldn't afford to take a single fan of mine for granted. Your love and affection meant the world to me!"

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Ayu: "You cheered me on, so I knew I had to keep going! I didn't want to let any of you down! If I did that, I wouldn't be able to call myself an idol ever again!"

9
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Ayu: "My path was a hard one, but I never gave up! I devoted my life - my very soul - to the pursuit of being an idol..."

10
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Ayu: "And now, I've finally made it!"

11
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Judge: "Can anything stop this woman? Her string of victories is unparalleled!"

12
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Judge: "She's been playing professional tennis for less than two years, but she's already made great waves in the sporting world!"

13
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Judge: "I think Hazel will be somebody to keep your eye on in the future!"

14
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Ayu: "I'm standing on this huge stage, in front of thousands and thousands of people, and I've never felt more humbled in my life!"

15
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Ayu: "You guys are my light, my life, and my love! My heart belongs to every single one of you... and so, I'm going to dedicate this next song to you!"

16
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Ayu: "This is my latest single, Overflowing Feelings! Let's GO! ☆"

17
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Hazel: "I did it! I won! I can't believe it!"

18
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Hazel: "Thank you for supporting me, everybody! I love you all!"

19
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Hazel: "I'm gonna keep doing my very best!"

20
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Crowd: "A-yu, A-yu, A-yu!!!"

21
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Judge: "Let's all applaud Hazel Williams, Japan's up-and-coming prodigy!"

22
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:59,000
Hiroki: "Alright... I think I've had enough of this."

23
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,000
Ayu: "H-Hey! What's the big idea?!"

24
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Hazel: "Yeah, Hiroki! What're you doing? I was watchin' that!"

25
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:08,000
Hiroki: "Oh, were you? Were you really?"

26
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:11,000
*I plant my hands on my hips, unimpressed.*

27
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:17,000
*Both Ayu and Hazel are sitting in front of the TV in my small, cramped apartment.*

28
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:23,000
*They were fighting for the remote control about two seconds ago, until I decided to step in.*

29
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:30,000
*I snatched up the remote from Hazel's clutches before Ayu could, and now the TV screen is blank.*

30
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:39,000
*I was getting sick of them swapping the channel over and over. I might have gotten a headache if things had carried on like that.*

31
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:47,000
Hiroki: "You weren't really trying to watch the TV. You just wanted to watch yourselves and your own accomplishments."

32
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:49,000
Hiroki: "Good grief..."

33
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:51,000
*I sigh, still clutching the remote.*

34
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:54,000
*I don't plan to give it back in a hurry.*

35
00:02:54,000 --> 00:03:01,000
*With great power comes great responsibility, and neither of them are mature enough to handle it.*

36
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:09,000
Hiroki: "What are the odds that they'd be airing one of your concerts at the same time as one of Hazel's tournaments..."

37
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:12,000
Hiroki: "This is like a recipe for disaster."

38
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:14,000
Ayu: "My concert was not a disaster!"

39
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:16,000
*Ayu puffs her cheeks out in a pout.*

40
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:19,000
Ayu: "It was wonderful! Highly acclaimed, in fact!"

41
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:26,000
Hazel: "And my tournament wasn't a disaster, either. Didn't you see how good I did? I was, like, super amazin'!"

42
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:31,000
Hazel: "Don't you wanna watch even more? It only gets better: I promise!"

43
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:35,000
Ayu: "No, he doesn't! Hiroki wants to watch me perform!"

44
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:38,000
Hazel: "No, he wants to watch me play!"

45
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:40,000
Ayu: "No, he wants to watch me!"

46
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,000
Hazel: "ME!"

47
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:44,000
Ayu: "Alright, fine! Let's settle this like adults!"

48
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,000
Ayu: "Hiroki!"

49
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:47,000
*Ayu stabs a finger in my direction.*

50
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:49,000
Ayu: "Who would you rather watch?"

51
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:51,000
Hiroki: "So, I get a choice?"

52
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:54,000
*That's unusually considerate, coming from Ayu.*

53
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:59,000
*It's a shame it's too late now. I mean, I already have a headache.*

54
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:04,000
Ayu: "If you like. Now, hurry up! I'm a busy woman, and I don't have all day!"

55
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:06,000
Hiroki: "Alright, alright. Fine..."

56
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:07,000
*I heave a sigh.*

57
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:15,000
*Though I have a "choice" in this matter (supposedly), I don't think Ayu or Hazel are at all interested in my opinion.*

58
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:18,000
*In that case, does it really matter what I say?*

59
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:20,000
*...Oh well. Let's give it a shot.*

60
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:22,000
*I guess I'd rather watch you, Ayu.":

61
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:25,000
Hiroki: "I guess I'd rather watch you sing, Ayu."

62
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:26,000
Ayu: "Ha!"

63
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,000
*Ayu puffs her chest out proudly.*

64
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:33,000
Ayu: "I knew it! Between Hazel and I, I really am the superior waifu!"

65
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:36,000
Ayu: "Now, bow before me, Hazel! Lick my feet!"

66
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,000
Hazel: "Your feet?"

67
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:38,000
*Hazel pulls a face.*

68
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:47,000
Hazel: "If it was Lady Yue tellin' me that, I'd be slobbering over her toes in a heartbeat, but I don't feel quite the same way about you."

69
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:48,000
Hazel: "Sorry, Ayu."

70
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,000
Ayu: "H-Huh?!"

71
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:51,000
*Ayu staggers back, aghast.*

72
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:56,000
Ayu: "Wh-What's wrong with my feet? Why wouldn't you want to lick them?!"

73
00:04:56,000 --> 00:05:00,000
Hazel: "'Cause they're all cracked an' dry an' stuff."

74
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:04,000
Hazel: "You dance an awful lot, so they're probably all hard."

75
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:11,000
Hazel: "I bet Lady Yue's feet are way nicer. Since she's a princess, she sits on a throne all day!"

76
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:14,000
Hazel: "Her toes must be niiice and soft, uehehe~"

77
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,000
Ayu: "Wh-Why, you...!"

78
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:17,000
*Ayu grits her teeth together.*

79
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:23,000
*It looks like I have, quite unwittingly, fanned the flames of discontent even higher.*

80
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,000
*Oh, brother...*

81
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:29,000
Hiroki: "Come on, you two, quit arguing. Can't we all try to be friends?"

82
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:31,000
*I'd rather watch Hazel.":

83
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:35,000
Hiroki: "I guess I'd rather watch you play tennis, Hazel..."

84
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:37,000
Hazel: "Ufufu! I knew it!"

85
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:42,000
*Hazel grins and puffs out her chest, a contented smile on her face.*

86
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:48,000
Hazel: "Idols are fun an' all, but they don't get the blood pumping like tennis does!"

87
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:52,000
Hazel: "There's somethin' visceral about sports, don't you think?"

88
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:54,000
Hazel: "It's super exciting!"

89
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:56,000
Ayu: "Exciting? Yeah, right..."

90
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:57,000
*Ayu pulls a face.*

91
00:05:57,000 --> 00:06:05,000
Ayu: "Performing can be just as hard on the body - if not harder - than smacking a stupid ball across a stupid net."

92
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:11,000
Ayu: "If you don't limber up properly, you can end up spraining a leg, or even breaking it."

93
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:14,000
Ayu: "Then, your whole career will be ruined!"

94
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:22,000
Ayu: "Being an idol is serious business! Don't take it lightly, or the industry will chew you up and spit you back out!"

95
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:27,000
Ayu: "I'm putting my body on the line every single time I step onto a stage!"

96
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:31,000
Hazel: "An' I'm risking my body every time I step onto the court!"

97
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:38,000
Hazel: "'Sides, unlike you, I've gotta worry about not flashin' everybody while tryin' to hit my serves!"

98
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:40,000
Hazel: "It requires a lot of skill!"

99
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:44,000
Ayu: "Sure, that's a handicap, but it's entirely self-imposed!"

100
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:48,000
Ayu: "If you actually wore underwear, it wouldn't be a problem!"

101
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:50,000
Ayu: "You're so stupid!"

102
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:53,000
Hazel: "Hehehe... You might be right about that..."

103
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:54,000
Ayu: "Urgh!"

104
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:55,000
*Ayu scowls.*

105
00:06:55,000 --> 00:07:00,000
Ayu: "For some reason, hearing you say that only pisses me off even more!"

106
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:03,000
Hiroki: "H-Hey, now. Let's try to calm down."

107
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:05,000
Hiroki: "Can't we all be friends?"

108
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:08,000
*Right now, I don't want to watch either of you!":

109
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:16,000
Hiroki: "I'm sorry, but I don't really want to watch either of you right now. Not if you're going to make that much noise."

110
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:18,000
Hazel: "Eh? You don't...?!"

111
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:21,000
Ayu: "You don't want to see me perform?"

112
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:27,000
Hiroki: "I've seen you perform in person before, Ayu. I already know how talented you are."

113
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:35,000
Hiroki: "As for you, Hazel, I've seen you practice in the tennis courts a bunch of times. I'm well aware of your skills."

114
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:40,000
Hiroki: "Neither of you need to try and impress me. I'm impressed already."

115
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:43,000
Hiroki: "You're both very accomplished women."

116
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:46,000
Hiroki: "Now, can't we all try to be friends?"

117
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:56,000
*And can't we leave the TV alone? The poor thing is pretty old, and I'm afraid it'll short circuit if it has to withstand even more intense channel hopping.*

118
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,000
Ayu: "Hmph..."

119
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,000
*Ayu pouts.*

120
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:03,000
Ayu: "Like I'd want to be friends with a muscle-bound Amazon like her..."

121
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:07,000
Hazel: "A-An Amazon?! That's actually kinda cool...!"

122
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:12,000
Hazel: "I wonder if I could crush a man's head between my thighs, hehehe~"

123
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:16,000
Ayu: "...but I guess it's unbecoming of me to argue so bitterly."

124
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:25,000
Ayu: "I'm supposed to be an idol. It's my job to bring love and happiness to people! I must swallow my own discontent and put on a big smile!"

125
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,000
Ayu: "Kira~!"

126
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:32,000
*Ayu makes a peace sign with both hands, all the while fluttering her big anime eyes.*

127
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:39,000
*I know this is just an act (Ayu, despite her public image, is pretty caustic), but it's an effective one.*

128
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:48,000
*Nobody's better at turning on the charm than Ikue Ayu (known among her fans as Ayu-Ayu). She can go from 0 to 100 in about 0.2 seconds.*

129
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:53,000
Hazel: "Ooh! That's the patented Ayu-Ayu wink I've heard so much about!"

130
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:58,000
Hazel: "You really are adorable, Ayu! It's no wonder you're so popular!"

131
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:01,000
Ayu: "H-Hey, what're you doing? Get off me!"

132
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:04,000
Hazel: "I won't! You're too adowwwwable!"

133
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:13,000
Ayu: "D-Don't baby talk me - a-and don't pat my head! You'll get my hair all mussed up, you dolt! Idiot! Garbage! Worthless human refuse!"

134
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:19,000
Hiroki: ""Worthless human refuse" is a bit much, even coming from you, don't you think...?"

135
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:24,000
*Moreover, Ayu and Hazel aren't real humans, though they might look the part.*

136
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:26,000
*They are, in actual fact, succubi.*

137
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:29,000
*I know, I know. It's hard to believe, isn't it?*

138
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:36,000
*I had a pretty tough time when I first learned about the existence of succubi and the succubus realm.*

139
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:42,000
*As it transpires, a lot of famous and successful women across the world are succubi.*

140
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:53,000
*Succubi harvest magical energy through intimate relations, as the legends say... but they can also gain energy through being liked, loved, praised, and revered.*

141
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:58,000
*As such, many succubi are driven to come to the human world to seek out fame.*

142
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:06,000
*Through a series of events too complicated to go into right now, I was able to meet five succubi famous in various fields.*

143
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:16,000
*First, I ran into Ayu. Her full name's Ikue Ayu, and she's Japan's top idol. She acts sweet and cute onstage, but that's pretty much all for show.*

144
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:21,000
*She actually has a cutting tongue, and she can be incredibly harsh.*

145
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:30,000
*Next, I met Wakatsuki Marina. She's a revered businesswoman who runs a successful clothing company, despite being rather young.*

146
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:35,000
*She's an aloof, cool-headed woman, but she's a sweetheart deep down.*

147
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:43,000
*Then, there's Cosmos Moretti. Cosmos is a half-Japanese, half-Italian girl who rose to prominence via social media.*

148
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:53,000
*She has a huge number of followers on the image sharing website RapidPound, where she constantly uploads photos of herself in various saucy outfits.*

149
00:10:53,000 --> 00:11:05,000
*There's also Yamamoto Hifumi, the famous actress. She's been in the entertainment industry for over a decade, and she's beloved by the general public for her calm, gentle demanor.*

150
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:11,000
*Finally, there's Hazel Williams. Hazel's father is American, and I think she grew up there.*

151
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:15,000
*She's an easygoing, laid-back woman (most of the time, at least).*

152
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:20,000
*She's a famous tennis star, and she practises almost every single day.*

153
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:26,000
*These women all fell for me, for one reason or another, and now I'm almost never alone.*

154
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:37,000
*It's hard to give equal amounts of attention to five different women (particularly when they all have such busy schedules), but I think I do a decent job of it.*

155
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:42,000
*It's a challenge, but I've never been one to back down from those.*

156
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:48,000
*Spending time with all these clever, interesting, beautiful women is very rewarding...*

157
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:50,000
*And there are perks to it, too.*

158
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:53,000
*Right now, though, I feel at a bit of a loss.*

159
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:59,000
*I'm flattered Ayu and Hazel dropped by to pay me a visit, but it's getting pretty late...*

160
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:04,000
Hiroki: "I have to go to work tomorrow, you know. I'm sure you do as well."

161
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:09,000
Hiroki: "Maybe we should postpone this little get-together. What do you say?"

162
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:11,000
Hazel: "Huh? Postpone it?!"

163
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:13,000
*Hazel stares at me, open-mouthed.*

164
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:22,000
Hazel: "But I've been lookin' forward to seein' you for aaaages, Hiroki! I've been so busy this last month we've barely had a chance to talk!"

165
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:27,000
Ayu: "W-Well, it's not like I really care about seeing you or anything..."

166
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:34,000
*Ah, here we go with the old tsundere routine. Ayu does this so often, she has it down to a fine art.*

167
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:37,000
*Who does she think she's fooling, anyway?*

168
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:42,000
*She might be able to trick her fans, but to me, she's incredibly transparent!*

169
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:49,000
Ayu: "B-But it would be a shame to go home already. I haven't spent nearly enough time with you yet."

170
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:56,000
Hiroki: "But don't you have an upcoming tennis tournament, Hazel - and aren't you recording a new single, Ayu?"

171
00:12:56,000 --> 00:13:00,000
Hiroki: "I'd hate for you to jeopardize your careers for my sake."

172
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:06,000
Hazel: "Ehehe~ You're always so considerate. That's why I love you so much, Hiroki!"

173
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:07,000
Ayu: "Nggk..."

174
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:08,000
*Ayu winces.*

175
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:14,000
Ayu: "Look at you, dropping the "L" bomb so quickly. That sort of love is so cheap!"

176
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:16,000
Ayu: "Don't you have any shame?"

177
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:17,000
Hazel: "Mmm..."

178
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:21,000
*Hazel considers for a few moments, then says cheerfully...*

179
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:22,000
Hazel: "Nope!"

180
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:29,000
Ayu: "Urgh. I suppose I should've expected as much, coming from a woman who never wears any underwear."

181
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:33,000
Hazel: "There ain't nothin' wrong with that! I just don't like it!"

182
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:38,000
Hazel: "Human beings weren't meant to wear underwear. It's unnatural!"

183
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:45,000
Ayu: "I don't think human beings were meant to wield racquets and hit balls across courts, but here we are."

184
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:49,000
Hazel: "That's different! That's that, and this is this!"

185
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:54,000
Hazel: "Y'know I feel strongly about this whole "no underwear" thing, Ayu!"

186
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,000
Hazel: "In fact..."

187
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:58,000
*Hazel toys with the hem of her pleated skirt.*

188
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:03,000
Hazel: "I'm not wearin' any underwear right now. Do you wanna see?!"

189
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:07,000
Hiroki: "Well, uh... I'm not opposed to the idea, but-"

190
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:08,000
Ayu: "Wh-Why, you..."

191
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:11,000
*Ayu grabs hold of Hazel's ponytail and tugs it.*

192
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:16,000
Ayu: "Stop trying to make moves on Hiroki when I'm here, you uncultured swine!"

193
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:18,000
Hazel: "Eh? Why can't I?"

194
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:25,000
Hazel: "We've done all sorts of naughty things together! I don't see why it should be such a problem now!"

195
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:33,000
Ayu: "It's a problem because you're not alone! You can't flirt with Hiroki all brazen-like in front of me! I-It's degenerate!"

196
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:34,000
Hazel: "Ohoho~?"

197
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:35,000
*Hazel grins.*

198
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:41,000
Hazel: "So, are you saying you've never done anything degenerate with Hiroki, Ayu?"

199
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:43,000
Ayu: "Well, that is... Nggh..."

200
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:45,000
*Ayu glances away, her face flushed.*

201
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:53,000
Ayu: "I-In any case, I-I don't like watching you slobber over him. It's embarrassing! You really need to learn some restraint!"

202
00:14:53,000 --> 00:15:01,000
Hazel: "Aw, don't be like that, Ayu! If you've got a problem with me bein' lovey-dovey with Hiroki, why don't you join in?"

203
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:02,000
Ayu: "H-Huh?!"

204
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:03,000
*Ayu steps back.*

205
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:09,000
Ayu: "Wh-What's this nonsense? I-It's not like I want to hold him, o-or kiss him, or anything..."

206
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:11,000
Hazel: "I'm sure you don't. Ufufu~"

207
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:21,000
Hazel: "You're so cute, Ayu, even when you don't mean to be. You can say the meanest of things, but deep down, you're still an innocent little girl!"

208
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:25,000
Ayu: "I-I'm not innocent, and I'm most definitely not little!"

209
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:33,000
Ayu: "I know how to flatter men as well as the next woman! I-I just don't because I have more self-respect than that!"

210
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:38,000
Ayu: "I-It's not like I want to lavish attention on Hiroki or anything..."

211
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:43,000
Hazel: "Does that mean you don't mind if I lavish attention on him instead?"

212
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:51,000
Ayu: "N-No, um...! I-If you're going to do that, you'll probably make all sorts of amateur mistakes! You're too clumsy!"

213
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:52,000
Hazel: "Really?"

214
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:53,000
*Hazel giggles.*

215
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:57,000
Hazel: "I think I'm pretty good at handling balls myself!"

216
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:58,000
Ayu: "No, no, no!"

217
00:15:58,000 --> 00:16:05,000
Ayu: "I met Hiroki before you did, and I'm the one with real experience. I'll show you how it's done!"

218
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:10,000
Ayu: "You're big and brutish and clumsy, so you should probably sit this one out."

219
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:17,000
Ayu: "Let me put it in terms you'd understand, even with that empty head of yours: you're being benched!"

220
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:21,000
Hazel: "Heeeh. Gettin' feisty now, aren't we? That's cute, too."

221
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:29,000
Hazel: "I love handsome guys, but cute girls are also great~! Being scolded by Japan's top idol is gettin' me excited!"

222
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:32,000
Hazel: "I just can't hold back any longer!"

223
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:33,000
Ayu: "Hiroki!"

224
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:34,000
Hazel: "Hiroki!"

225
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:35,000
Hiroki: "Aaah..."

226
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:37,000
*Th-Things sure are escalating fast.*

227
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:42,000
*I guess it's to be expected, given these girls are succubi, but still...*

228
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:46,000
*Would it kill them to give me a bit of time to prepare my heart?*

229
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:54,000
Hiroki: "H-Hey, time out, you guys! It really is getting late, s-so if we could just settle this score another day then-"

230
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:57,000
Ayu: "No, we can't! We're going to settle it now!"

231
00:16:57,000 --> 00:17:03,000
Ayu: "Who can make you feel better? Hazel or I? We need to figure that out this instant!"

232
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:05,000
Ayu: "It's a competition!"

233
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:07,000
Hazel: "Ehehe~ This sounds like fun~"

234
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:09,000
Hazel: "Let's give it a go!"

235
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:13,000
*Later that night, cuddled up with Ayu and Hazel, I have a dream.*

236
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:16,000
*It's a very gentle dream of the nostalgic variety.*

237
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:23,000
*It's a dream of something that happened to me once, more than a decade ago, in my final year of high school...*

238
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:30,000
*There was a girl in my class called Yukie. She was a transfer student, and she didn't have any friends.*

239
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:38,000
*Though she was pretty and good at academics, she was cold and icy and kept everybody at a distance: myself included.*

240
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:42,000
*A few guys tried to ask her out, but they were roundly rejected.*

241
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:48,000
*I never thought I'd have a chance with her, so I never even contemplated the idea.*

242
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:53,000
*Time passed. As I never spoke to Yukie, she soon faded from my mind...*

243
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:58,000
*That is, at least, until I received a letter from her in my shoe locker.*

244
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:05,000
*Meet me on the roof after school. I have something very important I need to discuss with you. From Yukie.*

245
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:13,000
*The letter had been written in a neat, elegant script. The characters seemed feminine enough, but I had my doubts.*

246
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:16,000
*Would Yukie really send me such a letter?*

247
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:17,000
*It seemed unlikely.*

248
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:24,000
*There was no way the real Yukie - that ice princess - would ever want to talk to me after school.*

249
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:31,000
*It must have been a set-up by the rest of my classmates. I was certain it was one big, elaborate prank.*

250
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:36,000
*That's what I told myself... but I went to the school roof regardless.*

251
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:37,000
*I was curious.*

252
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:43,000
*I'll admit, my heart was pounding pretty hard at the time. I kept telling myself, what if...*

253
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:45,000
*But I knew I was being silly.*

254
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:48,000
*There was no way it was really her...*

255
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:49,000
*But it was.*

256
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:57,000
*She was waiting for me on the roof after school. She turned to me, her dark hair fluttering in the breeze, and said...*

257
00:18:57,000 --> 00:19:05,000
Yukie: "I've been waiting for you. I have something very important I want to tell you. Hiroki, I... I love you..."

258
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:14,000
*I was utterly astounded, as you might expect. I never imagined Yukie would say such a thing to me, of all people. It was impossible!*

259
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:16,000
*It must have been a dream...*

260
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:22,000
*But, though I pinched myself, I didn't wake up. Yukie's white, alabaster face didn't waver.*

261
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:26,000
*She had written me that letter, and she had confessed to me.*

262
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:31,000
*We had exchanged less than five words in the past, but she was being sincere.*

263
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:32,000
*She loved me.*

264
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:36,000
*I knew little about Yukie, and I doubt she knew much about me.*

265
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:44,000
*We'd been in the same class for most of the year, but we were relative strangers. Like everybody else, I had avoided her.*

266
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:48,000
*If she'd ever stared at me longingly, I'd never noticed.*

267
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:50,000
*I never thought she loved me.*

268
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:51,000
*I was wrong.*

269
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:54,000
*I accepted her confession, and she kissed me.*

270
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:56,000
*After that we started going out.*

271
00:19:56,000 --> 00:20:03,000
*She was my first girlfriend, and though I didn't know much about love, I did care about her a great deal.*

272
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:07,000
*I thought we would stay together for a long time...*

273
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:10,000
*But that's something else I was wrong about.*

274
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:12,000
*I haven't seen her in years.*

275
00:20:12,000 --> 00:20:17,000
*I wonder what she's doing now? Was she able to find happiness like I have?*

276
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:26,000
*If so, I'd be pleased for her. She was an aloof girl, and she seemed to find it hard to make friends. I wouldn't want her to be lonely.*

277
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:27,000
*...*

278
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:28,000
*Now, that's strange.*

279
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:31,000
*Why am I thinking about Yukie at a time like this?*

280
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:32,000
*The next morning...*

281
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:33,000
*Beep, beep, beep...*

282
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:34,000
Hiroki: "Urgh..."

283
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:39,000
*I'm pulled out of my slumber by the familiar, tinny beeping of my alarm clock.*

284
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:46,000
*I get up, stretching, and shut off the hateful device before it can make my headache worse than it is already.*

285
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:51,000
*I feel even more tired than usual. I must've gone to bed late last night.*

286
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:58,000
*Snatches of the previous evening return to me in bits and pieces as I try to shake off my sleepiness.*

287
00:20:58,000 --> 00:21:01,000
*Ayu and Hazel came over, didn't they?*

288
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:06,000
*They were camped out in front of the TV for a while, arguing over the channel.*

289
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:12,000
*They had a bit of a fight, which then descended into a competition to curry my favor.*

290
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:15,000
*One thing led to another, and then...*

291
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:16,000
*Well.*

292
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:18,000
*It's no wonder I feel so tired.*

293
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:19,000
Hiroki: "Aaaah..."

294
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:20,000
*I yawn.*

295
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:26,000
*It's hard being popular... but I doubt this is a problem many men would sympathize with.*

296
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:31,000
*In fact, I'm sure most men would kill me if they knew how lucky I am.*

297
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:36,000
*I do wonder where Ayu and Hazel are now, though. Maybe they left already?*

298
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:47,000
*They stayed with me pretty late last night. I feel a bit bad about making them go home on their own. I'm not sure if the streets are safe for a couple of women...*

299
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:57,000
*But, well, it's not like Hazel and Ayu are ordinary women. They're both succubi, and they have incredible powers (not to mention amazing strength).*

300
00:21:57,000 --> 00:21:59,000
*I'm sure they'll be fine.*

301
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:01,000
*At least, I hope they are.*

302
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:06,000
*Should I text them to see if they're alright? Would that be overbearing?*

303
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:08,000
*It's not like I'm their father.*

304
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:14,000
*It's with these thoughts in mind that I exit my room. I'm still in my boxer shorts.*

305
00:22:14,000 --> 00:22:21,000
*I mean to have a shower, then pull on my clothes, but I stop when I pass by the cramped kitchen.*

306
00:22:21,000 --> 00:22:23,000
*It's not empty after all.*

307
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:27,000
*Hazel is sitting at the table, one leg folded over the other.*

308
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:32,000
*She's wearing her sports attire, and her long hair is pulled back in a ponytail.*

309
00:22:32,000 --> 00:22:38,000
*She's brushing some of her loose hair aside with one hand, and her head is bowed.*

310
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:43,000
*Her eyes are half-lidded, and her lips are clamped about a banana.*

311
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:49,000
*It's not every day I wake up to see a pretty girl in my house, sitting in my kitchen...*

312
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:55,000
*Though, since I first met Ayu, it's starting to become a semi-regular occurrence.*

313
00:22:55,000 --> 00:23:00,000
*All the same, I haven't quite gotten used to it. It's a lot to take in.*

314
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:03,000
Hiroki: "Hey, Hazel. You're up pretty early."

315
00:23:03,000 --> 00:23:04,000
Hazel: "Oh, Hiroki!"

316
00:23:04,000 --> 00:23:08,000
*Hazel takes the banana from her mouth and smiles at me.*

317
00:23:08,000 --> 00:23:14,000
*Her smile is so wide and warm, I can feel the stress simply melting off my shoulders.*

318
00:23:14,000 --> 00:23:17,000
Hazel: "G'morning! It's nice to see you!"

319
00:23:17,000 --> 00:23:21,000
Hiroki: "That should be my line. You're looking good."

320
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:23,000
Hazel: "Good in what way?"

321
00:23:23,000 --> 00:23:25,000
*Is she fishing for compliments?*

322
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:26,000
*What a minx...*

323
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:27,000
*You look healthy.":

324
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:29,000
Hiroki: "I mean, healthy... Uh..."

325
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:33,000
*I look at the banana, which Hazel is still holding in her hands.*

326
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:41,000
*She's taken only a small bite from the very top, and the yellow flesh of the fruit is indented with her teeth marks.*

327
00:23:41,000 --> 00:23:44,000
*The top of the banana glistens with saliva.*

328
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:47,000
*That makes it look even more inappropriate...*

329
00:23:47,000 --> 00:23:52,000
*But no! I'm not going to dwell on such things! I'm supposed to be an adult!*

330
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:56,000
Hiroki: "You have a pretty healthy appetite, at least."

331
00:23:56,000 --> 00:24:04,000
Hazel: "Oh, yeah. I need to load up on calories in the morning, so I can push myself to the max when I'm exercising."

332
00:24:04,000 --> 00:24:12,000
Hazel: "I was rifling through your cupboards, and I've already had a bowl of cereal, and some yogurt and toast..."

333
00:24:12,000 --> 00:24:20,000
*Hazel glances at the sink, as do I. True to her words, there's a bowl and a couple of plates inside it, covered in crumbs.*

334
00:24:20,000 --> 00:24:22,000
Hazel: "I hope you don't mind?"

335
00:24:22,000 --> 00:24:26,000
Hazel: "I felt kinda bad, helpin' myself to all your stuff..."

336
00:24:26,000 --> 00:24:33,000
Hazel: "But a girl's gotta eat, you know? It's important for my training regime! I don't wanna get sloppy!"

337
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:40,000
Hiroki: "It's fine. I'm not destitute. I can afford to shell out for a bowl of cereal and a banana."

338
00:24:40,000 --> 00:24:43,000
Hazel: "Oh, that's good! I'm glad, hehe~"

339
00:24:43,000 --> 00:24:52,000
Hazel: "I know I probably should've asked you first, before I helped myself to your food, but you looked so peaceful sleepin'..."

340
00:24:52,000 --> 00:24:54,000
Hazel: "I didn't wanna bother you."

341
00:24:54,000 --> 00:24:57,000
Hiroki: "It's alright. I appreciate the thought..."

342
00:24:57,000 --> 00:25:05,000
*Not that it counts for too much, I guess. I've got to go to work today anyway, and my alarm clock already disturbed me.*

343
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:14,000
*I think I'd rather be shaken awake by a beauty like Hazel than roused from my slumber by a shrill cacophony of beep, beep, beeping.*

344
00:25:14,000 --> 00:25:16,000
*Oh well. It's too late for that.*

345
00:25:16,000 --> 00:25:17,000
*You look sexy.":

346
00:25:17,000 --> 00:25:21,000
Hiroki: "This should probably go without saying, but... Well."

347
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:22,000
*I smile.*

348
00:25:22,000 --> 00:25:25,000
Hiroki: "I think you look pretty sexy right now."

349
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:27,000
Hazel: "What, really? Aw, geez!"

350
00:25:27,000 --> 00:25:30,000
*Hazel grins and takes another bite of her banana.*

351
00:25:30,000 --> 00:25:35,000
Hazel: "Thanks a lot! You sure know how to perk a girl's spirits up, hehe~"

352
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:39,000
Hiroki: "Were you feeling un-perky before I dropped by?"

353
00:25:39,000 --> 00:25:44,000
Hazel: "Not really. I'm always givin' it 101%%, y'know, but... Well."

354
00:25:44,000 --> 00:25:48,000
Hazel: "It's easier to get fired up when you're around."

355
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:51,000
Hazel: "You're the best wingman there is!"

356
00:25:51,000 --> 00:25:55,000
Hazel: "When you praise me, I feel like I can do anything!"

357
00:25:55,000 --> 00:25:57,000
Hiroki: "Then I'll keep on doing it!"

358
00:25:57,000 --> 00:25:59,000
*Hazel grins at me, and I return it.*

359
00:25:59,000 --> 00:26:02,000
*There is something weighing on my mind, though.*

360
00:26:02,000 --> 00:26:06,000
Hiroki: "Say, Hazel... Are you the only person here?"

361
00:26:06,000 --> 00:26:08,000
Hazel: "That's right. Why?"

362
00:26:08,000 --> 00:26:12,000
Hiroki: "Nothing, really. I was just wondering where Ayu went..."

363
00:26:12,000 --> 00:26:22,000
*I glance around the kitchen, as though Japan's top idol might be hiding beneath the table, or in one of the cupboards... but, of course, she isn't.*

364
00:26:22,000 --> 00:26:25,000
*As far as I can see, it's just Hazel and I here.*

365
00:26:25,000 --> 00:26:28,000
Hazel: "Ayu? Oh, she left already for work."

366
00:26:28,000 --> 00:26:33,000
Hazel: "She has a big concert coming up, and she has to rehearse for it."

367
00:26:33,000 --> 00:26:42,000
Hazel: "Speaking of which, I should probably get going myself. I need to head over to the Ookawa Sports Center so I can practice my swings."

368
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:47,000
Hazel: "I'm cutting it pretty close. Looks like I'll probably be late..."

369
00:26:47,000 --> 00:26:51,000
Hazel: "I hope Yuriko isn't too cross with me, hehe..."

370
00:26:51,000 --> 00:26:54,000
Hiroki: "Has she been getting on your case lately?"

371
00:26:54,000 --> 00:27:07,000
Hazel: "A little. She doesn't know that I've been spendin' time with you - I'm tryin' to keep it a secret - but I think she's figured I have another special somebody I'm spendin' time with."

372
00:27:07,000 --> 00:27:10,000
Hazel: "She's kinda jealous like that, haha..."

373
00:27:10,000 --> 00:27:20,000
Hazel: "I told her before we started dating that our relationship wasn't exclusive. She said she was fine with it, but she's a pretty jealous person."

374
00:27:20,000 --> 00:27:25,000
Hazel: "If she couldn't stand sharin' me, she really should've said so. Geez..."

375
00:27:25,000 --> 00:27:26,000
*Hazel sighs.*

376
00:27:26,000 --> 00:27:33,000
Hazel: "Humans are so weird and possessive. I don't see what's wrong with spreading the love around."

377
00:27:33,000 --> 00:27:39,000
Hazel: "It's not like I was tryin' to trick her or anything. I'm always honest and upfront!"

378
00:27:39,000 --> 00:27:46,000
Hiroki: "I know you are. You don't play mind games. That's one of the reasons why I like you so much."

379
00:27:46,000 --> 00:27:49,000
*I think Hazel's the polar opposite of Ayu.*

380
00:27:49,000 --> 00:27:55,000
*Ayu always turns red and sputters when she has to say something even halfway nice.*

381
00:27:55,000 --> 00:28:06,000
*She seems to have great difficulty in articulating her real feelings, perhaps because she spends so much time wearing the artifice of a cute, sweet, simpering idol.*

382
00:28:06,000 --> 00:28:09,000
*She's a total tsundere through and through.*

383
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:16,000
*Hazel, meanwhile, isn't one to mince words. She's always upfront, so she's easy to hang out with.*

384
00:28:16,000 --> 00:28:19,000
*She's a lot more chill than Ayu is...*

385
00:28:19,000 --> 00:28:22,000
*Though they both have their own appeals.*

386
00:28:22,000 --> 00:28:24,000
Hazel: "Hehe... You like me, huh?"

387
00:28:24,000 --> 00:28:25,000
*Hazel grins.*

388
00:28:25,000 --> 00:28:29,000
Hazel: "Well, I'm glad to hear it! I like you a whole bunch too!"

389
00:28:29,000 --> 00:28:38,000
Hazel: "Now that I've heard that, I feel like I can really give it my all today in the gym! I'm gonna work up a sweat all for you!"

390
00:28:38,000 --> 00:28:42,000
Hiroki: "Great. You do your best! I'll be rooting for you!"

391
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:43,000
Hazel: "Alright!"

392
00:28:43,000 --> 00:28:47,000
*Hazel takes another bite of her banana, then shoots me a grin.*

393
00:28:47,000 --> 00:28:52,000
Hazel: "Who cares if Yuriko acts all pissy with me? I don't need her anyways!"

394
00:28:52,000 --> 00:28:59,000
Hazel: "I've got you now, and you're the sweetest, most supportive boyfriend a gal could ever dream of, hehe~"

395
00:28:59,000 --> 00:29:04,000
Hazel: "Now, a'fore I go, I've gotta give you somethin' to remember me by!"

396
00:29:04,000 --> 00:29:07,000
Hiroki: "As if I could ever forget you!"

397
00:29:07,000 --> 00:29:12,000
Hazel: "I know I'm pretty unforgettable, but just lemme do this one thing!"

398
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:19,000
*Hazel finishes her banana, then darts to my side. Quick as a flash, she presses a kiss against my lips.*

399
00:29:19,000 --> 00:29:24,000
*I want to grasp her close and kiss her back, but there isn't enough time.*

400
00:29:24,000 --> 00:29:28,000
*Hazel breaks the kiss and glances at the clock, her face flushed.*

401
00:29:28,000 --> 00:29:33,000
Hazel: "Ah, nuts! I've hung about way too long! I've really gotta get goin'!"

402
00:29:33,000 --> 00:29:37,000
Hazel: "I'll see you later! Have a good day at work!"

403
00:29:37,000 --> 00:29:40,000
Hiroki: "Yeah, uh... See you. Have a good one."

404
00:29:40,000 --> 00:29:47,000
*I wave after Hazel as she dashes out my apartment, the white pleats of her short skirt fluttering as she goes.*

405
00:29:47,000 --> 00:29:50,000
*The door slams. Then, there's silence.*

406
00:29:50,000 --> 00:29:51,000
*I'm alone again.*

407
00:29:51,000 --> 00:30:00,000
*In the past, I used to spend pretty much all my time at my apartment alone... but the company of all these cute succubi has spoiled me.*

408
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:07,000
*The apartment, small though it is, feels much cosier when it's filled with their excitable chatter.*

409
00:30:07,000 --> 00:30:11,000
*Hazel's barely been gone five seconds, and I miss her already.*

410
00:30:11,000 --> 00:30:15,000
*I press my fingers to my lips, savoring the warmth of her kiss.*

411
00:30:15,000 --> 00:30:17,000
*Then, I shake my head.*

412
00:30:17,000 --> 00:30:20,000
Hiroki: "There's no point being maudlin."

413
00:30:20,000 --> 00:30:29,000
Hiroki: "It sucks that we can't spend more time together, but Hazel and Ayu and the rest have busy schedules. They all have to go to work."

414
00:30:29,000 --> 00:30:30,000
*Speaking of which...*

415
00:30:30,000 --> 00:30:33,000
Hiroki: "Oh, crap! I've gotta get to work, too!"

416
00:30:33,000 --> 00:30:42,000
*The interlude with Hazel in the kitchen wasn't as brief as I thought. A good fifteen minutes have passed, and I'm still in my underwear!*

417
00:30:42,000 --> 00:30:44,000
*I need to get in the shower, stat!*

418
00:30:44,000 --> 00:30:47,000
*Will I even have enough time for breakfast?*

419
00:30:47,000 --> 00:30:51,000
Hiroki: "This is no good! I'm going to be late...!!!"

420
00:30:51,000 --> 00:30:52,000
Hiroki: "Safe...!"

421
00:30:52,000 --> 00:30:57,000
*I step onto the train mere seconds before the automatic doors slide shut.*

422
00:30:57,000 --> 00:31:09,000
*I have to nudge a couple of smartly-dressed businessmen out of the way, which earns me a few reproachful glances, but it's a minor price to pay for getting to work on time.*

423
00:31:09,000 --> 00:31:15,000
*Why should I care what a bunch of strangers think of me? It's not like I'll see them again.*

424
00:31:15,000 --> 00:31:21,000
*I settle into a nook in the corner of the train, hemmed in by a sea of arms and elbows.*

425
00:31:21,000 --> 00:31:24,000
*The train's full to bursting, just like always.*

426
00:31:24,000 --> 00:31:28,000
*It's a warm day, and I feel particularly hot and uncomfortable.*

427
00:31:28,000 --> 00:31:35,000
*At least I'm right by the door. That gives me an ample view of the Tokyo scenery as it speeds by...*

428
00:31:35,000 --> 00:31:40,000
*Not that it's all that interesting, if I'm being perfectly honest.*

429
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:50,000
*Tourists in Tokyo like to gawp and stare at almost everything, but I've lived here for years, and I'm accustomed to all the tall, gray buildings.*

430
00:31:50,000 --> 00:31:53,000
*They don't hold any mystery to me any more.*

431
00:31:53,000 --> 00:32:01,000
*An office block's just an office block at the end of the day, regardless of how high it is, or how many windows it has...*

432
00:32:01,000 --> 00:32:07,000
*The train rumbles around me. It rounds a bend and I shift, my head bumping against the wall.*

433
00:32:07,000 --> 00:32:14,000
*We're pulling into the next station, not that it's any business of mine. I don't plan to get off here.*

434
00:32:14,000 --> 00:32:24,000
*The train soon comes to a stop. The doors slide open, and a bevy of men and women struggle to extricate themselves from this glorified tin can.*

435
00:32:24,000 --> 00:32:30,000
*I press my body against the wall, so as to give the crowd more space to disperse.*

436
00:32:30,000 --> 00:32:31,000
*As I do, I yawn.*

437
00:32:31,000 --> 00:32:32,000
Hiroki: "Aaah..."

438
00:32:32,000 --> 00:32:33,000
*I feel pretty tired.*

439
00:32:33,000 --> 00:32:38,000
*I didn't get much sleep last night, and my shower did little to wake me up.*

440
00:32:38,000 --> 00:32:43,000
*It sure is hard trying to please a whole harem of needy succubi...*

441
00:32:43,000 --> 00:32:45,000
*And, speaking of needy succubi...*

442
00:32:45,000 --> 00:32:48,000
???: "Hiroki! It's good to see you again!"

443
00:32:48,000 --> 00:32:49,000
Hiroki: "Ah..."

444
00:32:49,000 --> 00:32:55,000
*I can hear a sweet, girlish voice, coupled with two very soft somethings pushed up against me.*

445
00:32:55,000 --> 00:33:00,000
*I recognize that voice - not to mention the heft of that chest against my own.*

446
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:01,000
Hiroki: "Cosmos?"

447
00:33:01,000 --> 00:33:03,000
Cosmos: "That's right! It's me~!"

448
00:33:03,000 --> 00:33:07,000
*Cosmos looks up at me, a coy smile playing about her lips.*

449
00:33:07,000 --> 00:33:12,000
*Her head is tilted to one side, and her cute stubby ponytail flutters.*

450
00:33:12,000 --> 00:33:23,000
*Everything about Cosmos is cute, actually. She's very upfront about her feelings, which is a big plus. I can't imagine Ayu cuddling up to me like this in public...*

451
00:33:23,000 --> 00:33:26,000
*But that might be a blessing in disguise.*

452
00:33:26,000 --> 00:33:28,000
Hiroki: "Hey, Cosmos..."

453
00:33:28,000 --> 00:33:35,000
*I glance about the train awkwardly. The last of the new passengers have filed in, and the door's sliding shut.*

454
00:33:35,000 --> 00:33:38,000
*Nobody seems to be paying us much attention.*

455
00:33:38,000 --> 00:33:49,000
*This compartment's comprised of about 80%% businessmen, who look too tired and defeated by the daily grind to care overly much beyond the upcoming work day.*

456
00:33:49,000 --> 00:33:53,000
*I doubt my interaction with Cosmos has much meaning for them...*

457
00:33:53,000 --> 00:33:57,000
*But there's always a chance a few of Cosmos's fans might be here.*

458
00:33:57,000 --> 00:34:03,000
*Cosmos does have over two million followers on RapidPound. You can never be too careful.*

459
00:34:03,000 --> 00:34:05,000
*Tell Cosmos to be more careful.":

460
00:34:05,000 --> 00:34:13,000
*Though I like it when Cosmos clings to me, there is that old adage to consider: it's better to be safe than sorry.*

461
00:34:13,000 --> 00:34:16,000
*I ought to try and talk some sense into her.*

462
00:34:16,000 --> 00:34:22,000
Hiroki: "Is it really alright for you to cling to me like that? I don't want anybody seeing us."

463
00:34:22,000 --> 00:34:26,000
Cosmos: "I think it should be fine. It's busy. Nobody will notice."

464
00:34:26,000 --> 00:34:27,000
*Cosmos pouts.*

465
00:34:27,000 --> 00:34:30,000
Cosmos: "Don't you like it when I cling to you?"

466
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:37,000
Hiroki: "Of course I like it. I like it a lot! I just think it'd be better to err on the side of caution..."

467
00:34:37,000 --> 00:34:39,000
Cosmos: "Well, maybe you're right..."

468
00:34:39,000 --> 00:34:43,000
Cosmos: "It's sad, though. I want to spend more time with you."

469
00:34:43,000 --> 00:34:47,000
Cosmos: "It feels like it's been a long time since we last spoke."

470
00:34:47,000 --> 00:34:49,000
*She's not wrong about that.*

471
00:34:49,000 --> 00:35:00,000
*Though Cosmos is supposed to be my girlfriend, I've been so busy juggling my day job with the continued attentions of four other women it's hard to keep everybody happy.*

472
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:08,000
*Maybe I should start pencilling in dates with my succubus partners into a calendar. Would that make things easier to manage?*

473
00:35:08,000 --> 00:35:10,000
Hiroki: "Sorry, Cosmos. My bad."

474
00:35:10,000 --> 00:35:13,000
*I offer her what I hope is a placating smile.*

475
00:35:13,000 --> 00:35:17,000
Hiroki: "I've been a pretty rotten boyfriend, haven't I?"

476
00:35:17,000 --> 00:35:20,000
Cosmos: "I don't know if I'd go that far..."

477
00:35:20,000 --> 00:35:21,000
*Cosmos demurs.*

478
00:35:21,000 --> 00:35:27,000
Cosmos: "You're a good boyfriend. I know you care about me. I'm happy to date a man like you..."

479
00:35:27,000 --> 00:35:30,000
Cosmos: "But I wish I could be by your side more."

480
00:35:30,000 --> 00:35:38,000
Cosmos: "I've never had a boyfriend before. I never knew how nice it can be to share my life with somebody else."

481
00:35:38,000 --> 00:35:42,000
Cosmos: "When I'm with you... I feel very warm and contented."

482
00:35:42,000 --> 00:35:46,000
Cosmos: "I don't mind sharing you with my sisters, but..."

483
00:35:46,000 --> 00:35:50,000
*Cosmos's fingers curl against the front of my shirt.*

484
00:35:50,000 --> 00:35:54,000
Cosmos: "Sleeping on my own at night makes me feel a little sad."

485
00:35:54,000 --> 00:36:01,000
Cosmos: "Now I know how nice it feels to be with the person I love, I don't ever want to let you go."

486
00:36:01,000 --> 00:36:03,000
Hiroki: "...Thanks, Cosmos."

487
00:36:03,000 --> 00:36:09,000
*I smile at my girlfriend tenderly, ruffling the top of her dip-dyed head as I do so.*

488
00:36:09,000 --> 00:36:17,000
*Cosmos is a little... spacey, shall we say (I guess the name her mother picked suits her well), but she means well.*

489
00:36:17,000 --> 00:36:23,000
*She's unfailingly earnest in her affection, which makes it easy for me to respond in turn.*

490
00:36:23,000 --> 00:36:26,000
*As far as girlfriends go, she's top tier.*

491
00:36:26,000 --> 00:36:27,000
*Don't make a fuss.":

492
00:36:27,000 --> 00:36:30,000
*I'm a bit worried about this, but...*

493
00:36:30,000 --> 00:36:35,000
*Oh well. I haven't seen her in a long time. I might as well let her cling.*

494
00:36:35,000 --> 00:36:37,000
*I'm sure it'll be fine.*

495
00:36:37,000 --> 00:36:41,000
*'Sides, if I ask her to let go, it might upset her.*

496
00:36:41,000 --> 00:36:50,000
*Cosmos isn't the sort to throw temper tantrums (she's not like Ayu), but if she cries, it'll definitely attract a bunch of attention.*

497
00:36:50,000 --> 00:36:52,000
*I could do without that right now.*

498
00:36:52,000 --> 00:36:55,000
Hiroki: "It's good to see you again. I missed you."

499
00:36:55,000 --> 00:36:59,000
Cosmos: "I missed you too! I missed you so, so much!"

500
00:36:59,000 --> 00:37:03,000
*Cosmos nuzzles her cheek against my chest, purring like a cat.*

501
00:37:03,000 --> 00:37:07,000
Cosmos: "It feels like it's been ages since we last spoke!"

502
00:37:07,000 --> 00:37:11,000
Cosmos: "I was starting to suffer from withdrawl symptoms!"

503
00:37:11,000 --> 00:37:13,000
Hiroki: "Oh yeah? Like what?"

504
00:37:13,000 --> 00:37:18,000
Cosmos: "It's strange, but my heart... It felt so dull and leaden..."

505
00:37:18,000 --> 00:37:24,000
Cosmos: "The sky started to look gray, and my favorite snacks started to taste odd."

506
00:37:24,000 --> 00:37:30,000
Cosmos: "I still took a bunch of photos for my fans, but my heart wasn't really in it."

507
00:37:30,000 --> 00:37:37,000
Cosmos: "Some of them noticed. I got several comments on my last photoset, where I was wearing a cute swimsuit."

508
00:37:37,000 --> 00:37:40,000
*A swimsuit, huh? I'd like to see that.*

509
00:37:40,000 --> 00:37:45,000
*I might be Cosmos's boyfriend, but I've yet to see her in a bikini.*

510
00:37:45,000 --> 00:37:50,000
Cosmos: "My fans said my smile didn't seem genuine. It didn't light up my eyes."

511
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:54,000
Cosmos: "I didn't really understand it, at the time..."

512
00:37:54,000 --> 00:38:00,000
Cosmos: "But now, after seeing you, I feel so warm and fuzzy, I can't stop smiling."

513
00:38:00,000 --> 00:38:02,000
Cosmos: "This must be true love."

514
00:38:02,000 --> 00:38:04,000
Hiroki: "You're so sappy."

515
00:38:04,000 --> 00:38:07,000
*I grin, then rub the top of Cosmos's head.*

516
00:38:07,000 --> 00:38:11,000
Hiroki: "I'd feel bad if I was hampering your work in any way..."

517
00:38:11,000 --> 00:38:14,000
Hiroki: "But I'm glad you were thinking about me."

518
00:38:14,000 --> 00:38:16,000
Hiroki: "Thanks, Cosmos."

519
00:38:16,000 --> 00:38:20,000
Hiroki: "I love you too, even if I've been a bit absent lately."

520
00:38:20,000 --> 00:38:28,000
Hiroki: "I'll try to put more time aside for you in the future. Maybe we can go on a date this weekend. How does that sound?"

521
00:38:28,000 --> 00:38:29,000
Cosmos: "A date?!"

522
00:38:29,000 --> 00:38:35,000
*Cosmos's eyes light up. She stares at me, her face illuminated with innocent happiness.*

523
00:38:35,000 --> 00:38:37,000
Cosmos: "That sounds like fun!"

524
00:38:37,000 --> 00:38:40,000
Hiroki: "Great. Are you free this Saturday?"

525
00:38:40,000 --> 00:38:43,000
Cosmos: "If I wasn't before, I am now."

526
00:38:43,000 --> 00:38:50,000
Cosmos: "You should know that you take priority, Hiroki. Nothing is more important to me than you."

527
00:38:50,000 --> 00:38:52,000
Cosmos: "I really do love you!"

528
00:38:52,000 --> 00:38:56,000
*Cosmos giggles and presses a kiss against my cheek.*

529
00:38:56,000 --> 00:39:03,000
*I should probably tell her to be a little more cautious (nobody's staring, but you never know), but...*

530
00:39:03,000 --> 00:39:04,000
*Ah, screw it.*

531
00:39:04,000 --> 00:39:13,000
*I might be a worrier at heart, but I can throw caution to the wind from time to time - particularly if it'll make Cosmos happy.*

532
00:39:13,000 --> 00:39:15,000
*The pay-off is totally worth it.*

533
00:39:15,000 --> 00:39:19,000
*She's always adorable, but she looks even better when she smiles.*

534
00:39:19,000 --> 00:39:21,000
Hiroki: "Ah... What a day..."

535
00:39:21,000 --> 00:39:27,000
*I feel tired already, and I haven't even gotten to work yet - not that I'm complaining.*

536
00:39:27,000 --> 00:39:29,000
*I need to get my act together.*

537
00:39:29,000 --> 00:39:36,000
*If I'm gonna make all five of my succubus girlfriends happy, I need to keep working to better myself.*

538
00:39:36,000 --> 00:39:42,000
*I think I'm pretty average. My home isn't very lavish, and my job isn't all that impressive...*

539
00:39:42,000 --> 00:39:48,000
*But, if I keep toiling away, I'm sure I'll be able to stand toe-to-toe with my partners.*

540
00:39:48,000 --> 00:39:49,000
*Speaking of which...*

541
00:39:49,000 --> 00:39:58,000
*I saw Ayu and Hazel yesterday, and Cosmos earlier this morning, but I haven't seen Marina in a while. I think she's busy with work.*

542
00:39:58,000 --> 00:40:01,000
*Then, there's Hifumi. What has she getting up to?*

543
00:40:01,000 --> 00:40:05,000
*I know she's been busy shooting a new movie, but...*

544
00:40:05,000 --> 00:40:06,000
Hiroki: "Ah..."

545
00:40:06,000 --> 00:40:11,000
*I pause in the middle of the street, hands jammed into my pockets.*

546
00:40:11,000 --> 00:40:15,000
*My eyes meet those of Yamamoto Hifumi's, the famous actress...*

547
00:40:15,000 --> 00:40:25,000
*But this is not Hifumi in the flesh. This Hifumi is far bigger than I am, and she towers above me on a bright billboard that overlooks the street.*

548
00:40:25,000 --> 00:40:36,000
*This Hifumi is wearing a wedding dress. It's a very slinky, sexy sort of wedding dress, which displays quite a lot of her bust and the milky whiteness of her back.*

549
00:40:36,000 --> 00:40:47,000
*A white, transparent veil is affixed to her inky black hair, and cream-colored roses and ribbons adorn her outfit like something you might see on a fancy cake.*

550
00:40:47,000 --> 00:40:50,000
*Hifumi certainly looks mouth-watering enough.*

551
00:40:50,000 --> 00:40:58,000
*The length of her full skirt is very demure, but her large bust creates a nice contrast with it. She looks very sexy.*

552
00:40:58,000 --> 00:41:02,000
*I'm not the only person who's standing in the street, gawking.*

553
00:41:02,000 --> 00:41:07,000
*Part of me feels a little jealous. I'd like to keep Hifumi for myself...*

554
00:41:07,000 --> 00:41:10,000
*But I'm happy she's so enduringly popular.*

555
00:41:10,000 --> 00:41:18,000
*Hifumi's purple eyes are shining with the unabashed happiness of a newlywed. Looking at her feels... soothing, somehow.*

556
00:41:18,000 --> 00:41:23,000
*This large, blown-up picture of Hifumi must be advertising her latest movie.*

557
00:41:23,000 --> 00:41:30,000
*She told me a little about it last I spoke to her, which must have been... a couple of weeks ago, I think?*

558
00:41:30,000 --> 00:41:37,000
*She told me it's a romantic comedy. In the movie, Hifumi plays a woman who sews bridal gowns for a living.*

559
00:41:37,000 --> 00:41:46,000
*After sewing so many beautiful dresses for other women, Hifumi's character begins to dream about wearing such a gown for herself...*

560
00:41:46,000 --> 00:41:55,000
*And so, she begins to sew herself the most magnificent wardrobe of wedding dresses, despite not having a fiancé, or even a boyfriend.*

561
00:41:55,000 --> 00:42:02,000
*Hifumi's character starts to wear these wedding dresses out and about, to make herself feel happy...*

562
00:42:02,000 --> 00:42:10,000
*And, in doing so, she catches the attention of several young bachelors, who soon begin to vie for her attentions.*

563
00:42:10,000 --> 00:42:16,000
*It sounds diverting enough, though I can't imagine the movie'll be all that complex.*

564
00:42:16,000 --> 00:42:22,000
*I doubt it'll win any awards when it finally comes out, but its cast is star-studded.*

565
00:42:22,000 --> 00:42:30,000
*This movie might be marketed towards women, but I bet droves of men will flock to see it too, on account of Hifumi's fame.*

566
00:42:30,000 --> 00:42:33,000
*Maybe I should go and watch it, too.*

567
00:42:33,000 --> 00:42:39,000
*Romantic comedies aren't really my thing, but it'd be nice to see Hifumi on the big screen.*

568
00:42:39,000 --> 00:42:42,000
*Since I'm her "husband", I should support her.*

569
00:42:42,000 --> 00:42:49,000
*It'll be a little awkward seeing five handsome actors flirt with her, but it's not like it'll be real.*

570
00:42:49,000 --> 00:42:54,000
*It's all make-believe - and besides, I really do have five whole lovers.*

571
00:42:54,000 --> 00:43:01,000
*If Hifumi feels at all jealous about this arrangement, she doesn't say anything. She's very agreeable.*

572
00:43:01,000 --> 00:43:09,000
*Hifumi can put up with my real relationships, so I should be able to put up with her fictional ones. That's only fair.*

573
00:43:09,000 --> 00:43:11,000
*I don't want be a hypocrite.*

574
00:43:11,000 --> 00:43:15,000
*It's a little sad I can't see Hifumi as much as I'd like, but...*

575
00:43:15,000 --> 00:43:17,000
Hiroki: "I know you're working hard."

576
00:43:17,000 --> 00:43:20,000
Hiroki: "You really are impressive, Hifumi."

577
00:43:20,000 --> 00:43:22,000
*I smile and shake my head, bemused.*

578
00:43:22,000 --> 00:43:28,000
Hiroki: "Geez. I can hardly believe I'm dating a person like her. Life's full of surprises."

579
00:43:28,000 --> 00:43:31,000
*All of a sudden, I'm feeling sentimental...*

580
00:43:31,000 --> 00:43:36,000
*But I think I might have dallied on the street corner a little too long.*

581
00:43:36,000 --> 00:43:44,000
*With great effort, I tear my eyes away from the billboard and fish my phone out my pocket. I check the time, then gasp.*

582
00:43:44,000 --> 00:43:47,000
Hiroki: "H-Huh? It's that late already?!"

583
00:43:47,000 --> 00:43:50,000
*I've gotta get going, or I won't make it to work!*

584
00:43:50,000 --> 00:43:53,000
*I've really gotta learn to stop spacing out!*

585
00:43:53,000 --> 00:44:03,000
*I get to work a few minutes before 09:00. I'm not late (technically, I'm early), but the rest of my coworkers are there already, bowed over their desks.*

586
00:44:03,000 --> 00:44:06,000
*My boss is something of a slave driver.*

587
00:44:06,000 --> 00:44:12,000
*Work starts officially at 09:00, but he prefers us to get there at least fifteen minutes early.*

588
00:44:12,000 --> 00:44:16,000
*A few months ago, he'd chew me out for being so "lax"...*

589
00:44:16,000 --> 00:44:19,000
Boss: "Ogasawara! Good morning, my boy!"

590
00:44:19,000 --> 00:44:22,000
Hiroki: "Ah, yes, um... good morning, sir."

591
00:44:22,000 --> 00:44:31,000
Boss: "Now, what's with that mealy-mouthed reply? You should be a bit more enthusiastic! It's a beautiful morning, wouldn't you agree?"

592
00:44:31,000 --> 00:44:34,000
Hiroki: "Yes, um... It's positively divine."

593
00:44:34,000 --> 00:44:40,000
Boss: "That's the spirit! Now, are you ready to get to work? I'm expecting results!"

594
00:44:40,000 --> 00:44:41,000
Hiroki: "Yes, sir..."

595
00:44:41,000 --> 00:44:42,000
*I sigh.*

596
00:44:42,000 --> 00:44:46,000
*My boss hasn't scolded me half as much as he used to.*

597
00:44:46,000 --> 00:44:49,000
*In fact, he's being pretty friendly.*

598
00:44:49,000 --> 00:44:52,000
*I never imagined we'd ever be on such good terms.*

599
00:44:52,000 --> 00:44:59,000
*I've worked for the Sakura Daily for a few years, but I've never quite seen eye-to-eye with my boss.*

600
00:44:59,000 --> 00:45:03,000
*He's a large, overwhelming man, both in body and in personality.*

601
00:45:03,000 --> 00:45:13,000
*He's the sort of person who commands attention when he walks into a room, and he's not afraid of telling people exactly what he thinks of them.*

602
00:45:13,000 --> 00:45:19,000
*I used to complain about him all the time with my colleagues (behind his back, of course).*

603
00:45:19,000 --> 00:45:21,000
*He's not all that likeable.*

604
00:45:21,000 --> 00:45:24,000
*I don't think he likes me all that much, either.*

605
00:45:24,000 --> 00:45:30,000
*He didn't, at least, but that changed when he learned about my connection to Marina.*

606
00:45:30,000 --> 00:45:34,000
*Marina's influence has helped our agency land all sorts of jobs.*

607
00:45:34,000 --> 00:45:42,000
*My boss and my colleagues don't know the exact nature of our relationship, but I think they can make an educated guess.*

608
00:45:42,000 --> 00:45:46,000
*We did go on a trip to the hot springs together, after all.*

609
00:45:46,000 --> 00:45:53,000
*My boss is well aware that I have friends in high places, and now he's doing all he can to flatter my ego.*

610
00:45:53,000 --> 00:45:55,000
*It's incredibly transparent.*

611
00:45:55,000 --> 00:45:58,000
*To be honest, it makes me feel uncomfortable.*

612
00:45:58,000 --> 00:46:03,000
*My colleagues have taken a very dim view on my new status in the office.*

613
00:46:03,000 --> 00:46:12,000
*I was never all that close to my coworkers, but we used to go drinking from time to time, and they were never above chatting to me.*

614
00:46:12,000 --> 00:46:17,000
*We were all in the same boat: victims of the boss's capricious whims.*

615
00:46:17,000 --> 00:46:23,000
*Now my boss is paying me especial attention, my colleagues have turned their backs on me.*

616
00:46:23,000 --> 00:46:29,000
*They're particularly jealous about my relationship with Marina - and Ayu, and Cosmos, et al.*

617
00:46:29,000 --> 00:46:32,000
*Being a popular guy is surprisingly hard.*

618
00:46:32,000 --> 00:46:36,000
Boss: "Let me run you through the day's agenda, Ogasawara."

619
00:46:36,000 --> 00:46:41,000
*My boss issues me orders, while I nod and jot them down on my laptop.*

620
00:46:41,000 --> 00:46:45,000
*It looks like I have a couple of complex jobs to take care of.*

621
00:46:45,000 --> 00:46:55,000
*First, I have to attend some dull, dry government conference to take a few pics for an upcoming article, and then I need to go to some sporting event...*

622
00:46:55,000 --> 00:46:57,000
*I've got a busy day ahead of me.*

623
00:46:57,000 --> 00:47:01,000
*Well, I guess too much work is better than no work.*

624
00:47:01,000 --> 00:47:06,000
Boss: "And there you have it! It's a lot, but I'm sure you can manage."

625
00:47:06,000 --> 00:47:10,000
*My boss slaps a large hand on my shoulder and laughs.*

626
00:47:10,000 --> 00:47:15,000
Boss: "You've proven yourself to be quite capable over the last few months!"

627
00:47:15,000 --> 00:47:23,000
Boss: "I had my reservations about you at first, I'll admit, but I'm wise enough to admit when my judgment has erred!"

628
00:47:23,000 --> 00:47:28,000
Boss: "With your connections, you've become an indispensable part of our company!"

629
00:47:28,000 --> 00:47:37,000
Boss: "We never would've been admitted to this conference if your little friend, Miss Wakatsuki, hadn't intervened on our behalf."

630
00:47:37,000 --> 00:47:40,000
Boss: "We're really going places, thanks to you!"

631
00:47:40,000 --> 00:47:42,000
Hiroki: "O-Oh, no, uh..."

632
00:47:42,000 --> 00:47:44,000
*I duck my head, abashed.*

633
00:47:44,000 --> 00:47:51,000
Hiroki: "It's nothing, sir. That's all Marina's doing, not mine. You don't need to thank me for her help..."

634
00:47:51,000 --> 00:47:56,000
Boss: "But she's only helping us because of you! We all know that! It's obvious!"

635
00:47:56,000 --> 00:48:05,000
Boss: "I can't say I understand what you are to Miss Wakatsuki, but I hope you hang onto her! She's been a great blessing! Hohoho!"

636
00:48:05,000 --> 00:48:09,000
*My boss laughs uproariously, as though he's told a funny joke.*

637
00:48:09,000 --> 00:48:12,000
*His voice is very, very loud, and I wince.*

638
00:48:12,000 --> 00:48:18,000
*My colleagues are all glaring at me. I can hear a few of them whispering among themselves...*

639
00:48:18,000 --> 00:48:23,000
Coworker: "It looks like the boss is sucking up to Ogasawara again."

640
00:48:23,000 --> 00:48:26,000
Coworker 2: "Pfft. Like that's anything new."

641
00:48:26,000 --> 00:48:33,000
Coworker 3: "It's not fair. If I'd come into the office as late as him, I would've been chewed out..."

642
00:48:33,000 --> 00:48:39,000
Coworker 2: "It's one rule for him, another for the rest of us. It's like he's untouchable."

643
00:48:39,000 --> 00:48:43,000
Coworker: "He must be feeling pretty smug about all this."

644
00:48:43,000 --> 00:48:48,000
Coworker 3: "I bet he feels especially smug about his "relationship"-"

645
00:48:48,000 --> 00:48:52,000
*This coworker makes little quotation marks with his fingers.*

646
00:48:52,000 --> 00:48:54,000
Coworker 3: "-with Wakatsuki Marina."

647
00:48:54,000 --> 00:49:02,000
Coworker 4: "Wakatsuki Marina, of all people! I still can't believe a plain, ordinary guy like him was able to pull her!"

648
00:49:02,000 --> 00:49:05,000
Coworker 2: "There's no justice in this world!"

649
00:49:05,000 --> 00:49:10,000
Coworker: "Some people have life way too easy. What about the rest of us?!"

650
00:49:10,000 --> 00:49:17,000
*My colleagues sound pretty annoyed, and I can't say I blame them. I'd be annoyed if I was in their shoes.*

651
00:49:17,000 --> 00:49:21,000
*Their jealous looks are making me feel kinda bad, though.*

652
00:49:21,000 --> 00:49:32,000
*I don't think I've done anything to apologize for (my boss is the one at fault for flaunting his favoritism like this), but my natural instinct is to bow my head.*

653
00:49:32,000 --> 00:49:35,000
*I don't really want my coworkers to hate me!*

654
00:49:35,000 --> 00:49:36,000
Boss: "Hey! You lot!"

655
00:49:36,000 --> 00:49:41,000
*The boss, overhearing these mutinous whispers, glowers at my colleagues.*

656
00:49:41,000 --> 00:49:47,000
Boss: "Stop gossiping among yourselves and start working. I don't pay you to flap your lips!"

657
00:49:47,000 --> 00:49:56,000
Boss: "Maybe I'll consider what you have to say when you've contributed enough to the company, but not a single one of you is there yet!"

658
00:49:56,000 --> 00:50:02,000
Boss: "Compared to Ogasawara, you're all parasites! You're not even fit to lick my boots!"

659
00:50:02,000 --> 00:50:03,000
Boss: "Now shut up!"

660
00:50:03,000 --> 00:50:05,000
Coworkers: "Yes, boss..."

661
00:50:05,000 --> 00:50:09,000
*A dull, apathetic chorus of voices respond to my boss's jabs.*

662
00:50:09,000 --> 00:50:16,000
*Heads swivel, eyes focus on computer screens, and the steady click-clack of keyboards fills the office.*

663
00:50:16,000 --> 00:50:23,000
*Nobody's talking any more. Nobody's looking at me either, but I can still sense the resentment in the air.*

664
00:50:23,000 --> 00:50:30,000
*The atmosphere's awfully tense. It feels like a powder keg, ready to blow, and it's all my fault.*

665
00:50:30,000 --> 00:50:32,000
*This... is pretty uncomfortable.*

666
00:50:32,000 --> 00:50:35,000
*I wasn't made to be the center of attention.*

667
00:50:35,000 --> 00:50:36,000
Boss: "Very good."

668
00:50:36,000 --> 00:50:40,000
*My boss nods his head, arms folded. At least he looks satisfied.*

669
00:50:40,000 --> 00:50:47,000
*Doesn't he realize how tense it is? Maybe he's so far removed from petty office politics that he doesn't care.*

670
00:50:47,000 --> 00:50:51,000
Boss: "Now, do you know what you have to do, Ogasawara?"

671
00:50:51,000 --> 00:50:55,000
Hiroki: "Yes, boss. Don't worry. Leave everything to me."

672
00:50:55,000 --> 00:50:58,000
Boss: "Good lad. I knew I could count on you!"

673
00:50:58,000 --> 00:51:03,000
Boss: "It's a shame you don't have any appointments with any sexy women today."

674
00:51:03,000 --> 00:51:09,000
Boss: "I'm sure you're dying to photograph Hazel Williams again, or Yamamoto Hifumi..."

675
00:51:09,000 --> 00:51:11,000
Boss: "But keep your spirits up!"

676
00:51:11,000 --> 00:51:14,000
*My boss slaps my shoulder again. It hurts.*

677
00:51:14,000 --> 00:51:18,000
Boss: "I'm sure the opportunity will arise in due course!"

678
00:51:18,000 --> 00:51:22,000
Boss: "Until then, you need to work these dull, ordinary jobs."

679
00:51:22,000 --> 00:51:27,000
Boss: "If you keep at it, I'm sure you'll be rewarded. In my humble opinion-"

680
00:51:27,000 --> 00:51:29,000
*Nothing about my boss is humble.*

681
00:51:29,000 --> 00:51:31,000
Boss: "-you deserve as much!"

682
00:51:31,000 --> 00:51:34,000
Boss: "Keep up the good work, you hear?"

683
00:51:34,000 --> 00:51:35,000
Hiroki: "Yes, boss."

684
00:51:35,000 --> 00:51:38,000
*He's so loud, I can't help but hear him.*

685
00:51:38,000 --> 00:51:41,000
*Satisfied, my boss ambles back to his office.*

686
00:51:41,000 --> 00:51:45,000
*In his absence, my colleagues begin to mutter among themselves.*

687
00:51:45,000 --> 00:51:52,000
*I can't catch everything they're saying, but I hear my name being tossed around more than a few times.*

688
00:51:52,000 --> 00:51:54,000
*Are they plotting to murder me?*

689
00:51:54,000 --> 00:51:58,000
*I don't want to be cut up and dissolved in a bathtub!*

690
00:51:58,000 --> 00:52:01,000
*I have a pretty bad feeling about this...*

691
00:52:01,000 --> 00:52:02,000
Hiroki: "Geez..."

692
00:52:02,000 --> 00:52:04,000
*I stare blankly at my monitor.*

693
00:52:04,000 --> 00:52:06,000
*My head's starting to hurt.*

694
00:52:06,000 --> 00:52:13,000
*Time passes in a blur. The working week crawls to a close, and before I know it, Friday evening is upon me.*

695
00:52:13,000 --> 00:52:19,000
*It'll be Saturday tomorrow. I promised I'd go out on a date with Cosmos then: a proper date.*

696
00:52:19,000 --> 00:52:22,000
*I'm not entirely sure where I'll take her, though.*

697
00:52:22,000 --> 00:52:31,000
*It might be nice to go to a café, where I can treat Cosmos to one of the immensely sugary desserts she seems to covet so much...*

698
00:52:31,000 --> 00:52:36,000
*But we've been on several café dates already. I don't want to bore her.*

699
00:52:36,000 --> 00:52:39,000
*I should try something new and exciting.*

700
00:52:39,000 --> 00:52:41,000
*Maybe we could go to the movies?*

701
00:52:41,000 --> 00:52:46,000
*I think that new romantic comedy starring Hifumi opens tomorrow...*

702
00:52:46,000 --> 00:52:55,000
*But it might be insensitive to take my girlfriend to see my other girlfriend (who likes to call herself my "wife") on the big screen.*

703
00:52:55,000 --> 00:53:01,000
*Cosmos is one of the clingiest members of my retinue, and I wouldn't want to hurt her feelings.*

704
00:53:01,000 --> 00:53:07,000
*I don't get to spend much time with her as it is. I'd hate to spoil our date and let her down.*

705
00:53:07,000 --> 00:53:09,000
*The movies is probably out, then...*

706
00:53:09,000 --> 00:53:14,000
*But what about a theme park? I don't think I've ever been there with Cosmos.*

707
00:53:14,000 --> 00:53:21,000
*Destiny Land isn't too far away. We can get there on the train. It shouldn't take much more than an hour.*

708
00:53:21,000 --> 00:53:26,000
*Destiny Land is a super popular theme park for children and adults alike.*

709
00:53:26,000 --> 00:53:35,000
*It has a whole bunch of rides, the staff members dress up like popular Destiny characters, and there's parades and firework displays.*

710
00:53:35,000 --> 00:53:40,000
*Cosmos's interests tend towards the cute and kitschy, so I'm sure she'd love it.*

711
00:53:40,000 --> 00:53:47,000
*I might act dry and humorless, but I'm pretty fond of Destiny Land, though it's been years since I last went.*

712
00:53:47,000 --> 00:53:52,000
*Who doesn't love Destiny Land? It's a place of hopes, dreams, magic...*

713
00:53:52,000 --> 00:53:54,000
*But it's also expensive.*

714
00:53:54,000 --> 00:53:57,000
*Can I afford two tickets on my meager salary?*

715
00:53:57,000 --> 00:54:00,000
Hiroki: "Geez. I need to stop worrying."

716
00:54:00,000 --> 00:54:05,000
*I'm supposed to have fun on my date with Cosmos, not fret over tiny details.*

717
00:54:05,000 --> 00:54:08,000
*I don't think it really matters where we go.*

718
00:54:08,000 --> 00:54:13,000
*I'm sure Cosmos will be happy regardless of what I choose. She's not very picky.*

719
00:54:13,000 --> 00:54:18,000
Cosmos: "It'll be fine, Hiroki. I'll be happy so long as I'm with you."

720
00:54:18,000 --> 00:54:20,000
*I'm sure that's what she'll say.*

721
00:54:20,000 --> 00:54:21,000
*That's a comfort...*

722
00:54:21,000 --> 00:54:25,000
*Though there's a few other things I'm also worried about.*

723
00:54:25,000 --> 00:54:30,000
*Cosmos is famous. If we go anywhere too populated, we might attract attention.*

724
00:54:30,000 --> 00:54:38,000
*People will start snapping photos of us, and then news of our relationship will spread across the internet like wildfire.*

725
00:54:38,000 --> 00:54:40,000
*It would cause a huge scandal.*

726
00:54:40,000 --> 00:54:49,000
*People will find my address and start throwing eggs at my house, and Cosmos's reputation will plummet. She might lose all her fans.*

727
00:54:49,000 --> 00:54:51,000
*I don't want that to happen.*

728
00:54:51,000 --> 00:54:58,000
*Maybe she can wear a disguise? A pair of dark sunglasses, perhaps? Would anybody notice her then?*

729
00:54:58,000 --> 00:55:03,000
*Dating a celebrity - even an e-celeb like Cosmos - is a lot of hard work...*

730
00:55:03,000 --> 00:55:08,000
*And I have to worry about this stuff with not just one, but five women!*

731
00:55:08,000 --> 00:55:11,000
*The mere thought of it is exhausting.*

732
00:55:11,000 --> 00:55:12,000
Hiroki: "Aaah..."

733
00:55:12,000 --> 00:55:16,000
*I yawn, pressing a hand to my mouth. Tears bead in my eyes.*

734
00:55:16,000 --> 00:55:22,000
*It's getting pretty late. It's already pitch black outside. I should probably hit the hay.*

735
00:55:22,000 --> 00:55:25,000
*I can worry about what I want to do tomorrow.*

736
00:55:25,000 --> 00:55:30,000
*I settle down on my futon, sighing as the stress fades from my aching limbs.*

737
00:55:30,000 --> 00:55:34,000
*I feel light and fluffy, like I'm floating on a cloud~*

738
00:55:34,000 --> 00:55:36,000
*Within minutes, I fall asleep.*

739
00:55:36,000 --> 00:55:41,000
*I'm so exhausted, I fully expect to sleep for hours and hours, but...*

740
00:55:41,000 --> 00:55:43,000
???: "-ki... Hey, Hiroki..."

741
00:55:43,000 --> 00:55:44,000
Hiroki: "Nn...?"

742
00:55:44,000 --> 00:55:49,000
*I can hear a voice. It's soft and sweet and feminine, and it sounds familiar.*

743
00:55:49,000 --> 00:55:52,000
*I'm only half-awake, but I'm sure that's...*

744
00:55:52,000 --> 00:55:53,000
Hiroki: "Cosmos?"

745
00:55:53,000 --> 00:55:55,000
Cosmos: "That's right~!"

746
00:55:55,000 --> 00:55:59,000
Cosmos: "Good morning, Hiroki! It's nice to see you, ehehe~"

747
00:55:59,000 --> 00:56:01,000
Hiroki: "Good morning...?"

748
00:56:01,000 --> 00:56:10,000
*I blink, wiping the sleep from my eyes, and sit up. It's still pitch black outside, and I know it's late before I glance at my alarm clock.*

749
00:56:10,000 --> 00:56:13,000
Hiroki: "It's not even four a.m. yet, Cosmos..."

750
00:56:13,000 --> 00:56:22,000
Cosmos: "I know, but I wanted to see you. I simply couldn't wait! I was so excited about our date, I didn't get a single wink of sleep."

751
00:56:22,000 --> 00:56:26,000
Cosmos: "It's been so long since I had you all to myself..."

752
00:56:26,000 --> 00:56:29,000
Cosmos: "I couldn't hold myself back!"

753
00:56:29,000 --> 00:56:31,000
Cosmos: "I'm not a bad girl, am I?"

754
00:56:31,000 --> 00:56:33,000
Hiroki: "...No, I don't think so."

755
00:56:33,000 --> 00:56:41,000
*It's a little inconvenient that she's so attached. I would've liked to get a couple more hours of sleep, at least...*

756
00:56:41,000 --> 00:56:45,000
*But I'd be a churlish sort of man to rebuff Cosmos's affections.*

757
00:56:45,000 --> 00:56:47,000
*I know she means well.*

758
00:56:47,000 --> 00:56:51,000
Hiroki: "I'm flattered you like me so much, Cosmos, but..."

759
00:56:51,000 --> 00:56:52,000
Cosmos: "But?"

760
00:56:52,000 --> 00:56:54,000
Hiroki: "What are you wearing?"

761
00:56:54,000 --> 00:57:01,000
*Now that I'm slightly more awake, the unusualness of Cosmos's attire strikes me with full force.*

762
00:57:01,000 --> 00:57:10,000
*She isn't wearing her pink holographic jacket and her criminally tight shorts, and neither is she wearing her clingy succubus attire.*

763
00:57:10,000 --> 00:57:13,000
*She's dressed up just like a bunny girl!*

764
00:57:13,000 --> 00:57:24,000
*Her curves are barely contained by a skintight leotard. The black leotard bears a few similarities to her succubus outfit, but I suppose it's slightly more modest.*

765
00:57:24,000 --> 00:57:27,000
*That's not saying all that much, though.*

766
00:57:27,000 --> 00:57:34,000
*Cosmos has paired her leotard with a pair of black tights, which are ever-so-slightly see through.*

767
00:57:34,000 --> 00:57:39,000
*The curve of her hips is clearly defined, as is the bulging of her full thighs.*

768
00:57:39,000 --> 00:57:45,000
*Her outfit has been capped off with a pair of floppy ears and a fluffy white tail.*

769
00:57:45,000 --> 00:57:47,000
*She looks utterly adorable!*

770
00:57:47,000 --> 00:57:51,000
Cosmos: "So, you noticed, did you? It took you a little while."

771
00:57:51,000 --> 00:57:54,000
Cosmos: "Maybe this isn't bold enough..."

772
00:57:54,000 --> 00:57:58,000
*Cosmos glances down at her attire, her brow furrowed.*

773
00:57:58,000 --> 00:58:06,000
Cosmos: "I have a lot of other costumes back at home. I wear them during my photo shoots for my RapidPound followers."

774
00:58:06,000 --> 00:58:11,000
Cosmos: "I have a tight Chinese dress, a maid outfit, and lots of swimsuits..."

775
00:58:11,000 --> 00:58:18,000
Cosmos: "I wasn't sure which one you would like the most, so I picked one of my very favorites..."

776
00:58:18,000 --> 00:58:20,000
Cosmos: "But maybe it's too plain?"

777
00:58:20,000 --> 00:58:22,000
Cosmos: "What do you think, Hiroki?"

778
00:58:22,000 --> 00:58:27,000
Hiroki: "Oh, no! It's not plain at all! I think it suits you perfectly!"

779
00:58:27,000 --> 00:58:28,000
Cosmos: "You do?"

780
00:58:28,000 --> 00:58:34,000
Hiroki: "Yeah! It clings to you in all the right places! I can see all your curves!"

781
00:58:34,000 --> 00:58:40,000
Hiroki: "Your chest looks great, and there's even a window so I can see your belly button!"

782
00:58:40,000 --> 00:58:42,000
Hiroki: "That's super cute!"

783
00:58:42,000 --> 00:58:43,000
Cosmos: "Ehehe..."

784
00:58:43,000 --> 00:58:44,000
*Cosmos giggles.*

785
00:58:44,000 --> 00:58:49,000
Cosmos: "I like that, too. I think it's one of this outfit's best features!"

786
00:58:49,000 --> 00:58:52,000
*Man, belly buttons sure are great...":

787
00:58:52,000 --> 00:58:58,000
Hiroki: "I concur. Belly buttons are severely underrated. They can be pretty erotic..."

788
00:58:58,000 --> 00:59:01,000
Cosmos: "I like your belly button too, Hiroki."

789
00:59:01,000 --> 00:59:02,000
Hiroki: "You do?"

790
00:59:02,000 --> 00:59:05,000
Cosmos: "Mm. Viva belly buttons! Banzai!"

791
00:59:05,000 --> 00:59:06,000
Hiroki: "Haha..."

792
00:59:06,000 --> 00:59:10,000
*Now it's my turn to laugh. I shake my head, amused.*

793
00:59:10,000 --> 00:59:14,000
Hiroki: "What a funny thing to get so worked up over."

794
00:59:14,000 --> 00:59:21,000
Cosmos: "Well, it's not just your belly button I like. I like all of you. Being with you makes me happy..."

795
00:59:21,000 --> 00:59:25,000
Cosmos: "So, I wanted to try and make you happy in return."

796
00:59:25,000 --> 00:59:27,000
Cosmos: "What do you think?"

797
00:59:27,000 --> 00:59:30,000
*Your armpits are super cute too, Cosmos!":

798
00:59:30,000 --> 00:59:34,000
Hiroki: "You can't overlook the importance of armpits, though!"

799
00:59:34,000 --> 00:59:39,000
Hiroki: "I think your armpits look particularly nice in that outfit, Cosmos!"

800
00:59:39,000 --> 00:59:40,000
Cosmos: "Really?"

801
00:59:40,000 --> 00:59:44,000
Hiroki: "Yeah! They're so white and soft and smooth..."

802
00:59:44,000 --> 00:59:47,000
Hiroki: "I'd love to bury my face in them!"

803
00:59:47,000 --> 00:59:51,000
Cosmos: "You can, if you want, if it would make you happy."

804
00:59:51,000 --> 00:59:55,000
Cosmos: "I decided to dress like this for your sake, after all."

805
00:59:55,000 --> 00:59:57,000
Cosmos: "What do you think?"

806
00:59:57,000 --> 01:00:01,000
*Cosmos looks at me shyly, a small smile playing about her lips.*

807
01:00:01,000 --> 01:00:05,000
*I'd prefer it if I could get a better look at your behind.":

808
01:00:05,000 --> 01:00:11,000
Hiroki: "Belly buttons are great and all, but they can't compare to a nice behind."

809
01:00:11,000 --> 01:00:16,000
Hiroki: "In that regard, I think Hazel might just have you beaten..."

810
01:00:16,000 --> 01:00:20,000
Hiroki: "But you're both adorable in your own rights."

811
01:00:20,000 --> 01:00:25,000
Cosmos: "When it comes to pure lewdness, not even I can compete with Hazel."

812
01:00:25,000 --> 01:00:27,000
Cosmos: "She's so shameless!"

813
01:00:27,000 --> 01:00:32,000
Cosmos: "I would never go outside in a skirt, without wearing panties."

814
01:00:32,000 --> 01:00:34,000
Cosmos: "This is the best I can do."

815
01:00:34,000 --> 01:00:37,000
Cosmos: "I know I might not stack up to her, but..."

816
01:00:37,000 --> 01:00:39,000
Cosmos: "Did I do good?"

817
01:00:39,000 --> 01:00:41,000
Hiroki: "You did great."

818
01:00:41,000 --> 01:00:46,000
*I give Cosmos a thumbs up. She beams and claps her hands together.*

819
01:00:46,000 --> 01:00:47,000
Cosmos: "Yay~"

820
01:00:47,000 --> 01:00:52,000
*Cosmos's cuteness has helped me forget, for a few moments, how tired I am...*

821
01:00:52,000 --> 01:00:54,000
*But a few questions still remain.*

822
01:00:54,000 --> 01:00:59,000
Hiroki: "Did you walk here in that outfit, all the way from your home?"

823
01:00:59,000 --> 01:01:04,000
Cosmos: "I did, but don't worry. I wore a coat on top. Nobody should have seen."

824
01:01:04,000 --> 01:01:10,000
Cosmos: "I've worn even skimpier outfits than this to take photos for social media..."

825
01:01:10,000 --> 01:01:16,000
Cosmos: "But right now, you're the only person in the world who can see me like this."

826
01:01:16,000 --> 01:01:18,000
Cosmos: "I belong to you!"

827
01:01:18,000 --> 01:01:21,000
Hiroki: "That's a relief, at least..."

828
01:01:21,000 --> 01:01:27,000
*I wonder if she could get in trouble for flouting public decency laws in a get-up like that?*

829
01:01:27,000 --> 01:01:32,000
*It's not like she's revealing everything. Hostesses in bars sometimes wear less.*

830
01:01:32,000 --> 01:01:34,000
*I'd rather not risk it, though.*

831
01:01:34,000 --> 01:01:42,000
*It'd cause quite a stir if Cosmos Moretti, the famous RapidPounder, was incarcerated for being simply too lewd.*

832
01:01:42,000 --> 01:01:48,000
Hiroki: "And how'd you get into my apartment, anyway? I thought I locked the door."

833
01:01:48,000 --> 01:01:50,000
Hiroki: "Don't tell me I forgot..."

834
01:01:50,000 --> 01:01:54,000
*I hope I'm not going senile. I'm not even thirty yet!*

835
01:01:54,000 --> 01:01:56,000
Cosmos: "It was locked. Don't worry."

836
01:01:56,000 --> 01:02:02,000
Cosmos: "That didn't stop me, though. Nothing can get in the way of my love for you."

837
01:02:02,000 --> 01:02:05,000
Hiroki: "Ah, yes... I should've figured."

838
01:02:05,000 --> 01:02:11,000
*This isn't the first time Cosmos has bypassed locks and sneaked, unbidden, into my home.*

839
01:02:11,000 --> 01:02:17,000
*She's done it a couple of times already, which explains why I'm not more startled than I am.*

840
01:02:17,000 --> 01:02:19,000
*I guess I've become used to it.*

841
01:02:19,000 --> 01:02:27,000
*She freaked me out the first time she showed up in my apartment unannounced, but now I know she doesn't mean any harm.*

842
01:02:27,000 --> 01:02:32,000
*She's not a wicked succubus who wants to drain me of my life's essence.*

843
01:02:32,000 --> 01:02:34,000
*She just wants to be my girlfriend.*

844
01:02:34,000 --> 01:02:38,000
*She's pretty pushy about it, but her insistence is kinda cute.*

845
01:02:38,000 --> 01:02:44,000
*The other succubi need to step up their game, or Cosmos will take my heart in one fell swoop!*

846
01:02:44,000 --> 01:02:49,000
Cosmos: "Hey, Hiroki... Aren't you going to pay a little more attention to me?"

847
01:02:49,000 --> 01:02:54,000
Cosmos: "I did come all the way here to see you - and I was walking in heels!"

848
01:02:54,000 --> 01:02:57,000
Cosmos: "You should tell me that you love me."

849
01:02:57,000 --> 01:03:01,000
Cosmos: "You're my boyfriend, so... I only want you to look at me."

850
01:03:01,000 --> 01:03:04,000
Hiroki: "Right. I'm sorry, Cosmos. I just..."

851
01:03:04,000 --> 01:03:05,000
Hiroki: "Ah..."

852
01:03:05,000 --> 01:03:06,000
*My voice trails off.*

853
01:03:06,000 --> 01:03:14,000
*Cosmos is holding something in her hand. It looks like a paintbrush, its bristles dripping with brown... paint, is it?*

854
01:03:14,000 --> 01:03:19,000
*Actually, I'm not too sure about that. It smells a bit too sweet to be paint.*

855
01:03:19,000 --> 01:03:20,000
*Is that...*

856
01:03:20,000 --> 01:03:22,000
Hiroki: "Melted chocolate?"

857
01:03:22,000 --> 01:03:25,000
Cosmos: "Ding, ding. You got it. Well done!"

858
01:03:25,000 --> 01:03:29,000
Cosmos: "Since you're so smart, I'll give you a prize."

859
01:03:29,000 --> 01:03:34,000
Cosmos: "I'll cover myself in chocolate, and you can lick it off me."

860
01:03:34,000 --> 01:03:38,000
Cosmos: "It's been so long since we've spent any time together..."

861
01:03:38,000 --> 01:03:41,000
Cosmos: "I wanted to do something special."

862
01:03:41,000 --> 01:03:48,000
*Slowly, Cosmos daubs a brown heart upon her cleavage. The bristles press against her pale skin, dyeing it.*

863
01:03:48,000 --> 01:03:49,000
*I watch on, awed.*

864
01:03:49,000 --> 01:03:55,000
*Forget belly buttons and armpits. This sight is way more erotic than either of those things!*

865
01:03:55,000 --> 01:03:57,000
Cosmos: "So, Hiroki..."

866
01:03:57,000 --> 01:04:00,000
Cosmos: "Aren't you going to help me?"

867
01:04:00,000 --> 01:04:02,000
Hiroki: "H-Help you? With what?"

868
01:04:02,000 --> 01:04:04,000
Cosmos: "With my outfit, of course."

869
01:04:04,000 --> 01:04:08,000
Cosmos: "If this keeps up, it's going to get all dirty."

870
01:04:08,000 --> 01:04:17,000
Cosmos: "I love this bunny girl costume. I think it's really cute. I'd hate for it to get covered in sticky, goopy chocolate..."

871
01:04:17,000 --> 01:04:20,000
Cosmos: "So you'll have to help me remove it."

872
01:04:20,000 --> 01:04:23,000
Cosmos: "Doesn't that sound like fun?"

873
01:04:23,000 --> 01:04:27,000
Cosmos: "I'm getting excited just thinking about it!"

874
01:04:27,000 --> 01:04:34,000
*After that escapade, I wash my futon and scrub melted chocolate from the tatami floor as best I can.*

875
01:04:34,000 --> 01:04:38,000
*Cosmos hops into the shower, and she cleans herself.*

876
01:04:38,000 --> 01:04:44,000
*Fortunately, the chocolate comes away quite easily - but she does stain one of my towels brown.*

877
01:04:44,000 --> 01:04:48,000
*At least she has the wherewithal to look guilty about it.*

878
01:04:48,000 --> 01:04:52,000
*It's not like I'm really angry, either. It's only a stupid towel.*

879
01:04:52,000 --> 01:04:55,000
*Cosmos's happiness is far more important.*

880
01:04:55,000 --> 01:05:02,000
*By the time we've put everything right, the sun has risen. It's seven a.m. now: too late to go back to bed.*

881
01:05:02,000 --> 01:05:07,000
*I still feel tired, but I decide to go ahead with my promised date.*

882
01:05:07,000 --> 01:05:12,000
*We eat breakfast together in my kitchen, then set off to a nearby art gallery.*

883
01:05:12,000 --> 01:05:17,000
*Cosmos's experiment with the melted chocolate must have inspired me.*

884
01:05:17,000 --> 01:05:27,000
*We walk around and examine all the paintings, hand-in-hand. To any outside observer, I'm sure we look like any ordinary couple, out on a date.*

885
01:05:27,000 --> 01:05:33,000
*Cosmos is wearing her cat ears, like always, but we don't run into any of her adoring fans.*

886
01:05:33,000 --> 01:05:38,000
*Maybe they can't recognize her when she isn't wearing her more risque outfits?*

887
01:05:38,000 --> 01:05:47,000
*It doesn't seem like the men and women in this art gallery know Cosmos's real identity, either as a social media star or as a succubus.*

888
01:05:47,000 --> 01:05:51,000
*I doubt they know everything we did earlier this morning, either.*

889
01:05:51,000 --> 01:05:55,000
*Even I'm a little shaken, and I was an active participant!*

890
01:05:55,000 --> 01:05:57,000
*It doesn't quite feel real...*

891
01:05:57,000 --> 01:06:03,000
*But the sensation of Cosmos's palm in my own reassures me that this is my new reality.*

892
01:06:03,000 --> 01:06:11,000
*I don't just have one wonderful girlfriend. I have five, and I'm determined to make them all happy, even if it kills me.*

893
01:06:11,000 --> 01:06:15,000
*I care about them all far too much to choose favorites.*

894
01:06:15,000 --> 01:06:18,000
Cosmos: "Alright, darling! Open wide and say "aah"!"

895
01:06:18,000 --> 01:06:24,000
*After our trip to the art gallery, Cosmos asked if we could go to this cute café.*

896
01:06:24,000 --> 01:06:31,000
*It's a place I have many fond memories of. It was here Cosmos and I had our first real interaction.*

897
01:06:31,000 --> 01:06:41,000
*...Well, no, that's not quite right. Our first "real interaction" was on the train, when I was on my way to work, but I don't think that really counts.*

898
01:06:41,000 --> 01:06:47,000
*We didn't really talk. Cosmos just pushed herself up against me (most indecently, I might add).*

899
01:06:47,000 --> 01:06:50,000
*Back then, I didn't even know her name!*

900
01:06:50,000 --> 01:06:57,000
*I never imagined that our relationship would escalate as it has - or that we'd even have a relationship.*

901
01:06:57,000 --> 01:07:00,000
*Life sure does work in mysterious ways.*

902
01:07:00,000 --> 01:07:07,000
*She's my girlfriend now, though, and it was in this very café that she confessed her feelings to me.*

903
01:07:07,000 --> 01:07:11,000
*Though she barely knew me, she was certain she loved me.*

904
01:07:11,000 --> 01:07:21,000
*She was interested in the man who had ensnared her exacting older sisters, Marina and Ayu, so she decided to nominate herself as my girlfriend.*

905
01:07:21,000 --> 01:07:27,000
*Technically, she's still the only one of the five succubi I know who's my "girlfriend".*

906
01:07:27,000 --> 01:07:38,000
*Ayu calls me her cameraman, Marina calls me her partner, Hifumi calls me her husband, and Hazel calls me her wingman, but Cosmos is probably the most lovey-dovey.*

907
01:07:38,000 --> 01:07:42,000
*She likes holding my hand, sneaking kisses, embracing me, and...*

908
01:07:42,000 --> 01:07:46,000
Cosmos: "Come on, open up! If you don't, the ice cream will melt."

909
01:07:46,000 --> 01:07:50,000
Cosmos: "I don't want to waste it! It's really, really good!"

910
01:07:50,000 --> 01:07:51,000
Hiroki: "Well now..."

911
01:07:51,000 --> 01:07:53,000
*I cross my legs beneath the table.*

912
01:07:53,000 --> 01:08:03,000
*Since I'm kind of tall, my knees bump against the underside of the table, and it shakes - as does my black coffee and Cosmos's extravagant sundae.*

913
01:08:03,000 --> 01:08:08,000
*I swear, for such a skinny girl, Cosmos sure does eat a lot of sweets.*

914
01:08:08,000 --> 01:08:11,000
*I wonder where all the calories go? To her chest?*

915
01:08:11,000 --> 01:08:14,000
*That would certainly explain her figure.*

916
01:08:14,000 --> 01:08:20,000
Hiroki: "I'm not that big on sweets myself. I bought that sundae so you could enjoy it, not me."

917
01:08:20,000 --> 01:08:25,000
Cosmos: "But you've not eaten anything since breakfast! You'll go hungry!"

918
01:08:25,000 --> 01:08:26,000
*Cosmos pouts.*

919
01:08:26,000 --> 01:08:31,000
Cosmos: "Let me look after you! It's what a girlfriend's supposed to do!"

920
01:08:31,000 --> 01:08:35,000
Hiroki: "You get so insistent about the strangest of things."

921
01:08:35,000 --> 01:08:39,000
Cosmos: "I know I'm strange, but I don't think this is."

922
01:08:39,000 --> 01:08:40,000
*Cosmos pouts.*

923
01:08:40,000 --> 01:08:45,000
Cosmos: "You're my boyfriend and I want to look after you. That's normal."

924
01:08:45,000 --> 01:08:48,000
Cosmos: "At least, I think it's normal."

925
01:08:48,000 --> 01:08:52,000
Cosmos: "Lots of girls do stuff like this with their partners."

926
01:08:52,000 --> 01:08:59,000
Hiroki: "Guess you're right there. There's nothing wrong with wanting to make your significant other happy."

927
01:08:59,000 --> 01:09:01,000
Cosmos: "That's right!"

928
01:09:01,000 --> 01:09:08,000
*Cosmos nods enthusiastically. A few drops of half-melted ice cream drip from the spoon and land on the table.*

929
01:09:08,000 --> 01:09:11,000
Cosmos: "I'm glad we're on the same page."

930
01:09:11,000 --> 01:09:16,000
Cosmos: "You are my significant other, and you are very, very significant to me."

931
01:09:16,000 --> 01:09:23,000
Cosmos: "You have a big place in my heart. You make me happy, so I want to make you happy in return."

932
01:09:23,000 --> 01:09:27,000
Cosmos: "Ice cream makes me happy, so it should make you happy."

933
01:09:27,000 --> 01:09:28,000
Cosmos: "Now eat."

934
01:09:28,000 --> 01:09:31,000
*Cosmos jabs the spoon in my direction.*

935
01:09:31,000 --> 01:09:38,000
Cosmos: "Eat from the spoon that was in my mouth, and swallow my saliva along with the gooey melted ice cream!"

936
01:09:38,000 --> 01:09:40,000
Cosmos: "It will taste really good!"

937
01:09:40,000 --> 01:09:43,000
Hiroki: "You think your saliva tastes good?"

938
01:09:43,000 --> 01:09:47,000
Cosmos: "It can't taste bad, or I'd gag every time I swallow."

939
01:09:47,000 --> 01:09:48,000
Hiroki: "Good point."

940
01:09:48,000 --> 01:09:49,000
*I smile.*

941
01:09:49,000 --> 01:09:56,000
Hiroki: "Maybe you could do what Hifumi does and sell your bottled spit. I hear it's very lucrative."

942
01:09:56,000 --> 01:09:58,000
Cosmos: "Hifumi sells her spit?!"

943
01:09:58,000 --> 01:10:04,000
Hiroki: "In kuchikamizake, yeah. It's a special kind of sake made from fermented spit."

944
01:10:04,000 --> 01:10:05,000
Cosmos: "Wow..."

945
01:10:05,000 --> 01:10:07,000
*Cosmos's brow furrows.*

946
01:10:07,000 --> 01:10:10,000
Cosmos: "Hifumi is more degenerate than I thought."

947
01:10:10,000 --> 01:10:17,000
Hiroki: "I don't know if "degenerate" is the right word. It's a very dignified, ancient Japanese art!"

948
01:10:17,000 --> 01:10:20,000
Cosmos: "Do you think I'm dignified, Hiroki?"

949
01:10:20,000 --> 01:10:22,000
*I think you're adorable.":

950
01:10:22,000 --> 01:10:27,000
Hiroki: "I think you're adorable - even more so when you get all pouty."

951
01:10:27,000 --> 01:10:30,000
*I nudge Cosmos's foot beneath the table.*

952
01:10:30,000 --> 01:10:33,000
Hiroki: "I'm not big on sweets, like I said..."

953
01:10:33,000 --> 01:10:42,000
Hiroki: "But I have no problems with your spit - and I bet the ice cream will taste pretty good when fed to me by a total cutie like you."

954
01:10:42,000 --> 01:10:44,000
*I think you're a klutz.":

955
01:10:44,000 --> 01:10:48,000
Hiroki: "Nah. You're too much of a klutz to be dignified."

956
01:10:48,000 --> 01:10:52,000
Hiroki: "In fact, that's the last word I'd use to describe you!"

957
01:10:52,000 --> 01:10:53,000
Cosmos: "Huh?"

958
01:10:53,000 --> 01:10:54,000
*Cosmos pouts cutely.*

959
01:10:54,000 --> 01:10:56,000
Cosmos: "You're so mean!"

960
01:10:56,000 --> 01:11:00,000
Cosmos: "I'm trying to be nice to you, and you're teasing me!"

961
01:11:00,000 --> 01:11:03,000
Hiroki: "But I thought you liked being teased."

962
01:11:03,000 --> 01:11:08,000
Hiroki: "You didn't seem to have any problems with it earlier this morning..."

963
01:11:08,000 --> 01:11:09,000
*I grin.*

964
01:11:09,000 --> 01:11:14,000
Hiroki: "'Sides, I don't mind if you're a bit clumsy. It's part of your appeal."

965
01:11:14,000 --> 01:11:18,000
Hiroki: "Now, why don't you go ahead and feed me that ice cream?"

966
01:11:18,000 --> 01:11:26,000
Hiroki: "I have no problems with your spit, and I bet the ice cream will taste better when fed to me by a cutie like you."

967
01:11:26,000 --> 01:11:27,000
Cosmos: "E-Eh?!"

968
01:11:27,000 --> 01:11:30,000
*Cosmos blinks her big, shining eyes.*

969
01:11:30,000 --> 01:11:36,000
*Her face turns an adorable shade of pink as I slurp the ice cream from her spoon.*

970
01:11:36,000 --> 01:11:44,000
*She was the one who suggested (nay, demanded) that we share a spoon, but it looks like she's getting flustered.*

971
01:11:44,000 --> 01:11:46,000
Cosmos: "Hiroki, you, um..."

972
01:11:46,000 --> 01:11:54,000
*Cosmos shifts in her seat. She drops the spoon on the table with a clatter, then surveys me beneath her eyelashes.*

973
01:11:54,000 --> 01:11:57,000
Cosmos: "D-Do you really think I'm adorable?"

974
01:11:57,000 --> 01:12:03,000
*I swallow the ice cream with a shudder (I was right: it is too sweet), then smile.*

975
01:12:03,000 --> 01:12:06,000
Hiroki: "Of course I do. You're the best."

976
01:12:06,000 --> 01:12:08,000
Cosmos: "Uwaaah... Th-The best..."

977
01:12:08,000 --> 01:12:11,000
*Cosmos cups her cheeks with her hands.*

978
01:12:11,000 --> 01:12:14,000
Cosmos: "I've never been told that before."

979
01:12:14,000 --> 01:12:19,000
Hiroki: "Well, you'd better get used to it, 'cause I'm going to keep saying it."

980
01:12:19,000 --> 01:12:22,000
Hiroki: "Don't forget: I like you a lot."

981
01:12:22,000 --> 01:12:26,000
Hiroki: "If I didn't, we wouldn't be going on a date right now."

982
01:12:26,000 --> 01:12:27,000
Cosmos: "Waaah...!"

983
01:12:27,000 --> 01:12:28,000
*Cosmos squeaks.*

984
01:12:28,000 --> 01:12:33,000
Cosmos: "W-Well, I did assume you must like me. It is strange, though..."

985
01:12:33,000 --> 01:12:36,000
Hiroki: "Aren't you used to being liked?"

986
01:12:36,000 --> 01:12:43,000
Hiroki: "You're one of the most popular creators on RapidPound. You must get compliments every single day."

987
01:12:43,000 --> 01:12:50,000
Cosmos: "I do, but... the kindness of strangers, though appreciated, isn't the same as your kindness."

988
01:12:50,000 --> 01:12:55,000
Cosmos: "When those people compliment me, they usually talk about my body."

989
01:12:55,000 --> 01:13:01,000
Cosmos: "They don't know me as a person, so they can't talk about my personality..."

990
01:13:01,000 --> 01:13:06,000
Cosmos: "And, while they call me "sexy", they don't often call me "cute"."

991
01:13:06,000 --> 01:13:10,000
Hiroki: "Good. Then this can be a thing between me and you."

992
01:13:10,000 --> 01:13:20,000
Hiroki: "Your fans can call you sexy all they want, but I'll call you cute - and I want to see all the sides of you that you don't show anybody else."

993
01:13:20,000 --> 01:13:27,000
Hiroki: "We can go on dates together, and I'll do all the sappy couple things with you that you like."

994
01:13:27,000 --> 01:13:31,000
Hiroki: "You can feed me in public, and we can link arms..."

995
01:13:31,000 --> 01:13:35,000
Hiroki: "We'll do whatever you want, if it makes you happy."

996
01:13:35,000 --> 01:13:38,000
Cosmos: "What? No, that isn't how this works!"

997
01:13:38,000 --> 01:13:41,000
*Cosmos pouts and kicks me under the table.*

998
01:13:41,000 --> 01:13:44,000
Cosmos: "I'm supposed to make you happy!"

999
01:13:44,000 --> 01:13:47,000
Hiroki: "But I want to make you happy!"

1000
01:13:47,000 --> 01:13:50,000
Cosmos: "But I'm your girlfriend! It's my job!"

1001
01:13:50,000 --> 01:13:53,000
Hiroki: "No, it's not. Don't talk like that."

1002
01:13:53,000 --> 01:14:00,000
Hiroki: "I don't want you to think of this as a chore. I want you only to do things with me if you want to."

1003
01:14:00,000 --> 01:14:02,000
Hiroki: "Don't force yourself."

1004
01:14:02,000 --> 01:14:06,000
Cosmos: "I'm not! I'm more worried that I'm forcing you."

1005
01:14:06,000 --> 01:14:12,000
Cosmos: "I've never dated anybody before, and there's a lot of things I still don't understand."

1006
01:14:12,000 --> 01:14:16,000
Cosmos: "There's a lot of things I want to do with you, too."

1007
01:14:16,000 --> 01:14:19,000
Cosmos: "Being with you is exciting..."

1008
01:14:19,000 --> 01:14:22,000
Cosmos: "But I'm afraid I'm too demanding."

1009
01:14:22,000 --> 01:14:25,000
Cosmos: "I don't want to make you uncomfortable."

1010
01:14:25,000 --> 01:14:28,000
Hiroki: "You don't - and, if you did, I'd tell you."

1011
01:14:28,000 --> 01:14:30,000
*I ruffle the top of Cosmos's head.*

1012
01:14:30,000 --> 01:14:38,000
Hiroki: "Don't worry. We can't all be experienced with these things. It'll come with time, and we have plenty of that."

1013
01:14:38,000 --> 01:14:42,000
Hiroki: "It's not like I'm planning to break up with you."

1014
01:14:42,000 --> 01:14:44,000
Cosmos: "Oh, Hiroki... Thank you."

1015
01:14:44,000 --> 01:14:45,000
*Cosmos smiles.*

1016
01:14:45,000 --> 01:14:49,000
Cosmos: "You really are nice. I appreciate it a lot."

1017
01:14:49,000 --> 01:14:52,000
Cosmos: "You're so good to me, it makes me worry..."

1018
01:14:52,000 --> 01:14:53,000
Hiroki: "What about?"

1019
01:14:53,000 --> 01:14:57,000
Cosmos: "About what will happen if you have to leave me."

1020
01:14:57,000 --> 01:14:59,000
Hiroki: "Why would I ever do that?"

1021
01:14:59,000 --> 01:15:03,000
Hiroki: "Don't you believe me when I say I want to be with you?"

1022
01:15:03,000 --> 01:15:09,000
Hiroki: "I know I've been busy with work lately, but I really do want to stay by your side."

1023
01:15:09,000 --> 01:15:10,000
Cosmos: "Hehe."

1024
01:15:10,000 --> 01:15:11,000
*Cosmos giggles.*

1025
01:15:11,000 --> 01:15:17,000
Cosmos: "You say you don't like sweets, but you're a pretty good sweet talker yourself."

1026
01:15:17,000 --> 01:15:21,000
Cosmos: "Your words are even more sugary than my sundae."

1027
01:15:21,000 --> 01:15:29,000
Cosmos: "Hearing that makes me happy. Marina always scolds me, and Ayu teases me, but I think you understand me."

1028
01:15:29,000 --> 01:15:31,000
Cosmos: "You're so nice..."

1029
01:15:31,000 --> 01:15:38,000
Cosmos: "But you've ensnared so many hearts, it seems inevitable she'll notice. Then, she might get jealous."

1030
01:15:38,000 --> 01:15:40,000
Cosmos: "If she takes you from me.."

1031
01:15:40,000 --> 01:15:45,000
*Cosmos's brow furrows. She dips her head, her expression troubled.*

1032
01:15:45,000 --> 01:15:48,000
Cosmos: "Well. I'll just hope that doesn't happen."

1033
01:15:48,000 --> 01:15:51,000
Cosmos: "I don't want to say goodbye to you."

1034
01:15:51,000 --> 01:15:53,000
Cosmos: "I love you way too much."

1035
01:15:53,000 --> 01:15:54,000
*A few days later...*

1036
01:15:54,000 --> 01:15:58,000
Boss: "Ah! Ogasawara! You're just the man I want to see!"

1037
01:15:58,000 --> 01:16:03,000
*My boss greets me jovially when I arrive at work on Monday morning.*

1038
01:16:03,000 --> 01:16:09,000
*He slaps me on the back with one of his large, meaty hands, and I try to suppress a groan.*

1039
01:16:09,000 --> 01:16:19,000
*I'm glad my boss has warmed to me, after years of my working underneath him, but being in his good graces is almost as painful as being in his bad books.*

1040
01:16:19,000 --> 01:16:22,000
*Those hearty slaps of his hurt, damn it.*

1041
01:16:22,000 --> 01:16:29,000
*I'm not a small man by any means - I'm one of the tallest people in my office - but my boss is tall and wide.*

1042
01:16:29,000 --> 01:16:33,000
*I think he must have an extra 100 pounds on me, if not more.*

1043
01:16:33,000 --> 01:16:36,000
*I hope he hasn't left any bruises...*

1044
01:16:36,000 --> 01:16:45,000
Boss: "Now, what are you doing, lad? Sit down. Sit. I have something I want to discuss with you! It's a highly important matter."

1045
01:16:45,000 --> 01:16:46,000
Hiroki: "Right..."

1046
01:16:46,000 --> 01:16:48,000
Hiroki: "What is it...?"

1047
01:16:48,000 --> 01:16:57,000
Boss: "I have a job for you. It should prove to be pretty interesting, too: more so than taking photos at dull political events!"

1048
01:16:57,000 --> 01:16:58,000
Hiroki: "Uh-huh..."

1049
01:16:58,000 --> 01:17:04,000
*I've been working at this company long enough to know what my boss considers newsworthy.*

1050
01:17:04,000 --> 01:17:10,000
*He's a bit of a lech, and he loves running articles on famous idols, actresses, pin-up models.*

1051
01:17:10,000 --> 01:17:22,000
*This is ostensibly in the name of selling more copies of our newspaper, but in actuality, I think my boss just likes gawking at all the photographs of pretty women I snap for him.*

1052
01:17:22,000 --> 01:17:36,000
*There's nothing wrong with gawking at pretty women, of course (idols, actresses, and pin-up models are in the business of being gawked at), but my boss doesn't do much to hide his... interests, shall we say.*

1053
01:17:36,000 --> 01:17:37,000
*He's so transparent.*

1054
01:17:37,000 --> 01:17:42,000
Hiroki: "So, what's this job? Do you want me to meet some celeb again?"

1055
01:17:42,000 --> 01:17:52,000
Boss: "Yes, indeed. I have it on good authority that there should be several important people at this event: Wakatsuki Marina chief among them!"

1056
01:17:52,000 --> 01:17:53,000
Hiroki: "Marina?"

1057
01:17:53,000 --> 01:17:55,000
*I sit up a little straighter.*

1058
01:17:55,000 --> 01:17:58,000
*Marina's name has piqued my interest.*

1059
01:17:58,000 --> 01:18:03,000
Hiroki: "Do you want me to take some photos of her for an upcoming article?"

1060
01:18:03,000 --> 01:18:06,000
Boss: "Her, and whoever else happens to be there."

1061
01:18:06,000 --> 01:18:14,000
Boss: "A big charity event's going to be held the weekend after next, you see. It's all been set up by Miss Wakatsuki."

1062
01:18:14,000 --> 01:18:24,000
Boss: "She's arranged a ball for the social elite, with champagne and caviar: the works. There'll be an orchestra, and hundreds of people will be there."

1063
01:18:24,000 --> 01:18:32,000
Boss: "The price of entry is steep, but all proceeds will go towards developing a new children's wing at a local hospital."

1064
01:18:32,000 --> 01:18:34,000
Hiroki: "Oh, really? I hadn't heard."

1065
01:18:34,000 --> 01:18:37,000
Boss: "Didn't Miss Wakatsuki tell you about it?"

1066
01:18:37,000 --> 01:18:41,000
Hiroki: "She didn't have a chance. She's been so busy with work..."

1067
01:18:41,000 --> 01:18:53,000
*Maybe this is why it's been so silent on the Marina front for the last few weeks. She must've been busy arranging this charity ball, on top of all her other responsibilities.*

1068
01:18:53,000 --> 01:18:55,000
*Marina sure is a hard worker.*

1069
01:18:55,000 --> 01:19:01,000
Boss: "That's a shame. I'm rather banking on your continued relationship with Miss Wakatsuki."

1070
01:19:01,000 --> 01:19:07,000
Boss: "It's thanks to your relationship that we're being invited to all these prestigious jobs!"

1071
01:19:07,000 --> 01:19:09,000
*My boss slaps me on my back, hard.*

1072
01:19:09,000 --> 01:19:12,000
Boss: "Don't let her get away from you, now!"

1073
01:19:12,000 --> 01:19:15,000
Hiroki: "I-I, uh... I'll do my best, sir..."

1074
01:19:15,000 --> 01:19:18,000
*Not that Marina's a fish or anything.*

1075
01:19:18,000 --> 01:19:20,000
Boss: "Good lad! That's the spirit!"

1076
01:19:20,000 --> 01:19:27,000
Boss: "Marina mightn't have informed you about this event, but she was kind enough to tell me all about it."

1077
01:19:27,000 --> 01:19:33,000
Boss: "She sent me an email this morning, asking if I wished to cover it in my paper."

1078
01:19:33,000 --> 01:19:40,000
Boss: "She requested that I send you over to take some photos of it. It's good PR for her and her company."

1079
01:19:40,000 --> 01:19:42,000
Hiroki: "She asked for me?"

1080
01:19:42,000 --> 01:19:43,000
Boss: "By name."

1081
01:19:43,000 --> 01:19:46,000
Boss: "Do you think you're up to the challenge?"

1082
01:19:46,000 --> 01:19:54,000
*My coworkers are beginning to whisper at this. They're trying to keep their voices down, but I can still hear them.*

1083
01:19:54,000 --> 01:19:56,000
Coworker: "What? Ogasawara again?"

1084
01:19:56,000 --> 01:20:02,000
Coworker 2: "He's not the only photographer in the office. Why does he get all the best jobs?"

1085
01:20:02,000 --> 01:20:09,000
Coworker 3: "The boss never used to rate him so much, but now he's putting all his faith in him. It isn't fair!"

1086
01:20:09,000 --> 01:20:16,000
Coworker 2: "I'm a better photographer than he is. If anybody deserves to go to this event, it's me!"

1087
01:20:16,000 --> 01:20:26,000
Coworker 4: "Well, we all know life isn't fair. It's not a meritocracy. Whether you get ahead or not, it's all determined by who you know, not what."

1088
01:20:26,000 --> 01:20:31,000
Coworker 2: "I sure wish Wakatsuki Marina would pay attention to me..."

1089
01:20:31,000 --> 01:20:34,000
Coworker: "What does she see in Ogasawara, anyway?"

1090
01:20:34,000 --> 01:20:40,000
Coworker 3: "This is it. It's official. There is no God. I have no faith in this world!"

1091
01:20:40,000 --> 01:20:46,000
*My coworkers commiserate with one another, all the while shooting me vicious glances.*

1092
01:20:46,000 --> 01:20:50,000
*If looks could kill, I'd be dead several times over.*

1093
01:20:50,000 --> 01:20:54,000
*Fortunately, looks can't kill, and I'm very much alive.*

1094
01:20:54,000 --> 01:20:56,000
*I just need to try and ignore them.*

1095
01:20:56,000 --> 01:21:05,000
*Being the object of the office's collective jealousy is painful, but there's no point trying to argue back. It'd be a waste of my breath...*

1096
01:21:05,000 --> 01:21:12,000
*And, in any case, I'm too excited about this opportunity to pay what they have to say much heed.*

1097
01:21:12,000 --> 01:21:22,000
*The ball itself sounds like it'll be a fun event (maybe I'll be able to try foie gras!), but I'm more excited about seeing Marina again. It's been ages.*

1098
01:21:22,000 --> 01:21:25,000
Hiroki: "Y-Yes, sir! I'll do my best!"

1099
01:21:25,000 --> 01:21:35,000
Boss: "I knew you would. Make sure you make a good impression. You'll be representing our paper to a whole ballroom full of the rich and the famous."

1100
01:21:35,000 --> 01:21:42,000
Boss: "Make sure you brush your hair, for once - and don't wear those awful jeans. Rent yourself a nice suit."

1101
01:21:42,000 --> 01:21:43,000
Hiroki: "Yes, sir..."

1102
01:21:43,000 --> 01:21:46,000
*I reply, with a touch less enthusiasm than before.*

1103
01:21:46,000 --> 01:21:52,000
*I've never thought of my boss as a very homey guy, but he's starting to sound like my dad.*

1104
01:21:52,000 --> 01:22:02,000
*I wonder if my boss has any kids of his own. He's old enough for it, but I've never heard him mention having a wife (or a mistress), nor a family...*

1105
01:22:02,000 --> 01:22:10,000
Boss: "I want you to take a lot of photographs. You need to capture the glitz and the glamor of this event in its fullest!"

1106
01:22:10,000 --> 01:22:15,000
Boss: "You can't afford to screw this up. It's an incredible opportunity!"

1107
01:22:15,000 --> 01:22:18,000
Boss: "And, if it's not too much trouble..."

1108
01:22:18,000 --> 01:22:19,000
*My boss grins.*

1109
01:22:19,000 --> 01:22:26,000
Boss: "...I'd like you to butter Miss Wakatsuki up, too. Flatter her ego. Try and keep in her good books."

1110
01:22:26,000 --> 01:22:31,000
Boss: "Offer to dance with her, maybe, if the opportunity arises..."

1111
01:22:31,000 --> 01:22:37,000
Boss: "And if she invites you back to her hotel room, don't turn her down, for pity's sake."

1112
01:22:37,000 --> 01:22:44,000
Boss: "Miss Wakatsuki is a very important business connection for us. I'd hate for you to turn her against us."

1113
01:22:44,000 --> 01:22:46,000
Hiroki: "I'll do my best, sir..."

1114
01:22:46,000 --> 01:22:49,000
*I reassure my boss, not that I really need to.*

1115
01:22:49,000 --> 01:22:58,000
*The full extent of my relationship with Marina isn't public knowledge, but it's progressed further than I think even my boss realizes.*

1116
01:22:58,000 --> 01:23:01,000
*We're bound together by a strong bond.*

1117
01:23:01,000 --> 01:23:08,000
*I care for Marina deeply, and I'm sure she cares for me. That'll be why she invited me to this event.*

1118
01:23:08,000 --> 01:23:11,000
*I bet she wants to spend time with me, too.*

1119
01:23:11,000 --> 01:23:18,000
*This isn't just a good gig. This is a chance to spend a bit of quality time with a woman I love.*

1120
01:23:18,000 --> 01:23:19,000
*I can hardly wait.*

1121
01:23:19,000 --> 01:23:25,000
*I just wonder what sort of dress she'll be wearing to this most prestigious of events.*

1122
01:23:25,000 --> 01:23:29,000
*Time passes, and the date of Marina's charity ball arrives.*

1123
01:23:29,000 --> 01:23:34,000
*I buy myself a nice suit several days in advance, just like my boss instructed.*

1124
01:23:34,000 --> 01:23:39,000
*It's costly, but buying it outright isn't much more expensive than renting.*

1125
01:23:39,000 --> 01:23:46,000
*Moreover, I tell myself, if Marina invites me to even more of these events, I'll need a nice suit of my own.*

1126
01:23:46,000 --> 01:23:52,000
*Maybe it's presumptuous of me to assume I'll receive any future invitations like this...*

1127
01:23:52,000 --> 01:23:55,000
*But I don't see why Marina wouldn't.*

1128
01:23:55,000 --> 01:24:00,000
*We are partners, after all, and I don't mean that in the business sense.*

1129
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:08,000
*The ball takes place in a fancy government building with smooth marble floors and gilt chandeliers hanging from the ceiling.*

1130
01:24:08,000 --> 01:24:15,000
*I don't arrive late by any means, but there's already a lot of people thronging the ballroom when I do arrive.*

1131
01:24:15,000 --> 01:24:20,000
*There's a lot of wealthy women wearing extravagant, elaborate dresses...*

1132
01:24:20,000 --> 01:24:23,000
*But nobody looks more beautiful than Marina.*

1133
01:24:23,000 --> 01:24:33,000
*She's resplendent in a crimson grown with a very low back. The dress clings to her every single curve, and it makes her look more gorgeous than ever.*

1134
01:24:33,000 --> 01:24:41,000
*When she sees me, she flits over to me, a glass of champagne in one hand and a bright smile upon her made-up face.*

1135
01:24:41,000 --> 01:24:45,000
Marina: "Hiroki! It really is wonderful to see you here!"

1136
01:24:45,000 --> 01:24:51,000
Hiroki: "It's good to see you, too, Marina... but should you really be talking to me now?"

1137
01:24:51,000 --> 01:24:53,000
Marina: "Why shouldn't I?"

1138
01:24:53,000 --> 01:24:55,000
*Marina purses her lips.*

1139
01:24:55,000 --> 01:25:02,000
Marina: "You forget, I am the one who arranged this event. I should be allowed to speak to whomever I wish."

1140
01:25:02,000 --> 01:25:05,000
Hiroki: "I'm not saying you can't. It's just..."

1141
01:25:05,000 --> 01:25:13,000
*I crane my neck about the luxurious room. Most of these people are unfamiliar to me, but a handful look familiar.*

1142
01:25:13,000 --> 01:25:23,000
*I'm sure I've seen the man in the suit (though that's not very descriptive. All the men here are wearing suits) by the trestle table of canapés before.*

1143
01:25:23,000 --> 01:25:27,000
*Is he a politician? I distinctly remember seeing him on TV.*

1144
01:25:27,000 --> 01:25:38,000
*I think that bald man conversing with a gaggle of pretty, leggy ladies is a politician too. Isn't he the minister of welfare? Education? It's something like that.*

1145
01:25:38,000 --> 01:25:49,000
*That woman over there is a popular enka singer from the 80s, and I'm sure the man she's walking with, arm-in-arm, is the owner of a large electronics company.*

1146
01:25:49,000 --> 01:25:54,000
*This place is crawling with the rich, the mighty, and the important!*

1147
01:25:54,000 --> 01:25:57,000
*How many connections does Marina have, anyway?!*

1148
01:25:57,000 --> 01:26:05,000
Hiroki: "There's a lot of people here with way more influence than me. Shouldn't you be trying to butter them up?"

1149
01:26:05,000 --> 01:26:08,000
Marina: "All in due time, my dear Hiroki."

1150
01:26:08,000 --> 01:26:16,000
Marina: "The mere fact I invited them here, to this gathering of elites, should be enough to flatter most of their egos."

1151
01:26:16,000 --> 01:26:25,000
Marina: "You're quite right that I'll have to do a bit more schmoozing throughout the night, but I can spare at least a few minutes for you!"

1152
01:26:25,000 --> 01:26:27,000
Hiroki: "But I'm nobody special..."

1153
01:26:27,000 --> 01:26:29,000
Marina: "Darling, please."

1154
01:26:29,000 --> 01:26:37,000
*Marina hands her glass of half-drunk champagne to a conveniently passing waiter, then takes my hands in her own.*

1155
01:26:37,000 --> 01:26:41,000
Marina: "To me, you are the most important person here."

1156
01:26:41,000 --> 01:26:49,000
Marina: "You might not have as much money as the rest of this crowd, but I know you on a far more personal level than most."

1157
01:26:49,000 --> 01:26:58,000
Marina: "I know that you are a sweet, kind man, who would do anything to help those in need. That is more than can be said for most!"

1158
01:26:58,000 --> 01:27:06,000
Hiroki: "But this is a charity event. I doubt these people would have come here if they didn't want to help those in need?"

1159
01:27:06,000 --> 01:27:07,000
Marina: "Oh, no."

1160
01:27:07,000 --> 01:27:09,000
*Marina wrinkles her nose.*

1161
01:27:09,000 --> 01:27:18,000
Marina: "When you've been to as many of these events as I have, you'll learn that this is all for show. These people are posturing."

1162
01:27:18,000 --> 01:27:24,000
Marina: "They want to look good to the cameras, the newspapers, and the general public."

1163
01:27:24,000 --> 01:27:32,000
Marina: "That's why they come to events like this, and that's why they donate so much of their money to charity."

1164
01:27:32,000 --> 01:27:35,000
Marina: "Well, that and the tax breaks."

1165
01:27:35,000 --> 01:27:45,000
Marina: "You can write donations off, so you don't need to pay tax on them. Most of the very rich do it as a means to safeguard their own cash."

1166
01:27:45,000 --> 01:27:54,000
Marina: "I'd wager the majority of the people here are wholly self-interested. They don't really care about anything but themselves."

1167
01:27:54,000 --> 01:27:59,000
Marina: "You're different, though. That's why I'm so very fond of you, see?"

1168
01:27:59,000 --> 01:28:04,000
Hiroki: "I don't think I'm all that great, but thanks for the vote of confidence."

1169
01:28:04,000 --> 01:28:10,000
Hiroki: "I've been feeling distinctly out-of-the-loop ever since I got here, ahaha..."

1170
01:28:10,000 --> 01:28:18,000
Hiroki: "Other than you, nobody's come to talk to me at all. It's like they can smell money... or my lack of it."

1171
01:28:18,000 --> 01:28:22,000
Marina: "Don't pay them any heed. I won't, while I'm with you."

1172
01:28:22,000 --> 01:28:23,000
Marina: "Now!"

1173
01:28:23,000 --> 01:28:28,000
*Marina's expression brightens as the violin quartet in the corner begin to play.*

1174
01:28:28,000 --> 01:28:33,000
Marina: "I'm rather fond of this song! Would you care to dance with me, Hiroki?"

1175
01:28:33,000 --> 01:28:34,000
*Of course I would!":

1176
01:28:34,000 --> 01:28:40,000
Hiroki: "I'd love to dance with you, Marina. In fact, I can think of nothing I'd like more."

1177
01:28:40,000 --> 01:28:44,000
Hiroki: "You really do look beautiful in that dress, by the by."

1178
01:28:44,000 --> 01:28:47,000
Hiroki: "I can't wait to press you against my body."

1179
01:28:47,000 --> 01:28:51,000
*I grin, my self-confidence bolstered by the glitzy atmosphere.*

1180
01:28:51,000 --> 01:28:54,000
*I'm almost starting to feel like an elite myself!*

1181
01:28:54,000 --> 01:28:58,000
Hiroki: "I bet all the old guys here will be super jealous."

1182
01:28:58,000 --> 01:29:00,000
Marina: "I'm sure they will."

1183
01:29:00,000 --> 01:29:01,000
*Marina titters.*

1184
01:29:01,000 --> 01:29:06,000
Marina: "I am a very popular woman. My company is in high demand..."

1185
01:29:06,000 --> 01:29:08,000
Marina: "But worry not."

1186
01:29:08,000 --> 01:29:10,000
Marina: "I only have eyes for you."

1187
01:29:10,000 --> 01:29:13,000
Marina: "Now, come with me. Follow my lead."

1188
01:29:13,000 --> 01:29:14,000
*I'm not so sure...":

1189
01:29:14,000 --> 01:29:20,000
Hiroki: "Wouldn't that raise eyebrows? You can't give me your very first dance of the evening!"

1190
01:29:20,000 --> 01:29:27,000
Marina: "Hiroki, please. We've been through this. I can do whatever I like. I have enough money for it!"

1191
01:29:27,000 --> 01:29:28,000
Hiroki: "But-"

1192
01:29:28,000 --> 01:29:29,000
Marina: "Ah, ah, ah!"

1193
01:29:29,000 --> 01:29:32,000
*Marina tuts and wags a finger in my face.*

1194
01:29:32,000 --> 01:29:34,000
Marina: "I'm not listening."

1195
01:29:34,000 --> 01:29:38,000
Marina: "Now, come on! When will we next get a chance like this?"

1196
01:29:38,000 --> 01:29:46,000
*Marina takes her hand in mine and pulls me onto the dance floor, where numerous other couples are already waltzing.*

1197
01:29:46,000 --> 01:29:51,000
*I feel very tall and gangly in my suit, and I almost trip over my own feet.*

1198
01:29:51,000 --> 01:29:55,000
*It feels like everybody in the room's staring at me.*

1199
01:29:55,000 --> 01:29:56,000
*My face burns.*

1200
01:29:56,000 --> 01:30:01,000
Hiroki: "M-Marina, please! I don't know how to dance! I've never done it before!"

1201
01:30:01,000 --> 01:30:06,000
Marina: "Then I'll teach you. It's really very simple. Hands here, Hiroki."

1202
01:30:06,000 --> 01:30:10,000
*Marina takes my hand and rests it upon the small of her back.*

1203
01:30:10,000 --> 01:30:16,000
*Our bodies are pressed up close together. I can feel Marina's chest pushed up against my own.*

1204
01:30:16,000 --> 01:30:22,000
*When I inhale, I catch a whiff of her perfume. It's soft and fragrant, like flowers.*

1205
01:30:22,000 --> 01:30:24,000
Marina: "Now, do you feel alright?"

1206
01:30:24,000 --> 01:30:26,000
Hiroki: "I'm getting the hang of it."

1207
01:30:26,000 --> 01:30:34,000
Marina: "Good. Then keep your eyes on me. Follow my footsteps. Don't worry about keeping time to the music: I can lead you."

1208
01:30:34,000 --> 01:30:37,000
Marina: "I have experience with this sort of thing."

1209
01:30:37,000 --> 01:30:45,000
*Marina sways to and fro with the music, her hand clasped in my own. Her white hair flutters, as does her long red gown.*

1210
01:30:45,000 --> 01:30:51,000
*She looks entirely in her element. Her body is relaxed, and there's a smile on her face.*

1211
01:30:51,000 --> 01:30:55,000
Marina: "Do you think you're getting the hang of this, Hiroki?"

1212
01:30:55,000 --> 01:30:59,000
Hiroki: "Maybe. I just hope I don't step on your feet."

1213
01:30:59,000 --> 01:31:04,000
Marina: "It'll be fine, dear! Just let yourself go! Give in to the music, or..."

1214
01:31:04,000 --> 01:31:09,000
*Marina smiles seductively, pushing her full bosom up against my chest.*

1215
01:31:09,000 --> 01:31:13,000
Marina: "...if that isn't possible, give yourself up to me."

1216
01:31:13,000 --> 01:31:14,000
Hiroki: "Ulp..."

1217
01:31:14,000 --> 01:31:15,000
*I swallow.*

1218
01:31:15,000 --> 01:31:19,000
*Marina's so seductive, she's making my spine tingle.*

1219
01:31:19,000 --> 01:31:23,000
*Since her body's so close to mine, I can't help but stare at her!*

1220
01:31:23,000 --> 01:31:24,000
Marina: "Hey, now!"

1221
01:31:24,000 --> 01:31:27,000
*Marina's fingers tighten about my own. She pouts.*

1222
01:31:27,000 --> 01:31:31,000
Marina: "Eyes on my face while we're in public, if you please."

1223
01:31:31,000 --> 01:31:41,000
Marina: "I don't mind if you want to stare at my chest later, when we're alone, but at the present your drooling might cause something of a scandal!"

1224
01:31:41,000 --> 01:31:44,000
Hiroki: "O-Oh, uh... I'm sorry about that?"

1225
01:31:44,000 --> 01:31:50,000
Marina: "Ehehe~ It's quite alright. I'm flattered that you like staring so much, really."

1226
01:31:50,000 --> 01:31:57,000
Marina: "I know I'm a bit older than Ayu and Cosmos. Sometimes, I do worry I'm not enough to satisfy you..."

1227
01:31:57,000 --> 01:32:01,000
Marina: "But I'm glad my body can excite you all the same!"

1228
01:32:01,000 --> 01:32:03,000
Hiroki: "You're really not that old."

1229
01:32:03,000 --> 01:32:05,000
Marina: "I'm older than you."

1230
01:32:05,000 --> 01:32:13,000
Hiroki: "By, like, three or four years. It's not a big deal. Besides, you look a lot younger. Your skin is so soft and smooth!"

1231
01:32:13,000 --> 01:32:16,000
Marina: "Why, thank you~ You really are a charmer!"

1232
01:32:16,000 --> 01:32:21,000
Marina: "Now, let's keep going. One, two, three, one, two, three..."

1233
01:32:21,000 --> 01:32:25,000
*Marina counts the beat of the song while I try to keep up.*

1234
01:32:25,000 --> 01:32:30,000
*Dancing was a struggle at first, but I think I'm starting to get the hang of it.*

1235
01:32:30,000 --> 01:32:37,000
*My body relaxes instinctively against Marina's, and I almost find myself enjoying the experience.*

1236
01:32:37,000 --> 01:32:40,000
*I never knew dancing could be so much fun!*

1237
01:32:40,000 --> 01:32:43,000
Marina: "There you are! You're a natural!"

1238
01:32:43,000 --> 01:32:45,000
Hiroki: "You really think so?"

1239
01:32:45,000 --> 01:32:49,000
Marina: "Mmhmm. You haven't stepped on my feet just yet, have you?"

1240
01:32:49,000 --> 01:32:50,000
*She giggles.*

1241
01:32:50,000 --> 01:32:58,000
Marina: "With a bit more instruction, you would make a fine dancer. You just need to have more confidence in yourself!"

1242
01:32:58,000 --> 01:33:04,000
Marina: "I wish we could dance the rest of the night away, but alas, this song will soon end..."

1243
01:33:04,000 --> 01:33:05,000
*She sighs.*

1244
01:33:05,000 --> 01:33:14,000
Marina: "After this, I'll have to start playing the hostess again. I'll have to leave you on your own for a little while. Is that alright?"

1245
01:33:14,000 --> 01:33:19,000
Hiroki: "It's fine. I have some photographs I need to take, anyway."

1246
01:33:19,000 --> 01:33:23,000
Marina: "Ah, yes! You are here for work, not pleasure, aren't you?"

1247
01:33:23,000 --> 01:33:26,000
Marina: "I suppose we're the same, in that regard!"

1248
01:33:26,000 --> 01:33:31,000
Marina: "Well then. I shan't keep you too much longer - but Hiroki..."

1249
01:33:31,000 --> 01:33:34,000
*Marina's fingers squeeze mine insistently.*

1250
01:33:34,000 --> 01:33:39,000
Marina: "Would you care to come back to my hotel with me when all this is over?"

1251
01:33:39,000 --> 01:33:44,000
Marina: "Dancing with you was fun, but it wasn't quite enough to satisfy me."

1252
01:33:44,000 --> 01:33:49,000
Marina: "I would love to spend even more time with you, in private..."

1253
01:33:49,000 --> 01:33:51,000
Marina: "Wouldn't you?"

1254
01:33:51,000 --> 01:33:52,000
*The next morning...*

1255
01:33:52,000 --> 01:33:57,000
Marina: "Aaah! It's been a long time since I had such a refreshing night's sleep!"

1256
01:33:57,000 --> 01:34:01,000
Marina: "You're quite the comfortable pillow, Hiroki!"

1257
01:34:01,000 --> 01:34:04,000
Hiroki: "Ahaha... Don't mention it..."

1258
01:34:04,000 --> 01:34:11,000
*It's only a little past seven a.m., but Marina's already up and dressed in her standard business attire.*

1259
01:34:11,000 --> 01:34:16,000
*Her white-blonde hair has been combed and her suit is devoid of wrinkles.*

1260
01:34:16,000 --> 01:34:23,000
*I guess Marina must've prepared to spend the night in a hotel, to have a change of clothes to hand.*

1261
01:34:23,000 --> 01:34:26,000
*She really does think of everything.*

1262
01:34:26,000 --> 01:34:34,000
*She left the slinky red dress she wore last night in a heap on the hotel room floor, but it's since been picked up.*

1263
01:34:34,000 --> 01:34:40,000
*Said dress is now hanging outside the wardrobe, encased in a protective plastic bag.*

1264
01:34:40,000 --> 01:34:51,000
*I think it might be a little too late to worry about protecting that dress. It's been creased and wrinkled to high heaven, and I might even have gotten it a little wet.*

1265
01:34:51,000 --> 01:34:54,000
*Things were kind of wild last night...*

1266
01:34:54,000 --> 01:34:57,000
Hiroki: "Hey, Marina... I was wondering..."

1267
01:34:57,000 --> 01:34:59,000
Marina: "Yes? What is it?"

1268
01:34:59,000 --> 01:35:02,000
Hiroki: "How much did that dress cost?"

1269
01:35:02,000 --> 01:35:05,000
Marina: "Now, let me see. It was quite expensive."

1270
01:35:05,000 --> 01:35:07,000
Marina: "It's a designer piece by..."

1271
01:35:07,000 --> 01:35:12,000
*Marina trots out the name of a high-end brand with international renown.*

1272
01:35:12,000 --> 01:35:20,000
*I don't know all that much about fashion, but a dress from that fashion house must have cost an enormous amount!*

1273
01:35:20,000 --> 01:35:26,000
*I wouldn't be surprised if it's worth more than a full month - no, six months! - of my salary!*

1274
01:35:26,000 --> 01:35:27,000
Hiroki: "Ah, geez..."

1275
01:35:27,000 --> 01:35:34,000
*It's only now, in the dawning of the morning, that I've realized the enormity of last night's thoughtlessness.*

1276
01:35:34,000 --> 01:35:41,000
Hiroki: "I figured that dress was a designer piece, but I didn't realize it was from that company..."

1277
01:35:41,000 --> 01:35:46,000
Hiroki: "If I'd have known, I would've been more careful with it..."

1278
01:35:46,000 --> 01:35:51,000
Hiroki: "I'm sorry, Marina! I really, truly didn't mean to get it dirty!"

1279
01:35:51,000 --> 01:35:53,000
Marina: "Hm? What's this?"

1280
01:35:53,000 --> 01:35:54,000
*Marina grins.*

1281
01:35:54,000 --> 01:36:00,000
Marina: "You don't think I care about a silly dress more than our relationship, do you?"

1282
01:36:00,000 --> 01:36:02,000
Hiroki: "What? But, uh..."

1283
01:36:02,000 --> 01:36:06,000
*Marina's tone makes me pause. I blink at her, nonplussed.*

1284
01:36:06,000 --> 01:36:11,000
Hiroki: "That dress isn't silly. It must've cost at least a million yen..."

1285
01:36:11,000 --> 01:36:13,000
Marina: "Only a million?"

1286
01:36:13,000 --> 01:36:16,000
*Marina raises a neatly-sculpted eyebrow.*

1287
01:36:16,000 --> 01:36:22,000
Marina: "My dear Hiroki, you are underestimating me! This piece is entirely unique!"

1288
01:36:22,000 --> 01:36:29,000
Marina: "It was tailor made for me, by a professional in the industry, to my exact specifications!"

1289
01:36:29,000 --> 01:36:39,000
Marina: "It was more than just one million yen. I would never wear something so cheap to a widely publicized charity event of my own organizing!"

1290
01:36:39,000 --> 01:36:40,000
Hiroki: "H-Huh?"

1291
01:36:40,000 --> 01:36:42,000
*My dumbstruck stare widens.*

1292
01:36:42,000 --> 01:36:45,000
Hiroki: "Are you saying one million yen is cheap?"

1293
01:36:45,000 --> 01:36:47,000
Marina: "To a woman like me, it is."

1294
01:36:47,000 --> 01:36:57,000
Marina: "You forget, I am always in the public eye. People expect more of me than they do the average woman. I have a lot of expectations to meet."

1295
01:36:57,000 --> 01:37:05,000
Marina: "If I did not wear the most expensive, unique pieces to my own charity events, I would be mocked and branded a pauper!"

1296
01:37:05,000 --> 01:37:12,000
Marina: "There would be stories run about my poor fashion sensibilities in magazines across the country!"

1297
01:37:12,000 --> 01:37:13,000
Hiroki: "Really...?"

1298
01:37:13,000 --> 01:37:23,000
Marina: "Really. The world of tabloid magazines is nasty and cut-throat. Unscrupulous reporters always try to drag the rich and the famous down."

1299
01:37:23,000 --> 01:37:28,000
Marina: "I thought you would know that, working in the industry yourself."

1300
01:37:28,000 --> 01:37:32,000
Hiroki: "I guess... But I don't work for a tabloid magazine."

1301
01:37:32,000 --> 01:37:42,000
Hiroki: "The Sakura Daily might be a little trashy, but it's still a proper newspaper. We don't run all that many articles on celebs' clothing..."

1302
01:37:42,000 --> 01:37:49,000
*My boss is far more interested in what lies beneath said clothing than how much it costs, anyway.*

1303
01:37:49,000 --> 01:37:51,000
Marina: "Ehehe. But of course."

1304
01:37:51,000 --> 01:37:52,000
*Marina giggles.*

1305
01:37:52,000 --> 01:37:59,000
Marina: "I know you aren't a vulture like the rest, darling, but others aren't as forgiving as you are."

1306
01:37:59,000 --> 01:38:05,000
Marina: "Once one has reached the heights, one has to be aware of their appearance at all times!"

1307
01:38:05,000 --> 01:38:14,000
Marina: "It's almost as tiring as running my own company, if I'm being perfectly honest. The continued media attention is exhausting..."

1308
01:38:14,000 --> 01:38:18,000
Marina: "But I do my best to give them a show all the same."

1309
01:38:18,000 --> 01:38:27,000
Marina: "As such, I really couldn't afford to wear a dress that costs anything less than three million yen. That is the bare minimum."

1310
01:38:27,000 --> 01:38:30,000
Marina: "Anything less would only invite scorn!"

1311
01:38:30,000 --> 01:38:33,000
Hiroki: "Th-Three million?! N-No way..."

1312
01:38:33,000 --> 01:38:42,000
*I look at the crumpled dress, sheathed within its plastic wrap, then back to Marina. Towards the dress, and over to Marina again.*

1313
01:38:42,000 --> 01:38:47,000
*I knew the dress was a big deal, but this is even worse than I feared.*

1314
01:38:47,000 --> 01:38:50,000
*That dress is ridiculously, insanely costly...*

1315
01:38:50,000 --> 01:38:52,000
*And I tore at it like an animal!*

1316
01:38:52,000 --> 01:38:54,000
*How could I have been so stupid?!*

1317
01:38:54,000 --> 01:38:59,000
*At this rate, I might as well have defaced all the paintings in the Louvre!*

1318
01:38:59,000 --> 01:39:03,000
Hiroki: "I'm so sorry, Marina! I really am the worst...!"

1319
01:39:03,000 --> 01:39:07,000
Marina: "There, there. Don't be so hard on yourself, dear."

1320
01:39:07,000 --> 01:39:09,000
*Marina's eyes soften.*

1321
01:39:09,000 --> 01:39:12,000
Marina: "I'm not upset about the dress."

1322
01:39:12,000 --> 01:39:14,000
Hiroki: "Y-You're not?"

1323
01:39:14,000 --> 01:39:15,000
Marina: "No."

1324
01:39:15,000 --> 01:39:18,000
Marina: "It was expensive, but it's only a dress."

1325
01:39:18,000 --> 01:39:25,000
Marina: "It's nothing more than a garment to conceal my body, and it has fulfilled its function well."

1326
01:39:25,000 --> 01:39:29,000
Marina: "I looked simply splendid in it last night, did I not?"

1327
01:39:29,000 --> 01:39:31,000
*Yeah, you looked amazing.":

1328
01:39:31,000 --> 01:39:34,000
Hiroki: "You looked... amazing, yeah..."

1329
01:39:34,000 --> 01:39:42,000
*I can remember how that dress clung to every one of Marina's voluptuous curves. It made her look incredibly sexy.*

1330
01:39:42,000 --> 01:39:48,000
*When the pair of us danced together, I felt so light-headed I thought I might collapse!*

1331
01:39:48,000 --> 01:39:51,000
*Then we went back to this hotel, and...*

1332
01:39:51,000 --> 01:39:55,000
*Well. With that, we've come back to where we started, haven't we?*

1333
01:39:55,000 --> 01:39:57,000
Marina: "Thank you very much!"

1334
01:39:57,000 --> 01:40:01,000
*Actually, I think I prefer you in your business outfit.":

1335
01:40:01,000 --> 01:40:06,000
Hiroki: "Actually, I think I like you more in your business clothes."

1336
01:40:06,000 --> 01:40:07,000
Marina: "Really, now?"

1337
01:40:07,000 --> 01:40:09,000
*Marina smiles thinly.*

1338
01:40:09,000 --> 01:40:11,000
Marina: "That's interesting to know."

1339
01:40:11,000 --> 01:40:14,000
Marina: "Is there any particular reason why?"

1340
01:40:14,000 --> 01:40:19,000
Hiroki: "I dunno. I guess it's 'cause you look so smart and put-together?"

1341
01:40:19,000 --> 01:40:25,000
Marina: "You mean to say, you like a mature older woman who can take charge and boss you around?"

1342
01:40:25,000 --> 01:40:26,000
Hiroki: "Maybe..."

1343
01:40:26,000 --> 01:40:32,000
*I've never really thought of myself as being all that submissive, but what can I say?*

1344
01:40:32,000 --> 01:40:34,000
*Marina must bring it out of me.*

1345
01:40:34,000 --> 01:40:39,000
Hiroki: "That's not to say your red dress didn't look good too, of course!"

1346
01:40:39,000 --> 01:40:43,000
Hiroki: "I think it was very pretty... but it wasn't really "you"."

1347
01:40:43,000 --> 01:40:47,000
Hiroki: "You were dressing up back then: playing a part."

1348
01:40:47,000 --> 01:40:54,000
Hiroki: "The cool, confident Marina in the business suit is the woman I know best, who I first fell for!"

1349
01:40:54,000 --> 01:40:56,000
Marina: "Hehe... How charming."

1350
01:40:56,000 --> 01:41:00,000
*I think you'd look even better in a wedding dress.":

1351
01:41:00,000 --> 01:41:02,000
Marina: "A-A wedding dress?!"

1352
01:41:02,000 --> 01:41:05,000
*Marina's eyes widen and her cheeks turn pink.*

1353
01:41:05,000 --> 01:41:10,000
*Coughing delicately into one hand, she dips her head and mumbles...*

1354
01:41:10,000 --> 01:41:14,000
Marina: "Th-That might be a bit premature, I'm afraid."

1355
01:41:14,000 --> 01:41:15,000
Hiroki: "What?"

1356
01:41:15,000 --> 01:41:17,000
*I pout, feigning disappointment.*

1357
01:41:17,000 --> 01:41:22,000
Hiroki: "I thought you liked me, Marina! You were all over me last night!"

1358
01:41:22,000 --> 01:41:27,000
Hiroki: "Are you trying to say you wouldn't wear a wedding dress for my sake?"

1359
01:41:27,000 --> 01:41:30,000
Marina: "I-It's not that I wouldn't, but..."

1360
01:41:30,000 --> 01:41:36,000
Marina: "That's more Hifumi's domain than mine. I wouldn't want to step on her toes."

1361
01:41:36,000 --> 01:41:41,000
Marina: "In any event, I'm not sure if I'm cut out for being a wife."

1362
01:41:41,000 --> 01:41:46,000
Marina: "I'm too busy with work. We hardly spend time together as it is."

1363
01:41:46,000 --> 01:41:50,000
Marina: "I'm not even very good at cooking or cleaning!"

1364
01:41:50,000 --> 01:41:58,000
Hiroki: "That's fine. It's not like you have to be. You're rich enough that you can afford maids to do all that stuff."

1365
01:41:58,000 --> 01:42:01,000
Marina: "Th-That is true, I suppose, but... Hmm..."

1366
01:42:01,000 --> 01:42:04,000
*Marina ponders, one hand beneath her chin.*

1367
01:42:04,000 --> 01:42:11,000
Marina: "If you are serious about this proposal, I suppose I must "up my game", as Hazel would say."

1368
01:42:11,000 --> 01:42:17,000
Hiroki: "You don't need to change: not one bit. I'm happy with you the way you are."

1369
01:42:17,000 --> 01:42:22,000
Marina: "That is very sweet of you, Hiroki, but you are forgetting something."

1370
01:42:22,000 --> 01:42:25,000
Marina: "I like being the best in everything I do."

1371
01:42:25,000 --> 01:42:31,000
Marina: "If you wish for me to be your wife, I must strive to be the best at that, too."

1372
01:42:31,000 --> 01:42:36,000
Marina: "Just say the word, and I will learn how to cook and clean for your sake."

1373
01:42:36,000 --> 01:42:42,000
Marina: "I will take lessons from Hifumi, and I will not stop until I have defeated her!"

1374
01:42:42,000 --> 01:42:46,000
Marina: "I will be the best, most dutiful wife you can imagine!"

1375
01:42:46,000 --> 01:42:49,000
Marina: "That is, if I can spare the time..."

1376
01:42:49,000 --> 01:42:50,000
*Marina smiles shyly.*

1377
01:42:50,000 --> 01:42:55,000
Marina: "A-Anyway, I think that is enough of that. We are getting distracted."

1378
01:42:55,000 --> 01:42:58,000
Marina: "There is something I want to ask you."

1379
01:42:58,000 --> 01:42:59,000
Hiroki: "What is it?"

1380
01:42:59,000 --> 01:43:02,000
Marina: "Well, um... I-It is a delicate matter."

1381
01:43:02,000 --> 01:43:07,000
Marina: "It is beneath me to fish for compliments, but I was wondering... Um..."

1382
01:43:07,000 --> 01:43:09,000
Marina: "Last night, at the ball..."

1383
01:43:09,000 --> 01:43:12,000
Marina: "Did any other woman catch your eye?"

1384
01:43:12,000 --> 01:43:13,000
Hiroki: "Huh?"

1385
01:43:13,000 --> 01:43:14,000
*My frown deepens.*

1386
01:43:14,000 --> 01:43:17,000
*Does Marina really need to ask that?*

1387
01:43:17,000 --> 01:43:24,000
*I just proposed to her (more or less), but it looks like she has some doubts about my affections.*

1388
01:43:24,000 --> 01:43:27,000
*I didn't peg her for the self-conscious type!*

1389
01:43:27,000 --> 01:43:32,000
*She acts cool and mature most of the time, but she has a shy side, too.*

1390
01:43:32,000 --> 01:43:33,000
*It's endearing.*

1391
01:43:33,000 --> 01:43:35,000
Hiroki: "Don't be silly, Marina."

1392
01:43:35,000 --> 01:43:36,000
*I smile at her.*

1393
01:43:36,000 --> 01:43:41,000
*Marina beams. She must be pleased by my compliment, though I'm not sure why.*

1394
01:43:41,000 --> 01:43:45,000
*I bet Marina gets lavished with praise on the regular.*

1395
01:43:45,000 --> 01:43:49,000
*I'm a nobody, really. My opinion isn't all that special...*

1396
01:43:49,000 --> 01:43:52,000
*But Marina seems to value it all the same.*

1397
01:43:52,000 --> 01:43:54,000
*Is that because she values me?*

1398
01:43:54,000 --> 01:44:00,000
Marina: "I'm glad you liked my dress, Hiroki. I did pick it out while thinking of you."

1399
01:44:00,000 --> 01:44:09,000
Marina: "Truthfully, I did want to attract a lot of stares. That was my job, as the hostess of last night's ball. It was my duty to shine..."

1400
01:44:09,000 --> 01:44:12,000
Marina: "But I wanted to shine for your sake, too."

1401
01:44:12,000 --> 01:44:18,000
Marina: "I wanted to look marvelous, so you would pay attention to me, and only me."

1402
01:44:18,000 --> 01:44:19,000
Hiroki: "Huh? Really?"

1403
01:44:19,000 --> 01:44:20,000
*I blink.*

1404
01:44:20,000 --> 01:44:23,000
Hiroki: "I didn't think you were the jealous type."

1405
01:44:23,000 --> 01:44:34,000
Marina: "I'm not, normally. I have no qualms about sharing you with my sisters. They are fellow succubi, like myself, and it is hard for humans to resist them..."

1406
01:44:34,000 --> 01:44:41,000
Marina: "But the thought of being passed over in the favor of normal human women is a different matter."

1407
01:44:41,000 --> 01:44:44,000
*Marina pouts cutely, her arms folded.*

1408
01:44:44,000 --> 01:44:53,000
Marina: "I knew there would be a lot of other famous women at that event. It would be a lie if I said I wasn't a little concerned..."

1409
01:44:53,000 --> 01:44:56,000
Hiroki: "That I would choose them over you?"

1410
01:44:56,000 --> 01:45:03,000
Marina: "Mm. I've never cared so much about any of my previous conquests, but... Well. You're special."

1411
01:45:03,000 --> 01:45:05,000
Marina: "Do you find that strange?"

1412
01:45:05,000 --> 01:45:07,000
Hiroki: "No. I think it's endearing."

1413
01:45:07,000 --> 01:45:09,000
*I smile at Marina fondly.*

1414
01:45:09,000 --> 01:45:22,000
*I was under the impression she'd bought that dress to make a good impression on the paparazzi (everything she said earlier attested to as much), but I now I see she might've had ulterior motives.*

1415
01:45:22,000 --> 01:45:28,000
*She didn't just want to look good for the sake of gossip magazines and TV specials.*

1416
01:45:28,000 --> 01:45:30,000
*She was thinking about me, too.*

1417
01:45:30,000 --> 01:45:35,000
*She spent over three million yen so she could look good for my sake.*

1418
01:45:35,000 --> 01:45:38,000
*Thinking about it like that... it's kind of crazy.*

1419
01:45:38,000 --> 01:45:43,000
*I know you can't put a price on love, but three million yen is astronomical.*

1420
01:45:43,000 --> 01:45:50,000
*I could never even dream about having all that money, but Marina used it to ensure my eyes wouldn't wander.*

1421
01:45:50,000 --> 01:45:54,000
*If that isn't proof of her love, I don't know what is.*

1422
01:45:54,000 --> 01:45:58,000
Hiroki: "Thank you for thinking of me, Marina. It makes me happy."

1423
01:45:58,000 --> 01:46:07,000
Hiroki: "Your tastes were impeccable, as always. You looked so good in that dress, I couldn't look at anybody else, much less think of them."

1424
01:46:07,000 --> 01:46:11,000
Hiroki: "You were the only one on my mind all evening."

1425
01:46:11,000 --> 01:46:13,000
Marina: "Oh, Hiroki...!"

1426
01:46:13,000 --> 01:46:14,000
*Marina smiles.*

1427
01:46:14,000 --> 01:46:16,000
Marina: "Do you really mean that?"

1428
01:46:16,000 --> 01:46:19,000
Hiroki: "I do. You stole my heart all over again..."

1429
01:46:19,000 --> 01:46:29,000
Hiroki: "Though you didn't really need to buy such an expensive dress. You're so pretty, I bet you'd look good in anything - even a potato sack!"

1430
01:46:29,000 --> 01:46:34,000
Marina: "Well, I could hardly show up to my own ball in a potato sack..."

1431
01:46:34,000 --> 01:46:37,000
Marina: "Though I do appreciate the compliment."

1432
01:46:37,000 --> 01:46:38,000
*Marina chuckles.*

1433
01:46:38,000 --> 01:46:46,000
Marina: "I suppose I was foolish to be concerned. In a room full of human women, I shall always shine the brightest."

1434
01:46:46,000 --> 01:46:50,000
Marina: "Normal women cannot hope to compete with us succubi!"

1435
01:46:50,000 --> 01:46:56,000
Hiroki: "That might be true... but I don't like you solely because you're a succubus."

1436
01:46:56,000 --> 01:46:59,000
Hiroki: "I like you for your own sake."

1437
01:46:59,000 --> 01:47:03,000
Hiroki: "You've been looking out for me since the day we met."

1438
01:47:03,000 --> 01:47:09,000
Hiroki: "You act cool and aloof, but I think you're a very kind woman. You're cute."

1439
01:47:09,000 --> 01:47:10,000
Marina: "Wh-What?"

1440
01:47:10,000 --> 01:47:18,000
Marina: "I-I can't believe you would call me "cute". "Mature" or "sexy", yes, but not "cute"! That isn't my archetype..."

1441
01:47:18,000 --> 01:47:24,000
Marina: "I-If you like cute girls, you'd be better off talking to Ayu or Cosmos..."

1442
01:47:24,000 --> 01:47:29,000
Hiroki: "Ayu and Cosmos are cute too, but you're cute in a different way!"

1443
01:47:29,000 --> 01:47:34,000
Marina: "N-No, I'm not. If you think that, you must need new glasses!"

1444
01:47:34,000 --> 01:47:38,000
Hiroki: "You can say whatever you like, but Marina..."

1445
01:47:38,000 --> 01:47:40,000
*I stab a finger in her direction.*

1446
01:47:40,000 --> 01:47:44,000
Hiroki: "...you can't stop me from thinking that you're cute!"

1447
01:47:44,000 --> 01:47:51,000
Hiroki: "Last night, when you cuddled in bed with me like a stray cat, you were particularly adorable!"

1448
01:47:51,000 --> 01:47:55,000
Hiroki: "You were so sweet, my heart almost stopped beating!"

1449
01:47:55,000 --> 01:47:58,000
Marina: "O-Oh, really... That sounds serious..."

1450
01:47:58,000 --> 01:48:01,000
*Marina tries to look and sound unaffected.*

1451
01:48:01,000 --> 01:48:08,000
*She clears her throat and coils a strand of white hair around her finger, but I can see that she's shaking.*

1452
01:48:08,000 --> 01:48:12,000
Marina: "In that case, y-you should probably see a cardiologist..."

1453
01:48:12,000 --> 01:48:17,000
Hiroki: "I don't need to. I know there's nothing wrong with my heart."

1454
01:48:17,000 --> 01:48:24,000
Hiroki: "These are my sincere, truthful feelings. I think you are cute, and you'd better accept it!"

1455
01:48:24,000 --> 01:48:29,000
Marina: "Well, hmph... Th-This is quite novel, for me, but... In that case..."

1456
01:48:29,000 --> 01:48:34,000
*Marina draws in a breath. She straightens her shoulders, then says firmly...*

1457
01:48:34,000 --> 01:48:45,000
Marina: "If you want me to accept that I am cute - which I still do not believe - then I want you to accept that I do not care about the fate my dress has suffered."

1458
01:48:45,000 --> 01:48:54,000
Marina: "It was an expensive piece, yes, but I could afford it. I knew I would be dancing, so I was prepared for it to get a bit rumpled."

1459
01:48:54,000 --> 01:48:57,000
Marina: "It is perfectly salvageable."

1460
01:48:57,000 --> 01:49:03,000
Marina: "I can soon fix it up again. You'd never know it got creased to begin with."

1461
01:49:03,000 --> 01:49:13,000
Marina: "I might be wealthy, but I'm not so very wasteful I'd let all my fine possessions go to ruin. I take good care of all my belongings, so do not fret."

1462
01:49:13,000 --> 01:49:19,000
Marina: "You've done nothing to apologize for, and I won't hear of you feeling guilty!"

1463
01:49:19,000 --> 01:49:21,000
Hiroki: "Ah... Ahaha..."

1464
01:49:21,000 --> 01:49:28,000
Hiroki: "Alright, fine. I'll stop apologizing about your dress if you stop saying you're not cute."

1465
01:49:28,000 --> 01:49:30,000
Marina: "Alright, fine. It's a deal."

1466
01:49:30,000 --> 01:49:35,000
*Marina holds out her hand. I take it in my own, and we shake on this agreement.*

1467
01:49:35,000 --> 01:49:38,000
Marina: "There. Now we've made a verbal contract."

1468
01:49:38,000 --> 01:49:47,000
Marina: "If you go back on your word, I'll mobilize my entire legal team. Don't be surprised if the next time we meet, it's at court."

1469
01:49:47,000 --> 01:49:53,000
Hiroki: "A-At court? B-But I don't have that sort of money...! You'd bankrupt me...!"

1470
01:49:53,000 --> 01:49:58,000
Marina: "Then you'd best not renege on our agreement. Everybody wins!"

1471
01:49:58,000 --> 01:50:05,000
*Marina smiles thinly, in the same style I suspect she does when cinching complex business deals.*

1472
01:50:05,000 --> 01:50:06,000
*This woman...*

1473
01:50:06,000 --> 01:50:15,000
*Though her cute side is undeniable (and now, Marina legally can't deny it), she's kind of scary, too. Her backbone's made of sturdy stuff.*

1474
01:50:15,000 --> 01:50:22,000
*I guess she's gotta be fierce, or she never would've been able to build her business empire as she has.*

1475
01:50:22,000 --> 01:50:24,000
*It's no wonder she's so respected!*

1476
01:50:24,000 --> 01:50:32,000
Marina: "Now, the day is wearing on. I would love to stay with you and talk, but my company will not manage itself."

1477
01:50:32,000 --> 01:50:38,000
Marina: "I fear I ought to be going soon, but before I do, I would like to ask you something."

1478
01:50:38,000 --> 01:50:41,000
Marina: "It might sound silly, but..."

1479
01:50:41,000 --> 01:50:43,000
Marina: "Are you happy, Hiroki?"

1480
01:50:43,000 --> 01:50:46,000
Hiroki: "Now, that's quite a broad question..."

1481
01:50:46,000 --> 01:50:49,000
*"Happiness" isn't all that cut and dry.*

1482
01:50:49,000 --> 01:50:58,000
*It entails a lot of things, from one's job satisfaction to their finances to their familial relationships to their friendships.*

1483
01:50:58,000 --> 01:51:02,000
*Mental health's also pretty important, as is the physical.*

1484
01:51:02,000 --> 01:51:07,000
*People can be satisfied in one area, but woefully deficient in the other.*

1485
01:51:07,000 --> 01:51:15,000
*Happiness comes and goes in unpredictable patterns. It's even more erratic than the migratory paths of birds and fish.*

1486
01:51:15,000 --> 01:51:20,000
*For a long while, I don't think I was very pleased with any aspect of my life.*

1487
01:51:20,000 --> 01:51:28,000
*I lived in a tumbledown apartment, I had a long commitment to work, and I felt like my boss never really valued me.*

1488
01:51:28,000 --> 01:51:33,000
*I rarely spoke to my parents, I had few friends, and I didn't have a girlfriend.*

1489
01:51:33,000 --> 01:51:39,000
*The only real relationship I had was with my desk, my laptop, and maybe my camera.*

1490
01:51:39,000 --> 01:51:41,000
*It was kind of miserable, NGL...*

1491
01:51:41,000 --> 01:51:45,000
*But things have changed so much since I met Ayu, then Marina.*

1492
01:51:45,000 --> 01:51:57,000
*I still live in a cruddy apartment, I still have a tiring commute to work, and I still don't like my boss all that much, but these issues don't wear on me the way they did.*

1493
01:51:57,000 --> 01:52:02,000
Hiroki: "If I had to stop and think about it seriously, then... Yeah."

1494
01:52:02,000 --> 01:52:05,000
*I return Marina's query with a smile.*

1495
01:52:05,000 --> 01:52:09,000
Hiroki: "I am happy, and I know I owe a good chunk of that to you."

1496
01:52:09,000 --> 01:52:13,000
Hiroki: "Your influence has opened up a lot of doors in my life."

1497
01:52:13,000 --> 01:52:16,000
Hiroki: "I really can't thank you enough."

1498
01:52:16,000 --> 01:52:18,000
Marina: "You're welcome, dear."

1499
01:52:18,000 --> 01:52:24,000
*Marina shrugs off my thanks, as though she hasn't done anything all that amazing.*

1500
01:52:24,000 --> 01:52:26,000
*Maybe, in her eyes, she hasn't.*

1501
01:52:26,000 --> 01:52:34,000
*Marina is far, far wealthier than I am, so she can afford to pull strings and distribute favors like it's nothing.*

1502
01:52:34,000 --> 01:52:40,000
*In the grand scheme of things, she mightn't have gone that far out of her way for my sake...*

1503
01:52:40,000 --> 01:52:42,000
*But it's appreciated all the same.*

1504
01:52:42,000 --> 01:52:46,000
*She didn't have to do anything. She could have done nothing.*

1505
01:52:46,000 --> 01:52:49,000
*She didn't owe me, but she still helped me.*

1506
01:52:49,000 --> 01:52:51,000
*She really is a kind woman.*

1507
01:52:51,000 --> 01:52:59,000
Marina: "I think it only fair that I should try to help you wherever I can. You are a very important person to me, Hiroki."

1508
01:52:59,000 --> 01:53:02,000
Marina: "When you're happy, I am happy, too."

1509
01:53:02,000 --> 01:53:08,000
Marina: "Though I've had other partners in the past, they didn't move my heart as you did."

1510
01:53:08,000 --> 01:53:16,000
Marina: "I'm one of the oldest among my sisters, and I'm a bit more cynical about romance, but I care about you a lot."

1511
01:53:16,000 --> 01:53:18,000
Marina: "I might even love you."

1512
01:53:18,000 --> 01:53:24,000
Marina: "I'm a succubus, and you're a human... but you're more than just prey to me."

1513
01:53:24,000 --> 01:53:27,000
Marina: "You're very, very dear to me."

1514
01:53:27,000 --> 01:53:32,000
Hiroki: "You make that quite apparent. I've never once doubted your feelings."

1515
01:53:32,000 --> 01:53:34,000
Marina: "Well, that is good!"

1516
01:53:34,000 --> 01:53:41,000
Marina: "You are my most precious, beloved partner. I adore you... so please, take care of yourself."

1517
01:53:41,000 --> 01:53:45,000
Marina: "Don't let yourself get swept away in the arms of another."

1518
01:53:45,000 --> 01:53:51,000
Marina: "I don't mind sharing you with my younger sisters, as I've said. That is no problem..."

1519
01:53:51,000 --> 01:53:58,000
Marina: "But there is one person I absolutely do not want to share you with, under any circumstances."

1520
01:53:58,000 --> 01:53:59,000
Hiroki: "What..?"

1521
01:53:59,000 --> 01:54:02,000
*This conversation's taken a bit of a dark turn.*

1522
01:54:02,000 --> 01:54:10,000
*I thought Marina meant to reassure her love for me, before heading off to another day at the office... but maybe not.*

1523
01:54:10,000 --> 01:54:16,000
*This doesn't sound like a piece of motherly advice. It sounds like a real, genuine warning.*

1524
01:54:16,000 --> 01:54:17,000
*Why...?*

1525
01:54:17,000 --> 01:54:20,000
Hiroki: "This is kind of intense, haha..."

1526
01:54:20,000 --> 01:54:26,000
Hiroki: "If I didn't know any better, I'd almost think I was in some sort of danger!"

1527
01:54:26,000 --> 01:54:31,000
*I laugh a little, trying to defuse the tension, but it doesn't work.*

1528
01:54:31,000 --> 01:54:38,000
*The strange, sombre atmosphere remains, settling upon my shoulders like a layer of freshly fallen snow.*

1529
01:54:38,000 --> 01:54:41,000
Marina: "That is exactly what I am saying, yes."

1530
01:54:41,000 --> 01:54:42,000
Hiroki: "You... Ah..."

1531
01:54:42,000 --> 01:54:46,000
*Marina's words send a shiver running down my spine.*

1532
01:54:46,000 --> 01:54:48,000
*Suddenly, I feel cold.*

1533
01:54:48,000 --> 01:54:51,000
*My little joke doesn't seem all funny any more.*

1534
01:54:51,000 --> 01:54:54,000
Hiroki: "Am I... really in danger...?"

1535
01:54:54,000 --> 01:54:59,000
Marina: "Well. I can't say for certain. There's a chance I'm overreacting, but..."

1536
01:54:59,000 --> 01:55:07,000
Marina: "Hifumi had some business with Lady Yue a week prior, so she had to return to the succubus realm for a brief spell."

1537
01:55:07,000 --> 01:55:10,000
Marina: "Have you heard about Lady Yue, Hiroki?"

1538
01:55:10,000 --> 01:55:20,000
Hiroki: "Yeah, I have. Hifumi told me a little about her. She told me Yue rules over all the succubi, and she - I mean, Hifumi - acts as her advisor?"

1539
01:55:20,000 --> 01:55:22,000
Marina: "That is, indeed, correct."

1540
01:55:22,000 --> 01:55:32,000
Marina: "Lady Yue is rather young, as far as rulers go. She wasn't supposed to ascend to the throne. That should have been Hifumi's job, but she abdicated."

1541
01:55:32,000 --> 01:55:37,000
Marina: "The crown then went to Lady Yue, as the next in line to inherit."

1542
01:55:37,000 --> 01:55:40,000
Marina: "I suppose you knew this, too?"

1543
01:55:40,000 --> 01:55:43,000
Hiroki: "Hifumi mentioned it briefly."

1544
01:55:43,000 --> 01:55:48,000
Marina: "That's good. Then I needn't burden you with too many explanations."

1545
01:55:48,000 --> 01:55:59,000
Marina: "I won't go into too many details - I don't have the time for it right now - but I spoke to Hifumi a few days ago, when she returned from the succubus realm."

1546
01:55:59,000 --> 01:56:02,000
Marina: "She was... a bit shaken, actually."

1547
01:56:02,000 --> 01:56:05,000
Hiroki: "She was? But why? Did something happen?"

1548
01:56:05,000 --> 01:56:08,000
Marina: "Nothing has happened just yet, but..."

1549
01:56:08,000 --> 01:56:18,000
Marina: "It seems Lady Yue has taken a liking to a particular human boy. A boy who is, for some inexplicable reason, thronged by a whole harem of succubi."

1550
01:56:18,000 --> 01:56:23,000
Marina: "It shouldn't take you too long to guess who this boy might be."

1551
01:56:23,000 --> 01:56:28,000
*Well, after hearing all that, there's only one person it could be.*

1552
01:56:28,000 --> 01:56:29,000
Hiroki: "You mean..."

1553
01:56:29,000 --> 01:56:31,000
*I gesture towards myself.*

1554
01:56:31,000 --> 01:56:32,000
Hiroki: "Me?"

1555
01:56:32,000 --> 01:56:33,000
*Marina nods.*

1556
01:56:33,000 --> 01:56:36,000
Marina: "Clever boy. I knew you'd work it out."

1557
01:56:36,000 --> 01:56:41,000
Hiroki: "It's not like it was a great mystery, but... isn't this kind of weird?"

1558
01:56:41,000 --> 01:56:47,000
Hiroki: "Why would the succubus princess be interested in me? I'm not that special."

1559
01:56:47,000 --> 01:56:54,000
Marina: "How can you say that, when you have ensnared the heart of five succubi already? Clearly you must be."

1560
01:56:54,000 --> 01:57:06,000
Marina: "It's very rare for one man to attract the attention of so many succubi - and it's rare for one man to withstand the brunt of one succubus's passion, let alone five."

1561
01:57:06,000 --> 01:57:14,000
Marina: "Thinking about it in such terms, it's to be expected Lady Yue would take an interest in you at some point."

1562
01:57:14,000 --> 01:57:17,000
Marina: "I was foolish for not considering it."

1563
01:57:17,000 --> 01:57:21,000
Hiroki: "So, this Lady Yue... Has she been keeping tabs on me?"

1564
01:57:21,000 --> 01:57:22,000
Marina: "Mm."

1565
01:57:22,000 --> 01:57:23,000
*Marina nods.*

1566
01:57:23,000 --> 01:57:33,000
Marina: "As Lady Yue needs to manage the succubus realm, she doesn't often leave it... but we succubi have ways of observing the human world from our own."

1567
01:57:33,000 --> 01:57:39,000
Marina: "From what I have gathered, Lady Yue has been watching you for quite some time."

1568
01:57:39,000 --> 01:57:45,000
Marina: "For all I know, she might even be watching you right now. We would be none the wiser."

1569
01:57:45,000 --> 01:57:46,000
Hiroki: "Ah..."

1570
01:57:46,000 --> 01:57:49,000
*I glance around the hotel room, suddenly paranoid.*

1571
01:57:49,000 --> 01:57:55,000
*I'd never considered the possibility of being observed before. It simply hadn't occurred to me.*

1572
01:57:55,000 --> 01:58:00,000
*Now Marina's planted the idea in my mind, however, I can't shake it.*

1573
01:58:00,000 --> 01:58:02,000
*My skin prickles. I feel uneasy.*

1574
01:58:02,000 --> 01:58:07,000
*Was Lady Yue watching me that one evening when I was with Ayu and Hazel?*

1575
01:58:07,000 --> 01:58:16,000
*What about the time Cosmos showed up at my house wearing a bunny girl costume, or last night when I was in the hotel room with Marina?*

1576
01:58:16,000 --> 01:58:20,000
*If she was watching me, I'd have no way of knowing.*

1577
01:58:20,000 --> 01:58:22,000
*Now, that's unnerving...*

1578
01:58:22,000 --> 01:58:24,000
Hiroki: "S-So, this Lady Yue..."

1579
01:58:24,000 --> 01:58:26,000
Hiroki: "What does she want with me?"

1580
01:58:26,000 --> 01:58:33,000
Marina: "Of that, I am not certain. It is possible she means only to watch you, to see what will happen..."

1581
01:58:33,000 --> 01:58:40,000
Marina: "But Hifumi was concerned she might try to make your acquaintance here, in the human world."

1582
01:58:40,000 --> 01:58:47,000
Marina: "If you intrigue her enough, there's a chance she could try to take you with her to the succubus realm."

1583
01:58:47,000 --> 01:58:50,000
Marina: "Then, she might make you her plaything."

1584
01:58:50,000 --> 01:58:52,000
Hiroki: "Pl-Plaything?!"

1585
01:58:52,000 --> 01:58:54,000
Marina: "That's right."

1586
01:58:54,000 --> 01:59:04,000
Marina: "If that were to happen, you would be completely at her mercy. She could lock you up in the succubus realm and never, ever let you leave."

1587
01:59:04,000 --> 01:59:12,000
Marina: "Lady Yue is a jealous, possessive sort. If she gets her hands on you, there's no telling what will happen."

1588
01:59:12,000 --> 01:59:14,000
Marina: "I'm worried about you..."

1589
01:59:14,000 --> 01:59:19,000
Marina: "So please, stay safe. Don't let your guard down, and don't trust her."

1590
01:59:19,000 --> 01:59:21,000
Marina: "I love you a lot, Hiroki."

1591
01:59:21,000 --> 01:59:25,000
*Marina's eyes bore into mine. They look very intense and serious.*

1592
01:59:25,000 --> 01:59:29,000
Marina: "I'd be heartbroken if Yue stole you from me."

1593
01:59:29,000 --> 01:59:33,000
*The train rattles around me as I make my way back home.*

1594
01:59:33,000 --> 01:59:40,000
*Since today's a Sunday, I don't have any work to attend to - which is just as well, since it's almost nine.*

1595
01:59:40,000 --> 01:59:44,000
*If I did have to go into the office, I'd be late for sure.*

1596
01:59:44,000 --> 01:59:51,000
*My boss might be taking a soft approach with me as of late, but I don't think he'd let my tardiness slide.*

1597
01:59:51,000 --> 01:59:56,000
*He's such a stickler for time-keeping, he might as well be German.*

1598
01:59:56,000 --> 01:59:57,000
Hiroki: "Aaah..."

1599
01:59:57,000 --> 02:00:05,000
*Though I had a pleasant night, I feel a little sleepy. Marina's early stirring roused me, and I couldn't get back to sleep.*

1600
02:00:05,000 --> 02:00:06,000
*I feel tired.*

1601
02:00:06,000 --> 02:00:12,000
*Maybe I'll get some shut-eye when I return to my apartment. That sounds appealing.*

1602
02:00:12,000 --> 02:00:15,000
*I do feel a little bad for Marina, though.*

1603
02:00:15,000 --> 02:00:22,000
*It's a weekend, and she held a large charity event last night, but she still has to go into the office.*

1604
02:00:22,000 --> 02:00:31,000
*I complain about my job all the time (I don't think anybody likes working after hours), but Marina has it way tougher than I do.*

1605
02:00:31,000 --> 02:00:34,000
*She's very impressive, in all sorts of ways.*

1606
02:00:34,000 --> 02:00:40,000
*I hope I was able to relieve her of at least some of her heavy burdens last night...*

1607
02:00:40,000 --> 02:00:46,000
*Though I did, inadvertently, create a whole new problem by sullying her expensive dress.*

1608
02:00:46,000 --> 02:00:52,000
*She told me not to apologize, on pain of legal action, but I still feel kinda bad about it.*

1609
02:00:52,000 --> 02:01:02,000
*I've never been in a position to ruin a three million yen dress before. The idea might sound cathartic, but in practice it's not that much fun.*

1610
02:01:02,000 --> 02:01:06,000
*The dress isn't the only thing weighing on my mind, either.*

1611
02:01:06,000 --> 02:01:07,000
Hiroki: "Nn..."

1612
02:01:07,000 --> 02:01:12,000
*The train rounds a corner. My head bumps against the wall, and I wince.*

1613
02:01:12,000 --> 02:01:16,000
*I can't stop thinking about what Marina said this morning.*

1614
02:01:16,000 --> 02:01:20,000
*According to her, the ruler of all succubi has her eye on me.*

1615
02:01:20,000 --> 02:01:23,000
*I'm not sure what that entails, exactly, but...*

1616
02:01:23,000 --> 02:01:33,000
Marina: "If you intrigue her enough, there's a chance she could try to take you with her to the succubus realm, to make you her newest plaything."

1617
02:01:33,000 --> 02:01:35,000
*Could that really happen?*

1618
02:01:35,000 --> 02:01:51,000
*It sounds like a storyline lifted straight from a light novel: the sorts with the long, unwieldy titles you see in book store windows, stealing shelf space from the classics my high school English teachers loved like Dazai and Mishima.*

1619
02:01:51,000 --> 02:01:56,000
*I guess it doesn't sound like too terrible a fate in theory, but...*

1620
02:01:56,000 --> 02:02:04,000
Marina: "Lady Yue is a jealous, possessive sort. If she gets her hands on you, there's no telling what will happen."

1621
02:02:04,000 --> 02:02:11,000
*I don't know the first thing about Lady Yue, but Marina's words don't paint her in the most compelling light.*

1622
02:02:11,000 --> 02:02:14,000
*To be honest, she sounds kind of scary.*

1623
02:02:14,000 --> 02:02:20,000
*If she can use succubus magic, she'll be able to watch me wherever I go, whatever I do.*

1624
02:02:20,000 --> 02:02:24,000
*I'm only a weak, feeble human. I have no way of hiding from her.*

1625
02:02:24,000 --> 02:02:28,000
*What will happen if she really does decide to kidnap me?*

1626
02:02:28,000 --> 02:02:30,000
*I'll be entirely at her mercy...*

1627
02:02:30,000 --> 02:02:34,000
*And I'm afraid I'll never see Marina or the others ever again.*

1628
02:02:34,000 --> 02:02:38,000
*My journey back home is uneventful despite my anxieties.*

1629
02:02:38,000 --> 02:02:45,000
*I meet nobody suspicious on the train (not even Cosmos), nor during my walk back to my apartment.*

1630
02:02:45,000 --> 02:02:47,000
*Everything seems normal.*

1631
02:02:47,000 --> 02:02:55,000
*The sky is blue, a few birds are chirping, and the people I pass by on the gray sidewalk hurry by without a word.*

1632
02:02:55,000 --> 02:02:57,000
*Nobody gives me a second glance.*

1633
02:02:57,000 --> 02:03:07,000
*I fumble with my keys for a little while outside my apartment. My palms feel sweaty, though it's not a particularly hot day, and I drop them twice.*

1634
02:03:07,000 --> 02:03:08,000
*Why am I shaking?*

1635
02:03:08,000 --> 02:03:12,000
*Nothing's bad happened. I have no reason to feel afraid.*

1636
02:03:12,000 --> 02:03:14,000
*Everything's normal, like I said...*

1637
02:03:14,000 --> 02:03:16,000
*But something doesn't feel right.*

1638
02:03:16,000 --> 02:03:19,000
*I breathe in deeply, then examine my apartment.*

1639
02:03:19,000 --> 02:03:25,000
*It looks the same as it always does, with its dreary windows and age-spotted walls.*

1640
02:03:25,000 --> 02:03:32,000
*When I try the front door handle, it doesn't budge. It's still locked, just as I left it last night.*

1641
02:03:32,000 --> 02:03:36,000
*I don't think anybody's been here during my absence...*

1642
02:03:36,000 --> 02:03:39,000
*But, even if they have, how would I know?*

1643
02:03:39,000 --> 02:03:47,000
*Succubi like Cosmos can bypass locked doors with their magic. I should know from past experience. She's done it enough times.*

1644
02:03:47,000 --> 02:03:55,000
*Theoretically, this Yue should be far stronger than Cosmos. She could get inside my home with ease if she wanted.*

1645
02:03:55,000 --> 02:03:59,000
*She could be sitting inside waiting for me right now, in fact.*

1646
02:03:59,000 --> 02:04:00,000
*She could...*

1647
02:04:00,000 --> 02:04:01,000
Hiroki: "Stop it."

1648
02:04:01,000 --> 02:04:03,000
*I castigate myself under my breath.*

1649
02:04:03,000 --> 02:04:07,000
Hiroki: "You're being stupid. There's nothing wrong."

1650
02:04:07,000 --> 02:04:15,000
Hiroki: "You didn't even know Lady Yue was watching you until an hour ago. Why are you letting it bother you so much now?"

1651
02:04:15,000 --> 02:04:18,000
*Of course, I know why it's bothering me now.*

1652
02:04:18,000 --> 02:04:24,000
*It's because, back then, I didn't know there was anything for me to be bothered by.*

1653
02:04:24,000 --> 02:04:26,000
*Ignorance is bliss, as they say.*

1654
02:04:26,000 --> 02:04:36,000
*My over-active imagination is trying to make up for my lack of panic over the last week I was being observed, unknown - and it's working, too.*

1655
02:04:36,000 --> 02:04:42,000
Hiroki: "You need to get your act together. There's nothing to be afraid of. Just go in."

1656
02:04:42,000 --> 02:04:46,000
*I grip my key a little more tightly. Then, I twist it.*

1657
02:04:46,000 --> 02:04:50,000
*The lock of my front door gives way, and I step inside.*

1658
02:04:50,000 --> 02:04:55,000
*I close the door behind me. I take off my shoes. Then I pad into the kitchen.*

1659
02:04:55,000 --> 02:04:56,000
*There's nobody here.*

1660
02:04:56,000 --> 02:04:58,000
*Well, of course there isn't.*

1661
02:04:58,000 --> 02:05:00,000
*I sigh deeply, relieved.*

1662
02:05:00,000 --> 02:05:03,000
Hiroki: "What did you expect? You're so stupid..."

1663
02:05:03,000 --> 02:05:08,000
Hiroki: "You must've worked harder than you thought this last week."

1664
02:05:08,000 --> 02:05:14,000
Hiroki: "You should probably take a nap, before you start hallucinating for real..."

1665
02:05:14,000 --> 02:05:18,000
Hiroki: "And you really have to stop talking to yourself."

1666
02:05:18,000 --> 02:05:21,000
*Scolding myself thus, I open my bedroom door.*

1667
02:05:21,000 --> 02:05:29,000
*It looks much the same as always. My futon is arranged neatly in one corner, and my shelves are stacked with books and CDs.*

1668
02:05:29,000 --> 02:05:33,000
*My blinds are up, and sunlight filters in across the tatami mats.*

1669
02:05:33,000 --> 02:05:37,000
*So far, everything's as it should be... with an exception.*

1670
02:05:37,000 --> 02:05:41,000
*It's only one exception, mind you, but it sure is a doozy.*

1671
02:05:41,000 --> 02:05:46,000
???: "Ah. So, you're finally here, Hiroki. You kept me waiting quite a long time."

1672
02:05:46,000 --> 02:05:50,000
???: "Don't you know that it's rude to keep a lady waiting?"

1673
02:05:50,000 --> 02:05:52,000
???: "I'm disappointed in you."

1674
02:05:52,000 --> 02:05:54,000
Hiroki: "Wh-What? You, I... Uh..."

1675
02:05:54,000 --> 02:06:00,000
*If I hadn't tucked my keys into my pocket already, I'm sure I would've dropped them.*

1676
02:06:00,000 --> 02:06:05,000
*I feel like I've dropped my jaw too, all the way down to the floor.*

1677
02:06:05,000 --> 02:06:09,000
*I was right. There really is somebody in my apartment!*

1678
02:06:09,000 --> 02:06:11,000
*It's a mysterious woman.*

1679
02:06:11,000 --> 02:06:19,000
*I don't know how old she is, but I think she must be of a similar age to myself: in her mid to late twenties or so.*

1680
02:06:19,000 --> 02:06:28,000
*She's kneeling on my tatami floor, hands folded upon her lap, like a hina doll. She rises to her feet, however, upon seeing me.*

1681
02:06:28,000 --> 02:06:37,000
*Everything about this woman is graceful and elegant. Her hair is long and dark, and it cascades all the way down to the small of her back.*

1682
02:06:37,000 --> 02:06:44,000
*She's attired in a soft swathe of white and blue fabrics, and her eyes are similarly outlined in blue.*

1683
02:06:44,000 --> 02:06:51,000
*When she rises to her feet, she does so without a sound. Her dress ripples like the waves of an ocean.*

1684
02:06:51,000 --> 02:06:57,000
*Her outfit looks like it should be cumbersome, but it doesn't hamper her in the slightest.*

1685
02:06:57,000 --> 02:06:59,000
*She looks just like a goddess...*

1686
02:06:59,000 --> 02:07:02,000
*But there's something familiar about her.*

1687
02:07:02,000 --> 02:07:05,000
*I'm sure I've seen her before, but where?*

1688
02:07:05,000 --> 02:07:06,000
*Could it be...*

1689
02:07:06,000 --> 02:07:10,000
???: "So, is that how you mean to greet me? I am disappointed."

1690
02:07:10,000 --> 02:07:14,000
*The woman purses her lips together in evident distaste.*

1691
02:07:14,000 --> 02:07:21,000
???: "I thought you would be happy. Didn't you miss me in the slightest during the last few years?"

1692
02:07:21,000 --> 02:07:22,000
???: "I am wounded."

1693
02:07:22,000 --> 02:07:24,000
Hiroki: "What? But you..."

1694
02:07:24,000 --> 02:07:27,000
*Her words stir a series of memories within me.*

1695
02:07:27,000 --> 02:07:35,000
*I recall a cool, powder blue sky, a similar shade to this woman's dress. The roof of my old high school, with its iron fence.*

1696
02:07:35,000 --> 02:07:38,000
*A gentle breeze. The fluttering of a plaid skirt.*

1697
02:07:38,000 --> 02:07:45,000
*Hands clasped, eyes wide, a gentle query spoken between two students in their final year of school.*

1698
02:07:45,000 --> 02:07:50,000
Yukie: "I know this might be sudden, so forgive me for the intrusion."

1699
02:07:50,000 --> 02:07:58,000
Yukie: "You are free to turn me down if you wish - I do not mean to inconvenience you - but please, Ogasawara..."

1700
02:07:58,000 --> 02:07:59,000
Yukie: "No, Hiroki."

1701
02:07:59,000 --> 02:08:01,000
Yukie: "Will you go out with me?"

1702
02:08:01,000 --> 02:08:02,000
Hiroki: "Aah..."

1703
02:08:02,000 --> 02:08:12,000
*A single syllable escapes from my lips. It tumbles from my mouth, in the stillness of my apartment, and seems to shatter on the tatami floor.*

1704
02:08:12,000 --> 02:08:15,000
*That's why this woman looks so familiar.*

1705
02:08:15,000 --> 02:08:20,000
*It's been a long time since we last spoke, but I still have dreams about her.*

1706
02:08:20,000 --> 02:08:24,000
*I never thought I'd see her again. I thought it was impossible.*

1707
02:08:24,000 --> 02:08:26,000
*Didn't she go and study abroad?*

1708
02:08:26,000 --> 02:08:29,000
*I was certain she'd be in America now, or Europe.*

1709
02:08:29,000 --> 02:08:35,000
*She always took everything seriously, but she was particularly fastidious about her studies.*

1710
02:08:35,000 --> 02:08:40,000
*Though she was a transfer student, she had the best grades in our class.*

1711
02:08:40,000 --> 02:08:49,000
*She could have done anything, gone anywhere. Everybody knew she was special. That's why the class kept their distance, I think.*

1712
02:08:49,000 --> 02:08:51,000
*They knew she wasn't like us.*

1713
02:08:51,000 --> 02:08:59,000
*That's why I was so surprised when she asked me out on that rooftop, only a few months before our university entrance exams.*

1714
02:08:59,000 --> 02:09:01,000
*She was my first ever girlfriend.*

1715
02:09:01,000 --> 02:09:07,000
*We were only together for a little while, but I cherished that time all the same.*

1716
02:09:07,000 --> 02:09:08,000
*I never thought...*

1717
02:09:08,000 --> 02:09:09,000
*This is...*

1718
02:09:09,000 --> 02:09:10,000
Hiroki: "Y-Yukie..."

1719
02:09:10,000 --> 02:09:12,000
*I stare at her, stunned.*

1720
02:09:12,000 --> 02:09:21,000
*I think it was easier to swallow the existence of succubi than it is the sudden, seemingly miraculous appearance of my ex-girlfriend.*

1721
02:09:21,000 --> 02:09:24,000
Hiroki: "Yukie, is that... really you...?"

1722
02:09:24,000 --> 02:09:26,000
Yukie: "So, you remember me?"

1723
02:09:26,000 --> 02:09:27,000
*Yukie smiles.*

1724
02:09:27,000 --> 02:09:33,000
Yukie: "I am relieved. I had feared you might have forgotten. The thought was... painful."

1725
02:09:33,000 --> 02:09:36,000
*Yukie rests one hand upon her chest.*

1726
02:09:36,000 --> 02:09:43,000
Yukie: "I did not like to think that our time together meant so little to you, when you were my very first."

1727
02:09:43,000 --> 02:09:48,000
Hiroki: "Y-You were my first, too! You were my very first girlfriend!"

1728
02:09:48,000 --> 02:09:53,000
Hiroki: "I know it's been a while, but I'd never forget you! I couldn't!"

1729
02:09:53,000 --> 02:10:01,000
Yukie: "Why, thank you. You have always been so passionate, though you needn't shout so loudly. I am standing right here."

1730
02:10:01,000 --> 02:10:03,000
Hiroki: "Yes, um... I-I'm sorry..."

1731
02:10:03,000 --> 02:10:08,000
Yukie: "It's alright. I like that passionate part of you. It is... amusing."

1732
02:10:08,000 --> 02:10:17,000
Yukie: "You were very dear to me once, Hiroki. You still are, in fact, though it has been a long time. Much has changed, myself included."

1733
02:10:17,000 --> 02:10:23,000
Yukie: "I am not the girl you used to know - or, indeed, the girl you thought you knew."

1734
02:10:23,000 --> 02:10:26,000
Yukie: "I have grown up quite a bit since then."

1735
02:10:26,000 --> 02:10:32,000
*Yukie tips her head to one side. She seems to be considering something, because she sighs.*

1736
02:10:32,000 --> 02:10:39,000
Yukie: "I did not think I would ever see you again, but I suppose I have always been drawn to you."

1737
02:10:39,000 --> 02:10:42,000
Yukie: "Once again, you piqued my interest."

1738
02:10:42,000 --> 02:10:46,000
Hiroki: "What do you mean? Didn't you go and study abroad?"

1739
02:10:46,000 --> 02:10:54,000
Yukie: "I went abroad, in a manner of speaking. I had duties to attend to, you see. I still do. I am a very busy woman."

1740
02:10:54,000 --> 02:10:58,000
Yukie: "I am sure, if Hifumi knew I was here, she would scold me."

1741
02:10:58,000 --> 02:11:02,000
Yukie: "I am behaving poorly... but what am I to do?"

1742
02:11:02,000 --> 02:11:08,000
Yukie: "I thought I could leave you be, but how can I? That is no longer possible."

1743
02:11:08,000 --> 02:11:10,000
Hiroki: "Wait, what...?"

1744
02:11:10,000 --> 02:11:15,000
*I stare at Yukie in what I'm sure is a very intelligent manner (not).*

1745
02:11:15,000 --> 02:11:22,000
*It seems like it's been my lot in life, as of late, to be perpetually surprised and confused by everything.*

1746
02:11:22,000 --> 02:11:29,000
*Sometimes, I wish I could instigate events of my own volition, instead of being forced to react to them.*

1747
02:11:29,000 --> 02:11:36,000
*I'm starting to feel a little like a chess piece being pushed around on a board, with no free will of my own.*

1748
02:11:36,000 --> 02:11:38,000
*This is all insane...!*

1749
02:11:38,000 --> 02:11:42,000
Hiroki: "Let's slow down for a sec. You said you know Hifumi?"

1750
02:11:42,000 --> 02:11:43,000
Yukie: "Yes?"

1751
02:11:43,000 --> 02:11:46,000
*Yukie blinks, her expression uncomprehending.*

1752
02:11:46,000 --> 02:11:48,000
Yukie: "Is that an issue?"

1753
02:11:48,000 --> 02:11:53,000
Hiroki: "I guess not. It depends on which Hifumi you're talking about..."

1754
02:11:53,000 --> 02:11:59,000
Yukie: "Why, the same Hifumi that you know: Yamamoto Hifumi, the famous actress. Who else?"

1755
02:11:59,000 --> 02:12:02,000
Hiroki: "R-Right, right. Who else, indeed..."

1756
02:12:02,000 --> 02:12:06,000
*This is even more complicated than I first imagined.*

1757
02:12:06,000 --> 02:12:12,000
Hiroki: "So, how do you know Hifumi - and, more importantly, how do you know that I know Hifumi?"

1758
02:12:12,000 --> 02:12:18,000
Hiroki: "I haven't seen her in a while, and our relationship's supposed to be a secret..."

1759
02:12:18,000 --> 02:12:28,000
Yukie: "It may be a secret from the prying masses, but I am not so easily fooled. It is my duty, you see, to know everything my subjects are getting up to."

1760
02:12:28,000 --> 02:12:29,000
Hiroki: "Subjects?"

1761
02:12:29,000 --> 02:12:30,000
Yukie: "Yes, indeed."

1762
02:12:30,000 --> 02:12:37,000
Yukie: "I have been monitoring Hifumi for quite some time... And Ayu, too, and Cosmos, and Marina, and Hazel."

1763
02:12:37,000 --> 02:12:41,000
Yukie: "They are all my subjects. They can hide nothing from me."

1764
02:12:41,000 --> 02:12:43,000
Yukie: "I see all, and I know all..."

1765
02:12:43,000 --> 02:12:47,000
Yukie: "And I know exactly what they have been doing with you."

1766
02:12:47,000 --> 02:12:50,000
Yukie: "They are trying to take you from me."

1767
02:12:50,000 --> 02:12:52,000
Hiroki: "What? Then, you mean..."

1768
02:12:52,000 --> 02:12:53,000
*My voice trails off.*

1769
02:12:53,000 --> 02:12:55,000
*I know exactly what this all means.*

1770
02:12:55,000 --> 02:13:02,000
*I'd have to be pretty stupid not to have put it together by now, but it all seems so ridiculous.*

1771
02:13:02,000 --> 02:13:09,000
*As if it wasn't enough that my high school girlfriend has appeared in my apartment, quite out of the blue!*

1772
02:13:09,000 --> 02:13:14,000
*That would be a pretty big plot twist in its own right, but this...*

1773
02:13:14,000 --> 02:13:17,000
*I-Isn't this too much of a coincidence?*

1774
02:13:17,000 --> 02:13:18,000
*What are the odds?!*

1775
02:13:18,000 --> 02:13:22,000
Hiroki: "Yukie, you... You're not really Yukie, are you?"

1776
02:13:22,000 --> 02:13:31,000
Hiroki: "That's how you referred to yourself when we went to school together... but Marina calls you something quite different."

1777
02:13:31,000 --> 02:13:35,000
Yukie: "Yes, I can imagine. She has never much liked me."

1778
02:13:35,000 --> 02:13:41,000
Yukie: "What scornful epithets does she use to refer to me? "That bitch", perhaps?"

1779
02:13:41,000 --> 02:13:42,000
Hiroki: "What? No...!"

1780
02:13:42,000 --> 02:13:49,000
*Yukie is such a demure, mild-mannered girl, hearing her say a word like "bitch" is quite shocking.*

1781
02:13:49,000 --> 02:13:52,000
*My perception of her is falling apart here!*

1782
02:13:52,000 --> 02:13:56,000
*I thought she was a serious, tranquil beauty, but in actuality...*

1783
02:13:56,000 --> 02:14:02,000
Hiroki: "You're Yue, aren't you? You're Lady Yue. You're the ruler of the succubi!"

1784
02:14:02,000 --> 02:14:03,000
Yue: "Yes, I am."

1785
02:14:03,000 --> 02:14:08,000
*Yukie - Yue, rather - doesn't refute this impossible claim. Instead, she nods.*

1786
02:14:08,000 --> 02:14:16,000
Yue: "I am Lady Yue. I once lived in the human realm, as all young succubi do, to learn of human culture and of your ways..."

1787
02:14:16,000 --> 02:14:22,000
Yue: "But since the completion of my training, I have dwelt within the realm of the succubi."

1788
02:14:22,000 --> 02:14:30,000
Yue: "I am the one to whom all the succubi you have met look up to. They all revere and fear me. At least, they should..."

1789
02:14:30,000 --> 02:14:36,000
Yue: "But perhaps, given my youth and relative inexperience, I have been too soft on them."

1790
02:14:36,000 --> 02:14:41,000
*Yukie's - no, Yue's. I have to remember that she is really Yue - eyes flash.*

1791
02:14:41,000 --> 02:14:47,000
Yue: "My subjects have been very, very wicked. They have all been trying to sway your heart."

1792
02:14:47,000 --> 02:14:54,000
Yue: "I am a magnanimous ruler. I am no tyrant. I am prepared to forgive one or two indiscretions."

1793
02:14:54,000 --> 02:15:01,000
Yue: "You are an interesting person, so I do not begrudge my subjects for their initial interest..."

1794
02:15:01,000 --> 02:15:04,000
Yue: "But three times? Four? Five? Six?"

1795
02:15:04,000 --> 02:15:06,000
*Yue's fingers clench into fists.*

1796
02:15:06,000 --> 02:15:12,000
Yue: "I cannot stand by and watch them seduce you any longer. It simply is not fair."

1797
02:15:12,000 --> 02:15:20,000
Yue: "I am the one who met you first, not them. You were my first partner and, to this day, you are my only partner."

1798
02:15:20,000 --> 02:15:25,000
Yue: "I loved you sincerely, and part of that love continues to exist within me."

1799
02:15:25,000 --> 02:15:31,000
Yue: "I am sure you feel it, too. We have a connection. We are meant to be together."

1800
02:15:31,000 --> 02:15:34,000
Hiroki: "I've often thought of you, true, but-"

1801
02:15:34,000 --> 02:15:36,000
Yue: "There are no "but"s."

1802
02:15:36,000 --> 02:15:39,000
*Yue cuts across me, her voice sharp and cold.*

1803
02:15:39,000 --> 02:15:41,000
*My legs tremble. I feel faint.*

1804
02:15:41,000 --> 02:15:50,000
*I remember that Yukie was quite cold and distant. A lot of the guys in my class were perturbed by her. They thought her unsettling.*

1805
02:15:50,000 --> 02:15:55,000
*I thought so too, once, until she confessed her feelings to me on the rooftop.*

1806
02:15:55,000 --> 02:16:03,000
*That came as a huge surprise. I hadn't realized Yukie, the stern and austere honor student, could even feel love.*

1807
02:16:03,000 --> 02:16:11,000
*I was wrong on that count, though. Her love was very earnest and sincere: so much so that it's survived for years.*

1808
02:16:11,000 --> 02:16:18,000
*Yukie was always serious about her school work. It stands to reason she'd be just as serious about her heart.*

1809
02:16:18,000 --> 02:16:28,000
Yue: "I do not want my subjects taking you for themselves. They do not deserve you. I want you for myself, and I have come here to stake my claim."

1810
02:16:28,000 --> 02:16:30,000
Yue: "I will have you back."

1811
02:16:30,000 --> 02:16:36,000
Hiroki: "Th-That's, uh, very nice, Yuki - I mean, Yue, but is that really your decision to make?"

1812
02:16:36,000 --> 02:16:48,000
Hiroki: "I'm happy to see you again, of course, and I don't mind making you a cup of tea so we can reminisce about the old times, but there's a reason they're the "old times"!"

1813
02:16:48,000 --> 02:16:54,000
Hiroki: "I'm not your boyfriend any more. I should be able to date who I want, shouldn't I?"

1814
02:16:54,000 --> 02:16:59,000
Yue: "If you were any other person, I would agree with you readily..."

1815
02:16:59,000 --> 02:17:02,000
Yue: "But such logic does not apply in your case."

1816
02:17:02,000 --> 02:17:03,000
Yue: "You are mine."

1817
02:17:03,000 --> 02:17:09,000
*...Crap. Her eyes are starting to look scary. The lights in her pupils have vanished!*

1818
02:17:09,000 --> 02:17:11,000
*She isn't listening to me at all!*

1819
02:17:11,000 --> 02:17:14,000
*I can't just go along with this madness, can I?*

1820
02:17:14,000 --> 02:17:16,000
*Try to reason with Yue.":

1821
02:17:16,000 --> 02:17:19,000
Hiroki: "I'm not yours! I'm my own person!"

1822
02:17:19,000 --> 02:17:25,000
Hiroki: "I rent this apartment, I have a job, and there are people here who care about me!"

1823
02:17:25,000 --> 02:17:29,000
Hiroki: "I can't go to the succubus realm with you! I can't-"

1824
02:17:29,000 --> 02:17:33,000
Yue: "You can. You must. You do not have a choice in the matter."

1825
02:17:33,000 --> 02:17:40,000
*Yue takes another step towards me. She's backed me into a corner. There's nowhere for me to run...!*

1826
02:17:40,000 --> 02:17:43,000
Yue: "I shall make you look at me and only me."

1827
02:17:43,000 --> 02:17:48,000
Yue: "I was your very first girlfriend, and I fully intend to be your last."

1828
02:17:48,000 --> 02:17:51,000
Yue: "Now, stop struggling. This needn't hurt."

1829
02:17:51,000 --> 02:17:53,000
Yue: "It will all be over soon."

1830
02:17:53,000 --> 02:17:54,000
Hiroki: "Y-Yue, wait-"

1831
02:17:54,000 --> 02:17:57,000
*I try to petition her, but to little avail.*

1832
02:17:57,000 --> 02:18:00,000
*Yue takes me by the arms and pulls me in.*

1833
02:18:00,000 --> 02:18:01,000
*Accept your fate.":

1834
02:18:01,000 --> 02:18:05,000
*I could try and protest, but what good would it do?*

1835
02:18:05,000 --> 02:18:13,000
*Yukie - I mean, Yue - might be a slip of a woman, but she's still a succubus. She has powers I can't possibly fathom.*

1836
02:18:13,000 --> 02:18:17,000
*I can argue, but she's under no obligation to listen.*

1837
02:18:17,000 --> 02:18:21,000
*I could run, but she would use her magic to stop me.*

1838
02:18:21,000 --> 02:18:22,000
*I could lash out...*

1839
02:18:22,000 --> 02:18:28,000
*But, no, that's not true. As much as she unnerves me, the fact remains that she is Yukie.*

1840
02:18:28,000 --> 02:18:30,000
*She's my first girlfriend.*

1841
02:18:30,000 --> 02:18:34,000
*I would never, ever want to hurt her - not that I could.*

1842
02:18:34,000 --> 02:18:37,000
*Fighting back is out of the question.*

1843
02:18:37,000 --> 02:18:39,000
*That being the case, what can I do?*

1844
02:18:39,000 --> 02:18:42,000
*Maybe it would be better for me to accept it.*

1845
02:18:42,000 --> 02:18:44,000
*It's what she wants...*

1846
02:18:44,000 --> 02:18:49,000
*And, in the back of my head, a little voice is telling me that I want this, too.*

1847
02:18:49,000 --> 02:18:51,000
*I really did miss her.*

1848
02:18:51,000 --> 02:18:54,000
*It's been so long since I last saw her.*

1849
02:18:54,000 --> 02:18:55,000
Hiroki: "Yukie..."

1850
02:18:55,000 --> 02:18:56,000
Yue: "Hiroki."

1851
02:18:56,000 --> 02:18:57,000
*Yue smiles.*

1852
02:18:57,000 --> 02:19:04,000
Yue: "Thank you for understanding. I knew I would be able to talk some sense into you eventually."

1853
02:19:04,000 --> 02:19:10,000
Yue: "It has been years since I last saw you, but the bond between us is unwavering."

1854
02:19:10,000 --> 02:19:13,000
Yue: "You are my Hiroki: nobody else's."

1855
02:19:13,000 --> 02:19:16,000
Yue: "I won't let anybody else have you."

1856
02:19:16,000 --> 02:19:18,000
Yue: "You belong to me."

1857
02:19:18,000 --> 02:19:25,000
*Her mouth presses against mine. Her lips are soft and warm, despite her cold and unapproachable appearance.*

1858
02:19:25,000 --> 02:19:31,000
*Deep down, beneath her layers of elegant white and blue silk, Yue's heart is very passionate.*

1859
02:19:31,000 --> 02:19:35,000
*It must be, for her to come all the way to Japan to find me.*

1860
02:19:35,000 --> 02:19:41,000
*She's been watching me for weeks. Months. It could even have been years, for all I know.*

1861
02:19:41,000 --> 02:19:46,000
*We only dated for a little while, but she's never stopped thinking of me.*

1862
02:19:46,000 --> 02:19:48,000
*She's always loved me.*

1863
02:19:48,000 --> 02:19:50,000
*Now, she's come back to claim me.*

1864
02:19:50,000 --> 02:19:56,000
*I can't escape, though I want to. My legs seem to have locked in place. My body is frozen.*

1865
02:19:56,000 --> 02:19:59,000
*I can only sigh into Yue's hot, demanding kiss.*

1866
02:19:59,000 --> 02:20:06,000
*Her tongue coils with mine. I can taste her saliva. There's something sweet about it; almost fruity.*

1867
02:20:06,000 --> 02:20:11,000
*The softness of her skin... The warmth of her lips... The taste of her tongue...*

1868
02:20:11,000 --> 02:20:15,000
*It all serves to melt what little self-restraint I still possess.*

1869
02:20:15,000 --> 02:20:19,000
*Reality begins to warp. My skull pulsates. My legs feel weak.*

1870
02:20:19,000 --> 02:20:21,000
*Yue's kiss is draining me.*

1871
02:20:21,000 --> 02:20:24,000
*I can't... keep standing any longer.*

1872
02:20:24,000 --> 02:20:25,000
*I...*

1873
02:20:25,000 --> 02:20:26,000
Hiroki: "Nn..."

1874
02:20:26,000 --> 02:20:30,000
*I break the kiss and step back - or, at least, I try to.*

1875
02:20:30,000 --> 02:20:34,000
*I don't get very far, because the wall's in the way.*

1876
02:20:34,000 --> 02:20:37,000
*My head bumps against it, and I groan.*

1877
02:20:37,000 --> 02:20:39,000
*The room shifts before my eyes.*

1878
02:20:39,000 --> 02:20:43,000
*The walls, my bookcase, and the tatami mats all blur together.*

1879
02:20:43,000 --> 02:20:44,000
*My strength fades.*

1880
02:20:44,000 --> 02:20:46,000
*Then, I pitch forwards.*

1881
02:20:46,000 --> 02:20:50,000
*I hit the ground, limp and insensible, and everything goes black.*

1882
02:20:50,000 --> 02:20:52,000
Hiroki: "Haaa... Nn..."

1883
02:20:52,000 --> 02:20:57,000
*When I eventually wake up, it's with a dull, throbbing ache in my temple.*

1884
02:20:57,000 --> 02:21:00,000
*I wonder if something's wrong with me. Am I sick?*

1885
02:21:00,000 --> 02:21:07,000
*My arms and legs feel heavy, but I don't seem to have a temperature. I'm not hot at all. In fact, I feel cold.*

1886
02:21:07,000 --> 02:21:09,000
Hiroki: "What's going on...?"

1887
02:21:09,000 --> 02:21:16,000
*I don't know how long I've been asleep. I don't remember what happened before I passed out, either.*

1888
02:21:16,000 --> 02:21:22,000
*My mind is blank. My memories have slipped away. It's like my skull's turned into a colander.*

1889
02:21:22,000 --> 02:21:25,000
*I think I was in my home, but I wasn't alone.*

1890
02:21:25,000 --> 02:21:26,000
*Who was with me...?*

1891
02:21:26,000 --> 02:21:27,000
Hiroki: "Nn..."

1892
02:21:27,000 --> 02:21:32,000
*I strain my leaky memory to its absolute limit, my head still throbbing.*

1893
02:21:32,000 --> 02:21:38,000
*Maybe all this thinking is bad for me. Humans weren't made to exert ourselves like this.*

1894
02:21:38,000 --> 02:21:40,000
*What if I have a brain haemorrhage?*

1895
02:21:40,000 --> 02:21:44,000
*It's a shame I don't have a famous doctor in my harem of succubi.*

1896
02:21:44,000 --> 02:21:52,000
*They're all very talented in their own ways, but I don't think any of them would be much use wielding a scalpel.*

1897
02:21:52,000 --> 02:21:54,000
*Speaking of succubi...*

1898
02:21:54,000 --> 02:22:03,000
*Was I with a succubus before I passed out? I think I might have been. I can recall, though faintly, the sensation of lips against my own.*

1899
02:22:03,000 --> 02:22:05,000
*Somebody kissed me...*

1900
02:22:05,000 --> 02:22:06,000
Hiroki: "..."

1901
02:22:06,000 --> 02:22:13,000
*I press my fingers against my lips, as a detective might run his gloved fingers about a crime scene.*

1902
02:22:13,000 --> 02:22:19,000
*If I was kissed, it must have been hours ago. I can't feel any warmth on my lips now.*

1903
02:22:19,000 --> 02:22:20,000
*I feel so cold...*

1904
02:22:20,000 --> 02:22:22,000
Hiroki: "Where am I, anyway...?"

1905
02:22:22,000 --> 02:22:29,000
*Now that I've (somewhat) regained my senses, I let my hand fall from my mouth and look at my surroundings.*

1906
02:22:29,000 --> 02:22:31,000
*I'm not in my apartment any more.*

1907
02:22:31,000 --> 02:22:33,000
*In fact, I have no idea where I am.*

1908
02:22:33,000 --> 02:22:36,000
*This place is like nothing I've ever seen.*

1909
02:22:36,000 --> 02:22:39,000
*I'm in a large room with a high, vaulted ceiling.*

1910
02:22:39,000 --> 02:22:47,000
*There are windows, but the sky outside them is dark, which makes everything feel dull and gloomy despite its grand scale.*

1911
02:22:47,000 --> 02:22:49,000
*Really, this room is huge!*

1912
02:22:49,000 --> 02:23:00,000
*It's like something from a fairytale palace, but slightly wrong: the color scheme too dark and gloomy to be befitting of a flaxen-haired heroine from a Destiny movie.*

1913
02:23:00,000 --> 02:23:06,000
*Maybe this spacious room is, instead, the abode of an evil stepmother, or a wicked witch?*

1914
02:23:06,000 --> 02:23:11,000
*That might explain why it's so cold in here. It's full of dark magic.*

1915
02:23:11,000 --> 02:23:12,000
Hiroki: "Brr..."

1916
02:23:12,000 --> 02:23:16,000
*I shiver, wrapping my arms about myself, as I continue to stare.*

1917
02:23:16,000 --> 02:23:19,000
*The furniture seems to loom over me.*

1918
02:23:19,000 --> 02:23:27,000
*The bed I'm sitting upon, meanwhile, is a real work of art. It's large, the mattress soft, with a fancy headboard.*

1919
02:23:27,000 --> 02:23:31,000
*It looks like something a princess might sleep in...*

1920
02:23:31,000 --> 02:23:32,000
Hiroki: "Princess..."

1921
02:23:32,000 --> 02:23:33,000
*My brow furrows.*

1922
02:23:33,000 --> 02:23:36,000
*Why has that struck a chord within me?*

1923
02:23:36,000 --> 02:23:43,000
*I don't know any princesses. They're pretty rare in today's modern society, beyond fantasy RPGs and the like.*

1924
02:23:43,000 --> 02:23:52,000
*There aren't all that many people who can confidently state that they're princesses - and those who can would never interact with me.*

1925
02:23:52,000 --> 02:24:00,000
*I'm just Ogasawara Hiroki. There's nothing special about me, other than my unique scent that succubi find irresistible.*

1926
02:24:00,000 --> 02:24:06,000
*There's no way any member of any countries' royal family would fake interest in me.*

1927
02:24:06,000 --> 02:24:09,000
*No human princess would, at least, but...*

1928
02:24:09,000 --> 02:24:11,000
*What about a succubus princess?*

1929
02:24:11,000 --> 02:24:12,000
*What if...*

1930
02:24:12,000 --> 02:24:17,000
Angry voice: "I'm disappointed in you! You've been an utterly awful influence!"

1931
02:24:17,000 --> 02:24:22,000
Angry voice: "What do you have to say for yourself, hmm? I'm listening!"

1932
02:24:22,000 --> 02:24:24,000
Whiny voice: "Grr... Wh-Why, you..."

1933
02:24:24,000 --> 02:24:33,000
Angry voice: "Do not refer to me as "you". That is a mark of great disrespect. I am your lady, and you will refer to me as thus!"

1934
02:24:33,000 --> 02:24:39,000
Angry voice: "Now, stop staring at me with those sad eyes. You look utterly pitiful."

1935
02:24:39,000 --> 02:24:42,000
Angry voice: "You are going to make me sick!"

1936
02:24:42,000 --> 02:24:44,000
Whiny voice: "Nngh, aah...! O-Ow...!"

1937
02:24:44,000 --> 02:24:45,000
Hiroki: "Huh?"

1938
02:24:45,000 --> 02:24:48,000
*I sit up a little straighter, my senses restored.*

1939
02:24:48,000 --> 02:24:55,000
*I can hear voices. They're dim and distant, but I think they must be coming from outside this room.*

1940
02:24:55,000 --> 02:25:02,000
*Though I can't see the speakers, both voices sound familiar. One is proud and haughty, the other pained.*

1941
02:25:02,000 --> 02:25:10,000
*The first voice is a little harder to place than the second, but I'm quite certain about the owner of those low moans.*

1942
02:25:10,000 --> 02:25:13,000
Whiny voice: "Nnn... Aah, haa... Y-You..."

1943
02:25:13,000 --> 02:25:16,000
Whiny voice: "H-How dare you...?! You bitch...!"

1944
02:25:16,000 --> 02:25:26,000
Angry voice: "You would call me that, despite my superior status? You do not know your place. You've let the acclaim of the humans get to your head!"

1945
02:25:26,000 --> 02:25:31,000
Angry voice: "Now, submit before me! I won't stop until I've seen you cry!"

1946
02:25:31,000 --> 02:25:33,000
Whiny voice: "Nngkh, nn... Haa..."

1947
02:25:33,000 --> 02:25:37,000
*I've never heard her make sounds quite like that before, but...*

1948
02:25:37,000 --> 02:25:40,000
Hiroki: "That's Marina. It has to be!"

1949
02:25:40,000 --> 02:25:44,000
Hiroki: "She's in trouble... and I need to go and help her!"

1950
02:25:44,000 --> 02:25:49,000
*I rise from the bed, disrupting the dark covers that pool around me.*

1951
02:25:49,000 --> 02:26:00,000
*Whoever lay me down upon this bed didn't strip me of my clothes, thank goodness, so I don't need to hunt around in that imposing wardrobe for something to put on.*

1952
02:26:00,000 --> 02:26:06,000
*I dash across the vast bed chamber, the soles of my feet slapping against the floor.*

1953
02:26:06,000 --> 02:26:10,000
*The pained gasps and cries get louder with each step I take.*

1954
02:26:10,000 --> 02:26:12,000
*I hope I'm not too late...!*

1955
02:26:12,000 --> 02:26:13,000
Hiroki: "Marina...!"

1956
02:26:13,000 --> 02:26:18,000
*I throw open the hefty double doors, and step out into a large hallway.*

1957
02:26:18,000 --> 02:26:23,000
*The hallway is dark and the sky beyond these windows is pitch black.*

1958
02:26:23,000 --> 02:26:28,000
*This strange, other-worldly mansion is nothing like anywhere I've ever been.*

1959
02:26:28,000 --> 02:26:38,000
*In terms of design, it's very Western. Gothic, too. It looks a little like the haunted house at Destiny Land, but it's on a far grander scale.*

1960
02:26:38,000 --> 02:26:44,000
*Everything looks very expensive. The person who owns this place must be an aesthete.*

1961
02:26:44,000 --> 02:26:49,000
*I wonder if this place has a billiards room, and a library, and...*

1962
02:26:49,000 --> 02:26:50,000
Marina: "Kyaa...!"

1963
02:26:50,000 --> 02:26:53,000
*My musings are cut short by another cry.*

1964
02:26:53,000 --> 02:26:55,000
*Marina sounds much closer now.*

1965
02:26:55,000 --> 02:27:05,000
*This hallway is lined with numerous wooden doors, all of them replete with brass handles, but my senses are telling me she's behind this one!*

1966
02:27:05,000 --> 02:27:08,000
Hiroki: "Hold on, Marina! I'm coming...!"

1967
02:27:08,000 --> 02:27:17,000
*My fingers tighten about the door handle. I pull it to, wincing with the effort (all the doors in this place are heavy), then slip inside.*

1968
02:27:17,000 --> 02:27:24,000
*I look around this new rooms, eyes agog. It's even larger than the bedroom, if such a thing is possible.*

1969
02:27:24,000 --> 02:27:27,000
*For such a large room, it's rather sparse...*

1970
02:27:27,000 --> 02:27:31,000
*Save for a throne at the very back of it, set upon a raised dais.*

1971
02:27:31,000 --> 02:27:36,000
*If this really is the throne room, it stands to reason royalty must live here.*

1972
02:27:36,000 --> 02:27:39,000
*This isn't just a mansion. It's a palace!*

1973
02:27:39,000 --> 02:27:40,000
Hiroki: "Wow..."

1974
02:27:40,000 --> 02:27:44,000
*I stare as a tourist might with wide, surprised eyes.*

1975
02:27:44,000 --> 02:27:46,000
*In a way, I guess I am a tourist.*

1976
02:27:46,000 --> 02:27:54,000
*This place is unfamiliar to me. I've seen more new sights in the last five minutes than I have the last five years.*

1977
02:27:54,000 --> 02:28:01,000
*It'd be nice if I had my camera, so I could take some photos of this place and it's exquisite architecture...*

1978
02:28:01,000 --> 02:28:03,000
*But now isn't the time!*

1979
02:28:03,000 --> 02:28:05,000
*I've finally found her!*

1980
02:28:05,000 --> 02:28:06,000
Hiroki: "Marina!"

1981
02:28:06,000 --> 02:28:07,000
Marina: "H-Hiroki?!"

1982
02:28:07,000 --> 02:28:11,000
*Marina stares at me, her face bright red with embarrassment.*

1983
02:28:11,000 --> 02:28:18,000
*I think, if I were in Marina's shoes (though it doesn't look like she's wearing any), I'd be embarrassed, too.*

1984
02:28:18,000 --> 02:28:23,000
*She's sprawled on the ground like an insect or a bug: something less than human.*

1985
02:28:23,000 --> 02:28:30,000
*Her voluptuous bosom is pushed up painfully on the plush carpet, and her long hair coils messily about her.*

1986
02:28:30,000 --> 02:28:35,000
*Her legs are slightly spread, and her shapely rear is raised in the air.*

1987
02:28:35,000 --> 02:28:42,000
*A pose such as this would be humiliating for anybody, let alone a businesswoman of Marina's caliber...*

1988
02:28:42,000 --> 02:28:46,000
*But that doesn't surmise the full extent of her humbling.*

1989
02:28:46,000 --> 02:28:55,000
*There's somebody sitting upon the throne, sporting long black tresses and a skintight costume that leaves little to the imagination.*

1990
02:28:55,000 --> 02:29:01,000
*I think I know who it is, though I've not seen her wear clothes like this before.*

1991
02:29:01,000 --> 02:29:04,000
*It's my high school sweetheart, Yukie...*

1992
02:29:04,000 --> 02:29:08,000
*Though I suppose her real name is Yue, the ruler of the succubi.*

1993
02:29:08,000 --> 02:29:10,000
*She is Marina's superior...*

1994
02:29:10,000 --> 02:29:14,000
*And right now, she's treating Marina like a piece of furniture.*

1995
02:29:14,000 --> 02:29:22,000
*Yue's feet are bare, and one leg is raised, as she props it up... not on a stool or a pouffe, but on Marina's body.*

1996
02:29:22,000 --> 02:29:30,000
*Yue nudges Marina with her foot. She grinds her sole against the top of Marina's head, none-too-gently, and Marina groans.*

1997
02:29:30,000 --> 02:29:32,000
Marina: "Nngh... Nn..."

1998
02:29:32,000 --> 02:29:36,000
*Her lower lip trembling, Marina glances down at the ground.*

1999
02:29:36,000 --> 02:29:46,000
Marina: "I'm sorry, Hiroki. I didn't want you to see me like this. I'm supposed to be the one who dominates, rather than the one who is dominated..."

2000
02:29:46,000 --> 02:29:49,000
*Marina's eyes bead with bitter, angry tears.*

2001
02:29:49,000 --> 02:29:53,000
Marina: "I hope this doesn't sour your opinion of me."

2002
02:29:53,000 --> 02:29:56,000
Marina: "I'm sure I must look pathetic..."

2003
02:29:56,000 --> 02:29:57,000
Yue: "Yes, you do."

2004
02:29:57,000 --> 02:30:00,000
*Yue looks at Marina coolly, arms folded.*

2005
02:30:00,000 --> 02:30:10,000
*She grinds her foot atop Marina's head even harder, in a truly vindictive manner that seems calculated to cause as much pain and humiliation as possible.*

2006
02:30:10,000 --> 02:30:11,000
Marina: "Nngh...!"

2007
02:30:11,000 --> 02:30:17,000
*Marina can't withstand the full brunt of Yue's anger. Her body dips, her face aflame.*

2008
02:30:17,000 --> 02:30:21,000
*Her succubus wings, which protrude from her back, quiver.*

2009
02:30:21,000 --> 02:30:31,000
*Dogs might wag their tails when they're happy, but I don't think the anxious quivering of Marina's wings signifies happiness. She must feel wretched.*

2010
02:30:31,000 --> 02:30:33,000
*She looks kind of wretched, too...*

2011
02:30:33,000 --> 02:30:36,000
*Not that I'd be callous enough to tell her that.*

2012
02:30:36,000 --> 02:30:42,000
Hiroki: "I-It's fine, Marina. Don't worry. I'd never think any less of you because of this!"

2013
02:30:42,000 --> 02:30:44,000
Marina: "Do you really mean that?"

2014
02:30:44,000 --> 02:30:52,000
Hiroki: "Yes, I do. I'm very fond of you, as I've said before. Something like this isn't enough to sway my feelings."

2015
02:30:52,000 --> 02:30:59,000
Hiroki: "I know you're not cowering before that woman because you want to. She must have forced you into this!"

2016
02:30:59,000 --> 02:31:00,000
Yue: "How astute."

2017
02:31:00,000 --> 02:31:02,000
*Yue casts her eyes upon me.*

2018
02:31:02,000 --> 02:31:10,000
*Her irises are a pale, icy blue, and they look paler still in this darkened throne room; so penetrating I shiver.*

2019
02:31:10,000 --> 02:31:17,000
Yue: "It is true enough Marina did not want to prostrate herself before me... but, then again, she never does."

2020
02:31:17,000 --> 02:31:19,000
Yue: "She has always been difficult."

2021
02:31:19,000 --> 02:31:20,000
*Yue's lip curls.*

2022
02:31:20,000 --> 02:31:31,000
Yue: "She thinks she is above me solely because she is older and a bit more experienced. She has never before taken me seriously, though I am supposed to be her ruler."

2023
02:31:31,000 --> 02:31:35,000
Yue: "She has always denigrated and disrespected me."

2024
02:31:35,000 --> 02:31:39,000
Yue: "She has far, far too much pride for a mere underling."

2025
02:31:39,000 --> 02:31:44,000
Yue: "I have tried to be lenient with her, but I cannot let it stand now."

2026
02:31:44,000 --> 02:31:53,000
Yue: "I will grind her beneath my heel - quite literally, as you can see - and show her just how truly small and insignificant she really is!"

2027
02:31:53,000 --> 02:31:54,000
Yue: "Now, Marina..."

2028
02:31:54,000 --> 02:32:05,000
*Yue looks down at her captive. Yue still isn't smiling (her expression is coolly detached), but I get the feeling she's enjoying this a bit more than she's letting on.*

2029
02:32:05,000 --> 02:32:07,000
*Yue really is a sadist...*

2030
02:32:07,000 --> 02:32:10,000
Yue: "Won't you subject yourself to me?"

2031
02:32:10,000 --> 02:32:16,000
Yue: "I will punish you, as is my right. It is what you deserve, for seducing my dear Hiroki."

2032
02:32:16,000 --> 02:32:17,000
Marina: "S-Seducing?"

2033
02:32:17,000 --> 02:32:19,000
*Marina glowers at Yue.*

2034
02:32:19,000 --> 02:32:23,000
Marina: "You make me sound like some wicked temptress!"

2035
02:32:23,000 --> 02:32:26,000
Yue: "Well, aren't you? You are a succubus."

2036
02:32:26,000 --> 02:32:28,000
Marina: "And so are you!"

2037
02:32:28,000 --> 02:32:34,000
Marina: "Seducing men might be in our nature, but Hiroki is more than just a conquest to me."

2038
02:32:34,000 --> 02:32:43,000
Marina: "In the beginning, I spoke to him because of his unique scent. He intrigued me. I-It was little more than idle curiosity, really..."

2039
02:32:43,000 --> 02:32:50,000
Marina: "But as time went by, our relationship developed. I began to learn a bit more about him, and then-"

2040
02:32:50,000 --> 02:32:51,000
Yue: "How dare you."

2041
02:32:51,000 --> 02:32:56,000
*Yue interrupts Marina's story, her voice as cold and glacial as a snowdrift.*

2042
02:32:56,000 --> 02:33:05,000
Yue: "Do not talk to me about your so-called "relationship" with my beloved. If you do, I will inflict far worse torments upon you than this!"

2043
02:33:05,000 --> 02:33:14,000
*Yue pushes her bare sole against Marina's head with so much force Marina's body buckles. Her chin hits the ground and she winces.*

2044
02:33:14,000 --> 02:33:16,000
*Maybe she bit her tongue...*

2045
02:33:16,000 --> 02:33:19,000
*Is that why her eyes are beading with tears?*

2046
02:33:19,000 --> 02:33:22,000
Yue: "You are truly shameless, even for a succubus."

2047
02:33:22,000 --> 02:33:29,000
Yue: "I have tried to tell you this dozens of times already, but I suppose I mustn't have made it clear enough."

2048
02:33:29,000 --> 02:33:33,000
Yue: "One does get tired of repeating oneself, though."

2049
02:33:33,000 --> 02:33:42,000
Yue: "I am a busy woman, and I have a good deal more to do than punish you for your transgressions, so please try to pay attention."

2050
02:33:42,000 --> 02:33:48,000
Yue: "If I ever have to school you in this matter again, I will crack open your skull."

2051
02:33:48,000 --> 02:33:52,000
*Yue stamps on Marina's head without mercy, her eyes emotionless.*

2052
02:33:52,000 --> 02:33:59,000
Yue: "Hiroki is mine. He belongs to me, not you, and I won't let you lay so much as a finger on him again."

2053
02:33:59,000 --> 02:34:06,000
Yue: "I don't care what sort of "relationship" you might have had once. It is all null and void now."

2054
02:34:06,000 --> 02:34:13,000
Yue: "Now we are in the succubus realm, nobody can refuse my wishes. I rule this place with absolute power."

2055
02:34:13,000 --> 02:34:17,000
*Ah... So we're in the succubus realm, are we? I had wondered.*

2056
02:34:17,000 --> 02:34:19,000
*I guess that clears up one mystery.*

2057
02:34:19,000 --> 02:34:29,000
*Yue must have brought me here after I fell unconscious. She might be regal, but I don't think she's above using underhanded methods to get what she wants.*

2058
02:34:29,000 --> 02:34:37,000
*I guess she used her magic on me to knock me insensible, so I wouldn't be able to struggle. Then, she kidnapped me.*

2059
02:34:37,000 --> 02:34:40,000
*Am I going to be trapped here from now on?*

2060
02:34:40,000 --> 02:34:44,000
*How does one get back to Tokyo from the succubus realm, anyway?*

2061
02:34:44,000 --> 02:34:52,000
*Maybe I need to walk through some sort of portal, recite some sort of spell, or click a pair of ruby-red slippers together...*

2062
02:34:52,000 --> 02:34:55,000
*Ah. Yue's still disciplining Marina.*

2063
02:34:55,000 --> 02:34:57,000
*What's she saying...?*

2064
02:34:57,000 --> 02:35:04,000
Yue: "I have decided that I want Hiroki, so you must learn to keep your distance and hold your tongue."

2065
02:35:04,000 --> 02:35:07,000
Yue: "This is not a request, but an order."

2066
02:35:07,000 --> 02:35:11,000
*Yue kicks Marina's head, her shoulders, and her stomach.*

2067
02:35:11,000 --> 02:35:21,000
*As Marina's slumped on the ground, propped up by her arms, she can't protect herself - and if she tried, I think it would provoke Yue's wrath further.*

2068
02:35:21,000 --> 02:35:24,000
*Marina has no other option but to take this abuse.*

2069
02:35:24,000 --> 02:35:32,000
*Marina grits her teeth together. Her eyes are filled with angry tears, but she has too much pride to let them fall.*

2070
02:35:32,000 --> 02:35:38,000
*Somehow, she looks oddly dignified, despite the severe dressing down she's receiving.*

2071
02:35:38,000 --> 02:35:44,000
*I don't think I'd be able to endure such torments without shedding at least a couple of tears.*

2072
02:35:44,000 --> 02:35:46,000
*Yue's not exactly being gentle.*

2073
02:35:46,000 --> 02:35:53,000
*It's a good thing she removed her shoes at least, I guess, but being kicked repeatedly must hurt.*

2074
02:35:53,000 --> 02:36:01,000
Yue: "I will forgive you for your previous relations with Hiroki. You weren't to know that I had already claimed him."

2075
02:36:01,000 --> 02:36:07,000
Yue: "You like to imagine you are the smartest of all of us, but you were wholly ignorant."

2076
02:36:07,000 --> 02:36:11,000
Yue: "I cannot revile somebody for acting without first knowing..."

2077
02:36:11,000 --> 02:36:14,000
*Another sharp, sudden kick to the stomach.*

2078
02:36:14,000 --> 02:36:18,000
Yue: "...but now you do know, you should keep your distance."

2079
02:36:18,000 --> 02:36:20,000
Yue: "Look upon this as a warning!"

2080
02:36:20,000 --> 02:36:26,000
Yue: "If you ever test my patience again, I will make you eat dirt and cry tears of blood!"

2081
02:36:26,000 --> 02:36:27,000
*Thud, thud, thud...*

2082
02:36:27,000 --> 02:36:32,000
*Yue is kicking Marina indiscriminately, while Marina groans and gasps.*

2083
02:36:32,000 --> 02:36:34,000
Marina: "Haa... Nngh, nn..."

2084
02:36:34,000 --> 02:36:46,000
*It looked like Yue was in control of her faculties (more or less) when I arrived in the throne room, but my presence seems to have spurred her jealousy on to insane levels.*

2085
02:36:46,000 --> 02:36:50,000
*If this keeps up, Marina might be in serious danger!*

2086
02:36:50,000 --> 02:37:01,000
*I know she's a succubus, and her body is made of hardier stuff than a normal human's, but Yue is a succubus, too. She must be very powerful, and she's not holding back!*

2087
02:37:01,000 --> 02:37:06,000
*Marina's body's going to end up covered in black and blue bruises!*

2088
02:37:06,000 --> 02:37:08,000
*She might even break a bone!*

2089
02:37:08,000 --> 02:37:15,000
*Yue shows no signs of stopping any time soon, despite Marina's gasps. Marina's pain only encourages her.*

2090
02:37:15,000 --> 02:37:17,000
*I have to do something...!*

2091
02:37:17,000 --> 02:37:19,000
*Plead with Yue to stop.":

2092
02:37:19,000 --> 02:37:22,000
Hiroki: "Yue, please! Stop this! I'm begging you!"

2093
02:37:22,000 --> 02:37:28,000
Hiroki: "I don't want to watch you do something so cruel! I thought you were kinder than that!"

2094
02:37:28,000 --> 02:37:32,000
Hiroki: "That's the reason why I fell for you to begin with!"

2095
02:37:32,000 --> 02:37:33,000
*Order Yue to stop.":

2096
02:37:33,000 --> 02:37:36,000
Hiroki: "I can't keep watching this. It's cruel."

2097
02:37:36,000 --> 02:37:38,000
*I grit my teeth together.*

2098
02:37:38,000 --> 02:37:42,000
*Fingers curled into fists at my sides, I cry out...*

2099
02:37:42,000 --> 02:37:45,000
Hiroki: "Quit that, Yue! That's enough!"

2100
02:37:45,000 --> 02:37:50,000
Hiroki: "What you're doing is cruel! Marina's done nothing to deserve this!"

2101
02:37:50,000 --> 02:37:52,000
Hiroki: "Leave her alone!"

2102
02:37:52,000 --> 02:37:53,000
Yue: "Oh...?"

2103
02:37:53,000 --> 02:37:56,000
*Yue glances at me. She purses her lips together.*

2104
02:37:56,000 --> 02:38:02,000
Yue: "You mustn't be as smart as I thought, Hiroki, to interfere with such matters."

2105
02:38:02,000 --> 02:38:11,000
Yue: "As the ruler of the succubus realm, and all the succubi who dwell within it, nobody can tell me what to do. I do not answer to orders."

2106
02:38:11,000 --> 02:38:14,000
Yue: "I am giving Marina only what she deserves..."

2107
02:38:14,000 --> 02:38:22,000
*Yue glances down at Marina. She's still curled up on the floor beneath Yue's bare foot, her face twisted in pain.*

2108
02:38:22,000 --> 02:38:25,000
*It certainly looks like she's suffering.*

2109
02:38:25,000 --> 02:38:32,000
*Her eyes are damp and watery. When she squeezes them together, a couple of tears trickle down her cheeks.*

2110
02:38:32,000 --> 02:38:33,000
*Yue sighs.*

2111
02:38:33,000 --> 02:38:41,000
Yue: "Well, perhaps you do have a point. There is a chance I may have been a little too thorough in distributing retribution."

2112
02:38:41,000 --> 02:38:50,000
Yue: "One does not like to lose one's cool. As the ruler of the succubus realm, such frenzied emotions are unsuitable for myself."

2113
02:38:50,000 --> 02:38:53,000
Yue: "I would hate to look hysterical, so..."

2114
02:38:53,000 --> 02:39:01,000
Yue: "I am finished with you for the present, Marina. I trust my actions made an impact, even if my words did not."

2115
02:39:01,000 --> 02:39:06,000
Yue: "Now, go. Leave me in peace. I do not wish to see your face again."

2116
02:39:06,000 --> 02:39:08,000
Marina: "Ha... Haha..."

2117
02:39:08,000 --> 02:39:09,000
*Marina laughs.*

2118
02:39:09,000 --> 02:39:14,000
*She might have sustained a lot of damage, but her pride hasn't wavered.*

2119
02:39:14,000 --> 02:39:18,000
*Rather than thanking Yue for her kindness, she instead says...*

2120
02:39:18,000 --> 02:39:22,000
Marina: "Th-The feeling is quite mutual, I can assure you."

2121
02:39:22,000 --> 02:39:23,000
Yue: "Oh?"

2122
02:39:23,000 --> 02:39:25,000
*Yue's icy eyes flash.*

2123
02:39:25,000 --> 02:39:30,000
Yue: "Are you trying to talk back to me, Marina, after all you've endured?"

2124
02:39:30,000 --> 02:39:34,000
Yue: "Do you truly have no sense of self-preservation?"

2125
02:39:34,000 --> 02:39:42,000
Yue: "If you enjoyed the sensation of my foot upon your quivering body that much, I could always punish you again..."

2126
02:39:42,000 --> 02:39:46,000
Marina: "N-No, it's... it's fine, Lady Yue. My apologies."

2127
02:39:46,000 --> 02:39:52,000
*Marina adjusts the straps of her complex outfit, then offers Yue a clipped curtsy.*

2128
02:39:52,000 --> 02:39:54,000
Marina: "I shall now depart."

2129
02:39:54,000 --> 02:40:05,000
Yue: "Yes, you do that. Do it quickly, too. If you do not, I may be forced to make you depart, not just from this room, but from the world of all living beings."

2130
02:40:05,000 --> 02:40:10,000
Marina: "Ha... How frightening. You really do have a way with words, my lady..."

2131
02:40:10,000 --> 02:40:18,000
Marina: "Hiroki is right, though. If you are to be an effective leader, you really ought to work on your temper."

2132
02:40:18,000 --> 02:40:20,000
Marina: "Anger does not become you."

2133
02:40:20,000 --> 02:40:21,000
Yue: "Y-You..."

2134
02:40:21,000 --> 02:40:27,000
*Yue glares at Marina, but Marina doesn't see it. She's already turned about on her heels.*

2135
02:40:27,000 --> 02:40:37,000
*I watch as Marina walks off. Her motions are somewhat slow and sluggish, no doubt from the beating she received at Yue's hands... or foot, rather.*

2136
02:40:37,000 --> 02:40:44,000
*Marina walks with something of a limp, and she has to drag her leg behind her, but she remains self-possessed.*

2137
02:40:44,000 --> 02:40:49,000
*She exits the room, closing the heavy door behind her with a dull thud.*

2138
02:40:49,000 --> 02:40:55,000
*Now, it's just Yue and me in the throne room... and the air feels positively glacial.*

2139
02:40:55,000 --> 02:40:59,000
*The atmosphere is so thick, you could cut it with a knife.*

2140
02:40:59,000 --> 02:41:09,000
*I felt much the same back in my apartment, when I was all alone with Yue. Chills are running up and down my spine, but my palms are starting to sweat.*

2141
02:41:09,000 --> 02:41:12,000
*My heart's beating pretty hard, too.*

2142
02:41:12,000 --> 02:41:16,000
*Is this what biologists call a "flight or fight" response?*

2143
02:41:16,000 --> 02:41:24,000
*My body must know, on some intrinsic level, that it isn't safe to be alone in Yue's company. I can't trust her.*

2144
02:41:24,000 --> 02:41:29,000
*What if she turns on me like she did Marina? The thought is a frightening one...*

2145
02:41:29,000 --> 02:41:36,000
*But I'm far more unnerved by the prospect of being trapped in the succubus realm for years - maybe decades.*

2146
02:41:36,000 --> 02:41:38,000
Yue: "Now, that is much better."

2147
02:41:38,000 --> 02:41:41,000
*Idly, Yue toys with a lock of her long, dark hair.*

2148
02:41:41,000 --> 02:41:46,000
*Her blue eyes, so pale they seem to be devoid of pigmentation, stare at me.*

2149
02:41:46,000 --> 02:41:50,000
*She might as well be seeing right through me, to my very soul...*

2150
02:41:50,000 --> 02:41:57,000
Yue: "It is nice to be alone with you, Hiroki. That is rather why I brought you here in the first place."

2151
02:41:57,000 --> 02:42:06,000
Yue: "Now we are in the succubus realm, you are all mine. I won't let any of the other succubi in my palace lay so much as a finger on you."

2152
02:42:06,000 --> 02:42:10,000
Yue: "If they try, there will be grave consequences."

2153
02:42:10,000 --> 02:42:15,000
Yue: "I have made it quite apparent that you are mine, and mine alone."

2154
02:42:15,000 --> 02:42:18,000
Hiroki: "That's, uh... very flattering..."

2155
02:42:18,000 --> 02:42:20,000
*And more than a little disturbing.*

2156
02:42:20,000 --> 02:42:23,000
Hiroki: "But how long am I going to stay here?"

2157
02:42:23,000 --> 02:42:25,000
Yue: "As long as I deem necessary."

2158
02:42:25,000 --> 02:42:32,000
*That's not a very useful response. I need to try and get some more concrete information out of her!*

2159
02:42:32,000 --> 02:42:35,000
Hiroki: "And how long is that, exactly?"

2160
02:42:35,000 --> 02:42:37,000
Yue: "Don't ask questions."

2161
02:42:37,000 --> 02:42:38,000
*Yue frowns.*

2162
02:42:38,000 --> 02:42:43,000
Yue: "You make it sound almost as though you do not want to spend time with me!"

2163
02:42:43,000 --> 02:42:46,000
Yue: "Are you not happy to see me again?"

2164
02:42:46,000 --> 02:42:49,000
*I'd be happier if you weren't being so cruel.":

2165
02:42:49,000 --> 02:42:54,000
Hiroki: "I'd be happier to see you again if you weren't being so cruel."

2166
02:42:54,000 --> 02:42:55,000
Yue: "Cruel?!"

2167
02:42:55,000 --> 02:42:57,000
*Yue raises her eyebrows.*

2168
02:42:57,000 --> 02:43:00,000
Yue: "You don't know what you're talking about."

2169
02:43:00,000 --> 02:43:07,000
Yue: "As the princess of this realm, it is my duty to discipline naughty succubi who step out of line."

2170
02:43:07,000 --> 02:43:09,000
Yue: "Marina was asking for it."

2171
02:43:09,000 --> 02:43:11,000
Hiroki: "No, she wasn't!"

2172
02:43:11,000 --> 02:43:14,000
*I glower at Yue, my anger resurfacing.*

2173
02:43:14,000 --> 02:43:17,000
Hiroki: "Nobody would ask to be treated like that!"

2174
02:43:17,000 --> 02:43:20,000
Hiroki: "What you did was wrong! It was immoral!"

2175
02:43:20,000 --> 02:43:23,000
Hiroki: "You should apologize to her, or else-"

2176
02:43:23,000 --> 02:43:25,000
Yue: "Or else... what?"

2177
02:43:25,000 --> 02:43:28,000
*Yue surveys me, her blue eyes cool as ice.*

2178
02:43:28,000 --> 02:43:31,000
*Her look is impassive, and I find myself wincing.*

2179
02:43:31,000 --> 02:43:33,000
*I don't know what to say to her.*

2180
02:43:33,000 --> 02:43:36,000
*There's nothing I can do to threaten her.*

2181
02:43:36,000 --> 02:43:39,000
*She has far more power than I ever will.*

2182
02:43:39,000 --> 02:43:42,000
Yue: "Heh. I thought that would render you quiet."

2183
02:43:42,000 --> 02:43:43,000
*Yue smiles.*

2184
02:43:43,000 --> 02:43:52,000
Yue: "I understand your desire to play the hero, but it is unnecessary. Marina is a grown woman, and she can look after herself."

2185
02:43:52,000 --> 02:43:56,000
Yue: "Please, do not let her sour our reunion. She is unimportant."

2186
02:43:56,000 --> 02:44:00,000
*I'd like to argue that point... but I'll let it slide for now.*

2187
02:44:00,000 --> 02:44:03,000
*There's other things weighing on my mind.*

2188
02:44:03,000 --> 02:44:10,000
Hiroki: "I can't stay here, you know? I have a life waiting for me back in Tokyo: an apartment, and a job."

2189
02:44:10,000 --> 02:44:12,000
Hiroki: "I need to return."

2190
02:44:12,000 --> 02:44:15,000
Yue: "Oh, Hiroki! How boring you've become!"

2191
02:44:15,000 --> 02:44:16,000
*Yue sighs.*

2192
02:44:16,000 --> 02:44:24,000
Yue: "I suppose I am pleased you have grown into such a responsible man, but you need not worry about such things any longer."

2193
02:44:24,000 --> 02:44:29,000
Yue: "Now, you exist for one purpose and one alone: keeping me happy."

2194
02:44:29,000 --> 02:44:33,000
Yue: "Let me soothe you of your concerns, my dear Hiroki."

2195
02:44:33,000 --> 02:44:36,000
*Yue licks her lower lip with her tongue.*

2196
02:44:36,000 --> 02:44:42,000
Yue: "I shall give myself unto you fully, until you forget about your prior attachments."

2197
02:44:42,000 --> 02:44:43,000
*I am happy, but...":

2198
02:44:43,000 --> 02:44:47,000
Hiroki: "It's not that I don't want to spend time with you, Yue..."

2199
02:44:47,000 --> 02:44:58,000
*I'm not just saying that to placate her, either. While it's true enough I don't want to incur the wrath of an angry succubus, I am genuinely pleased to see Yukie again.*

2200
02:44:58,000 --> 02:45:06,000
Hiroki: "You were a very special part of my life. I often wondered what you were doing and how you were getting on."

2201
02:45:06,000 --> 02:45:08,000
Hiroki: "I missed you."

2202
02:45:08,000 --> 02:45:11,000
Hiroki: "I was pleased to see you see you again..."

2203
02:45:11,000 --> 02:45:23,000
Hiroki: "But I can't stay in the succubus realm indefinitely. I have a life of my own, and a career, and an apartment. A family, too, though I don't see them all that often."

2204
02:45:23,000 --> 02:45:27,000
Hiroki: "I don't want that to all fall by the wayside."

2205
02:45:27,000 --> 02:45:29,000
Yue: "Oh, silly Hiroki."

2206
02:45:29,000 --> 02:45:30,000
*Yue sighs.*

2207
02:45:30,000 --> 02:45:34,000
Yue: "You don't need all those things. Not when you are with me."

2208
02:45:34,000 --> 02:45:40,000
Yue: "I shall make you so happy you forget about all your ties to the human world."

2209
02:45:40,000 --> 02:45:45,000
Yue: "Then, you will beg me to stay here. I am certain of that much!"

2210
02:45:45,000 --> 02:45:54,000
*She's awfully confident, given she has nothing to back up these claims. I hope she doesn't mean to cast some sort of spell on me...*

2211
02:45:54,000 --> 02:45:57,000
Hiroki: "I'm also a little curious..."

2212
02:45:57,000 --> 02:46:02,000
Hiroki: "Won't Cosmos and Ayu and the others wonder where I've gone?"

2213
02:46:02,000 --> 02:46:06,000
Yue: "So, you still care about them, though you have me now?"

2214
02:46:06,000 --> 02:46:07,000
*Yue's eyes flash.*

2215
02:46:07,000 --> 02:46:11,000
Yue: "Forget about them. They are no longer relevant."

2216
02:46:11,000 --> 02:46:12,000
Hiroki: "But-"

2217
02:46:12,000 --> 02:46:20,000
Yue: "There will be no "but"s. I am a ruler, and I do not tolerate back-chat even from you, whom I love most dearly."

2218
02:46:20,000 --> 02:46:29,000
Yue: "Now. If you are worried about Cosmos and Ayu and the rest, do not fret so. I have already informed them as to your new whereabouts."

2219
02:46:29,000 --> 02:46:30,000
Hiroki: "Y-You have?!"

2220
02:46:30,000 --> 02:46:38,000
Yue: "Indeed. I thought it would be... difficult... if you suddenly disappeared one day, and they were none the wiser."

2221
02:46:38,000 --> 02:46:49,000
Yue: "As irritating as my subjects are, I do not wish to make them panic. It is my duty, as their ruler, to look out for them, no matter how they have have wounded me."

2222
02:46:49,000 --> 02:46:54,000
Yue: "As a matter of fact, they are all in the succubus realm right now, too."

2223
02:46:54,000 --> 02:46:55,000
Hiroki: "They are?"

2224
02:46:55,000 --> 02:47:05,000
Yue: "Mm. I summoned all those pesky succubi here, alongside Marina, so I could scold them. They have all been very, very naughty girls: Hifumi included."

2225
02:47:05,000 --> 02:47:12,000
Yue: "I was shocked when I learned that she had been intimate with you, too. I did not expect it of her!"

2226
02:47:12,000 --> 02:47:23,000
Yue: "As you can see, I am still very upset. I think I will keep them in the succubus realm for a while, as part of their punishment, until they have learned their lesson."

2227
02:47:23,000 --> 02:47:28,000
Hiroki: "S-So, does that mean I can still see them? Can I talk to them?!"

2228
02:47:28,000 --> 02:47:31,000
Yue: "Now, why would you want to, when you have me?"

2229
02:47:31,000 --> 02:47:40,000
Yue: "I should be more than enough for you, Hiroki. Once, I was enough for you. I was your only girlfriend. We made one another very happy."

2230
02:47:40,000 --> 02:47:45,000
*Yue dips her head. She presses a hand to her chest, just above her heart.*

2231
02:47:45,000 --> 02:47:55,000
*She isn't smiling (she doesn't seem to do that often), but her expression has softened somewhat. She doesn't look as icy as usual, nor as intimidating.*

2232
02:47:55,000 --> 02:48:00,000
*I think she must be remembering the fond memories we have between us.*

2233
02:48:00,000 --> 02:48:07,000
*We were only together for a scant handful of months, but we were almost inseparable during that time.*

2234
02:48:07,000 --> 02:48:15,000
*We were a quintessential lovey-dovey couple, lost in our own bubble; disgusting to all unfortunate enough to witness us.*

2235
02:48:15,000 --> 02:48:20,000
*We went on a lot of dates. We went to cafés, the movies, and the countryside.*

2236
02:48:20,000 --> 02:48:27,000
*We studied together, and Yue even tried to cook for me, though her food was borderline inedible.*

2237
02:48:27,000 --> 02:48:30,000
*We shared many precious, happy moments.*

2238
02:48:30,000 --> 02:48:33,000
*At the time, I really did love her...*

2239
02:48:33,000 --> 02:48:44,000
Yue: "I am sure you were lonely when I left your life. That is why you had all these silly, meaningless relationships with all these succubi, one after the other."

2240
02:48:44,000 --> 02:48:49,000
Yue: "You were trying to fill the hole in your heart left by my hasty absence..."

2241
02:48:49,000 --> 02:48:54,000
Yue: "But you do not need to turn to the arms of these other women now."

2242
02:48:54,000 --> 02:49:00,000
Yue: "None are kinder, more thoughtful lovers than I, and none of them love you the way I do."

2243
02:49:00,000 --> 02:49:03,000
Yue: "I met you long before they did, after all."

2244
02:49:03,000 --> 02:49:04,000
Yue: "Now."

2245
02:49:04,000 --> 02:49:13,000
*Yue rises from her throne. Her wings twitch, and her long dark hair flutters around her white, creamy shoulders like a shroud.*

2246
02:49:13,000 --> 02:49:17,000
Yue: "Why don't I show you just how much I love you, Hiroki?"

2247
02:49:17,000 --> 02:49:26,000
Yue: "It has been a very, very long time since last we were together, and I would very much like to make the most of this moment."

2248
02:49:26,000 --> 02:49:32,000
Yue: "You are exceedingly important to me. No woman could love you as much as I do."

2249
02:49:32,000 --> 02:49:36,000
Yue: "I will accept every last drop of your love, so don't worry."

2250
02:49:36,000 --> 02:49:37,000
*Yue smiles.*

2251
02:49:37,000 --> 02:49:40,000
Yue: "You can do whatever you want with me."

2252
02:49:40,000 --> 02:49:49,000
Yue: "We will spend the whole day together, and all the night. I won't leave your side until I've succeeded in making you happy."

2253
02:49:49,000 --> 02:49:50,000
Hiroki: "Haa..."

2254
02:49:50,000 --> 02:49:55,000
*I lie back on my unfamiliar bed and stare up at the unfamiliar ceiling.*

2255
02:49:55,000 --> 02:50:03,000
*Our intimacy concluded, Yue left. She told me she had business to attend to, but she promised she would return later.*

2256
02:50:03,000 --> 02:50:11,000
Yue: "I'm the one who brought you here, Hiroki, so I won't let you be lonely. I'll take very, very good care of you."

2257
02:50:11,000 --> 02:50:21,000
Yue: "You should know by now, after everything we've done together, that I really am the most compatible woman for you. Nobody else can come close..."

2258
02:50:21,000 --> 02:50:25,000
Yue: "So don't yearn after anybody but me during my absence."

2259
02:50:25,000 --> 02:50:32,000
*That was what Yue said, before giving me a kiss and departing in a sweep of long, blue-black hair.*

2260
02:50:32,000 --> 02:50:37,000
*Her sentiments were... sweet, I suppose, but also a little unnerving.*

2261
02:50:37,000 --> 02:50:46,000
*I'm glad Yue likes me so much. I can't think of many men who wouldn't be pleased to bask in the attention of a woman like her.*

2262
02:50:46,000 --> 02:50:50,000
*She's certainly beautiful - but she's awfully controlling.*

2263
02:50:50,000 --> 02:50:53,000
*Maybe that comes with being a ruler?*

2264
02:50:53,000 --> 02:50:59,000
*I suppose she has to be stern, to keep order in the succubi realm, but surely there are limits?*

2265
02:50:59,000 --> 02:51:04,000
*My mind flickers back to Marina, lying in a crumpled heap at Yue's feet.*

2266
02:51:04,000 --> 02:51:05,000
*I wince.*

2267
02:51:05,000 --> 02:51:16,000
*Yue really did go too far. She treated Marina awfully. I'm glad I was able to step in before Marina got seriously hurt, but what would have happened if I wasn't there?*

2268
02:51:16,000 --> 02:51:18,000
*I hardly dare to imagine.*

2269
02:51:18,000 --> 02:51:20,000
Hiroki: "What am I going to do...?"

2270
02:51:20,000 --> 02:51:24,000
*I mutter aloud, but nobody replies. I didn't expect them to.*

2271
02:51:24,000 --> 02:51:26,000
*I know I'm on my own.*

2272
02:51:26,000 --> 02:51:36,000
*Though this bedroom is large, it's oppressive. The furnishings are all so dark, and the furniture - large though it is - seems far too spaced out.*

2273
02:51:36,000 --> 02:51:40,000
*There isn't enough stuff to fill up this vast, cavernous room.*

2274
02:51:40,000 --> 02:51:47,000
*It feels a bit like I'm in a cave, and the perpetual night beyond the open windows does little to cheer me.*

2275
02:51:47,000 --> 02:51:52,000
*I have no idea how long I've been lying here, nor what time it is.*

2276
02:51:52,000 --> 02:52:01,000
*It doesn't look like the sun ever rises in the succubus realm. It was pitch black when I first awoke here, and it's still black now.*

2277
02:52:01,000 --> 02:52:05,000
*It kind of matches my current mood, if I'm being quite honest.*

2278
02:52:05,000 --> 02:52:12,000
*I'm trapped here, in a strange environment, and I'm afraid there's no way for me to get back home.*

2279
02:52:12,000 --> 02:52:21,000
*What will I do about my job? What will my parents say when they find out I've gone missing? Then, I need to worry about the rent, too...*

2280
02:52:21,000 --> 02:52:26,000
*Well. I know time passes differently here than it does in the human world.*

2281
02:52:26,000 --> 02:52:32,000
*It's only been ten years since last I saw Yue, but she told me it felt more like a century.*

2282
02:52:32,000 --> 02:52:47,000
*I don't know how to work out the exact math without a calculator (I've never been the best at mental arithmetic), but if I've been here for... let's say six hours, only a fraction of that will have passed in the human world.*

2283
02:52:47,000 --> 02:52:54,000
*I feel like I've been here for a long time, but in actuality, it must've been about ten minutes or so.*

2284
02:52:54,000 --> 02:52:58,000
*That's not enough time for anybody to notice I've gone missing.*

2285
02:52:58,000 --> 02:53:00,000
*That gives me a bit of leeway.*

2286
02:53:00,000 --> 02:53:06,000
*It shouldn't matter too much if I stay here for a few days, or even a few weeks...*

2287
02:53:06,000 --> 02:53:10,000
*But I don't want to stay here for the rest of my life.*

2288
02:53:10,000 --> 02:53:12,000
*At least, I don't think I do...*

2289
02:53:12,000 --> 02:53:13,000
*Do I?*

2290
02:53:13,000 --> 02:53:16,000
*If I can stay with Yue, it might not be so bad.":

2291
02:53:16,000 --> 02:53:21,000
*I'm in a pretty difficult situation, but it's not the end of the world.*

2292
02:53:21,000 --> 02:53:24,000
*I am happy I was able to meet Yukie again...*

2293
02:53:24,000 --> 02:53:30,000
*And I'm happy she seems to love me just as much - if not more - as she always did.*

2294
02:53:30,000 --> 02:53:36,000
*The succubus realm is a strange, unnerving place, but being with Yue brightens it considerably.*

2295
02:53:36,000 --> 02:53:42,000
*It would be a lie if I said I wasn't anxious, but I might be able to get used to this.*

2296
02:53:42,000 --> 02:53:44,000
*It could definitely be worse.*

2297
02:53:44,000 --> 02:53:48,000
Hiroki: "Maybe I should just look at this as a break from work?"

2298
02:53:48,000 --> 02:53:51,000
Hiroki: "I was starting to get pretty burnt out."

2299
02:53:51,000 --> 02:53:52,000
Hiroki: "Still..."

2300
02:53:52,000 --> 02:53:55,000
*I look up at the ceiling, my brow furrowed.*

2301
02:53:55,000 --> 02:53:59,000
Hiroki: "I should probably find some way to pass the time."

2302
02:53:59,000 --> 02:54:02,000
Hiroki: "Maybe I should go for a walk...?"

2303
02:54:02,000 --> 02:54:04,000
*No, I absolutely can't stay here.":

2304
02:54:04,000 --> 02:54:07,000
*No, I can't stay here. I know I can't stay here.*

2305
02:54:07,000 --> 02:54:10,000
*I don't even want to entertain the notion.*

2306
02:54:10,000 --> 02:54:15,000
*I don't hate Yue, but the fact remains that she's holding me a prisoner.*

2307
02:54:15,000 --> 02:54:23,000
*I've got to be careful. If I don't harden my heart against her, I might come down with a cast of Stockholm Syndrome.*

2308
02:54:23,000 --> 02:54:25,000
*Then, I'll never be able to escape.*

2309
02:54:25,000 --> 02:54:26,000
*Speaking of which...*

2310
02:54:26,000 --> 02:54:30,000
Hiroki: "Nothing will get done if I keep lying here."

2311
02:54:30,000 --> 02:54:33,000
Hiroki: "I need to take matters into my own hands."

2312
02:54:33,000 --> 02:54:37,000
Hiroki: "Yue didn't forbid me from looking around, so..."

2313
02:54:37,000 --> 02:54:40,000
Hiroki: "Why don't I explore this palace?"

2314
02:54:40,000 --> 02:54:48,000
*If I keep my eyes peeled, I'm sure I'll be able to find some clues that'll help guide me back home. I have to. If I don't...*

2315
02:54:48,000 --> 02:54:51,000
*But I don't want to think about that."

2316
02:54:51,000 --> 02:54:55,000
*That's too grim a possibility to even begin to contemplate.*

2317
02:54:55,000 --> 02:55:00,000
*I meander aimlessly up and down the expansive hallways of Yue's palace.*

2318
02:55:00,000 --> 02:55:07,000
*I pass numerous wooden doors along the way, but when I try their handles I discover most of them are locked.*

2319
02:55:07,000 --> 02:55:13,000
*I really do have to wonder what's behind all these doors. Maybe it's meant to be a secret.*

2320
02:55:13,000 --> 02:55:20,000
*If Yue knew what I was doing, would she scold me? I don't want her to treat me as she did Marina...*

2321
02:55:20,000 --> 02:55:23,000
*Though I doubt she'd ever be that cruel to me.*

2322
02:55:23,000 --> 02:55:25,000
*She seems to love me too much.*

2323
02:55:25,000 --> 02:55:31,000
*It's precisely because of that obsessive "love" of hers that I found myself in this situation!*

2324
02:55:31,000 --> 02:55:34,000
Hiroki: "Geez... This place is huge..."

2325
02:55:34,000 --> 02:55:40,000
*I feel like I've been walking for hours, but I've yet to find the entrance of this palace.*

2326
02:55:40,000 --> 02:55:46,000
*The hallways seem to repeat themselves, over and over again, like a tessellating pattern.*

2327
02:55:46,000 --> 02:55:50,000
*In fact, I think I might be right back where I started.*

2328
02:55:50,000 --> 02:55:54,000
Hiroki: "Maybe Yue cast some kind of spell on this place..."

2329
02:55:54,000 --> 02:55:58,000
Hiroki: "She's canny. She must've known I'd try to escape."

2330
02:55:58,000 --> 02:56:00,000
Hiroki: "This is impossible."

2331
02:56:00,000 --> 02:56:01,000
*I sigh.*

2332
02:56:01,000 --> 02:56:10,000
*I pass a few succubi during my stroll. They have horns and wings, and they're wearing skimpy costumes which could pass as maid outfits.*

2333
02:56:10,000 --> 02:56:12,000
*I wonder if they're Yue's servants?*

2334
02:56:12,000 --> 02:56:21,000
*They shoot me curious looks, giggling among themselves like I'm some sort of specimen - a frog in a jar - but they don't try to approach me.*

2335
02:56:21,000 --> 02:56:29,000
*When I greet one of them, she turns about on her heels and marches off down the hall in the opposite direction.*

2336
02:56:29,000 --> 02:56:35,000
*I guess Yue must've given her maids strict orders not to interact with me, on pain of death.*

2337
02:56:35,000 --> 02:56:37,000
*She's awfully controlling.*

2338
02:56:37,000 --> 02:56:44,000
*It'd be nice if I could talk to somebody, but none of the succubi here dare to look me in the eye.*

2339
02:56:44,000 --> 02:56:45,000
*I feel trapped.*

2340
02:56:45,000 --> 02:56:49,000
*Desperate, now, I cross the hallway and stare out the window.*

2341
02:56:49,000 --> 02:56:52,000
*The sky, as expected, is still inky black.*

2342
02:56:52,000 --> 02:56:56,000
Hiroki: "The succubus realm's kind of depressing, huh?"

2343
02:56:56,000 --> 02:57:01,000
Hiroki: "It's no wonder so many of them prefer staying in the human world."

2344
02:57:01,000 --> 02:57:06,000
Hiroki: "This place feels so sterile. It's kind of like a hospital..."

2345
02:57:06,000 --> 02:57:12,000
*Though, I don't think many hospitals sport plush, wine red carpets or gilded chandeliers.*

2346
02:57:12,000 --> 02:57:14,000
*I'll amend my previous statement.*

2347
02:57:14,000 --> 02:57:17,000
Hiroki: "A very eccentric, gothic sort of hospital."

2348
02:57:17,000 --> 02:57:21,000
*I lean my elbows upon the windowsill and glance down.*

2349
02:57:21,000 --> 02:57:26,000
*There's some sort of courtyard below, with a stone fountain and a few trees.*

2350
02:57:26,000 --> 02:57:34,000
*There are bushes of red roses, all carefully cultivated, and what I think might be foxgloves, too - or hyacinths...?*

2351
02:57:34,000 --> 02:57:40,000
*A few benches are set up about the fountain, perhaps for open-air meals; picnics and the like.*

2352
02:57:40,000 --> 02:57:46,000
*It's quite scenic, actually. It looks like the sort of spot a couple might go to relax.*

2353
02:57:46,000 --> 02:57:53,000
*The scenery isn't the most important thing about this courtyard, however. It's the people that populate it.*

2354
02:57:53,000 --> 02:57:54,000
*I recognize them...!*

2355
02:57:54,000 --> 02:58:05,000
*That girl with the short, choppy hair, tied back into a stubby pigtail, could only be Cosmos, and I'd recognize Ayu's distinctive orange pigtails from a mile off!*

2356
02:58:05,000 --> 02:58:09,000
*They're all there! Cosmos, Ayu, Hifumi, and Marina!*

2357
02:58:09,000 --> 02:58:18,000
*...Well. I say "they're all there", but Hazel is conspicuously absent. I have no idea where she is, but maybe that's a good thing.*

2358
02:58:18,000 --> 02:58:24,000
*Perhaps Yue spared her her wrath, and she was allowed to remain in the human realm.*

2359
02:58:24,000 --> 02:58:35,000
*I don't know the precise details. Right now, I feel like I don't know very much at all - but I think talking to these four succubi might help clear matters up.*

2360
02:58:35,000 --> 02:58:40,000
*If anybody knows a way to escape from this place, I'm sure they will.*

2361
02:58:40,000 --> 02:58:42,000
*Luck might be on my side after all.*

2362
02:58:42,000 --> 02:58:53,000
*It takes a little while for me to figure out how to get into the courtyard. This palace is new to me, and the layout is strange and confusing: almost maze-like.*

2363
02:58:53,000 --> 02:59:02,000
*I get lost on several occasions. I run into dead-ends frequently, and no matter how I search I can't find a door that leads outside.*

2364
02:59:02,000 --> 02:59:07,000
*I try to ask a few of Yue's maids for advice, but they're not very helpful.*

2365
02:59:07,000 --> 02:59:14,000
*Afraid, I think, of potential retribution, should they show me any kindness, they all turn tail and flee.*

2366
02:59:14,000 --> 02:59:18,000
*It'd be nice if I had at least one ally in this place...*

2367
02:59:18,000 --> 02:59:20,000
*But maybe that's selfish.*

2368
02:59:20,000 --> 02:59:26,000
*I'm sure Ayu, Cosmos, Hifumi, Hazel, and Marina will help me. I just need to find them first.*

2369
02:59:26,000 --> 02:59:36,000
*I grow more and more frustrated with each passing minute, but I don't give up. I continue my search stubbornly, obstinately, until finally...*

2370
02:59:36,000 --> 02:59:38,000
Hiroki: "Thank goodness...!"

2371
02:59:38,000 --> 02:59:40,000
*...I reach my destination.*

2372
02:59:40,000 --> 02:59:42,000
*I'm standing outside, at long last!*

2373
02:59:42,000 --> 02:59:43,000
*I'm free! ...Not.*

2374
02:59:43,000 --> 02:59:53,000
*This courtyard is fringed on all sides by wings of Yue's mansion. I might be even more trapped in this isolated square of space than I was inside.*

2375
02:59:53,000 --> 02:59:56,000
*It does make for a nice change of pace, though.*

2376
02:59:56,000 --> 03:00:03,000
*The heavy black sky which looms above my head is unsettling, but I try not to pay it too much mind.*

2377
03:00:03,000 --> 03:00:12,000
*I'm more focused on the neatly-planted flowerbeds, and the sound of crystalline water splashing against the basin of the stone fountain.*

2378
03:00:12,000 --> 03:00:19,000
*Though I'm outside, I can't feel any breeze at all. My hair and my clothes remain undisturbed and untouched.*

2379
03:00:19,000 --> 03:00:22,000
*Perhaps there is no breeze in the succubus realm.*

2380
03:00:22,000 --> 03:00:24,000
*That'll take some getting used to.*

2381
03:00:24,000 --> 03:00:28,000
*Cosmos, Ayu, Hifumi, and Marina are sitting by the fountain.*

2382
03:00:28,000 --> 03:00:40,000
*They're all wearing their succubus attire, which might be expected, given the circumstances. Pointed horns protrude from their heads, and their wings furl against their thighs.*

2383
03:00:40,000 --> 03:00:49,000
*It's a little unusual seeing all four of them dressed like this. They generally assume their human forms when they're around me.*

2384
03:00:49,000 --> 03:00:55,000
*I've seen all four of them attired like this before, but never all four of them at once.*

2385
03:00:55,000 --> 03:01:00,000
*Though we're standing outside, those wings take up quite a bit of space.*

2386
03:01:00,000 --> 03:01:08,000
*I wonder if they can actually fly with those wings. They don't seem quite big enough for it. Maybe they're just for show...?*

2387
03:01:08,000 --> 03:01:12,000
*But there are more important things to think about now.*

2388
03:01:12,000 --> 03:01:18,000
*Marina seems to have recovered after the humiliation she suffered earlier in the day.*

2389
03:01:18,000 --> 03:01:27,000
*Her hair is neat and pristine once more, her succubus attire in place. She looks the same as always, save for the expression on her face.*

2390
03:01:27,000 --> 03:01:29,000
*It's positively thunderous.*

2391
03:01:29,000 --> 03:01:31,000
Marina: "I can't believe it..."

2392
03:01:31,000 --> 03:01:35,000
*Marina's fingers clench. Her tail flicks discontentedly.*

2393
03:01:35,000 --> 03:01:43,000
Marina: "How could Yue treat me like that when I am older than she is? Has she not heard of respecting one's elders?"

2394
03:01:43,000 --> 03:01:48,000
Ayu: "So, you're admitting you're old, are you? That's a first! Ohohoho!"

2395
03:01:48,000 --> 03:01:50,000
Hifumi: "Ayu, please..."

2396
03:01:50,000 --> 03:01:52,000
*Hifumi shoots Ayu a warning look.*

2397
03:01:52,000 --> 03:01:57,000
Hifumi: "You're not helping the situation. Can you not see that Marina is upset?"

2398
03:01:57,000 --> 03:02:01,000
Ayu: "Of course I can! I do have functioning eyes, you know?"

2399
03:02:01,000 --> 03:02:02,000
*Ayu pouts.*

2400
03:02:02,000 --> 03:02:08,000
Ayu: "Don't presume to treat me like a stupid child because I'm a bit younger than you!"

2401
03:02:08,000 --> 03:02:15,000
Marina: "Perhaps you wouldn't get treated like a stupid child if you didn't insist on acting like one."

2402
03:02:15,000 --> 03:02:16,000
Ayu: "Wh-Why, you...!"

2403
03:02:16,000 --> 03:02:20,000
*Ayu takes a step back. She grits her teeth together.*

2404
03:02:20,000 --> 03:02:27,000
Ayu: "Don't try and take that high and mighty tone with me! You're in no position to act like you're in charge!"

2405
03:02:27,000 --> 03:02:32,000
Ayu: "Don't you know it's that arrogance of yours that upsets Lady Yue?"

2406
03:02:32,000 --> 03:02:39,000
Ayu: "She can see, as I do, that you think you're better than all of us because you're older than we are!"

2407
03:02:39,000 --> 03:02:48,000
Ayu: "You might be our superior in terms of sheer years, but you're not the ruler of this realm, no matter how highly you hold yourself!"

2408
03:02:48,000 --> 03:02:55,000
Ayu: "Yue is our superior here, and you ought to abide by her rules if you don't want to be punished yet again!"

2409
03:02:55,000 --> 03:02:59,000
Marina: "Do you think I don't know that? Yue made that very plain!"

2410
03:02:59,000 --> 03:03:02,000
Marina: "I'm still covered in bruises..."

2411
03:03:02,000 --> 03:03:08,000
Ayu: "If you ask me, you deserve it. You need to be taken down a peg every once in a while."

2412
03:03:08,000 --> 03:03:12,000
Ayu: "Know your place, Marina! You're really not all that special!"

2413
03:03:12,000 --> 03:03:14,000
Marina: "Wh-Why, you...!"

2414
03:03:14,000 --> 03:03:19,000
Hifumi: "Come on, everybody, let us not argue. We're all friends here, aren't we?"

2415
03:03:19,000 --> 03:03:25,000
Ayu: "No way! I wouldn't be friends with a saggy old woman like Marina even if you paid me!"

2416
03:03:25,000 --> 03:03:29,000
Marina: "The feeling is quite mutual, you conniving turncoat!"

2417
03:03:29,000 --> 03:03:38,000
Marina: "I can't believe you would support Yue's decision in this sorry affair, when I have done so very much for you over the years!"

2418
03:03:38,000 --> 03:03:45,000
Marina: "It is because of my connections you were able to break into the idol industry, don't forget!"

2419
03:03:45,000 --> 03:03:47,000
Marina: "Show a bit more gratitude!"

2420
03:03:47,000 --> 03:03:54,000
Ayu: "But of course, my dear older sister! I am very, very grateful for your continued instruction!"

2421
03:03:54,000 --> 03:04:05,000
Ayu: "It is so nice and thoughtful of you to take time from your busy schedule to mock me, belittle me, insult me, and spank me over the smallest of mishaps!"

2422
03:04:05,000 --> 03:04:08,000
Ayu: "Truly, you are a paragon of virtue..."

2423
03:04:08,000 --> 03:04:09,000
Ayu: "Not!"

2424
03:04:09,000 --> 03:04:16,000
*Ayu pulls a face. I think she might spit on the ground, were that not a distinctly un-idol-ish thing to do.*

2425
03:04:16,000 --> 03:04:24,000
*We might be in the succubus realm now, but Ayu still takes her role as an idol very seriously. She's a true workaholic!*

2426
03:04:24,000 --> 03:04:32,000
Ayu: "You might've done more for me than Yue has, Marina, but you're an interfering busybody with a god complex to boot!"

2427
03:04:32,000 --> 03:04:41,000
Ayu: "You're only upset right now because you can't stand to admit that, despite all your posturing, you're not the one in charge!"

2428
03:04:41,000 --> 03:04:47,000
Ayu: "Lady Yue is our ruler, and we must all obey her commands. That's simply how it is."

2429
03:04:47,000 --> 03:04:51,000
Ayu: "The sooner you get that through your head, the better!"

2430
03:04:51,000 --> 03:04:57,000
Hifumi: "I hate to kick you while you are down, Marina, but... Ayu is right on that score."

2431
03:04:57,000 --> 03:05:03,000
Hifumi: "If you didn't cheek Lady Yue so much, she would not have been so hard on you."

2432
03:05:03,000 --> 03:05:10,000
Ayu: "That's right. She scolded me about my relationship with Hiroki too, but she didn't slap me or step on me."

2433
03:05:10,000 --> 03:05:14,000
Ayu: "I just looked at her, all big wide eyes, and said..."

2434
03:05:14,000 --> 03:05:29,000
Ayu: ""I'm terribly sorry for upsetting you, Lady Yue! I did not understand my relations with that boy had caused you such pain! If I had been aware of your relationship, certainly I would not have spent so much time with him!""

2435
03:05:29,000 --> 03:05:33,000
Ayu: ""Please, may you find it in your heart to forgive me?!""

2436
03:05:33,000 --> 03:05:37,000
*Ayu clasps her hands to her front and bats her eyelashes.*

2437
03:05:37,000 --> 03:05:45,000
*She looks very winsome and endearing, but I know Ayu well enough that I can see right through this charade: as can Marina.*

2438
03:05:45,000 --> 03:05:47,000
*The older succubus rolls her eyes.*

2439
03:05:47,000 --> 03:05:51,000
Marina: "Oh, please. I know that's not what you really think."

2440
03:05:51,000 --> 03:05:59,000
Ayu: "Of course it isn't what I really think, but sometimes we have to tell teeny-tiny white lies to protect ourselves!"

2441
03:05:59,000 --> 03:06:07,000
Ayu: "If you knew how to bow and scrape and put on a front, Lady Yue would be much more inclined to forgive you!"

2442
03:06:07,000 --> 03:06:11,000
Marina: "So, you want me to act like a suck-up and a sycophant?"

2443
03:06:11,000 --> 03:06:13,000
*Marina rolls her eyes.*

2444
03:06:13,000 --> 03:06:19,000
Marina: "No, thank you. I would rather die than act as sweetly submissive as you do."

2445
03:06:19,000 --> 03:06:27,000
Marina: "I am a woman of principles. I think it is important to stick to them, no matter how hard the situation."

2446
03:06:27,000 --> 03:06:36,000
Marina: "I won't renounce my love for Hiroki, no matter what Yue does to me - and I certainly won't apologize for it like you did, Ayu."

2447
03:06:36,000 --> 03:06:37,000
Marina: "I refuse!"

2448
03:06:37,000 --> 03:06:45,000
Ayu: "That is very brave of you, my dear older sister... but if you keep acting this stubborn, Lady Yue will punish you."

2449
03:06:45,000 --> 03:06:52,000
Ayu: "We don't know how long she'll make us stay here. Surely it's better to try and keep on her good side?"

2450
03:06:52,000 --> 03:06:53,000
Ayu: "If you don't..."

2451
03:06:53,000 --> 03:06:58,000
*Ayu draws her index finger across her throat in a swift, menacing motion.*

2452
03:06:58,000 --> 03:07:01,000
Ayu: "...your life won't be worth living."

2453
03:07:01,000 --> 03:07:02,000
Marina: "Nngh..."

2454
03:07:02,000 --> 03:07:03,000
*Marina flinches.*

2455
03:07:03,000 --> 03:07:10,000
*She must understand the truth behind Ayu's words, even if she doesn't want to, because she bows her head.*

2456
03:07:10,000 --> 03:07:20,000
Marina: "I don't want Yue to punish me like that ever again. It was painful, though I tried to tell myself otherwise... and it was humiliating, too."

2457
03:07:20,000 --> 03:07:24,000
Marina: "I can't bear to be treated in such a manner again..."

2458
03:07:24,000 --> 03:07:28,000
Marina: "But I don't want to stop loving Hiroki, either."

2459
03:07:28,000 --> 03:07:35,000
Marina: "I can't stop feeling the way I do because Yue has commanded me to. Hearts don't work that way!"

2460
03:07:35,000 --> 03:07:41,000
Hifumi: "I know, Marina. I understand, too. This is a difficult situation for all of us."

2461
03:07:41,000 --> 03:07:47,000
Hifumi: "I am very fond of Hiroki myself. He is quite unlike the other human men I have known."

2462
03:07:47,000 --> 03:07:50,000
Hifumi: "He is dear, sweet, and kind..."

2463
03:07:50,000 --> 03:07:59,000
Hifumi: "But Lady Yue has her sights set upon him. We cannot disobey her wishes. If we do, she will rain retribution down upon our heads."

2464
03:07:59,000 --> 03:08:05,000
Hifumi: "It is better to be circumspect, as Ayu said. We need to learn how to hide our feelings."

2465
03:08:05,000 --> 03:08:10,000
Hifumi: "That is the only way we'll ever earn Lady Yue's forgiveness."

2466
03:08:10,000 --> 03:08:14,000
Marina: "But I don't want her forgiveness. I don't need it!"

2467
03:08:14,000 --> 03:08:18,000
Marina: "I would far, far rather stay with Hiroki. I love him!"

2468
03:08:18,000 --> 03:08:20,000
Marina: "Don't you feel the same?"

2469
03:08:20,000 --> 03:08:21,000
Ayu: "W-Well..."

2470
03:08:21,000 --> 03:08:25,000
*Ayu glances away, blushing, and toys with her hair.*

2471
03:08:25,000 --> 03:08:36,000
Ayu: "I-It'd be a lie if I said I didn't like that boy, foolish though he is. He can be quite an amusing companion at times, and toying with him is a good deal of fun."

2472
03:08:36,000 --> 03:08:44,000
Ayu: "I don't really care one way or the other, but if I had to choose between a life with Hiroki and one without him..."

2473
03:08:44,000 --> 03:08:47,000
Ayu: "I think I would rather be with him."

2474
03:08:47,000 --> 03:08:57,000
Hifumi: "As would I. I have been so busy with work these last few weeks, I've nary had a chance to speak to him. As a result, I've felt rather lonely."

2475
03:08:57,000 --> 03:09:02,000
Hifumi: "Oh, what wouldn't I give to see his cute, sleeping face again!"

2476
03:09:02,000 --> 03:09:08,000
Hifumi: "For me, there is no honor greater than letting him use my thighs as a pillow!"

2477
03:09:08,000 --> 03:09:15,000
Ayu: "Hmph. You baby him too much, Hifumin. He's a grown man, and he needs to be treated as such."

2478
03:09:15,000 --> 03:09:20,000
Ayu: "Fortunately, I'm no softie! If he were here, I'd whip him into shape!"

2479
03:09:20,000 --> 03:09:26,000
Marina: "But he isn't here. He's in the succubus realm, but we're not allowed to speak with him."

2480
03:09:26,000 --> 03:09:29,000
Hifumi: "That is quite the quandary, yes..."

2481
03:09:29,000 --> 03:09:30,000
Ayu: "Poor Hiroki..."

2482
03:09:30,000 --> 03:09:33,000
*Ayu scuffs the ground with the tip of her shoe.*

2483
03:09:33,000 --> 03:09:44,000
Ayu: "I don't envy him, being the object of Yue's affections. She's so single-minded. When she wants something, she does anything within her power to take it."

2484
03:09:44,000 --> 03:09:47,000
Ayu: "I wonder if he'll be alright..."

2485
03:09:47,000 --> 03:09:56,000
*The three succubus sisters share a sad, melancholic sigh among themselves. They look so maudlin, my heart aches in sympathy for them.*

2486
03:09:56,000 --> 03:09:59,000
*I can't stand in the shadows a second longer.*

2487
03:09:59,000 --> 03:10:03,000
*I've missed them too, and I want to talk to them...!*

2488
03:10:03,000 --> 03:10:05,000
Hiroki: "Hey, um... You guys...?"

2489
03:10:05,000 --> 03:10:06,000
Cosmos: "Hiroki...!"

2490
03:10:06,000 --> 03:10:12,000
*Cosmos, who was very quiet during the previous conversation, is the first to notice me.*

2491
03:10:12,000 --> 03:10:20,000
*She extricates herself from the other three succubi and dashes towards me, her stubby ponytail bobbing with every step.*

2492
03:10:20,000 --> 03:10:23,000
Cosmos: "Hiroki, is that really you?!"

2493
03:10:23,000 --> 03:10:28,000
Hiroki: "It's me, in the flesh. I promise, I'm not a hallucination or a mirage."

2494
03:10:28,000 --> 03:10:31,000
Cosmos: "Oh, thank goodness! I was so worried!"

2495
03:10:31,000 --> 03:10:39,000
Cosmos: "I was afraid Yue would lock you up in her room and throw away the key! That's the sort of thing she might do..."

2496
03:10:39,000 --> 03:10:40,000
Cosmos: "She's scary!"

2497
03:10:40,000 --> 03:10:42,000
*I don't think she's that bad...":

2498
03:10:42,000 --> 03:10:47,000
Hiroki: "She's a bit... forceful, yes, but I don't think she's that bad."

2499
03:10:47,000 --> 03:10:50,000
Hiroki: "Deep down, I'm sure she means well."

2500
03:10:50,000 --> 03:10:52,000
*She is kind of scary, yeah.":

2501
03:10:52,000 --> 03:10:53,000
Hiroki: "I concur..."

2502
03:10:53,000 --> 03:10:58,000
Hiroki: "Anyway, it's nice to see you too, Cosmos. All of you. I missed you..."

2503
03:10:58,000 --> 03:11:05,000
*I ruffle the top of Cosmos's head, then look about the other three succubi standing by the fountain.*

2504
03:11:05,000 --> 03:11:10,000
Hiroki: "And, based on what I overheard, it sounds like you missed me, too."

2505
03:11:10,000 --> 03:11:11,000
Ayu: "H-Huh?!"

2506
03:11:11,000 --> 03:11:19,000
*Ayu's eyes widen to comic proportions. She takes a step back, holding one hand up to her face, and cries out...*

2507
03:11:19,000 --> 03:11:25,000
Ayu: "Wh-What are you talking about? I-It's not like I miss you or anything, y-you idiot!"

2508
03:11:25,000 --> 03:11:31,000
Ayu: "I really don't care about you all that much! You're nothing but a cameraman to me!"

2509
03:11:31,000 --> 03:11:37,000
Ayu: "Since you don't have your camera with you right now, you're totally worthless!"

2510
03:11:37,000 --> 03:11:39,000
Hiroki: "Really, now? Is that so?"

2511
03:11:39,000 --> 03:11:40,000
*I smile.*

2512
03:11:40,000 --> 03:11:47,000
Hiroki: "How funny. You were singing a different tune just five seconds ago - but maybe I misunderstood."

2513
03:11:47,000 --> 03:11:54,000
Hiroki: "Is there another way to construe "I want to be with him" that I'm too stupid to fully understand?"

2514
03:11:54,000 --> 03:11:55,000
Ayu: "Wh-Why, you...!"

2515
03:11:55,000 --> 03:11:59,000
*Ayu plants her hands on her hips, her tail twitching indignantly.*

2516
03:11:59,000 --> 03:12:01,000
*She looks utterly pissed...*

2517
03:12:01,000 --> 03:12:06,000
*But her outrage is softened somewhat by the heavy blush that adorns her cheeks.*

2518
03:12:06,000 --> 03:12:10,000
*Her face is almost as red as her skintight succubus outfit.*

2519
03:12:10,000 --> 03:12:21,000
Ayu: "Y-Y-You shouldn't have been listening to our conversation in the first place, st-stupid! Eavesdropping is a crime! I should have you executed for that!"

2520
03:12:21,000 --> 03:12:24,000
Ayu: "Off with your head! Off with your head!"

2521
03:12:24,000 --> 03:12:28,000
Hiroki: "A beheading, huh? That's a pretty rough sentence."

2522
03:12:28,000 --> 03:12:34,000
Hiroki: "I guess I'm lucky Yue is the one who rules over the succubus realm, not you."

2523
03:12:34,000 --> 03:12:43,000
Hiroki: "If you want to kill me, Ayu, you'll have to appeal to Yue first - but I have a sneaking suspicion she'll overrule you."

2524
03:12:43,000 --> 03:12:46,000
Hiroki: "She seems pretty fond of me."

2525
03:12:46,000 --> 03:12:52,000
Cosmos: "She is very fond of you. She loves you. I thought you were my boyfriend, but..."

2526
03:12:52,000 --> 03:12:57,000
*Cosmos grips my arm with her own and peers up at me, her eyes large and misty.*

2527
03:12:57,000 --> 03:13:02,000
Cosmos: "...she said you were her boyfriend first, a long time ago. Is that true?"

2528
03:13:02,000 --> 03:13:03,000
Hiroki: "Cosmos..."

2529
03:13:03,000 --> 03:13:05,000
*My expression softens.*

2530
03:13:05,000 --> 03:13:16,000
*Teasing Ayu is all well and good (I'd recommend it, in fact. Studies have shown it's very beneficial for one's mental health!), but I'm not sure how to deal with Cosmos.*

2531
03:13:16,000 --> 03:13:18,000
*She looks utterly heartbroken.*

2532
03:13:18,000 --> 03:13:26,000
*I know it's foolish, as I met Yue a decade before Cosmos, but I can't shake the niggling feeling that I've cheated on her.*

2533
03:13:26,000 --> 03:13:31,000
*At the very least, news of my relationship with Yue has hurt her feelings.*

2534
03:13:31,000 --> 03:13:43,000
Hiroki: "I'm sorry, but it is true. Yue was my very first girlfriend, when I was back in high school. I didn't know she was called Yue then, though - or that she was a succubus."

2535
03:13:43,000 --> 03:13:48,000
Hiroki: "I thought she was a normal human girl. She called herself Yukie."

2536
03:13:48,000 --> 03:13:50,000
Cosmos: "So it is true..."

2537
03:13:50,000 --> 03:13:51,000
*Cosmos sighs.*

2538
03:13:51,000 --> 03:13:53,000
Cosmos: "Did you love her a lot?"

2539
03:13:53,000 --> 03:13:55,000
Hiroki: "At the time, I did..."

2540
03:13:55,000 --> 03:13:58,000
Hiroki: "I'm a bit conflicted about it now, though."

2541
03:13:58,000 --> 03:14:03,000
Hiroki: "It's been a while since I last saw her. Things are different."

2542
03:14:03,000 --> 03:14:07,000
Cosmos: "So, you don't want to be her boyfriend again?"

2543
03:14:07,000 --> 03:14:09,000
*I wouldn't be opposed to the idea.":

2544
03:14:09,000 --> 03:14:14,000
Hiroki: "If she wants me to be her boyfriend again, I wouldn't be opposed to it."

2545
03:14:14,000 --> 03:14:20,000
Hiroki: "A lot of time has passed, and Yue's a bit different to how I remember her..."

2546
03:14:20,000 --> 03:14:23,000
Hiroki: "But she's still very pretty."

2547
03:14:23,000 --> 03:14:28,000
Hiroki: "I think she might be too good for a guy like me, actually."

2548
03:14:28,000 --> 03:14:31,000
Hiroki: "Maybe that's why I feel so conflicted..."

2549
03:14:31,000 --> 03:14:33,000
Cosmos: "Oh, right... I see..."

2550
03:14:33,000 --> 03:14:34,000
*Cosmos sighs.*

2551
03:14:34,000 --> 03:14:36,000
Cosmos: "I was afraid of that."

2552
03:14:36,000 --> 03:14:40,000
Cosmos: "I wanted you to be my boyfriend, and mine alone..."

2553
03:14:40,000 --> 03:14:43,000
Cosmos: "But I shouldn't be possessive."

2554
03:14:43,000 --> 03:14:46,000
Cosmos: "Then, I would be just as bad as Yue."

2555
03:14:46,000 --> 03:14:51,000
Cosmos: "I don't want to make you feel guilty. You can't help how you feel."

2556
03:14:51,000 --> 03:14:54,000
Cosmos: "That's something you taught me, Hiroki."

2557
03:14:54,000 --> 03:14:59,000
Cosmos: "If you like Lady Yue and she likes you, I should be happy for you."

2558
03:14:59,000 --> 03:15:02,000
Cosmos: "This news should make me smile, but..."

2559
03:15:02,000 --> 03:15:06,000
Cosmos: "I don't really get it, but my heart... it hurts..."

2560
03:15:06,000 --> 03:15:08,000
Cosmos: "Why are my eyes so wet?"

2561
03:15:08,000 --> 03:15:11,000
Ayu: "They're wet 'cause you sad, dummy."

2562
03:15:11,000 --> 03:15:13,000
Cosmos: "Sad? But why?"

2563
03:15:13,000 --> 03:15:19,000
Cosmos: "Hiroki isn't hurt. He doesn't seem upset. In fact, he seems happy to be here."

2564
03:15:19,000 --> 03:15:22,000
Cosmos: "Shouldn't I be happy for his sake?"

2565
03:15:22,000 --> 03:15:23,000
Ayu: "Oh, please."

2566
03:15:23,000 --> 03:15:24,000
*Ayu scoffs.*

2567
03:15:24,000 --> 03:15:32,000
Ayu: "Only a saint would be able to watch on, smiling, as their boyfriend's stolen away from underneath their nose!"

2568
03:15:32,000 --> 03:15:38,000
Ayu: "Luckily for you, you're not a saint but a succubus, and you're allowed to be upset."

2569
03:15:38,000 --> 03:15:40,000
Ayu: "You're allowed to be angry!"

2570
03:15:40,000 --> 03:15:46,000
Ayu: "As a matter of fact, I'm more than just angry about all this! I'm pissed off!"

2571
03:15:46,000 --> 03:15:48,000
Hiroki: "Why? What's wrong, Ayu?"

2572
03:15:48,000 --> 03:15:49,000
Ayu: ""What's wrong"?"

2573
03:15:49,000 --> 03:15:52,000
*Ayu parrots me, a look of disbelief on her face.*

2574
03:15:52,000 --> 03:15:56,000
Ayu: "Do you really have to ask me that? Shouldn't it be obvious?!"

2575
03:15:56,000 --> 03:16:06,000
Ayu: "The four of us have been sat out in here in the cold, freezing our butts off, worried about you, and you're acting like nothing's wrong!"

2576
03:16:06,000 --> 03:16:09,000
Ayu: "It's almost like you're enjoying this!!!"

2577
03:16:09,000 --> 03:16:13,000
Ayu: "How can you stand there, smiling, after Yue KIDNAPPED you?!"

2578
03:16:13,000 --> 03:16:16,000
Hiroki: "It is a lot to take in, it's true..."

2579
03:16:16,000 --> 03:16:21,000
Hiroki: "But it's not like she's a stranger. She was my first ever girlfriend."

2580
03:16:21,000 --> 03:16:23,000
Hiroki: "It's complicated."

2581
03:16:23,000 --> 03:16:27,000
Ayu: "Sure, she might be your first, but WE'RE your partners, too!"

2582
03:16:27,000 --> 03:16:31,000
Ayu: "Don't you care about us any? What about OUR feelings?!"

2583
03:16:31,000 --> 03:16:34,000
Ayu: "Don't tell me you've given up on us already?!"

2584
03:16:34,000 --> 03:16:36,000
Hiroki: "What? Of course I haven't!"

2585
03:16:36,000 --> 03:16:39,000
*I can't be her boyfriend. I'm your boyfriend.":

2586
03:16:39,000 --> 03:16:44,000
Hiroki: "I can't, no matter how much she asks. I'm your boyfriend now."

2587
03:16:44,000 --> 03:16:46,000
Cosmos: "O-Oh, Hiroki..."

2588
03:16:46,000 --> 03:16:52,000
*Cosmos's eyes swim with relieved tears. Sniffling, she nuzzles her cheek against my arm.*

2589
03:16:52,000 --> 03:17:00,000
Cosmos: "Thank you. Thank you for staying with me, and for loving me, even though I'm weird and I'm not very clever!"

2590
03:17:00,000 --> 03:17:08,000
Cosmos: "Most people would say Yue is much, much prettier than I am. If you liked her more than me, I would understand."

2591
03:17:08,000 --> 03:17:16,000
Cosmos: "It hurt a lot, but I was prepared to give you up. I thought it was for the best. I didn't think I had a chance."

2592
03:17:16,000 --> 03:17:20,000
Cosmos: "I was so sad when Yue told me that she loved you..."

2593
03:17:20,000 --> 03:17:23,000
Cosmos: "And I felt so, so lonely...!"

2594
03:17:23,000 --> 03:17:25,000
Hiroki: "Hey. It's alright."

2595
03:17:25,000 --> 03:17:31,000
*I rub the top of Cosmos's head as one might a small animal, my voice soft and gentle.*

2596
03:17:31,000 --> 03:17:38,000
Hiroki: "You don't need to cry, or feel lonely. You're my girlfriend, and nothing will change that."

2597
03:17:38,000 --> 03:17:43,000
Ayu: "And what about the rest of us, huh? How do you feel about us?"

2598
03:17:43,000 --> 03:17:46,000
Hiroki: "Why do you ask? Are you worried, Ayu?"

2599
03:17:46,000 --> 03:17:50,000
Ayu: "O-Of course I'm not worried! I-I just wanted to know!"

2600
03:17:50,000 --> 03:17:58,000
Ayu: "It's not fair that you're letting Cosmos monopolize all your attention! We have a right to know where we stand, too!"

2601
03:17:58,000 --> 03:18:06,000
Ayu: "Do you still like us? Yes or no! I-It's a simple question, s-so it should be easy even for a moron for you to answer!"

2602
03:18:06,000 --> 03:18:11,000
Hiroki: "It is easy. It's so easy, I don't even need to contemplate it."

2603
03:18:11,000 --> 03:18:17,000
*I smile, first at the huffy Ayu, then the gentle Hifumi and the slightly out-of-sorts Marina.*

2604
03:18:17,000 --> 03:18:26,000
Hiroki: "I'm still your cameraman, Ayu. I'm still Marina's darling and Hifumi's husband, too. That won't change, no matter what happens."

2605
03:18:26,000 --> 03:18:30,000
Hiroki: "I still like all of you, and I won't stop caring for you."

2606
03:18:30,000 --> 03:18:33,000
Hiroki: "I just hope you don't stop caring for me."

2607
03:18:33,000 --> 03:18:35,000
Marina: "Oh, Hiroki..."

2608
03:18:35,000 --> 03:18:43,000
*Marina's eyes are starting to look misty. She brushes aside a few tears with the back of her arm, then offers me a smile.*

2609
03:18:43,000 --> 03:18:45,000
Marina: "You really are a gentleman."

2610
03:18:45,000 --> 03:18:49,000
Hifumi: "Yes, indeed. You would make a wonderful husband."

2611
03:18:49,000 --> 03:18:54,000
Hifumi: "Now, I feel ashamed for telling Lady Yue I had no interest in you."

2612
03:18:54,000 --> 03:19:02,000
Hifumi: "I thought it the best way to calm her nerves... but perhaps I should have held strong, just like Marina did."

2613
03:19:02,000 --> 03:19:12,000
Hifumi: "She persisted in her love for you, and she was punished horribly. I knew that would happen, so I obfuscated my true emotions. I wasn't honest."

2614
03:19:12,000 --> 03:19:15,000
Hifumi: "It... is not my proudest moment."

2615
03:19:15,000 --> 03:19:20,000
*Hifumi presses her hands against her front and offers me a deep, reverent bow.*

2616
03:19:20,000 --> 03:19:25,000
Hifumi: "I only hope you can forgive me for this grave folly, my dear husband."

2617
03:19:25,000 --> 03:19:30,000
Hifumi: "If I have displeased you, you may scold me however you like."

2618
03:19:30,000 --> 03:19:38,000
Hiroki: "It's fine, Hifumi. You don't need to feel guilty. You only said what you felt you ought to protect yourself."

2619
03:19:38,000 --> 03:19:43,000
Hiroki: "I don't blame you, after speaking to Yue. She's very forceful."

2620
03:19:43,000 --> 03:19:49,000
Marina: "Yes, indeed. She's far too forceful. Jealous, too. It's a horrible combination."

2621
03:19:49,000 --> 03:19:50,000
*Marina scowls.*

2622
03:19:50,000 --> 03:19:57,000
Marina: "She summoned us to the succubus realm with no prior warning, then cross-examined us all individually."

2623
03:19:57,000 --> 03:20:05,000
Marina: "Now, she won't let us return to the human world until she's satisfied we've seen the error of her ways."

2624
03:20:05,000 --> 03:20:08,000
Marina: "She's treating us like prisoners!"

2625
03:20:08,000 --> 03:20:16,000
Cosmos: "Oh, I hope my fans will be alright without me. They get worried if I go too long without posting new photos..."

2626
03:20:16,000 --> 03:20:25,000
Ayu: "Ha! As if your weird contingent of socially maladjusted, always on Cheeper, only leaving the house to buy instant noodles fans matter!"

2627
03:20:25,000 --> 03:20:28,000
Ayu: "It's my fans who'll pose a real problem!"

2628
03:20:28,000 --> 03:20:35,000
Ayu: "I'm the famous idol Ikue Ayu! If I go missing, people will riot! It'll cause a huge scandal!"

2629
03:20:35,000 --> 03:20:43,000
Ayu: "This is so inconvenient for my career! I'm supposed be going on tour soon! How can I, when I'm trapped here?!"

2630
03:20:43,000 --> 03:20:46,000
*Ayu kicks at the stone fountain disconsolately.*

2631
03:20:46,000 --> 03:20:48,000
Ayu: "This is such a mess!"

2632
03:20:48,000 --> 03:20:56,000
Marina: "We're all in a difficult situation right now... though I believe none of us are in as much danger as Hiroki."

2633
03:20:56,000 --> 03:21:03,000
Marina: "I am sure Yue will tire of us eventually, and will let us leave. As for Hiroki, however..."

2634
03:21:03,000 --> 03:21:04,000
*I swallow.*

2635
03:21:04,000 --> 03:21:08,000
Hiroki: "Do you really think she'll keep me here forever?"

2636
03:21:08,000 --> 03:21:14,000
Marina: "It is a distinct possibility. It's exactly the sort of thing she would do."

2637
03:21:14,000 --> 03:21:16,000
*Crap. I was afraid of that.*

2638
03:21:16,000 --> 03:21:27,000
*Yue seemed very serious when she told me her plans earlier. She's given me no reason to doubt her, but I tried to cling onto a small sliver of hope regardless.*

2639
03:21:27,000 --> 03:21:30,000
*Now, that hope has been extinguished.*

2640
03:21:30,000 --> 03:21:34,000
Hiroki: "Is there anything that can be done about this?"

2641
03:21:34,000 --> 03:21:37,000
*I look between the four succubi helplessly.*

2642
03:21:37,000 --> 03:21:44,000
Hiroki: "Could one of you talk to her about this? You might be able to convince her to let me go."

2643
03:21:44,000 --> 03:21:45,000
Hifumi: "Well..."

2644
03:21:45,000 --> 03:21:50,000
*Hifumi folds her arms across her chest in thought, her eyes half-lidded.*

2645
03:21:50,000 --> 03:22:01,000
Hifumi: "Out of all of us, Lady Yue is the closest to myself. If I had not abdicated, she would not be on the throne right now. She owes her current status to me."

2646
03:22:01,000 --> 03:22:13,000
Hifumi: "As her advisor, it is my duty to give her advice. I can tell her things few others would dare. She rarely loses her temper with me, no matter how bold my suggestions."

2647
03:22:13,000 --> 03:22:17,000
Hifumi: "Perhaps I could try and sway her mind for you?"

2648
03:22:17,000 --> 03:22:20,000
Hiroki: "Oh, Hifumi...! Thank you very much...!"

2649
03:22:20,000 --> 03:22:26,000
*Now, it's my turn to bow before her. I bow very humbly, in a manner that makes Ayu scoff.*

2650
03:22:26,000 --> 03:22:29,000
Hifumi: "Now, now. Don't thank me just yet."

2651
03:22:29,000 --> 03:22:39,000
*Though she was the one who suggested this plan, Hifumi doesn't seem to have much faith in it. Her expression is still cloudy, her lips pursed.*

2652
03:22:39,000 --> 03:22:43,000
Hifumi: "There is no guarantee I will be able to do anything."

2653
03:22:43,000 --> 03:22:51,000
Hifumi: "I might be Lady Yue's tutor, but she has always been headstrong. She isn't the sort of person to change her mind."

2654
03:22:51,000 --> 03:22:55,000
Hifumi: "I'm not at all certain my petitions will reach her..."

2655
03:22:55,000 --> 03:22:58,000
Hifumi: "But I shall try and do my best regardless."

2656
03:22:58,000 --> 03:23:03,000
Hiroki: "I'll try to temper my expectations accordingly. Thanks, Hifumi."

2657
03:23:03,000 --> 03:23:09,000
*I don't feel particularly optimistic about my future, but I smile at her nonetheless.*

2658
03:23:09,000 --> 03:23:15,000
Hiroki: "Your best is all I can ask for. It'd be unfair to expect you to do anything more."

2659
03:23:15,000 --> 03:23:18,000
Hiroki: "I'm a little curious, though..."

2660
03:23:18,000 --> 03:23:21,000
*I glance about the courtyard, my arms folded.*

2661
03:23:21,000 --> 03:23:26,000
Hiroki: "Why's there only four of you? Isn't Hazel in the succubus realm?"

2662
03:23:26,000 --> 03:23:33,000
Marina: "She is, but she's not with us. She's busy attending... other duties, I suppose you could say."

2663
03:23:33,000 --> 03:23:35,000
Hiroki: "Other duties? Like what?"

2664
03:23:35,000 --> 03:23:36,000
Marina: "Well..."

2665
03:23:36,000 --> 03:23:39,000
*Marina toys with a lock of her sleek, white hair.*

2666
03:23:39,000 --> 03:23:44,000
Marina: "Let us just say she has a very special relationship with Lady Yue."

2667
03:23:44,000 --> 03:23:47,000
Marina: "I do not mean to be indiscreet, but..."

2668
03:23:47,000 --> 03:23:51,000
Hazel: "Oh, Lady Yue! You have such wonderfully smooth skin!"

2669
03:23:51,000 --> 03:23:57,000
Hazel: "Touching you is the greatest privilege imaginable! I'll never get enough of this!"

2670
03:23:57,000 --> 03:23:59,000
Hazel: "It's addictive!"

2671
03:23:59,000 --> 03:24:03,000
Hazel: "In fact, it feels kinda like I'm kneading mochi, hehe~"

2672
03:24:03,000 --> 03:24:09,000
Yue: "Then I am glad you are enjoying yourself so much - but please, remember to be thorough."

2673
03:24:09,000 --> 03:24:17,000
Yue: "You may sate our own desires while massaging me, whatever they may be, but my needs should always come first."

2674
03:24:17,000 --> 03:24:19,000
Yue: "I am your ruler, after all."

2675
03:24:19,000 --> 03:24:30,000
Hazel: "Yes, that's right! You are my ruler, Lady Yue! Every single inch of my body belongs to you! Please, do whatever you want with me! I have no complaints!"

2676
03:24:30,000 --> 03:24:33,000
Yue: "Heh. You've always been so obedient, Hazel."

2677
03:24:33,000 --> 03:24:38,000
Yue: "You're such a good girl. You're nothing like that traitorous Marina."

2678
03:24:38,000 --> 03:24:42,000
Hazel: "But of course, my ladyship! I live only to serve you!"

2679
03:24:42,000 --> 03:24:51,000
Hazel: "If you tell me not to pursue Hiroki, then I'll never look at him ever again! I love you dearly, and I'd hate to see you cry!"

2680
03:24:51,000 --> 03:24:54,000
Yue: "Thank you, Hazel. I'm glad you understand."

2681
03:24:54,000 --> 03:25:00,000
Yue: "Marina argued back when I told her to leave Hiroki alone, but you obeyed me instantly."

2682
03:25:00,000 --> 03:25:05,000
Hazel: "Well, that should go without sayin'! I'm your most loyal servant!"

2683
03:25:05,000 --> 03:25:10,000
Yue: "You really are. I think you might be even more loyal than Hifumi."

2684
03:25:10,000 --> 03:25:20,000
Yue: "I must reiterate, though: do not get close to that boy. Do not speak to him, and do not try to interact with him. You must bury your feelings for him."

2685
03:25:20,000 --> 03:25:22,000
Yue: "Do I make that quite plain?"

2686
03:25:22,000 --> 03:25:26,000
Hazel: "Aye, aye, milady! Leave it to me! I'll keep my distance!"

2687
03:25:26,000 --> 03:25:31,000
Yue: "You're sure it won't pain you? I thought you two had a special bond."

2688
03:25:31,000 --> 03:25:34,000
Hazel: "We were pretty close, yeah..."

2689
03:25:34,000 --> 03:25:41,000
Hazel: "But I love you just as much - no, more! - than I love him. If it'll make you happy, I'd do anythin'!"

2690
03:25:41,000 --> 03:25:48,000
Hazel: "Just let me massage your body every once in a while, and I'll never think about Hiroki again!"

2691
03:25:48,000 --> 03:25:50,000
Yue: "Very well. You may continue."

2692
03:25:50,000 --> 03:25:56,000
Yue: "Your massages are simply delightful. You know how to ease all the tension in my body."

2693
03:25:56,000 --> 03:26:02,000
Hazel: "That's 'cause I'm an athlete! I know how to look after myself - an' other people, too!"

2694
03:26:02,000 --> 03:26:10,000
Hazel: "If you wanna be a pro sportswoman, you've gotta be able to soothe your muscles after a wearyin' workout session!"

2695
03:26:10,000 --> 03:26:12,000
Yue: "Is that so? Hehehe..."

2696
03:26:12,000 --> 03:26:17,000
Yue: "You might act like something of an airhead, but you're awfully wise."

2697
03:26:17,000 --> 03:26:21,000
Hazel: "Waah! Milady praised me! I'm so happy! I could die happy!"

2698
03:26:21,000 --> 03:26:26,000
Hazel: "I love you, Lady Yue! I love you from the bottom of my heart!"

2699
03:26:26,000 --> 03:26:32,000
Yue: "Thank you, Hazel. Your love is appreciated. Now, my lower half is feeling a bit stiff..."

2700
03:26:32,000 --> 03:26:35,000
Yue: "Would you mind massaging that, too?"

2701
03:26:35,000 --> 03:26:38,000
Hazel: "Of course! It'll be my pleasure!"

2702
03:26:38,000 --> 03:26:42,000
Hazel: "Just leave your body in my very capable hands, hohoho!"

2703
03:26:42,000 --> 03:26:44,000
Hiroki: "Right... I see..."

2704
03:26:44,000 --> 03:26:47,000
Hiroki: "So, Hazel has a thing for Yue, does she?"

2705
03:26:47,000 --> 03:26:49,000
*I'm kind of jealous of Yue.":

2706
03:26:49,000 --> 03:26:51,000
*I'm kind of jealous of Yue.*

2707
03:26:51,000 --> 03:26:54,000
*I'd love to be massaged by Hazel like that.*

2708
03:26:54,000 --> 03:27:00,000
*Since Hazel's an athlete, she knows all about pressure points, muscles, and tendons.*

2709
03:27:00,000 --> 03:27:03,000
*I bet she gives incredible massages.*

2710
03:27:03,000 --> 03:27:06,000
*I'll have to add that to my bucket list...*

2711
03:27:06,000 --> 03:27:09,000
*If I ever get out of this place, that is.*

2712
03:27:09,000 --> 03:27:11,000
*I'm disappointed in Hazel.":

2713
03:27:11,000 --> 03:27:13,000
*I'm a bit disappointed in Hazel.*

2714
03:27:13,000 --> 03:27:18,000
*Doesn't she care that I've been trapped in the succubus realm against my will?*

2715
03:27:18,000 --> 03:27:21,000
*Has she totally turned her back on me?*

2716
03:27:21,000 --> 03:27:26,000
*I get that Yue's attractive, but is that enough to trump our shared bonds?*

2717
03:27:26,000 --> 03:27:28,000
*She's more flighty than I realized.*

2718
03:27:28,000 --> 03:27:36,000
Marina: "Yes, indeed. Some of the other succubi fawn over her too, but none are more blatant about it than Hazel."

2719
03:27:36,000 --> 03:27:40,000
Marina: "She practically worships the ground Yue walks on."

2720
03:27:40,000 --> 03:27:46,000
Ayu: "Totally! You should just see them together. Hazel wags her tail like a lovelorn puppy!"

2721
03:27:46,000 --> 03:27:47,000
*Ayu pulls a face.*

2722
03:27:47,000 --> 03:27:52,000
Ayu: "And Marina calls me a sycophant. I'm nothing compared to Hazel!"

2723
03:27:52,000 --> 03:27:58,000
Ayu: "I bet she prostrated herself before Yue when Yue scolded her, and begged for forgiveness!"

2724
03:27:58,000 --> 03:28:03,000
Ayu: "Knowing her, she probably offered to lick Yue's feet clean, too!"

2725
03:28:03,000 --> 03:28:07,000
Marina: "That is a mental image I could do without..."

2726
03:28:07,000 --> 03:28:12,000
Marina: "But it does not sound entirely beyond the realm of possibility."

2727
03:28:12,000 --> 03:28:20,000
Cosmos: "Hazel loves Yue a lot. Her love is pure, like my love for you. I don't think she means anything ill by it."

2728
03:28:20,000 --> 03:28:25,000
Cosmos: "At the end of the day, we can't help who we fall in love with."

2729
03:28:25,000 --> 03:28:27,000
Ayu: "I'm aware of that, but Yue?"

2730
03:28:27,000 --> 03:28:30,000
Ayu: "How could she fall in love with her?"

2731
03:28:30,000 --> 03:28:34,000
Marina: "For once, I agree with you. It's incredibly baffling."

2732
03:28:34,000 --> 03:28:38,000
Ayu: "It's not just baffling! It's downright bizarre!"

2733
03:28:38,000 --> 03:28:47,000
Ayu: "Lady Yue might not be that old, but she's our ruler! She could have us disposed of if she wished, with the flick of a finger!"

2734
03:28:47,000 --> 03:28:54,000
Hifumi: "Now, now. Some people like being looked down upon and dominated. Perhaps Hazel is the same way?"

2735
03:28:54,000 --> 03:28:59,000
Hiroki: "I guess Hazel won't be able to help me change Yue's mind, then..."

2736
03:28:59,000 --> 03:29:00,000
Marina: "Not at all."

2737
03:29:00,000 --> 03:29:01,000
*Marina snorts.*

2738
03:29:01,000 --> 03:29:07,000
Marina: "You shouldn't count on her as an ally when Yue's around. Hazel's besotted."

2739
03:29:07,000 --> 03:29:10,000
Hiroki: "Duly noted. I'll keep that in mind..."

2740
03:29:10,000 --> 03:29:17,000
Hifumi: "You needn't worry about Hazel's support, in any event. I will try to speak to Lady Yue, as I said."

2741
03:29:17,000 --> 03:29:29,000
Hifumi: "I cannot offer you very much in terms of support, but I will do all I can. I am sure the rest of us will, too. We all love you a lot, Hioki, and we want you to be safe."

2742
03:29:29,000 --> 03:29:32,000
Hifumi: "You must be on your guard, though."

2743
03:29:32,000 --> 03:29:34,000
*Hifumi's voice hardens.*

2744
03:29:34,000 --> 03:29:39,000
Hifumi: "This is Yue's domain. While you are here, you will be at her mercy."

2745
03:29:39,000 --> 03:29:45,000
Hifumi: "I shall try to protect you, but my influence is limited, and there is little I can do."

2746
03:29:45,000 --> 03:29:52,000
Hifumi: "Please, try and be careful. If anything happened to you, I fear I would not be able to forgive myself."

2747
03:29:52,000 --> 03:29:56,000
*I turn Hifumi's words over in my head for the rest of the day.*

2748
03:29:56,000 --> 03:30:05,000
*...Well, I say "day", but since the sky beyond the windows never changes color, I'm not sure where the day ends and the night begins.*

2749
03:30:05,000 --> 03:30:13,000
*Time stretches and dilates in strange ways. There aren't any clocks anywhere, and I can't keep track of anything.*

2750
03:30:13,000 --> 03:30:20,000
*I don't think I've been here all that long, but I'm already starting to lose all sense of the passing hours.*

2751
03:30:20,000 --> 03:30:30,000
*I already know that time doesn't pass in the succubus realm as it does in the human world. Could the perpetual night sky be a by-product of that?*

2752
03:30:30,000 --> 03:30:31,000
*I have no idea.*

2753
03:30:31,000 --> 03:30:33,000
*I'm starting to lose my bearings.*

2754
03:30:33,000 --> 03:30:37,000
*I know I should try to escape, but I still feel undecided.*

2755
03:30:37,000 --> 03:30:44,000
*I don't think staying here is good for me, but at the same token, I can't stop thinking about Yue.*

2756
03:30:44,000 --> 03:30:45,000
*I'm worried...*

2757
03:30:45,000 --> 03:30:47,000
*That she'll never let me leave.":

2758
03:30:47,000 --> 03:30:50,000
*She's so possessive, I'm a little afraid of her.*

2759
03:30:50,000 --> 03:30:52,000
*What will she do if I try to run?*

2760
03:30:52,000 --> 03:30:57,000
*Thinking about all the possibilities is enough to make me feel faint.*

2761
03:30:57,000 --> 03:30:58,000
Hiroki: "Urgh..."

2762
03:30:58,000 --> 03:31:02,000
*I groan, pressing a hand to my temple. It's throbbing.*

2763
03:31:02,000 --> 03:31:03,000
*I feel awful.*

2764
03:31:03,000 --> 03:31:11,000
*Humans were never meant to come here. That must be why I feel so out-of-sorts. My body is rejecting this place.*

2765
03:31:11,000 --> 03:31:16,000
*The air is strange and stuffy. When I'm indoors, it's hard to breathe.*

2766
03:31:16,000 --> 03:31:24,000
*I doubt I'll ever get used to it here. Neither do I want to. I need to try and escape, but that seems impossible.*

2767
03:31:24,000 --> 03:31:26,000
*I'll just have to rely on Hifumi.*

2768
03:31:26,000 --> 03:31:32,000
*She's dependable enough. She's one of the more mature succubi I know, alongside Marina.*

2769
03:31:32,000 --> 03:31:43,000
*Surely Yue will have to listen to her? She has to. She's only the current ruler because Hifumi bestowed the right upon her. Doesn't she owe Hifumi some sort of favor?*

2770
03:31:43,000 --> 03:31:47,000
*I can only hope their talk will be a favorable one...*

2771
03:31:47,000 --> 03:31:52,000
*But right now, I'm so sleepy, I can barely formulate coherent thoughts.*

2772
03:31:52,000 --> 03:31:54,000
*That she'll be lonely if I leave.":

2773
03:31:54,000 --> 03:31:59,000
*Yue's been clinging to me as much as she can ever since she brought me here.*

2774
03:31:59,000 --> 03:32:05,000
*She's professed her love to me multiple times, and I have no reason to disbelieve her.*

2775
03:32:05,000 --> 03:32:08,000
*I can tell that she cares for me a good deal.*

2776
03:32:08,000 --> 03:32:11,000
*If I leave, what would happen to her?*

2777
03:32:11,000 --> 03:32:13,000
*I'd hate for her to feel sad.*

2778
03:32:13,000 --> 03:32:14,000
*Could it be...*

2779
03:32:14,000 --> 03:32:17,000
*Do I still love her, after all this time?*

2780
03:32:17,000 --> 03:32:22,000
*I thought I'd forgotten my awkward first girlfriend, but evidently not.*

2781
03:32:22,000 --> 03:32:25,000
*Yukie meant a lot to me... and so does Yue.*

2782
03:32:25,000 --> 03:32:29,000
*I know she kidnapped me, and I know she's in the wrong, but...*

2783
03:32:29,000 --> 03:32:32,000
Hiroki: "I guess I'm still crazy about her."

2784
03:32:32,000 --> 03:32:33,000
Hiroki: "Man."

2785
03:32:33,000 --> 03:32:34,000
*I sigh.*

2786
03:32:34,000 --> 03:32:37,000
Hiroki: "How messed up are my priorities?"

2787
03:32:37,000 --> 03:32:45,000
*I'm the one in a dangerous situation. I should be worrying about my own welfare, but Yue's the only person I can think about.*

2788
03:32:45,000 --> 03:32:49,000
*It's almost like she's cast some sort of spell on me.*

2789
03:32:49,000 --> 03:32:56,000
*Hifumi might have offered to talk Yue around, but I'm starting to have some serious second thoughts.*

2790
03:32:56,000 --> 03:33:00,000
*Maybe it would be for the best if I stayed here after all.*

2791
03:33:00,000 --> 03:33:02,000
*Would that really be okay...?*

2792
03:33:02,000 --> 03:33:03,000
*I don't know...*

2793
03:33:03,000 --> 03:33:07,000
*And, right now, I'm so sleepy I can scarcely think.*

2794
03:33:07,000 --> 03:33:08,000
*I yawn.*

2795
03:33:08,000 --> 03:33:10,000
*My eyelashes fall shut.*

2796
03:33:10,000 --> 03:33:11,000
*Then, I fall asleep.*

2797
03:33:11,000 --> 03:33:13,000
???: "Oh, Hiroki... Mmph, chh..."

2798
03:33:13,000 --> 03:33:17,000
???: "I love you so much... You're mine, and only mine..."

2799
03:33:17,000 --> 03:33:18,000
???: "Mmph, mm..."

2800
03:33:18,000 --> 03:33:19,000
Hiroki: "Huh...?"

2801
03:33:19,000 --> 03:33:24,000
*I'm awoken from my dreams a short while later by a strange, damp sensation.*

2802
03:33:24,000 --> 03:33:32,000
*I can feel something pecking at my lips. The smell of perfume envelops me, and something silken brushes my skin.*

2803
03:33:32,000 --> 03:33:33,000
Hiroki: "What...?"

2804
03:33:33,000 --> 03:33:36,000
*Groggy and disoriented, I force my eyes open.*

2805
03:33:36,000 --> 03:33:37,000
*Then, I gasp.*

2806
03:33:37,000 --> 03:33:45,000
*Another pair of eyes are boring into mine. They're a very soft pale blue, like powdered snow, fringed with dark eyelashes.*

2807
03:33:45,000 --> 03:33:50,000
*I'm not alone. There's somebody else with me - and they're kissing me...!*

2808
03:33:50,000 --> 03:33:54,000
???: "Oh, Hiroki. It's nice to see that you're finally awake."

2809
03:33:54,000 --> 03:33:58,000
*The mysterious kisser draws back, a smug smile upon her face.*

2810
03:33:58,000 --> 03:34:07,000
*She brushes a few strands of dark hair behind her pale shoulder with her gloved hands, and that's when everything clicks into place.*

2811
03:34:07,000 --> 03:34:10,000
*This is my first girlfriend, Yukie. Yue.*

2812
03:34:10,000 --> 03:34:16,000
*She's a succubus. She kidnapped me, and brought me to the succubus realm, and now...*

2813
03:34:16,000 --> 03:34:17,000
Yue: "Hey, Hiroki."

2814
03:34:17,000 --> 03:34:24,000
*Yue's voice is a soft, sensuous purr, quite unlike the cool tones she used to address Marina earlier.*

2815
03:34:24,000 --> 03:34:31,000
*Her pale eyes look a little hotter than usual. They're half-lidded with arousal, and her cheeks are flushed.*

2816
03:34:31,000 --> 03:34:39,000
Yue: "It really has been a long time since last we spoke. I can't believe you could fall asleep at a time like this!"

2817
03:34:39,000 --> 03:34:47,000
Yue: "I had several duties to attend to, but now the day's business has been concluded I would like to enjoy myself."

2818
03:34:47,000 --> 03:34:52,000
Yue: "It's really not fair for you to fall asleep when I need you so badly."

2819
03:34:52,000 --> 03:34:54,000
Yue: "Don't you want to be with me?"

2820
03:34:54,000 --> 03:34:57,000
Hiroki: "O-Of course I want to be with you, but-"

2821
03:34:57,000 --> 03:34:58,000
Yue: "Shhh."

2822
03:34:58,000 --> 03:35:02,000
*Yue presses her gloved index finger against my lips.*

2823
03:35:02,000 --> 03:35:06,000
Yue: "Don't say anything that could spoil the moment."

2824
03:35:06,000 --> 03:35:14,000
Yue: "I've missed you intensely, my dear Hiroki. You are very, very valuable to me, and I wish to show you as much."

2825
03:35:14,000 --> 03:35:20,000
Yue: "I will show you my love over and over again, until you yearn for me as I do you."

2826
03:35:20,000 --> 03:35:25,000
Yue: "I won't let you leave me. From now on, you'll always be by my side."

2827
03:35:25,000 --> 03:35:26,000
Yue: "I adore you!"

2828
03:35:26,000 --> 03:35:31,000
*I open my mouth to retort, but Yue doesn't let me get a word in edgeways.*

2829
03:35:31,000 --> 03:35:40,000
*She dips her head once more, her dark hair trailing against my neck and shoulders, and presses her mouth to mine in a hot, demanding kiss.*

2830
03:35:40,000 --> 03:35:43,000
*I can feel her chest pushed up against mine.*

2831
03:35:43,000 --> 03:35:47,000
*She's so close, I can smell the sweat upon her skin.*

2832
03:35:47,000 --> 03:35:52,000
*I still feel tired, but I find myself quivering in anticipation all the same.*

2833
03:35:52,000 --> 03:35:53,000
*It feels good...*

2834
03:35:53,000 --> 03:35:57,000
*But Hifumi's earlier warning rings through my head.*

2835
03:35:57,000 --> 03:36:03,000
*Yue is dangerous. If I give too much of myself for her, she might never let me go.*

2836
03:36:03,000 --> 03:36:05,000
*Should I give in to this?*

2837
03:36:05,000 --> 03:36:07,000
*Let Yue do what she wants.":

2838
03:36:07,000 --> 03:36:08,000
*Push Yue away.":

2839
03:36:08,000 --> 03:36:11,000
*...I don't think I have any other choice.*

2840
03:36:11,000 --> 03:36:15,000
*Right now, I want nothing more than to lie with Yue.*

2841
03:36:15,000 --> 03:36:18,000
*It's impossible for me to fight her.*

2842
03:36:18,000 --> 03:36:21,000
*That being the case, I shouldn't bother.*

2843
03:36:21,000 --> 03:36:23,000
*I'll surrender to this sensation...*

2844
03:36:23,000 --> 03:36:25,000
*And I'll let her do what she wants.*

2845
03:36:25,000 --> 03:36:27,000
Hiroki: "I'm sorry, but..."

2846
03:36:27,000 --> 03:36:31,000
*Mustering all the willpower I possess, I push Yue away from me.*

2847
03:36:31,000 --> 03:36:34,000
Hiroki: "I don't know if I'm in the mood right now."

2848
03:36:34,000 --> 03:36:35,000
Yue: "What?"

2849
03:36:35,000 --> 03:36:38,000
*Yue's pale, powdery blue eyes flash.*

2850
03:36:38,000 --> 03:36:39,000
*She pouts.*

2851
03:36:39,000 --> 03:36:42,000
Yue: "Are you sure I can't persuade you?"

2852
03:36:42,000 --> 03:36:46,000
Hiroki: "Maybe later, but not right now. I'm too tired."

2853
03:36:46,000 --> 03:36:47,000
Yue: "Tired, hmm?"

2854
03:36:47,000 --> 03:36:48,000
*Yue smiles.*

2855
03:36:48,000 --> 03:36:55,000
Yue: "That sounds like the sort of excuse a housewife might make ten years into an unfulfilling relationship!"

2856
03:36:55,000 --> 03:36:59,000
Yue: "I certainly hope you don't regard me like that, Hiroki."

2857
03:36:59,000 --> 03:37:02,000
Hiroki: "No, not at all. I really am tired."

2858
03:37:02,000 --> 03:37:03,000
Yue: "Really?"

2859
03:37:03,000 --> 03:37:09,000
*Yue cups my cheek in one hand and looks at me, her brow furrowed with perplexity.*

2860
03:37:09,000 --> 03:37:10,000
Yue: "I wonder..."

2861
03:37:10,000 --> 03:37:17,000
Yue: "My naughty succubus subjects haven't been whispering poisonous lies in your ear, have they?"

2862
03:37:17,000 --> 03:37:21,000
Hiroki: "What? N-No, that has nothing to do with anything!"

2863
03:37:21,000 --> 03:37:23,000
Yue: "If you say so, dear..."

2864
03:37:23,000 --> 03:37:24,000
*Yue laughs.*

2865
03:37:24,000 --> 03:37:31,000
Yue: "Oh well. If you really are tired, I shall not force myself upon you. I would never do that."

2866
03:37:31,000 --> 03:37:33,000
Yue: "I love you, after all."

2867
03:37:33,000 --> 03:37:34,000
Yue: "Now..."

2868
03:37:34,000 --> 03:37:39,000
*Yue strips herself of her succubus attire, then lies down in bed beside me.*

2869
03:37:39,000 --> 03:37:46,000
*She winds her legs through mine, her arms twined about my middle, and nuzzles her cheek against my chest.*

2870
03:37:46,000 --> 03:37:49,000
Yue: "I think I will take this opportunity to rest."

2871
03:37:49,000 --> 03:37:51,000
Yue: "I am rather tired, too."

2872
03:37:51,000 --> 03:37:59,000
Yue: "We will have plenty more opportunities to be intimate in the future. For now, however, I must wish you goodnight."

2873
03:37:59,000 --> 03:38:01,000
Yue: "Sweet dreams, Hiroki."

2874
03:38:01,000 --> 03:38:04,000
*Yue presses a kiss against my cheek.*

2875
03:38:04,000 --> 03:38:06,000
Yue: "I hope you dream only of me."

2876
03:38:06,000 --> 03:38:07,000
Hiroki: "Nn... Haa..."

2877
03:38:07,000 --> 03:38:11,000
*It's still dark when I awake the following morning.*

2878
03:38:11,000 --> 03:38:21,000
*The sky beyond the windows is pitch black, and the only light afforded in the bed chamber is that from the chandelier which hangs from the ceiling.*

2879
03:38:21,000 --> 03:38:28,000
*The hazy, idle thoughts that swim about inside the fishbowl of my head are of a lackadaisical variety.*

2880
03:38:28,000 --> 03:38:30,000
*I don't quite feel like myself.*

2881
03:38:30,000 --> 03:38:36,000
*I can remember where I am, at least, and how I got here, but none of it feels really real.*

2882
03:38:36,000 --> 03:38:43,000
*It's almost as though my soul has split from my body, and I'm regarding myself as a third party.*

2883
03:38:43,000 --> 03:38:49,000
*It's strange to think that, a few months prior, I didn't even know that succubi existed.*

2884
03:38:49,000 --> 03:39:00,000
*I was incredibly surprised when Marina revealed the truth to me in her office. I even thought it might have been some sort of hallucination, or else a magic trick.*

2885
03:39:00,000 --> 03:39:09,000
*How could I have anticipated that my old girlfriend, Yukie, was a succubus too - or that she would kidnap me and bring me here?*

2886
03:39:09,000 --> 03:39:11,000
*I don't even know where "here" is!*

2887
03:39:11,000 --> 03:39:21,000
*I'm aware that I'm in the succubus realm (that much is apparent and unarguable), but where does it exist in relation to the rest of the world?*

2888
03:39:21,000 --> 03:39:30,000
*Does it reside in the same plane of existence as Tokyo, or is it separate from the world as I know it: nestled inside its own dimension?*

2889
03:39:30,000 --> 03:39:35,000
*If that is the case, it does make one wonder how the science of it all works.*

2890
03:39:35,000 --> 03:39:41,000
*Fortunately, I'm ignorant enough in the ways of science not to ponder this for too long.*

2891
03:39:41,000 --> 03:39:50,000
*If I were a genius, like Albert Einstein, I'm sure the existence of this "succubus realm" would leave me scratching my head...*

2892
03:39:50,000 --> 03:39:54,000
*But I'll try not to think about it too deeply for now.*

2893
03:39:54,000 --> 03:39:59,000
*I don't think I'm really capable of deep thought at the moment, anyway.*

2894
03:39:59,000 --> 03:40:05,000
*I'm not sure how long I slept, but my brain is slow and sluggish and my body feels weak.*

2895
03:40:05,000 --> 03:40:07,000
*I know why. It's all Yue's fault.*

2896
03:40:07,000 --> 03:40:13,000
*If I had any doubts as to whether she really is a succubus, they've all be washed away now.*

2897
03:40:13,000 --> 03:40:19,000
*For somebody so slender and delicate-looking, she has an incredible amount of stamina!*

2898
03:40:19,000 --> 03:40:25,000
*She went at it for what seemed like hours, without showing any signs of tiring...*

2899
03:40:25,000 --> 03:40:27,000
*But right now, she's fast asleep.*

2900
03:40:27,000 --> 03:40:37,000
*Yue lies beside me upon the bed. Her arms are raised, her dark hair strewn across the pillows, and there's a soft, contented smile upon her pretty face.*

2901
03:40:37,000 --> 03:40:39,000
*She really does look beautiful.*

2902
03:40:39,000 --> 03:40:46,000
*Her skin is smooth and pale, like that of a china doll's, and her matted lashes are dark as ebony.*

2903
03:40:46,000 --> 03:40:56,000
*In sleep, there's nothing dangerous about her at all. I feel like I could watch her for hours without tiring, despite the dull ache in my head.*

2904
03:40:56,000 --> 03:40:58,000
*Unbidden, a smile rises to my lips.*

2905
03:40:58,000 --> 03:40:59,000
Hiroki: "Yukie..."

2906
03:40:59,000 --> 03:41:02,000
*I run my hands through her hair. She doesn't stir.*

2907
03:41:02,000 --> 03:41:11,000
*Sepia-tinted memories flood into my mind, of days gone by. I can remember going on dates with Yukie, my very first girlfriend.*

2908
03:41:11,000 --> 03:41:17,000
*We went to the countryside, we went to the movies, and we ate ice cream together.*

2909
03:41:17,000 --> 03:41:24,000
*These might sound like uninspired dates - clichéd, almost - but they meant a lot to me at the time.*

2910
03:41:24,000 --> 03:41:26,000
*I never thought I'd see her again.*

2911
03:41:26,000 --> 03:41:33,000
*It's hard to believe our fates could converge like this, to make our paths cross in so unexpected a manner.*

2912
03:41:33,000 --> 03:41:36,000
Hiroki: "So, she was a succubus, huh...?"

2913
03:41:36,000 --> 03:41:40,000
Hiroki: "Sounds like something from a cheesy romance movie."

2914
03:41:40,000 --> 03:41:44,000
Hiroki: "Either that, or maybe... or a horror story?"

2915
03:41:44,000 --> 03:41:52,000
*I'll admit, I was pretty creeped out when I found her waiting for me in my apartment, but now I'm begining to wonder.*

2916
03:41:52,000 --> 03:41:55,000
*Why should I pull away from Yukie - sorry, Yue?*

2917
03:41:55,000 --> 03:41:59,000
*It's not like she's a stranger. She's my first girlfriend.*

2918
03:41:59,000 --> 03:42:05,000
*I loved her at a lot at the time, and my heart still pounds to look upon her now.*

2919
03:42:05,000 --> 03:42:07,000
*Can I truly leave her side?*

2920
03:42:07,000 --> 03:42:10,000
*I know it would be for the best, but...*

2921
03:42:10,000 --> 03:42:16,000
*I'm not sure how long I slept, but my brain is slow and sluggish and my body feels weak.*

2922
03:42:16,000 --> 03:42:23,000
*I feel so out of it, it takes me a few moments to register the sleeping presence lying beside me.*

2923
03:42:23,000 --> 03:42:31,000
*Yue's arms are raised, her dark hair strewn across the pillows, and there's a soft, contented smile upon her pretty face.*

2924
03:42:31,000 --> 03:42:40,000
*She must have kicked the bed covers off while she was dozing (I wonder if she's a restless sleeper), because her torso is exposed.*

2925
03:42:40,000 --> 03:42:45,000
*Her skin looks soft and silky beneath the lights of the chandelier.*

2926
03:42:45,000 --> 03:42:47,000
*She really does look beautiful.*

2927
03:42:47,000 --> 03:42:53,000
*I can hardly believe that she's so interested in me. It feels like something from a dream...*

2928
03:42:53,000 --> 03:43:01,000
*But this "dream" of mine will fast become a nightmare, if I'm unable to figure out how to escape from this place.*

2929
03:43:01,000 --> 03:43:12,000
*It's not as though I dislike Yue. I'm not sure I could - and that's not just because of how cute she looks while she's asleep (though that is part of the reason).*

2930
03:43:12,000 --> 03:43:18,000
*It's clear that she does care for me. She's made her fond feelings more than apparent.*

2931
03:43:18,000 --> 03:43:21,000
*I don't think I have the heart to spurn her...*

2932
03:43:21,000 --> 03:43:26,000
*But I don't want to stay by her side for the rest of my life, either.*

2933
03:43:26,000 --> 03:43:31,000
*I'd like to return to Tokyo, if I can. That's where I belong - not here.*

2934
03:43:31,000 --> 03:43:41,000
*I wonder if Hifumi will be able to talk her around, as we discussed yesterday. She might be the only person who can convince Yue to let me go.*

2935
03:43:41,000 --> 03:43:46,000
*For now, I'll put my faith in her. Who knows? Maybe things will pan out.*

2936
03:43:46,000 --> 03:43:48,000
*I just need to have hope.*

2937
03:43:48,000 --> 03:43:49,000
*Knock, knock, knock.*

2938
03:43:49,000 --> 03:43:52,000
*Ah! It sounds like somebody's at the door.*

2939
03:43:52,000 --> 03:43:53,000
*Who could it be...?*

2940
03:43:53,000 --> 03:43:56,000
Hifumi: "Excuse me, Lady Yue? Is now a good time?"

2941
03:43:56,000 --> 03:43:57,000
Yue: "Nn? What...?"

2942
03:43:57,000 --> 03:44:02,000
*Yue yawns. Her eyelashes flicker open, revealing her pale, icy irises.*

2943
03:44:02,000 --> 03:44:05,000
*Yawning, she sits up and glances to the door.*

2944
03:44:05,000 --> 03:44:07,000
Yue: "Hifumi...? Is that you?"

2945
03:44:07,000 --> 03:44:15,000
Hifumi: "Yes, indeed. I've come with your breakfast, Lady Yue. I made it myself, in the traditional Japanese style."

2946
03:44:15,000 --> 03:44:22,000
Hifumi: "There's white rice, miso soup, pickles, and some grilled fish. I hope it is to your liking!"

2947
03:44:22,000 --> 03:44:26,000
Yue: "Mm. That sounds good. I haven't eaten in a while..."

2948
03:44:26,000 --> 03:44:29,000
Yue: "Alright, Hifumi. You can come in."

2949
03:44:29,000 --> 03:44:32,000
Hifumi: "Thank you very much, milady!"

2950
03:44:32,000 --> 03:44:37,000
*The door opens with a creak and Hifumi enters, balancing a tray in one hand.*

2951
03:44:37,000 --> 03:44:44,000
*She shuts the door behind her, then approaches the bed where Yue and I sit, her tail swishing all the while.*

2952
03:44:44,000 --> 03:44:48,000
*Smiling serenely, she then rests the tray down upon the bed.*

2953
03:44:48,000 --> 03:44:51,000
Hifumi: "There you are, my lady. Please, enjoy."

2954
03:44:51,000 --> 03:44:55,000
Yue: "I always do. Your cooking is delicious, Hifumi – although..."

2955
03:44:55,000 --> 03:44:59,000
*Yue peers at the tray curiously, one hand beneath her chin.*

2956
03:44:59,000 --> 03:45:08,000
*Hifumi must have been pretty busy in the palace kitchens, wherever they are, because the tray is practically groaning with food.*

2957
03:45:08,000 --> 03:45:16,000
*There's a veritable mountain of soft, fluffy white rice piled into that ceramic bowl, and she's grilled five whole fish!*

2958
03:45:16,000 --> 03:45:26,000
Yue: "This seems like quite a bit more than usual. I'm not sure if I'll be able to eat it all. You should know that I have a delicate appetite."

2959
03:45:26,000 --> 03:45:31,000
Hifumi: "I am well aware, milady. I just thought that, given you have a guest-"

2960
03:45:31,000 --> 03:45:33,000
*Hifumi glances at me.*

2961
03:45:33,000 --> 03:45:39,000
Hifumi: "-I should make more food I generally do, so that he might have some as well."

2962
03:45:39,000 --> 03:45:43,000
Hifumi: "You would not want Hiroki to go hungry, would you?"

2963
03:45:43,000 --> 03:45:47,000
Yue: "Oh, no...! That is a good point. I didn't think."

2964
03:45:47,000 --> 03:46:00,000
Yue: "Forgive me for being so careless, Hiroki. It's been a long time since I last I interacted with a human, and I had forgotten that you need sustenance just as we do - human males in particular."

2965
03:46:00,000 --> 03:46:02,000
Yue: "I am truly sorry."

2966
03:46:02,000 --> 03:46:05,000
Hiroki: "It's fine, Yue. I don't worry about it."

2967
03:46:05,000 --> 03:46:08,000
*I offer Yue what I hope is a comforting smile.*

2968
03:46:08,000 --> 03:46:14,000
Hiroki: "Hifumi made enough food for the both of us, so it's not like I'll starve."

2969
03:46:14,000 --> 03:46:18,000
Yue: "Indeed, she did. It was very thoughtful of her."

2970
03:46:18,000 --> 03:46:27,000
Yue: "Hifumi has always been a kind and conscientious woman. Her advice has helped me greatly when it comes to the governing of my people."

2971
03:46:27,000 --> 03:46:30,000
Yue: "She is almost like a mother to me!"

2972
03:46:30,000 --> 03:46:34,000
Hifumi: "A mother? I do like that idea quite a lot, but really!"

2973
03:46:34,000 --> 03:46:35,000
*She giggles.*

2974
03:46:35,000 --> 03:46:39,000
Hifumi: "I am not that much older than you, Lady Yue!"

2975
03:46:39,000 --> 03:46:48,000
Hifumi: "I would not mind having little children of my own some day, that I might dote on, but you and I are not so far apart in age!"

2976
03:46:48,000 --> 03:46:55,000
Hifumi: "If you must refer to me as a member of the family, I would far rather be regarded as your big sister!"

2977
03:46:55,000 --> 03:46:56,000
Yue: "Why?"

2978
03:46:56,000 --> 03:46:57,000
*Yue smirks thinly.*

2979
03:46:57,000 --> 03:47:04,000
Yue: "Are you afraid that I'll put Hiroki off you if I comment about how advanced in years you really are?"

2980
03:47:04,000 --> 03:47:05,000
Hifumi: "Goodness me!"

2981
03:47:05,000 --> 03:47:08,000
*Hifumi's cheeks turn a soft shade of pink.*

2982
03:47:08,000 --> 03:47:12,000
Hifumi: "You are being awfully wilful today, milady!"

2983
03:47:12,000 --> 03:47:19,000
Hifumi: "Is that any way to address me after I took the effort of making you such a delicious breakfast?"

2984
03:47:19,000 --> 03:47:31,000
*I'm surprised to hear Hifumi talk down to Yue like that. I'm sure, if Marina said words to that effect, she'd be pushed to the floor and ground beneath the heel of Yue's foot.*

2985
03:47:31,000 --> 03:47:37,000
*Yue doesn't seem to mind being scolded by Hifumi, though. Her expression doesn't falter.*

2986
03:47:37,000 --> 03:47:39,000
*Instead, she smiles sheepishly.*

2987
03:47:39,000 --> 03:47:47,000
Yue: "...I guess you're right. I'm sorry, Hifumi. I had quite the busy night, and I suppose I am somewhat tired."

2988
03:47:47,000 --> 03:47:51,000
Yue: "I must have over-exerted myself, in my excitement."

2989
03:47:51,000 --> 03:47:53,000
Hifumi: "A busy night, hmm?"

2990
03:47:53,000 --> 03:47:57,000
*Hifumi glances between the pair of us, her brow furrowed.*

2991
03:47:57,000 --> 03:47:59,000
*I wonder if she's upset.*

2992
03:47:59,000 --> 03:48:09,000
*Hifumi doesn't seem to have any issues about sharing me with Marina, Cosmos, Ayu, and Hazel, but I suppose it's a bit different where Yue's concerned.*

2993
03:48:09,000 --> 03:48:15,000
*Yue, unlike the others, wants to keep me all to herself, and she has the authority to do so.*

2994
03:48:15,000 --> 03:48:19,000
*That must be why Hifumi looks so uncharacteristically gloomy.*

2995
03:48:19,000 --> 03:48:26,000
*The moments pass, however, and Hifumi's features soon rearrange themselves into a soft, gentle smile.*

2996
03:48:26,000 --> 03:48:32,000
Hifumi: "I needn't ask what it was, precisely, you were getting up to. It is quite apparent."

2997
03:48:32,000 --> 03:48:40,000
Yue: "...I guess you're right. I'm sorry, Hifumi. I have been working hard lately, and I suppose I am somewhat tired."

2998
03:48:40,000 --> 03:48:43,000
Hifumi: "You poor thing. You're always so busy!"

2999
03:48:43,000 --> 03:48:48,000
Yue: "Yes, indeed... but fortunately, I have my lovely Hiroki to soothe me."

3000
03:48:48,000 --> 03:48:49,000
Hifumi: "Nn..."

3001
03:48:49,000 --> 03:48:56,000
*Hifumi winces. I wonder if she's upset? Her facial features soon rearrange themselves, however, into a smile.*

3002
03:48:56,000 --> 03:49:00,000
Hifumi: "That is good and well, milady. I am very happy for you."

3003
03:49:00,000 --> 03:49:02,000
Yue: "You're not jealous?"

3004
03:49:02,000 --> 03:49:05,000
Hifumi: "Not at all! Rather, I am pleased for you!"

3005
03:49:05,000 --> 03:49:11,000
Hifumi: "You must be glad that you have been able to reunite with Hiroki after so many years."

3006
03:49:11,000 --> 03:49:14,000
Hifumi: "He is quite the catch, is he not?"

3007
03:49:14,000 --> 03:49:15,000
Yue: "He is indeed..."

3008
03:49:15,000 --> 03:49:24,000
*Yue pouts. She shifts over to me, disrupting the breakfast tray, and winds an arm about mine in the same manner Cosmos so often does.*

3009
03:49:24,000 --> 03:49:26,000
Yue: "...and he is mine."

3010
03:49:26,000 --> 03:49:31,000
Yue: "I won't have you gawping at him, Hifumi, no matter how much I like you."

3011
03:49:31,000 --> 03:49:35,000
Yue: "You've had your fun with him. Now it's my turn!"

3012
03:49:35,000 --> 03:49:37,000
Hifumi: "Of course, milady."

3013
03:49:37,000 --> 03:49:39,000
*Hifumi bows her head.*

3014
03:49:39,000 --> 03:49:50,000
Hifumi: "I wouldn't presume to try and steal your beloved from you, when it is apparent how much you care for him. I may be older than you, but I am not a scheming vixen."

3015
03:49:50,000 --> 03:49:55,000
Yue: "Good. I knew I could trust you. You're not at all like Marina."

3016
03:49:55,000 --> 03:49:57,000
*Yue's grip about my arm relaxes.*

3017
03:49:57,000 --> 03:50:05,000
*Reassured, now, that Yue won't try to steal me out from under her nose, Yue turns her attention to the breakfast tray.*

3018
03:50:05,000 --> 03:50:11,000
Yue: "Well then! I suppose I ought to eat something. I need to replenish my energy."

3019
03:50:11,000 --> 03:50:17,000
Yue: "I have been so awfully busy as of late! There is always something for me to do!"

3020
03:50:17,000 --> 03:50:20,000
Yue: "It almost makes me miss my student days."

3021
03:50:20,000 --> 03:50:23,000
Hiroki: "Did you enjoy being a student?"

3022
03:50:23,000 --> 03:50:31,000
Yue: "I didn't at first. I thought the lessons quite dull and tedious, and I didn't care for any of my classmates."

3023
03:50:31,000 --> 03:50:37,000
Yue: "They could tell that I was subtly different, so they all kept their distance."

3024
03:50:37,000 --> 03:50:39,000
Yue: "It was a bit lonely..."

3025
03:50:39,000 --> 03:50:41,000
Yue: "But then I met you."

3026
03:50:41,000 --> 03:50:42,000
*Yue smiles at me.*

3027
03:50:42,000 --> 03:50:49,000
Yue: "I appreciate your company a good deal. You brightened up my time spent in Tokyo considerably."

3028
03:50:49,000 --> 03:50:53,000
Yue: "It is because of you that I learned to tolerate humans."

3029
03:50:53,000 --> 03:51:02,000
Yue: "I had fun going on dates with you, and learning more about human society. We went a lot of places, and did a good many things."

3030
03:51:02,000 --> 03:51:05,000
Yue: "I was so young and carefree back then."

3031
03:51:05,000 --> 03:51:17,000
Yue: "Now, it is my duty to remain here, in the succubus realm, where it is always dark. The sun doesn't shine as it did in Tokyo, and there aren't any cafés or amusement parks."

3032
03:51:17,000 --> 03:51:19,000
Yue: "It is quite dreary."

3033
03:51:19,000 --> 03:51:24,000
Yue: "Sometimes, I wish I did not have quite so many responsibilities..."

3034
03:51:24,000 --> 03:51:32,000
Yue: "But my burden will be lessened, I think, with your company. Being with you is like a salve that heals my heart."

3035
03:51:32,000 --> 03:51:33,000
Yue: "Now."

3036
03:51:33,000 --> 03:51:39,000
*Yue scoops a spoonful of Hifumi's mouth-watering miso soup, then brings it up to my lips.*

3037
03:51:39,000 --> 03:51:42,000
Yue: "Will you let me feed you, darling?"

3038
03:51:42,000 --> 03:51:52,000
*I'm perfectly capable of feeding myself, but I oblige. I let Yue spoon mouthfuls of soup and morsels of fish to my lips, while Hifumi watches.*

3039
03:51:52,000 --> 03:52:02,000
*If Hifumi's jealous about our closeness  (and I rather suspect, despite her protests, that she is), she doesn't let on. Her brow doesn't wrinkle.*

3040
03:52:02,000 --> 03:52:07,000
*Instead, she smiles placidly, her hands folded together at her front.*

3041
03:52:07,000 --> 03:52:13,000
*She really is a wonderful actress. I've never seen anybody better at hiding their own emotions.*

3042
03:52:13,000 --> 03:52:16,000
*It's impressive... but it's kind of sad, too.*

3043
03:52:16,000 --> 03:52:24,000
*I feel sorry for Yue, who's obliged to stay in the succubus realm and rule her subjects, but I feel sorry for Hifumi, too.*

3044
03:52:24,000 --> 03:52:29,000
*It can't be easy, watching the person you love be pampered by another woman.*

3045
03:52:29,000 --> 03:52:35,000
*Then again, didn't Yue have to bear witness to dozens upon dozens of events like this?*

3046
03:52:35,000 --> 03:52:40,000
*She must've been observing me in the succubus realm for quite some time.*

3047
03:52:40,000 --> 03:52:46,000
*Did it break her heart to see me flirting with Hifumi and resting my head upon her lap...?*

3048
03:52:46,000 --> 03:52:48,000
Yue: "Mm. That was delicious."

3049
03:52:48,000 --> 03:52:53,000
*Yue finishes the last of the breakfast, then sets down her chopsticks.*

3050
03:52:53,000 --> 03:52:59,000
Yue: "Thank you, Hifumi. Your cooking seems to get better and better every time I see you."

3051
03:52:59,000 --> 03:53:05,000
Hifumi: "You're very welcome! Nothing makes me happier than watching people eat my food, ehehe~"

3052
03:53:05,000 --> 03:53:08,000
Hifumi: "I trust you enjoyed it as well, Hiroki?"

3053
03:53:08,000 --> 03:53:14,000
Hiroki: "O-Oh, yes! It was great. The fish was especially good, and I loved the miso soup."

3054
03:53:14,000 --> 03:53:16,000
Hifumi: "I'm relieved!"

3055
03:53:16,000 --> 03:53:17,000
*Hifumi beams.*

3056
03:53:17,000 --> 03:53:29,000
Hifumi: "I do most of my cooking in the human world now, in my apartment. I'm rather more accustomed to my own kitchen than the one here, so I feared I might have made a mistake."

3057
03:53:29,000 --> 03:53:32,000
Hifumi: "I'm glad everything went well!"

3058
03:53:32,000 --> 03:53:33,000
Hifumi: "Now..."

3059
03:53:33,000 --> 03:53:38,000
*Hifumi casts an eye over Yue. She's wearing nothing but her underwear.*

3060
03:53:38,000 --> 03:53:42,000
Hifumi: "Would you let me help you with your clothes, milady?"

3061
03:53:42,000 --> 03:53:45,000
Yue: "If you like. That would be most appreciated."

3062
03:53:45,000 --> 03:53:49,000
Hifumi: "Alright then. Stand up, and I'll start pampering you!"

3063
03:53:49,000 --> 03:53:55,000
*Yue obeys Hifumi's commands in a surprisingly obedient manner, like a child might.*

3064
03:53:55,000 --> 03:54:02,000
*Though Hifumi protested when Yue said she was like her mother, there is something motherly about her.*

3065
03:54:02,000 --> 03:54:05,000
*Watching her dote on Yue is kind of sweet.*

3066
03:54:05,000 --> 03:54:10,000
*Hifumi wraps Yue's clothes about her shoulders, smiling all the while.*

3067
03:54:10,000 --> 03:54:20,000
*Yue shivers when the fur of her cape touches her exposed skin, but she doesn't shrink or shy away from Hifumi's fingers. She looks completely at her ease.*

3068
03:54:20,000 --> 03:54:27,000
*This early morning ritual is one which must have occurred numerous times between these two women.*

3069
03:54:27,000 --> 03:54:32,000
*I can see, based on her relaxed posture, how deeply Yue trusts Hifumi.*

3070
03:54:32,000 --> 03:54:38,000
*Yue's relationship with Hifumi is the polar opposite to her relationship with Marina.*

3071
03:54:38,000 --> 03:54:45,000
*She seems to regard Hifumi very highly, and I can't see so much as a flicker of animosity in her eyes.*

3072
03:54:45,000 --> 03:54:52,000
*I think I can understand that. Hifumi's a sweet, unassuming woman. It's hard for anybody to dislike her.*

3073
03:54:52,000 --> 03:54:58,000
*That's partially why she's been such an enduringly popular actress for so many years.*

3074
03:54:58,000 --> 03:55:01,000
Hifumi: "By the way, milady... I was thinking..."

3075
03:55:01,000 --> 03:55:02,000
Yue: "Hm?"

3076
03:55:02,000 --> 03:55:05,000
*Yue shoots Hifumi a sidelong glance.*

3077
03:55:05,000 --> 03:55:07,000
Yue: "What is it, Hifumi?"

3078
03:55:07,000 --> 03:55:15,000
Hifumi: "I couldn't help but recall the talk you gave me yesterday, after you summoned me to the succubus realm."

3079
03:55:15,000 --> 03:55:16,000
Yue: "Oh, that?"

3080
03:55:16,000 --> 03:55:17,000
*Yue frowns.*

3081
03:55:17,000 --> 03:55:22,000
Yue: "Please, don't take it too personally. You know I dislike scolding you."

3082
03:55:22,000 --> 03:55:33,000
Yue: "I was upset at the time, I will admit, but if you have seen the error of your ways you needn't dwell upon it. One apology is more than enough to satisfy me."

3083
03:55:33,000 --> 03:55:35,000
Yue: "I know we all make mistakes."

3084
03:55:35,000 --> 03:55:38,000
Hifumi: "Thank you, milady. You are very gracious."

3085
03:55:38,000 --> 03:55:40,000
*Hifumi bows her head.*

3086
03:55:40,000 --> 03:55:49,000
Hifumi: "I am sure I am speaking on behalf of all of succubi - Marina included! - when I say that we did not know how much you adored Hiroki."

3087
03:55:49,000 --> 03:55:56,000
Hifumi: "Had we been aware of your intimate connection to him, I am sure we would not have pursued him."

3088
03:55:56,000 --> 03:56:00,000
Yue: "It's alright, Hifumi. I can forgive you and the others..."

3089
03:56:00,000 --> 03:56:02,000
*Yue's expression hardens.*

3090
03:56:02,000 --> 03:56:09,000
Yue: "But I cannot forgive Marina in a hurry. Not until she apologizes to me herself, with her own mouth."

3091
03:56:09,000 --> 03:56:18,000
Yue: "For one of my underlings, she has an absolutely awful attitude. She does not regard me with due respect, and her etiquette is shocking."

3092
03:56:18,000 --> 03:56:23,000
Yue: "I shan't let her off the hook, even if you ask me, Hifumi. I despise her!"

3093
03:56:23,000 --> 03:56:27,000
Hifumi: "Ehehe... Well, I thought you might say that."

3094
03:56:27,000 --> 03:56:28,000
*Hifumi laughs.*

3095
03:56:28,000 --> 03:56:39,000
Hifumi: "But, milady... While I know none of us would have pursued a relationship with Hiroki had we known of your bond with him, the fact remains that we still did."

3096
03:56:39,000 --> 03:56:44,000
Hifumi: "Hiroki has become a special person to all of us, myself included."

3097
03:56:44,000 --> 03:56:50,000
Hifumi: "I wish I could ignore the feelings I have for him, but it is not that simple."

3098
03:56:50,000 --> 03:57:00,000
Hifumi: "Perhaps my heart is weak - and if that is the case, I beg your pardon - but it is rare I find a man I care about quite as much as he."

3099
03:57:00,000 --> 03:57:04,000
Hifumi: "I know that Ayu, Cosmos, and Marina feel the same way."

3100
03:57:04,000 --> 03:57:06,000
Hifumi: "As for Hazel, meanwhile..."

3101
03:57:06,000 --> 03:57:08,000
*Hifumi purses her lips together.*

3102
03:57:08,000 --> 03:57:16,000
Hifumi: "I have not had a chance to speak to her since arriving in the succubus realm, but I am sure she is fond of him, too."

3103
03:57:16,000 --> 03:57:23,000
Hifumi: "We all like him a good deal, and we cannot stop liking him because you have commanded us to."

3104
03:57:23,000 --> 03:57:31,000
Hifumi: "It would be nice if we could put a stop to our feelings, as simply as one can turn off a light switch..."

3105
03:57:31,000 --> 03:57:33,000
Hifumi: "But that is not possible."

3106
03:57:33,000 --> 03:57:43,000
Yue: "I realize things must be hard for you, Hifumi, but you'll have to try and live with it. Hiroki is mine, and you must learn to keep your distance."

3107
03:57:43,000 --> 03:57:48,000
Hifumi: "I know that is what you wish milady, but... Please. Hear me out."

3108
03:57:48,000 --> 03:57:57,000
Hifumi: "Marina, Ayu, Cosmos, Hazel, and I have been sharing him for quite some time. We all love him equally, and he loves us."

3109
03:57:57,000 --> 03:58:05,000
Hifumi: "We have had a few spats, but we have been able to settle everything between us peaceably, as adults should."

3110
03:58:05,000 --> 03:58:12,000
Hifumi: "This arrangement is quite the pleasant one. You don't have any complaints with it, do you, Hiroki?"

3111
03:58:12,000 --> 03:58:14,000
Hiroki: "Oh, no! None at all!"

3112
03:58:14,000 --> 03:58:15,000
Hifumi: "You see?"

3113
03:58:15,000 --> 03:58:18,000
*Hifumi adjusts Yue's ruff about her shoulders.*

3114
03:58:18,000 --> 03:58:26,000
Hifumi: "We were all happy with the way things were, and so... I was wondering if you might not be happy like that, too?"

3115
03:58:26,000 --> 03:58:27,000
Yue: "Like what?"

3116
03:58:27,000 --> 03:58:31,000
*Yue's eyes narrow into slits, while her voice drops in volume.*

3117
03:58:31,000 --> 03:58:36,000
*All of a sudden, she doesn't look half so agreeable as once she did.*

3118
03:58:36,000 --> 03:58:41,000
Yue: "You aren't telling me to share my Hiroki with the rest of you, are you?"

3119
03:58:41,000 --> 03:58:53,000
Hifumi: "I thought it a possibility, milady. It would make us all happy. We love him, and it would be unfair to keep him trapped in the succubus realm against his will, surely?"

3120
03:58:53,000 --> 03:58:57,000
Yue: "He isn't trapped here against his will! He loves me!"

3121
03:58:57,000 --> 03:58:59,000
Hifumi: "I'm sure he does, but-"

3122
03:58:59,000 --> 03:59:08,000
Yue: "There are no buts! I won't let you stand here in my bedroom and insult me, Hifumi! I thought you were supposed to be my ally!"

3123
03:59:08,000 --> 03:59:13,000
Hifumi: "I-I am your ally, milady. I never meant any offence. I just-"

3124
03:59:13,000 --> 03:59:16,000
Yue: "Then maybe you shouldn't have said anything!"

3125
03:59:16,000 --> 03:59:20,000
*Yue jerks away from Hifumi suddenly, her eyes blazing.*

3126
03:59:20,000 --> 03:59:30,000
*She's fully dressed down, and she looks infuriated. Her tail is swishing indignantly, and her tall horns make her look more imposing than ever before.*

3127
03:59:30,000 --> 03:59:36,000
*Gone is the sweet, obliging Yue who praised Hifumi's cooking and fed me while in bed.*

3128
03:59:36,000 --> 03:59:42,000
*She's transformed into the cold-hearted succubus queen that debased Marina in the throne room.*

3129
03:59:42,000 --> 03:59:49,000
*The full brunt of her anger isn't even directed at me, and I can feel my blood running cold all the same.*

3130
03:59:49,000 --> 03:59:52,000
*It's little wonder Hifumi looks so pale!*

3131
03:59:52,000 --> 04:00:01,000
Yue: "How dare you try to tell me what to do?! You might be my advisor, but I am the queen, and you do not have any power over me!"

3132
04:00:01,000 --> 04:00:09,000
Yue: "If I want to keep Hiroki all to myself than I may! You have no right to butt in! My love life is none of your concern!"

3133
04:00:09,000 --> 04:00:12,000
Hifumi: "But this isn't just about you, milady...!"

3134
04:00:12,000 --> 04:00:20,000
*Hifumi looks anxious, but she doesn't back down. She tries to argue on my behalf, though she's trembling all the while.*

3135
04:00:20,000 --> 04:00:26,000
Hifumi: "This is about Hiroki, too. You need to stop and think about what he wants."

3136
04:00:26,000 --> 04:00:32,000
Hifumi: "This might be my own vanity speaking, but I believe he was happy with the five of us."

3137
04:00:32,000 --> 04:00:40,000
Hifumi: "After all we have gone through together, it would be cruel to part us - and it really isn't right to keep him here!"

3138
04:00:40,000 --> 04:00:45,000
Yue: "I am the one who will decide what is right and what is not, thank you!"

3139
04:00:45,000 --> 04:00:49,000
*Yue puffs out her impressive chest, her hands on her hips.*

3140
04:00:49,000 --> 04:01:01,000
Yue: "He might not want to stay here right now, but he will! We'll spend more time together, and I'll lavish attention on him, and then he'll realize how much he has missed me!"

3141
04:01:01,000 --> 04:01:10,000
Yue: "He'll be glad to leave the human world behind, as I did, so he can stay with me! In fact, I'm sure he'll thank me for it!"

3142
04:01:10,000 --> 04:01:17,000
Yue: "He loves me much, much more than he has ever loved you, so stop trying to spoil everything!"

3143
04:01:17,000 --> 04:01:21,000
Hifumi: "I am not trying to spoil anything, milady. I am merely-"

3144
04:01:21,000 --> 04:01:24,000
Yue: "Trying to make me doubt myself?"

3145
04:01:24,000 --> 04:01:26,000
*Yue raises one eyebrow.*

3146
04:01:26,000 --> 04:01:28,000
Yue: "Well, I won't have it!"

3147
04:01:28,000 --> 04:01:35,000
Yue: "If Hiroki were any other human, I would let him go without delay, but he... is special to me..."

3148
04:01:35,000 --> 04:01:43,000
*Yue's voice, which was once so self-righteous, now falters. She looks down at the floor, her eyes half-lidded, and sighs.*

3149
04:01:43,000 --> 04:01:49,000
Yue: "Perhaps it may appear that I am being unreasonable, but my judgement is perfectly sound."

3150
04:01:49,000 --> 04:01:54,000
Yue: "I am only doing this because I love him. How could that be bad?"

3151
04:01:54,000 --> 04:02:00,000
Yue: "Love is a good, pure emotion. It is not something to be ashamed of, nor second-guessed."

3152
04:02:00,000 --> 04:02:03,000
Yue: "Aren't you the one who told me that, Hifumi?"

3153
04:02:03,000 --> 04:02:09,000
Hifumi: "I... suppose I am, but... princess. Why do we not ask Hiroki what he wants to do?"

3154
04:02:09,000 --> 04:02:10,000
*Hifumi looks at me.*

3155
04:02:10,000 --> 04:02:13,000
Hifumi: "Do you really want to stay here?"

3156
04:02:13,000 --> 04:02:21,000
Yue: "Yes, Hiroki! You tell that meddling old woman! Tell her that you love me, and you want to stay by my side forever!"

3157
04:02:21,000 --> 04:02:22,000
Hiroki: "Well, I..."

3158
04:02:22,000 --> 04:02:25,000
*I look between Yue and Hifumi, quite at a loss.*

3159
04:02:25,000 --> 04:02:33,000
*It's true enough that I don't want to spend my life here, but I'm sure I'd hurt Yue's feelings if I told her that.*

3160
04:02:33,000 --> 04:02:40,000
*I did love her once. I think I still love her now, though my feelings have shifted somewhat as I grew older.*

3161
04:02:40,000 --> 04:02:46,000
*She's not exactly the same as the Yukie I remember, but that should go without saying.*

3162
04:02:46,000 --> 04:02:48,000
*Everything changes...*

3163
04:02:48,000 --> 04:02:52,000
*But, if I stay here, nothing will change. I'll be trapped.*

3164
04:02:52,000 --> 04:02:53,000
*What should I say?*

3165
04:02:53,000 --> 04:02:59,000
*...After thinking about all the things I've done with Yue, I know I can't leave her side.*

3166
04:02:59,000 --> 04:03:00,000
*Not now.*

3167
04:03:00,000 --> 04:03:06,000
*I don't want to break her heart, and that's why I finally succumb to her desires.*

3168
04:03:06,000 --> 04:03:09,000
*Her love is so earnest it's overwhelming.*

3169
04:03:09,000 --> 04:03:11,000
*I want to stay here.":

3170
04:03:11,000 --> 04:03:12,000
*I can't stay here.":

3171
04:03:12,000 --> 04:03:15,000
Hiroki: "I... think I want to stay here after all."

3172
04:03:15,000 --> 04:03:16,000
Hifumi: "What?"

3173
04:03:16,000 --> 04:03:19,000
*Hifumi stares at me, her eyes large as saucers.*

3174
04:03:19,000 --> 04:03:22,000
Hifumi: "Are you sure about that, Hiroki?"

3175
04:03:22,000 --> 04:03:24,000
Yue: "Why shouldn't he be sure?"

3176
04:03:24,000 --> 04:03:26,000
*Yue narrows her eyes.*

3177
04:03:26,000 --> 04:03:32,000
Yue: "He loves me as I love him. I was his very first girlfriend, and I intend to be his last."

3178
04:03:32,000 --> 04:03:41,000
Yue: "The rest of you cannot hope to compare to my charms. Hiroki's fate was sealed a decade prior, when our paths first crossed."

3179
04:03:41,000 --> 04:03:45,000
Yue: "We have been joined by the red string of fate ever since."

3180
04:03:45,000 --> 04:03:48,000
Yue: "In the end, this was inevitable."

3181
04:03:48,000 --> 04:03:57,000
*Yue crosses the room, until she's standing in front of me. Then, she winds her arms about my unresisting body and pulls me close.*

3182
04:03:57,000 --> 04:04:01,000
*Her dark tresses brush against my skin. They feel soft and silky.*

3183
04:04:01,000 --> 04:04:06,000
*When I inhale, I can smell her shampoo. It's sweet, but not cloying.*

3184
04:04:06,000 --> 04:04:09,000
*I could inhale this scent for the rest of my life.*

3185
04:04:09,000 --> 04:04:12,000
*I could embrace her for the rest of my life, too.*

3186
04:04:12,000 --> 04:04:19,000
*When I first came to the succubus realm I thought of resisting, but now I know that's impossible.*

3187
04:04:19,000 --> 04:04:23,000
*Yue claimed me completely last night, in both mind and body.*

3188
04:04:23,000 --> 04:04:26,000
*I can't forget the depths of her passion.*

3189
04:04:26,000 --> 04:04:29,000
*She's made her feelings abundantly clear.*

3190
04:04:29,000 --> 04:04:30,000
*She loves me, and...*

3191
04:04:30,000 --> 04:04:32,000
Hiroki: "I love you too, Yue."

3192
04:04:32,000 --> 04:04:36,000
Hiroki: "I left you once, but I can't afford to do that again."

3193
04:04:36,000 --> 04:04:42,000
Hiroki: "I've had a lot of dreams about you, and you've never been far from my mind."

3194
04:04:42,000 --> 04:04:46,000
Hiroki: "Now we're finally together again, I feel... at peace."

3195
04:04:46,000 --> 04:04:48,000
Hiroki: "I think this is right."

3196
04:04:48,000 --> 04:04:51,000
Hiroki: "This is how things should be."

3197
04:04:51,000 --> 04:04:53,000
Yue: "Of course it is, my dear."

3198
04:04:53,000 --> 04:04:59,000
*Yue runs her fingers through my hair, then tips my chin upwards and seals my mouth with a kiss.*

3199
04:04:59,000 --> 04:05:02,000
*Her teeth nibble against my lower lip, and I gasp.*

3200
04:05:02,000 --> 04:05:03,000
Yue: "Heh..."

3201
04:05:03,000 --> 04:05:05,000
*Yue uses this to her advantage.*

3202
04:05:05,000 --> 04:05:10,000
*She slides her tongue into my mouth and runs her hands across my skin.*

3203
04:05:10,000 --> 04:05:16,000
*Her scent grows stronger and stronger by the second, until I can hardly breathe for it.*

3204
04:05:16,000 --> 04:05:17,000
*My head is swimming.*

3205
04:05:17,000 --> 04:05:24,000
*The room begins to blur around me, and Hifumi with it. Now, Yue is the only person I can focus on.*

3206
04:05:24,000 --> 04:05:26,000
*My whole life revolves around her.*

3207
04:05:26,000 --> 04:05:29,000
*Like she said, maybe this was inevitabe.*

3208
04:05:29,000 --> 04:05:34,000
*I'd already given in last night, when I let her have her way with me.*

3209
04:05:34,000 --> 04:05:36,000
*I can't fight her advances.*

3210
04:05:36,000 --> 04:05:37,000
*Why would I want to?*

3211
04:05:37,000 --> 04:05:38,000
Hiroki: "Aaah..."

3212
04:05:38,000 --> 04:05:40,000
*This really does feel incredible.*

3213
04:05:40,000 --> 04:05:41,000
Yue: "You see?"

3214
04:05:41,000 --> 04:05:46,000
*Yue eventually breaks the kiss, then glares at Hifumi triumphantly.*

3215
04:05:46,000 --> 04:05:47,000
Yue: "Hiroki is mine."

3216
04:05:47,000 --> 04:05:52,000
Yue: "Though he resisted at first, I have since shown him the error of his ways."

3217
04:05:52,000 --> 04:05:56,000
Yue: "I have trained his body to love me, and only me."

3218
04:05:56,000 --> 04:06:01,000
Yue: "You could satifsy him once, but no longer. You are not enough."

3219
04:06:01,000 --> 04:06:05,000
Yue: "Now, I am the only person who can slake his thirst."

3220
04:06:05,000 --> 04:06:08,000
Yue: "As such, he ought to remain here with me."

3221
04:06:08,000 --> 04:06:12,000
Yue: "That is the only way he will ever find happiness."

3222
04:06:12,000 --> 04:06:14,000
Yue: "I will become his happiness."

3223
04:06:14,000 --> 04:06:17,000
Yue: "That is what fate has ordained."

3224
04:06:17,000 --> 04:06:21,000
*Yue sits on my lap, her arms wound tight about my shoulders.*

3225
04:06:21,000 --> 04:06:28,000
*I can feel her body pressing against me. She's soft and yielding; practically begging for my touch.*

3226
04:06:28,000 --> 04:06:34,000
*It's early in the morning, and I feel tired, but desire stirs in me all the same.*

3227
04:06:34,000 --> 04:06:35,000
*I want her.*

3228
04:06:35,000 --> 04:06:38,000
*I want her more than I've ever wanted anything.*

3229
04:06:38,000 --> 04:06:41,000
*I feel guilty about betraying the others, but...*

3230
04:06:41,000 --> 04:06:44,000
Yue: "Hiroki really had no say in the matter."

3231
04:06:44,000 --> 04:06:48,000
Yue: "A mere human can never hope to resist my allure."

3232
04:06:48,000 --> 04:06:52,000
Yue: "I am the queen of the succubus realm for a reason..."

3233
04:06:52,000 --> 04:06:55,000
Yue: "And, when I want something, I get it."

3234
04:06:55,000 --> 04:07:01,000
Yue: "Now Hiroki is here, with me, I shall never let him out of my sight ever again."

3235
04:07:01,000 --> 04:07:04,000
Yue: "He's all mine... forever... for all eternity."

3236
04:07:04,000 --> 04:07:06,000
Hiroki: "Yue... I'm sorry, but..."

3237
04:07:06,000 --> 04:07:12,000
Hiroki: "However much I like you, I don't think I can stay here. This isn't where I belong."

3238
04:07:12,000 --> 04:07:20,000
Hiroki: "I have a life already, and it's separate from yours. I have a job I'm proud of, and a family. I can't abandon them."

3239
04:07:20,000 --> 04:07:25,000
Hiroki: "I don't want to abandon Marina, Ayu, Cosmos, Hazel, or Hifumi either."

3240
04:07:25,000 --> 04:07:28,000
Hiroki: "Can't you let me go, please?"

3241
04:07:28,000 --> 04:07:29,000
Yue: "Nngh..."

3242
04:07:29,000 --> 04:07:35,000
*Yue takes a step back as though she's been slapped. Her eyes narrow, and her body stiffens.*

3243
04:07:35,000 --> 04:07:39,000
*For a few moments, I'm afraid she might burst into tears...*

3244
04:07:39,000 --> 04:07:41,000
*But then her expression hardens.*

3245
04:07:41,000 --> 04:07:50,000
Yue: "You're just saying that because Hifumi put the idea into your head. I'm sure I'll be able to talk you around soon enough."

3246
04:07:50,000 --> 04:07:54,000
Hiroki: "N-No, I'm not just saying that! I'm being earnest! I-"

3247
04:07:54,000 --> 04:08:00,000
Yue: "Am very confused. Tired, too. I don't think you even know what you're saying, Hiroki."

3248
04:08:00,000 --> 04:08:05,000
Yue: "You're not in your right state of mind, but don't worry. I still love you."

3249
04:08:05,000 --> 04:08:08,000
Yue: "I'll never, ever stop loving you."

3250
04:08:08,000 --> 04:08:09,000
Yue: "Now..."

3251
04:08:09,000 --> 04:08:10,000
*Yue turns.*

3252
04:08:10,000 --> 04:08:14,000
Yue: "I have some matters to attend to. If you'll excuse me."

3253
04:08:14,000 --> 04:08:20,000
*So saying, she exits the bedroom. The door falls shut behind her with a dull, heavy thud.*

3254
04:08:20,000 --> 04:08:23,000
*Now, it's just Hifumi and I in the bedroom.*

3255
04:08:23,000 --> 04:08:27,000
*She looks at me. I look at her. Then, we both sigh.*

3256
04:08:27,000 --> 04:08:31,000
Hifumi: "Oh dear me. I expected this would happen, but even so..."

3257
04:08:31,000 --> 04:08:34,000
Hifumi: "That didn't go very well at all!"

3258
04:08:34,000 --> 04:08:36,000
*I'm inclined to agree.*

3259
04:08:36,000 --> 04:08:39,000
*This situation is fast becoming untenable.*

3260
04:08:39,000 --> 04:08:41,000
*How will I ever escape now?*

3261
04:08:41,000 --> 04:08:48,000
Hifumi: "I'm sorry, Hiroki. I did try to talk her around, but she doesn't seem at all interested in listening."

3262
04:08:48,000 --> 04:08:51,000
Hifumi: "I just wish I could have been more help..."

3263
04:08:51,000 --> 04:08:53,000
Hiroki: "It's alright, Hifumi."

3264
04:08:53,000 --> 04:08:56,000
*I offer Hifumi a small, comforting smile.*

3265
04:08:56,000 --> 04:09:02,000
Hiroki: "I know you tried, and I do appreciate it. I couldn't be angry at you over that."

3266
04:09:02,000 --> 04:09:06,000
Hiroki: "You're not the one who's keeping me here, after all."

3267
04:09:06,000 --> 04:09:10,000
Hifumi: "Maybe not, but if I was better at negotiating..."

3268
04:09:10,000 --> 04:09:12,000
*Hifumi sighs, her head hanging.*

3269
04:09:12,000 --> 04:09:21,000
*There's no wind in the succubus realm that I can detect, and her inky black tresses which fall over her shoulders remain unstirred.*

3270
04:09:21,000 --> 04:09:28,000
*It's very quiet out here in the courtyard, save for the sound of running water from the fountain.*

3271
04:09:28,000 --> 04:09:34,000
*The flowers in their beds are motionless, as though they've been preserved in formaldehyde.*

3272
04:09:34,000 --> 04:09:38,000
*It's not really cold, but I find myself shivering all the same.*

3273
04:09:38,000 --> 04:09:40,000
*This place is pretty stifling.*

3274
04:09:40,000 --> 04:09:49,000
Hifumi: "Of all us succubi, I am the one whose opinion Lady Yue respects the most. If I cannot persuade her, I fear nobody can."

3275
04:09:49,000 --> 04:09:54,000
Hifumi: "She might have shot me down once, but I shall not give up here."

3276
04:09:54,000 --> 04:10:01,000
Hifumi: "I will continue to petition her about your release, day after day, until her resolve crumbles."

3277
04:10:01,000 --> 04:10:04,000
Hifumi: "You can count on me, Hiroki."

3278
04:10:04,000 --> 04:10:09,000
Hiroki: "Thanks, Hifumi. You're so dependable. I am a little worried, though..."

3279
04:10:09,000 --> 04:10:10,000
Hifumi: "About what?"

3280
04:10:10,000 --> 04:10:16,000
Hiroki: "I don't want Yue to lose her temper with you. She seems kind of... volatile..."

3281
04:10:16,000 --> 04:10:21,000
*And that might be an understatement, given how brutally she treated poor Marina.*

3282
04:10:21,000 --> 04:10:28,000
Hiroki: "If you got hurt for my behalf, I'd feel awful. I don't want that weighing on your shoulders."

3283
04:10:28,000 --> 04:10:42,000
*Hifumi's a famous actress. She's renowned across Japan for her smooth, beautiful face and her pale complexion. If Yue were to sully that - with a foot to the face, say - then Hifumi's career might be jeopardized!*

3284
04:10:42,000 --> 04:10:48,000
*I looked up to Hifumi when I was younger. She was one of my very first celebrity crushes.*

3285
04:10:48,000 --> 04:10:53,000
*The thought that a woman such as her wants to help me is humbling...*

3286
04:10:53,000 --> 04:10:58,000
*But I really don't want to be responsible for the potential fallout.*

3287
04:10:58,000 --> 04:11:00,000
*I'd feel awful if Hifumi got hurt.*

3288
04:11:00,000 --> 04:11:08,000
*Hifumi doesn't seem to share my concerns, though - or, if she does, she's able to mask them behind a small smile.*

3289
04:11:08,000 --> 04:11:10,000
Hifumi: "Don't worry, Hiroki."

3290
04:11:10,000 --> 04:11:20,000
Hifumi: "It is somewhat embarrassing to admit, but I am not doing this solely for your own sake. I have a bit of a vested interest in your safety, too."

3291
04:11:20,000 --> 04:11:26,000
Hifumi: "I like you a good deal, so I would very much like to continue being intimate with you."

3292
04:11:26,000 --> 04:11:33,000
Hifumi: "If we could no longer hold hands, or embrace, or kiss, then I fear I would be very upset."

3293
04:11:33,000 --> 04:11:41,000
Hifumi: "You make me happy, so I would like to continue being with you. That is why I want to argue on your behalf."

3294
04:11:41,000 --> 04:11:47,000
Hifumi: "As the only person here with enough authority to sway Lady Yue, I ought to do my best."

3295
04:11:47,000 --> 04:11:53,000
Hifumi: "Otherwise, I really might never be able to spend time with you like this!"

3296
04:11:53,000 --> 04:12:03,000
*Hifumi shifts a little on the bench so her thighs are brushing mine. A few strands of her hair brush against my cheek. It feels very gentle, like a caress.*

3297
04:12:03,000 --> 04:12:05,000
Hifumi: "Hey, Hiroki..."

3298
04:12:05,000 --> 04:12:08,000
*Hifumi blinks up at me, her eyes sensuous.*

3299
04:12:08,000 --> 04:12:12,000
Hifumi: "Would it be alright if I rested my head upon your lap?"

3300
04:12:12,000 --> 04:12:18,000
Hifumi: "I realize it may be something of an imposition, but all of a sudden, I feel so tired..."

3301
04:12:18,000 --> 04:12:29,000
*I don't have any personal issue with her suggestion, but I am worried Yue might find out. She seems to know everything that happens within the succubus realm.*

3302
04:12:29,000 --> 04:12:31,000
*I don't want Hifumi to get hurt...*

3303
04:12:31,000 --> 04:12:34,000
*But I don't want to be parted from her, either.*

3304
04:12:34,000 --> 04:12:35,000
*What should I say?*

3305
04:12:35,000 --> 04:12:38,000
*It should be fine for a little while.":

3306
04:12:38,000 --> 04:12:39,000
Hiroki: "It's fine."

3307
04:12:39,000 --> 04:12:41,000
*I offer Hifumi a smile.*

3308
04:12:41,000 --> 04:12:46,000
Hiroki: "You gave me your lap before. It's only fair that I return the favor."

3309
04:12:46,000 --> 04:12:48,000
Hifumi: "Oh, thank you...!"

3310
04:12:48,000 --> 04:12:50,000
*Hifumi's eyes light up.*

3311
04:12:50,000 --> 04:12:55,000
Hifumi: "You really are a darling. Then I shall take you up on your kindness."

3312
04:12:55,000 --> 04:13:02,000
Hifumi: "As much as I care for Yue, dealing with her for any protracted period of time can be exhausting."

3313
04:13:02,000 --> 04:13:04,000
Hifumi: "I need to rest."

3314
04:13:04,000 --> 04:13:13,000
*Sighing, Hifumi rests her head upon my lap. Her inky blank hair spills across my knees, while her violet eyes peer into my own.*

3315
04:13:13,000 --> 04:13:16,000
Hifumi: "Are you sure I am not too heavy?"

3316
04:13:16,000 --> 04:13:19,000
Hiroki: "I'm sure. I can scarcely even feel you!"

3317
04:13:19,000 --> 04:13:21,000
Hifumi: "Thank goodness... Ehehe..."

3318
04:13:21,000 --> 04:13:26,000
*Hifumi giggles, her chest rising and falling. Slowly, her eyelashes fall shut...*

3319
04:13:26,000 --> 04:13:30,000
*And, as they do so, a peculiar transformation occurs.*

3320
04:13:30,000 --> 04:13:34,000
*Hifumi's horns and wings melt away, as does her tail.*

3321
04:13:34,000 --> 04:13:40,000
*Her succubus attire fades, to be replaced with casual clothes I've not seen her wear before.*

3322
04:13:40,000 --> 04:13:44,000
*She's now clad, not her kimono, but a T-shirt and shorts.*

3323
04:13:44,000 --> 04:13:52,000
*Her hair is tied back in two messy pigtails, and a pair of red glasses are balanced upon the bridge of her nose.*

3324
04:13:52,000 --> 04:13:53,000
Hiroki: "Hifumi...?"

3325
04:13:53,000 --> 04:13:58,000
*I blink at her, perplexed, my fingers running through her tresses.*

3326
04:13:58,000 --> 04:14:00,000
Hiroki: "What's going on?"

3327
04:14:00,000 --> 04:14:01,000
Hifumi: "What? Oh..."

3328
04:14:01,000 --> 04:14:06,000
*Hifumi looks at herself. Her cheeks turn pink. Is she embarrassed?*

3329
04:14:06,000 --> 04:14:12,000
Hifumi: "I did not mean to show you such a side of myself. I felt so good, I let myself go!"

3330
04:14:12,000 --> 04:14:18,000
Hifumi: "All the stress drained from my body... and, before I knew it, this happened."

3331
04:14:18,000 --> 04:14:21,000
Hiroki: "Did you lose control of your magic?"

3332
04:14:21,000 --> 04:14:26,000
Hifumi: "It happens sometimes, when we succubi are particularly relaxed..."

3333
04:14:26,000 --> 04:14:28,000
Hiroki: "I see. Well..."

3334
04:14:28,000 --> 04:14:32,000
*I grin, my fingers still twining through Hifumi's jet black hair.*

3335
04:14:32,000 --> 04:14:37,000
Hiroki: "I'm very glad I can relax you, but your clothes are kind of curious."

3336
04:14:37,000 --> 04:14:40,000
Hiroki: "Do you often dress like that?"

3337
04:14:40,000 --> 04:14:42,000
Hifumi: "When I am at home, yes."

3338
04:14:42,000 --> 04:14:45,000
Hiroki: "I thought you preferred kimonos?"

3339
04:14:45,000 --> 04:14:52,000
Hifumi: "I do. Traditional Japanese attire is very elegant. Whenever I go out in public, I present myself thus."

3340
04:14:52,000 --> 04:15:02,000
Hifumi: "Kimonos are part of my image. As such, I cannot be seen without them. It would disappoint my fans if they saw me in a slovenly state..."

3341
04:15:02,000 --> 04:15:07,000
Hifumi: "But they can be cumbersome - particularly the long sleeves."

3342
04:15:07,000 --> 04:15:13,000
Hifumi: "When I am alone, I like to let my hair down, so to speak, and dress more casually."

3343
04:15:13,000 --> 04:15:19,000
Hifumi: "I feel at ease with you, so I must have summoned these clothes without thinking."

3344
04:15:19,000 --> 04:15:22,000
Hifumi: "I, um... hope you're not too disappointed?"

3345
04:15:22,000 --> 04:15:25,000
Hiroki: "Disappointed? Nah. I think you look cute."

3346
04:15:25,000 --> 04:15:26,000
Hifumi: "R-Really?"

3347
04:15:26,000 --> 04:15:32,000
Hiroki: "Yeah. It's pretty different from your usual look, but it still suits you."

3348
04:15:32,000 --> 04:15:36,000
Hiroki: "The traditional, elegant Hifumi is very nice..."

3349
04:15:36,000 --> 04:15:39,000
Hiroki: "But this is refreshing in its own right!"

3350
04:15:39,000 --> 04:15:42,000
Hifumi: "Wh-Why, thank you. I do appreciate it!"

3351
04:15:42,000 --> 04:15:46,000
Hifumi: "I am glad your opinion of me has not shifted, ehehe~"

3352
04:15:46,000 --> 04:15:52,000
Hiroki: "It'll take more than a casual tee and a pair of shorts to change my mind."

3353
04:15:52,000 --> 04:15:59,000
Hiroki: "I am wondering about the glasses, though. Do you really need them, or are they for decoration?"

3354
04:15:59,000 --> 04:16:05,000
Hifumi: "They are necessary, when I assume my human form. My eyesight is not the best."

3355
04:16:05,000 --> 04:16:11,000
Hifumi: "I usually wear contacts, but I don't like putting them in. They make me flinch..."

3356
04:16:11,000 --> 04:16:16,000
Hiroki: "As a fellow member of the four eyes club, I can relate to that."

3357
04:16:16,000 --> 04:16:19,000
Hifumi: "You have never worn contacts?"

3358
04:16:19,000 --> 04:16:24,000
Hiroki: "I have, but they feel kind of awkward. I've never gotten used to them."

3359
04:16:24,000 --> 04:16:31,000
Hiroki: "It's fine, though. I'm not a famous actress, so I don't have to worry about my appearance like you do."

3360
04:16:31,000 --> 04:16:35,000
Hifumi: "I think your glasses make you look very handsome..."

3361
04:16:35,000 --> 04:16:38,000
Hifumi: "And it is nice that we match!"

3362
04:16:38,000 --> 04:16:42,000
Hifumi: "It makes me feel even closer to you somehow, hehe~"

3363
04:16:42,000 --> 04:16:45,000
*Hifumi giggles, her cheeks still tinged pink.*

3364
04:16:45,000 --> 04:16:50,000
*Her eyes upturned, she then drops her voice to a whisper and says...*

3365
04:16:50,000 --> 04:16:52,000
Hifumi: "Hey, Hiroki..."

3366
04:16:52,000 --> 04:16:53,000
Hiroki: "Yeah?"

3367
04:16:53,000 --> 04:16:58,000
Hifumi: "I really do care about you. I don't want to say goodbye to you."

3368
04:16:58,000 --> 04:17:03,000
Hifumi: "That is why I will continue petitioning Yue. I cannot let this stand."

3369
04:17:03,000 --> 04:17:09,000
Hifumi: "You are my beloved. I have even dreamed of walking down the aisle with you some day..."

3370
04:17:09,000 --> 04:17:14,000
Hifumi: "But, if you stay here, my humble dreams will never come true."

3371
04:17:14,000 --> 04:17:17,000
Hifumi: "Ergo, I shall protect you. Do not worry."

3372
04:17:17,000 --> 04:17:22,000
Hifumi: "Things may seem bleak now, but I am sure they will be fine."

3373
04:17:22,000 --> 04:17:25,000
Hifumi: "We just need to stay together."

3374
04:17:25,000 --> 04:17:27,000
*We probably shouldn't.":

3375
04:17:27,000 --> 04:17:30,000
Hiroki: "Maybe that's not such a good idea."

3376
04:17:30,000 --> 04:17:36,000
Hiroki: "Yue's temper's short enough as it is, without us going out of our way to make it worse."

3377
04:17:36,000 --> 04:17:39,000
Hifumi: "Yes, I suppose you are right..."

3378
04:17:39,000 --> 04:17:41,000
*Hifumi exhales, disappointed.*

3379
04:17:41,000 --> 04:17:45,000
Hifumi: "You raise a sensible point, though it still stings."

3380
04:17:45,000 --> 04:17:48,000
Hifumi: "I would like to be even closer with you..."

3381
04:17:48,000 --> 04:17:52,000
Hifumi: "But I suppose this will have to do for now."

3382
04:17:52,000 --> 04:17:56,000
*Hifumi twines her arm through my own and squeezes it.*

3383
04:17:56,000 --> 04:17:58,000
Hifumi: "Tell me, Hiroki..."

3384
04:17:58,000 --> 04:18:01,000
Hifumi: "Would you be sad if we had to say goodbye?"

3385
04:18:01,000 --> 04:18:03,000
*She peers into my eyes.*

3386
04:18:03,000 --> 04:18:09,000
Hifumi: "I am certain I would be. In all my years, I have met no other man quite like you."

3387
04:18:09,000 --> 04:18:11,000
Hiroki: "Yeah... I would be sad."

3388
04:18:11,000 --> 04:18:16,000
Hiroki: "I like you a lot, Hifumi. I like Marina, Ayu, Cosmos, and Hazel too."

3389
04:18:16,000 --> 04:18:22,000
Hiroki: "I don't want to say goodbye to any of you - or to my old life. I have too much to lose."

3390
04:18:22,000 --> 04:18:24,000
Hifumi: "Then I shall do all I can."

3391
04:18:24,000 --> 04:18:27,000
Hifumi: "This might sound selfish, but..."

3392
04:18:27,000 --> 04:18:29,000
*Hifumi smiles bashfully.*

3393
04:18:29,000 --> 04:18:40,000
Hifumi: "After wearing so many beautiful, tailor-made wedding dresses in my latest movie, I began to wonder how it would feel to really walk down the aisle with somebody."

3394
04:18:40,000 --> 04:18:48,000
Hifumi: "I think it would be nice if I had a chance to be a bride - not just in a make-believe film, but in real life."

3395
04:18:48,000 --> 04:18:54,000
Hifumi: "The priest would read our vows, and then we would exchange rings and kiss..."

3396
04:18:54,000 --> 04:18:58,000
*Hifumi sighs dreamily and cups her cheek with one hand.*

3397
04:18:58,000 --> 04:19:00,000
Hifumi: "It all sounds so romantic!"

3398
04:19:00,000 --> 04:19:10,000
Hifumi: "Of course, it would have to take place in a church, with lovely wooden pews and stained glass windows. It would be a very traditional wedding!"

3399
04:19:10,000 --> 04:19:12,000
Hifumi: "I love things like that!"

3400
04:19:12,000 --> 04:19:16,000
Hiroki: "I figured. You're pretty by-the-books, Hifumi..."

3401
04:19:16,000 --> 04:19:20,000
Hiroki: "But would you really want to get married in a church?"

3402
04:19:20,000 --> 04:19:26,000
Hiroki: "I thought, based on your looks, you'd want something more quintessentially Japanese."

3403
04:19:26,000 --> 04:19:32,000
Hiroki: "We could get married at a shrine instead, and you could wear an elegant white kimono!"

3404
04:19:32,000 --> 04:19:36,000
Hifumi: "Ah, yes. That does sound appealing too, in its own way..."

3405
04:19:36,000 --> 04:19:48,000
Hifumi: "But I'd love to wear a very full dress with a frothy skirt, and a veil! I want a long, lacy veil, and I want to hold a bouquet of flowers, and I want to be with you...!"

3406
04:19:48,000 --> 04:19:55,000
*Hifumi pauses. She glances at her knees, her cheeks tinged pink, and presses her index fingers together.*

3407
04:19:55,000 --> 04:20:05,000
Hifumi: "It is rare for succubi to get married to human men, of course. Our natures are far too different. Such relationships tend to break down."

3408
04:20:05,000 --> 04:20:12,000
Hifumi: "Perhaps that is nothing more than a dream. I would not want to make my sisters jealous, after all."

3409
04:20:12,000 --> 04:20:17,000
Hifumi: "I fear it would be wicked of me to claim you so very completely..."

3410
04:20:17,000 --> 04:20:24,000
Hifumi: "But I can at least continue to call you my dear husband when we are alone together, can't I?"

3411
04:20:24,000 --> 04:20:27,000
Hiroki: "Of course you can. I don't mind at all."

3412
04:20:27,000 --> 04:20:38,000
*I have to wear a lot of different hats when I'm with these succubi. Being Hifumi's husband isn't too different from being Cosmos's boyfriend or Ayu's cameraman.*

3413
04:20:38,000 --> 04:20:45,000
Hifumi: "Oh, thank goodness. Thank you for understanding - and thank you for not shattering my dreams."

3414
04:20:45,000 --> 04:20:50,000
Hifumi: "You really are a nice man, Hiroki. I care about you very deeply."

3415
04:20:50,000 --> 04:20:53,000
Hifumi: "In fact, I believe I really do love you."

3416
04:20:53,000 --> 04:20:57,000
Hifumi: "That is why I will not stop fighting for your sake."

3417
04:20:57,000 --> 04:21:01,000
Hifumi: "I cannot let Lady Yue continue to come between us!"

3418
04:21:01,000 --> 04:21:07,000
*While I don't doubt Hifumi's earnestness, time begins to pass and nothing changes.*

3419
04:21:07,000 --> 04:21:13,000
*Hifumi continues to petition Yue every morning, but Yue remains cold and flinty to her demands.*

3420
04:21:13,000 --> 04:21:22,000
*Her expression never changes when Hifumi speaks to her, and after a minute or so she dismisses her advisor with a curt wave of one hand.*

3421
04:21:22,000 --> 04:21:29,000
*Hifumi tries her best (I know she does), but how can she sway Yue's heart when she refuses to listen?*

3422
04:21:29,000 --> 04:21:31,000
*It doesn't seem possible.*

3423
04:21:31,000 --> 04:21:44,000
*As for myself, I spend most of my time in my room. Yue often isn't there (she's too busy attending to her duties as a ruler), but when she is she's quick to pepper me with hungry, needy kisses.*

3424
04:21:44,000 --> 04:21:51,000
*These kisses often escalate into something more. Then, before I know it, the pair of us are entwined.*

3425
04:21:51,000 --> 04:22:00,000
*I don't dislike being intimate with Yue. She's beautiful, as I believe I've mentioned numerous times, and her love for me can't be denied.*

3426
04:22:00,000 --> 04:22:04,000
*Being with her always feels good in the moment, at least...*

3427
04:22:04,000 --> 04:22:10,000
*But when it's over, and Yue is fast asleep beside me, I always feel a vague sense of dread.*

3428
04:22:10,000 --> 04:22:18,000
*Every night, I fall asleep with the hope that the next day, surely, Hifumi will be able to penetrate Yue's defenses...*

3429
04:22:18,000 --> 04:22:19,000
*But nothing happens.*

3430
04:22:19,000 --> 04:22:25,000
*I'm always left disappointed - not with Hifumi, I hasten to add, but with this whole situation.*

3431
04:22:25,000 --> 04:22:33,000
*I don't know how long I've been in the succubus realm, but I think it must have been more than a week; maybe two.*

3432
04:22:33,000 --> 04:22:39,000
*I wonder how much time has passed in the human world during this time. Maybe a couple of days?*

3433
04:22:39,000 --> 04:22:47,000
*It's not a very long time by any stretch of the imagination, but if things continue like this I'll be in serious trouble.*

3434
04:22:47,000 --> 04:22:50,000
*I don't want to lose my job, or my apartment.*

3435
04:22:50,000 --> 04:22:57,000
*At least I'm not the only one trapped in here. Marina, Hifumi, Cosmos, Ayu, and Hazel are stuck, too.*

3436
04:22:57,000 --> 04:23:04,000
*They remain in this realm of eternal darkness, all five of them victims of Yue's capricious whims.*

3437
04:23:04,000 --> 04:23:10,000
*Hazel doesn't seem too upset by this arrangement, but the others are starting to become antsy.*

3438
04:23:10,000 --> 04:23:12,000
*Their careers are on the line.*

3439
04:23:12,000 --> 04:23:14,000
*We're all suffering together.*

3440
04:23:14,000 --> 04:23:21,000
*I talk to them occasionally, when I have the chance, but I'm afraid they'll be punished should Yue find out.*

3441
04:23:21,000 --> 04:23:32,000
*I've not seen her eavesdropping on our conversations just yet, but then again, I don't need to. Yue knows magic, and she could be spying on us from anywhere.*

3442
04:23:32,000 --> 04:23:34,000
*It's a troubling thought.*

3443
04:23:34,000 --> 04:23:37,000
*I feel tense and on edge pretty much all the time.*

3444
04:23:37,000 --> 04:23:40,000
*Now, I'm really starting to doubt my future.*

3445
04:23:40,000 --> 04:23:49,000
*I'm sure the other succubi will be released from here in due course, when Yue has had enough of tormenting them, but what about me?*

3446
04:23:49,000 --> 04:23:52,000
*She doesn't seem at all inclined to let me go.*

3447
04:23:52,000 --> 04:23:57,000
*In fact, with each passing day, she only grows clingier and more desperate.*

3448
04:23:57,000 --> 04:24:02,000
*She's utterly insatiable. I don't think she'll ever get bored of me.*

3449
04:24:02,000 --> 04:24:11,000
*Under other circumstances, the continued attention of a woman like Yue would be flattering, but I can't really enjoy it as I am now.*

3450
04:24:11,000 --> 04:24:17,000
*It's beginning to look distinctly possible that Hifumi will never be able to convince Yue.*

3451
04:24:17,000 --> 04:24:21,000
*Then, I'll be trapped here for the rest of my life.*

3452
04:24:21,000 --> 04:24:30,000
*A few days later, when I'm walking through one of the many identical hallways in Yue's palace, I run into Cosmos (though not literally).*

3453
04:24:30,000 --> 04:24:38,000
*Cosmos is wandering about aimlessly, her expression vague and unfixed. She reminds me of a lost and lonely cloud.*

3454
04:24:38,000 --> 04:24:39,000
Hiroki: "Hey, Cosmos."

3455
04:24:39,000 --> 04:24:42,000
*I wave at her in greeting, and she jumps.*

3456
04:24:42,000 --> 04:24:45,000
Cosmos: "Oh, Hiroki. I was looking for you."

3457
04:24:45,000 --> 04:24:46,000
Hiroki: "You were?"

3458
04:24:46,000 --> 04:24:47,000
Cosmos: "Mm..."

3459
04:24:47,000 --> 04:24:53,000
*Cosmos bites her lower lip and shifts from foot to foot. Her tail, meanwhile, quivers.*

3460
04:24:53,000 --> 04:25:00,000
*She doesn't look very happy-go-lucky. In fact, she looks the exact opposite of that. Sad-stop-unlucky?*

3461
04:25:00,000 --> 04:25:02,000
*...That's not a thing.*

3462
04:25:02,000 --> 04:25:13,000
*In any event, it upsets me to see Cosmos looking so down in the dumps. She's always been a bit of an airhead by nature, but she always smiles when she's with me.*

3463
04:25:13,000 --> 04:25:21,000
*All this time spent in the succubus realm, divorced from social media and all her fans, must be getting to her.*

3464
04:25:21,000 --> 04:25:23,000
Hiroki: "Is something the matter?"

3465
04:25:23,000 --> 04:25:27,000
Cosmos: "I'm... not really sure. It's all very confusing."

3466
04:25:27,000 --> 04:25:32,000
Hiroki: "Did something upset you? Are you thinking about your fans?"

3467
04:25:32,000 --> 04:25:40,000
Cosmos: "I always think about my fans. They've never been far from my mind, ever since Lady Yue summoned me here."

3468
04:25:40,000 --> 04:25:43,000
Cosmos: "Of course, I think about you more, Hiroki-"

3469
04:25:43,000 --> 04:25:44,000
Hiroki: "Of course."

3470
04:25:44,000 --> 04:25:53,000
Cosmos: "-but my fans are important, too. It is because of them that I've been able to continue manifesting in the human world for so long."

3471
04:25:53,000 --> 04:25:57,000
Cosmos: "Their support and their love means the world to me."

3472
04:25:57,000 --> 04:26:05,000
Cosmos: "I think of them kind of like my family. I know they all look out for me, and I'd hate to disappoint or upset them."

3473
04:26:05,000 --> 04:26:08,000
Cosmos: "They'll all be so worried about me!"

3474
04:26:08,000 --> 04:26:17,000
Hiroki: "That sounds like a lot of pressure to handle. Don't you ever worry about trying to make over three million people happy?"

3475
04:26:17,000 --> 04:26:23,000
Cosmos: "All the time. I always worry if I'm not good enough, or smart enough, or pretty enough."

3476
04:26:23,000 --> 04:26:32,000
Cosmos: "Ayu says I'm a skank. She tells me people are only interested in me because of my body. They don't care about me as a person."

3477
04:26:32,000 --> 04:26:34,000
Cosmos: "Maybe she is right..."

3478
04:26:34,000 --> 04:26:42,000
Cosmos: "But if these people like me at all, for any reason, I feel obliged to return their love with love of my own."

3479
04:26:42,000 --> 04:26:48,000
Cosmos: "I don't love them the same way I love you, Hiroki, but they're still precious to me."

3480
04:26:48,000 --> 04:26:50,000
Hiroki: "It's alright. I understand."

3481
04:26:50,000 --> 04:26:51,000
Cosmos: "You do?"

3482
04:26:51,000 --> 04:26:53,000
Hiroki: "Well... Not entirely."

3483
04:26:53,000 --> 04:26:59,000
*Though I'm a professional photographer, I'm not a famous RapidPound celeb like Cosmos is.*

3484
04:26:59,000 --> 04:27:09,000
*If I had to curate my social media presence carefully every day, selecting and discarding photos to upload at four hour intervals, I think I'd go mad.*

3485
04:27:09,000 --> 04:27:20,000
*It doesn't sound like a lot of work in theory, but I know Cosmos devotes her entire being to her fans. She's far more appreciative of them than Ayu is hers.*

3486
04:27:20,000 --> 04:27:25,000
*For all the lewd outfits she wears, Cosmos is very innocent in some regards.*

3487
04:27:25,000 --> 04:27:27,000
*Maybe that's why she's so popular?*

3488
04:27:27,000 --> 04:27:32,000
Cosmos: "I'm not worried about my fans right now, though. This isn't about me."

3489
04:27:32,000 --> 04:27:33,000
Hiroki: "It's not?"

3490
04:27:33,000 --> 04:27:34,000
Cosmos: "No."

3491
04:27:34,000 --> 04:27:38,000
*Cosmos shakes her head. Her stubby pigtail bounces.*

3492
04:27:38,000 --> 04:27:42,000
Cosmos: "I'm worried about Ayu. She's been acting kind of weird."

3493
04:27:42,000 --> 04:27:45,000
Hiroki: "Weirder than usual, you mean?"

3494
04:27:45,000 --> 04:27:47,000
Cosmos: "Do you think Ayu is weird?"

3495
04:27:47,000 --> 04:27:51,000
Cosmos: "I thought I was supposed to be the weird one."

3496
04:27:51,000 --> 04:27:56,000
Hiroki: "You're... unique, Cosmos. I don't think it's a bad thing, though."

3497
04:27:56,000 --> 04:28:04,000
Cosmos: "Ayu says we're all unique, but we're not necessarily unique in positive ways, and it's nothing to be proud of."

3498
04:28:04,000 --> 04:28:11,000
Hiroki: "Well, she's not necessarily wrong, but... Geez, that girl is prickly. She's like a cactus!"

3499
04:28:11,000 --> 04:28:19,000
Hiroki: "She acts so cute and sweet and bubbly, but deep down inside, she's so cynical. It's really not very cute."

3500
04:28:19,000 --> 04:28:21,000
Cosmos: "No, it's not."

3501
04:28:21,000 --> 04:28:27,000
Cosmos: "Ayu's pigtails are cute, and so is her face, but her personality is rotten."

3502
04:28:27,000 --> 04:28:36,000
Cosmos: "She puts on pretences all the time, and people can't see past it. Her fans think she really loves them. They're all deluded."

3503
04:28:36,000 --> 04:28:43,000
Hiroki: "And that's why Ayu's a certified weirdo. No healthy, normal person puts on a cute act like that 24/7."

3504
04:28:43,000 --> 04:28:44,000
Cosmos: "Heh..."

3505
04:28:44,000 --> 04:28:47,000
*Cosmos smiles at this. She looks amused.*

3506
04:28:47,000 --> 04:28:51,000
Cosmos: "When you put it like that, I guess Ayu is quite weird."

3507
04:28:51,000 --> 04:28:55,000
Cosmos: "I'll tell her that the next time she makes fun of me."

3508
04:28:55,000 --> 04:28:58,000
Hiroki: "Has she been making fun of you a lot?"

3509
04:28:58,000 --> 04:29:05,000
Cosmos: "All the time. She's very confrontational, but she's been even snappier than normal lately."

3510
04:29:05,000 --> 04:29:11,000
Cosmos: "I think it might be because she hasn't been able to spend enough time with you."

3511
04:29:11,000 --> 04:29:13,000
Hiroki: "Do you really think that?"

3512
04:29:13,000 --> 04:29:18,000
Cosmos: "Mm. I know that she likes you, though she doesn't admit to it."

3513
04:29:18,000 --> 04:29:26,000
Cosmos: "When she's with you, she actually smiles, and it looks like she means it. She isn't just putting on an act."

3514
04:29:26,000 --> 04:29:29,000
Cosmos: "You make her really happy, Hiroki."

3515
04:29:29,000 --> 04:29:35,000
Cosmos: "If Ayu is acidic, you must be alkaline. You balance her out, so she can act neutral."

3516
04:29:35,000 --> 04:29:37,000
Hiroki: "Huh... Is that so..."

3517
04:29:37,000 --> 04:29:41,000
*That's a nice simile. I wouldn't have expected it from her.*

3518
04:29:41,000 --> 04:29:45,000
*To be frank, I'm surprised she even knows what an alkali is.*

3519
04:29:45,000 --> 04:29:53,000
*She doesn't seem very well-versed in the ways of science, but her knowledge might run deeper than it initially appears.*

3520
04:29:53,000 --> 04:29:55,000
*She is a fan of Lynch, after all.*

3521
04:29:55,000 --> 04:29:57,000
*Cosmos is full of surprises.*

3522
04:29:57,000 --> 04:30:04,000
Cosmos: "Since we haven't been able to spend much time together, Ayu's temper is starting to boil over."

3523
04:30:04,000 --> 04:30:10,000
Cosmos: "She shouts at me for the smallest things, and she looks so grumpy all the time."

3524
04:30:10,000 --> 04:30:14,000
Cosmos: "She's so angry, she even started to rant at Lady Yue!"

3525
04:30:14,000 --> 04:30:18,000
Hiroki: "Huh? Did she really try to pick a fight with Yue?"

3526
04:30:18,000 --> 04:30:29,000
Cosmos: "She did. She's still doing it. I walked past the throne room a few minutes ago, and I overheard Ayu. She was shouting at Lady Yue, and she sounded very upset!"

3527
04:30:29,000 --> 04:30:38,000
Cosmos: "It was very surprising. Ayu says horrible things about people, but she's a coward, so she can only ever do it behind their backs."

3528
04:30:38,000 --> 04:30:48,000
Cosmos: "She's always been deferential towards Lady Yue. She sucks up to her almost as much as Hazel does, though I know she doesn't really like her."

3529
04:30:48,000 --> 04:30:52,000
Cosmos: "I've never heard Ayu shout at Lady Yue before."

3530
04:30:52,000 --> 04:30:54,000
Cosmos: "It's... scary."

3531
04:30:54,000 --> 04:30:55,000
Hiroki: "Ayu is?"

3532
04:30:55,000 --> 04:30:57,000
Cosmos: "No, Ayu is never scary."

3533
04:30:57,000 --> 04:30:59,000
*Cosmos shakes her head.*

3534
04:30:59,000 --> 04:31:06,000
Cosmos: "She has a short temper and she isn't very nice, but she's stupid so she doesn't scare me."

3535
04:31:06,000 --> 04:31:12,000
Cosmos: "She's a famous idol, but she has even fewer RapidPound followers than I do!"

3536
04:31:12,000 --> 04:31:13,000
*Oof...*

3537
04:31:13,000 --> 04:31:19,000
*That's a pretty harsh assessment of Ayu's character - not that it's entirely inaccurate.*

3538
04:31:19,000 --> 04:31:27,000
*I don't think Ayu's stupid myself, per se, but her self-important rages always tend to splutter out as quick as they come.*

3539
04:31:27,000 --> 04:31:32,000
*Her mood swings about wildly, but she's actually quite simple to placate.*

3540
04:31:32,000 --> 04:31:34,000
*You just need to flatter her ego.*

3541
04:31:34,000 --> 04:31:38,000
Cosmos: "Lady Yue is the scary one. She's unpredictable."

3542
04:31:38,000 --> 04:31:45,000
Cosmos: "I'm afraid she'll punish Ayu for this. She might cut off all her hair, or ban her from being an idol."

3543
04:31:45,000 --> 04:31:55,000
Cosmos: "If that happened, it would break Ayu's heart. She's worked really, really hard to be an idol. If she lost that, I'm afraid she'd never recover."

3544
04:31:55,000 --> 04:32:05,000
Cosmos: "I wanted to go into the throne room and stop her, but I was afraid Lady Yue would punish me, too. That's why I was looking for Hifumi - or you."

3545
04:32:05,000 --> 04:32:08,000
*Cosmos looks at me imploringly, her eyes large.*

3546
04:32:08,000 --> 04:32:13,000
Cosmos: "Won't you go into the throne room and stop Ayu before it's too late?"

3547
04:32:13,000 --> 04:32:20,000
Cosmos: "Lady Yue listens to you. If you tell her to go easy on Ayu, she might show some leniency."

3548
04:32:20,000 --> 04:32:22,000
Cosmos: "Please, Hiroki...!"

3549
04:32:22,000 --> 04:32:25,000
*Cosmos sounds genuinely troubled by all this.*

3550
04:32:25,000 --> 04:32:36,000
*I know her relationship with Ayu is a rocky one, but I think they're friends, of a sort. They're quite close in age, and they seem to hang out together a lot.*

3551
04:32:36,000 --> 04:32:40,000
*Ayu's certainly closer to Cosmos than she is Marina and Hifumi.*

3552
04:32:40,000 --> 04:32:52,000
*Ayu and Cosmos bicker all the time, but I think that might be proof of their close relationship. Though they're not blood-related, they really do act like squabbling sisters.*

3553
04:32:52,000 --> 04:32:53,000
*I smile.*

3554
04:32:53,000 --> 04:32:56,000
Hiroki: "You care about Ayu a lot, don't you?"

3555
04:32:56,000 --> 04:33:00,000
Cosmos: "I do, yes - and I'm sure she cares about me, too."

3556
04:33:00,000 --> 04:33:08,000
Cosmos: "We don't always get along, but she's one of the only succubi who ever speaks to me. That counts for a lot, I think."

3557
04:33:08,000 --> 04:33:16,000
Cosmos: "She can be cold and biting, but she can be kind too. She annoys me, but I still like her. I don't want her to be sad."

3558
04:33:16,000 --> 04:33:25,000
Cosmos: "Ayu might not seem like it, but she's very delicate. She hides behind her anger because, if she didn't, she might cry instead."

3559
04:33:25,000 --> 04:33:28,000
Cosmos: "I don't want Ayu to shed any tears!"

3560
04:33:28,000 --> 04:33:32,000
Hiroki: "Then I'll try to have a word with her. Yue, too."

3561
04:33:32,000 --> 04:33:35,000
Cosmos: "Y-You would? You don't mind?"

3562
04:33:35,000 --> 04:33:36,000
Hiroki: "Not at all."

3563
04:33:36,000 --> 04:33:37,000
*I smile at Cosmos.*

3564
04:33:37,000 --> 04:33:47,000
Hiroki: "I love all of you equally. That includes Ayu, whether she wishes it or not. She is a bit of a brat, but I don't want to see her cry, either."

3565
04:33:47,000 --> 04:33:51,000
Hiroki: "I'm her cameraman, and I won't ever abandon her."

3566
04:33:51,000 --> 04:33:59,000
*I dash to the throne room in double-quick time. The door is shut, but I can still hear Ayu's voice filtering into the hall.*

3567
04:33:59,000 --> 04:34:02,000
Ayu: "...not right! Lady Yue, please...!"

3568
04:34:02,000 --> 04:34:07,000
*I can't hear everything she's saying, but she certainly sounds impassioned.*

3569
04:34:07,000 --> 04:34:15,000
*She must be shouting quite loudly, using her indomitable idol lungs to her advantage, for her voice to carry so far.*

3570
04:34:15,000 --> 04:34:17,000
*I wonder what she's shouting about?*

3571
04:34:17,000 --> 04:34:20,000
*I guess there's only one way to find out.*

3572
04:34:20,000 --> 04:34:24,000
*I push open the door, stepping inside the throne room...*

3573
04:34:24,000 --> 04:34:25,000
Hiroki: "Ah..."

3574
04:34:25,000 --> 04:34:28,000
*...and I'm greeted by quite the sight.*

3575
04:34:28,000 --> 04:34:33,000
*Ayu is kneeling on the ground before Yue, her arms pressed against the floor.*

3576
04:34:33,000 --> 04:34:42,000
*Her head is bent low, her orange pigtails cascading down the smooth plane of her back, and her bared toes are curled beneath her rear.*

3577
04:34:42,000 --> 04:34:50,000
*Yue, meanwhile, is sitting upon her throne. She looks down at Ayu with pursed lips, as one might observe a sewer rat.*

3578
04:34:50,000 --> 04:34:57,000
*She must have seen me enter, because her eyes flick to me for a brief moment, but she doesn't greet me.*

3579
04:34:57,000 --> 04:35:02,000
*Maybe she doesn't want to interrupt whatever it is that's going on.*

3580
04:35:02,000 --> 04:35:11,000
*Ayu, for her part, hasn't noticed me at all. She continues to implore Lady Yue, her voice raising in pitch until it sounds high and breathy.*

3581
04:35:11,000 --> 04:35:16,000
Ayu: "Please, Lady Yue, I'm begging you! You simply have to let him go!"

3582
04:35:16,000 --> 04:35:26,000
*Ayu's voice is certainly impassioned, but I don't think she sounds angry. Her tone is, instead, deeply reverent - though it's bordering on hysterical.*

3583
04:35:26,000 --> 04:35:28,000
*Maybe Cosmos got the wrong idea.*

3584
04:35:28,000 --> 04:35:33,000
*Ayu isn't arguing with Yue. She's pleading with her - but not for her sake.*

3585
04:35:33,000 --> 04:35:37,000
*Judging by the sounds of it, she's trying to argue on my behalf.*

3586
04:35:37,000 --> 04:35:38,000
Yue: "Goodness me..."

3587
04:35:38,000 --> 04:35:40,000
*Yue sighs and shakes her head.*

3588
04:35:40,000 --> 04:35:49,000
Yue: "I fail to see what you think you can accomplish with this foolishness, Ayu. Have I not made my feelings quite plain enough already?"

3589
04:35:49,000 --> 04:35:53,000
Yue: "Hiroki is mine, and I shall do with him as I will."

3590
04:35:53,000 --> 04:35:58,000
Yue: "If I want him to stay here then he shall. That is the end of the matter."

3591
04:35:58,000 --> 04:35:59,000
Ayu: "But Yue...!"

3592
04:35:59,000 --> 04:36:03,000
*Ayu stares up at Yue, her hair spiralling across the floor.*

3593
04:36:03,000 --> 04:36:08,000
Ayu: "Please, reconsider! Hiroki might be a mere human, but he is not yours!"

3594
04:36:08,000 --> 04:36:17,000
Ayu: "As a sentient being, he should be allowed to make his own decisions, even if his IQ is not that much higher than a goldfish's!"

3595
04:36:17,000 --> 04:36:19,000
*Ouch. That's not very nice...*

3596
04:36:19,000 --> 04:36:26,000
*I appreciate that Ayu's trying to help me, but does she really have to make digs at my intelligence like that?*

3597
04:36:26,000 --> 04:36:29,000
*I'm far, far smarter than any aquatic life form...*

3598
04:36:29,000 --> 04:36:39,000
*Apart from maybe octopi. They're meant to be pretty smart. They can even unscrew jars with their tentacles. Sometimes even I struggle with that.*

3599
04:36:39,000 --> 04:36:48,000
Ayu: "I don't think Hiroki wishes to stay here much longer. He looks so despondent whenever I see him, it makes my heart break!"

3600
04:36:48,000 --> 04:36:59,000
Ayu: "He is still the same Hiroki I know, more or less, but if he is forced to remain here much longer he might lose that spark of his which makes him special!"

3601
04:36:59,000 --> 04:37:05,000
Ayu: "If you continue to treat him like this, he'll turn into nothing more than your doll!"

3602
04:37:05,000 --> 04:37:09,000
Yue: "Nonsense. He is quite happy and content with me."

3603
04:37:09,000 --> 04:37:16,000
Yue: "I fail to see why he should be otherwise - unless you are suggesting he loves you more than he loves me?"

3604
04:37:16,000 --> 04:37:21,000
Ayu: "N-No, milady! That isn't what I'm trying to say! Perish the thought!"

3605
04:37:21,000 --> 04:37:22,000
Yue: "Good."

3606
04:37:22,000 --> 04:37:26,000
*Yue leans back in her throne, her pale eyes cold and icy.*

3607
04:37:26,000 --> 04:37:35,000
Yue: "If that is what you were implying, Ayu, I would have to punish you for treason. I could humiliate you in ways you can only imagine."

3608
04:37:35,000 --> 04:37:36,000
Ayu: "Ggk..."

3609
04:37:36,000 --> 04:37:44,000
*Ayu tenses, but she doesn't back away. She remains kneeling upon the floor, her rear raised in the air, toes curled.*

3610
04:37:44,000 --> 04:37:51,000
*The floor in the throne room feels very sturdy underfoot. I think it's made of some sort of shiny marble.*

3611
04:37:51,000 --> 04:37:58,000
*It must be hard on Ayu's legs to kneel like this for quite so long, but her determination doesn't waver.*

3612
04:37:58,000 --> 04:38:04,000
*She must be accustomed to grueling tests of endurance like this. She is an idol, after all.*

3613
04:38:04,000 --> 04:38:11,000
*Some of her concerts last two hours, and she sings and dances through dozens upon dozens of songs.*

3614
04:38:11,000 --> 04:38:17,000
*It's easy to write Ayu off as being shrill and annoying, but she's an incredibly hard worker.*

3615
04:38:17,000 --> 04:38:19,000
*I think she's passionate, too.*

3616
04:38:19,000 --> 04:38:23,000
*Is she hoping some of that passion will reach Yue...?*

3617
04:38:23,000 --> 04:38:32,000
Ayu: "F-Forgive me my impertinence, milady, for I am young and inexperienced, but I do think it would be for the best if you let Hiroki go."

3618
04:38:32,000 --> 04:38:35,000
Ayu: "You cannot keep him trapped here!"

3619
04:38:35,000 --> 04:38:38,000
Yue: "He is not trapped. He wishes to be here."

3620
04:38:38,000 --> 04:38:40,000
Ayu: "Did he tell you that?"

3621
04:38:40,000 --> 04:38:45,000
Yue: "Well, no, not as such... but he will in due course. I am certain of that."

3622
04:38:45,000 --> 04:38:55,000
Yue: "Now, this conversation is very tedious. I shall not change my mind on the matter, so you needn't bow before me further. It's unpleasant."

3623
04:38:55,000 --> 04:38:57,000
*Yue wrinkles her nose.*

3624
04:38:57,000 --> 04:39:01,000
Yue: "Get to your feet and get yourself out of my sight."

3625
04:39:01,000 --> 04:39:12,000
Yue: "I was going to let you succubi return to the human world tomorrow morn - Marina included - but if you continue to argue with me I shall reconsider pardoning you."

3626
04:39:12,000 --> 04:39:15,000
Ayu: "That is very generous of you, Lady Yue-"

3627
04:39:15,000 --> 04:39:20,000
Yue: "Indeed, it is. I am overflowing with the milk of human kindness."

3628
04:39:20,000 --> 04:39:24,000
Ayu: "-b-but what about Hiroki? Won't you let him go, too?"

3629
04:39:24,000 --> 04:39:29,000
Yue: "We have discussed this already. Were you not paying attention?"

3630
04:39:29,000 --> 04:39:31,000
Yue: "Hiroki is going nowhere."

3631
04:39:31,000 --> 04:39:43,000
Yue: "If I let him leave this place, it will be harder for me to keep an eye on things, and who is to say what he might get up to with the rest of you succubi running about?"

3632
04:39:43,000 --> 04:39:46,000
Yue: "It is simply out of the question."

3633
04:39:46,000 --> 04:39:54,000
Yue: "He must remain here, by my side, forever. That is the only way I can ensure he will remain true and loyal."

3634
04:39:54,000 --> 04:39:58,000
Yue: "I love him, so I wish to keep him all to myself."

3635
04:39:58,000 --> 04:40:02,000
Ayu: "And I understand that!!! I understand it perfectly!!!"

3636
04:40:02,000 --> 04:40:05,000
*Ayu cries, her voice wavering with emotion.*

3637
04:40:05,000 --> 04:40:07,000
Ayu: "After all, I love Hiroki, too!"

3638
04:40:07,000 --> 04:40:08,000
Hiroki: "Ah..."

3639
04:40:08,000 --> 04:40:10,000
*I stare at Ayu, my eyes wide.*

3640
04:40:10,000 --> 04:40:11,000
*She... loves me...?*

3641
04:40:11,000 --> 04:40:22,000
*I had assumed, of course, but Ayu isn't the sort of girl to simply say these things. She always hides her real emotions behind layers upon layers of obfuscation.*

3642
04:40:22,000 --> 04:40:26,000
*She's the least straight-forward of all the succubi I know...*

3643
04:40:26,000 --> 04:40:30,000
*But that only makes her declaration of love sweeter.*

3644
04:40:30,000 --> 04:40:33,000
*I knew it. Ayu's a total softie at heart!*

3645
04:40:33,000 --> 04:40:34,000
*She's so cute!*

3646
04:40:34,000 --> 04:40:41,000
Ayu: "I know I say a lot of mean things to Hiroki, but I don't really mean them. It's just... Well..."

3647
04:40:41,000 --> 04:40:51,000
Ayu: "Being in love is embarrassing, a-and as an idol I should know better. If the tabloids found out about my feelings for him, I'd be ruined!"

3648
04:40:51,000 --> 04:40:55,000
Ayu: "I tried to keep my distance, but it proved to be impossible!"

3649
04:40:55,000 --> 04:41:04,000
Ayu: "He might not wear the best clothes, and his haircut's a bit old-fashioned and outdated, and he's not even that good-looking-"

3650
04:41:04,000 --> 04:41:10,000
*Now, these are some pretty harsh criticisms, coming from a girl who supposedly "loves" me.*

3651
04:41:10,000 --> 04:41:16,000
*If this is what Ayu's "love" is like, I shudder to think how acrimonious her hate must be.*

3652
04:41:16,000 --> 04:41:20,000
Ayu: "-but I love him all the same! I can't help it!"

3653
04:41:20,000 --> 04:41:29,000
Ayu: "I love him because he's sweet and he's kind and he's understanding, and he seems to know what I really mean even if I can't say it!"

3654
04:41:29,000 --> 04:41:36,000
Ayu: "I've been intolerably rude to him, but he's always put up with me. He's never lost his temper."

3655
04:41:36,000 --> 04:41:38,000
Ayu: "Plus, he smells really good..."

3656
04:41:38,000 --> 04:41:41,000
Ayu: "I doubt I'd ever find another guy like him."

3657
04:41:41,000 --> 04:41:53,000
Ayu: "I've not known him half as long as you have, Lady Yue, but he's already become a huge part of my life. Spending time with him makes me happy, so I understand why you love him."

3658
04:41:53,000 --> 04:42:03,000
Ayu: "If I were in your position, I would be horribly jealous, too. I would hate myself, and any other succubus, brazen enough to try and steal him from me."

3659
04:42:03,000 --> 04:42:11,000
Ayu: "In fact, I am jealous of the others! Seeing Marina and Cosmos and the others sidle up to him is so upsetting!"

3660
04:42:11,000 --> 04:42:15,000
Ayu: "I'm a selfish girl at heart, and I want him all for myself!"

3661
04:42:15,000 --> 04:42:22,000
Ayu: "It hurts me to see him acting so familiar with the other women, so I understand your feelings perfectly!"

3662
04:42:22,000 --> 04:42:27,000
Ayu: "I might be your underling, but I think the pair of us are very alike!"

3663
04:42:27,000 --> 04:42:31,000
Yue: "Hoh...? So, you understand, do you? Then, in that case..."

3664
04:42:31,000 --> 04:42:32,000
*Yue's eyes narrow.*

3665
04:42:32,000 --> 04:42:37,000
Yue: "Why do you persist in trying to take him from me? Do you want to hurt me?"

3666
04:42:37,000 --> 04:42:43,000
Ayu: "N-No, I don't! I don't want to hurt you, or anybody else! I want us all to be happy..."

3667
04:42:43,000 --> 04:42:47,000
Ayu: "And that's why I think Marina and Hifumi are right!"

3668
04:42:47,000 --> 04:42:55,000
Ayu: "No matter how much we might love Hiroki, we all ought to learn how to share! That's the only way to satisfy all of us!"

3669
04:42:55,000 --> 04:43:04,000
Ayu: "Please remember that we are succubi! Monogamy isn't in our nature! We shouldn't horde desirable humans for ourselves! That's not right!"

3670
04:43:04,000 --> 04:43:08,000
Ayu: "It might hurt initially, and we might feel jealous..."

3671
04:43:08,000 --> 04:43:13,000
Ayu: "But that's no reason to deprive everybody else of what they want!"

3672
04:43:13,000 --> 04:43:23,000
Ayu: "I love Hiroki, but I love my sisters too - and I even love you! That being the case, why can't we love one another? Wouldn't that be for the best!"

3673
04:43:23,000 --> 04:43:28,000
*Yue's face, which is already pale, turns whiter still during Ayu's speech.*

3674
04:43:28,000 --> 04:43:29,000
Yue: "Why, you..."

3675
04:43:29,000 --> 04:43:35,000
*Her gloved hands clench about the armrests of her throne. Then, she rises to her feet.*

3676
04:43:35,000 --> 04:43:43,000
*She crosses the marble floor, her heeled shoes clacking. The sound echoes throughout the high-ceilinged room ominously.*

3677
04:43:43,000 --> 04:43:44,000
*Ayu quivers.*

3678
04:43:44,000 --> 04:43:48,000
Yue: "How dare you tell me what's for the best. How dare you?"

3679
04:43:48,000 --> 04:43:52,000
Yue: "Why, I have half a mind to turn you into a frog...!"

3680
04:43:52,000 --> 04:43:59,000
*Ayu trembles, but still she doesn't back down. She stares at Yue, hands clenched together, and cries...*

3681
04:43:59,000 --> 04:44:05,000
Ayu: "Fine then! Do it! Do whatever you want with me, but that won't make Hiroki happy!"

3682
04:44:05,000 --> 04:44:11,000
Yue: "Nobody can make Hiroki happier than I! You take that back! Still your traitorous tongue!"

3683
04:44:11,000 --> 04:44:20,000
Ayu: "No, I won't! I've spent my whole life hiding my true feelings, but I can't be silent when it comes to this! It's far too important!"

3684
04:44:20,000 --> 04:44:24,000
Ayu: "I'm being honest for once, without any pretences..."

3685
04:44:24,000 --> 04:44:32,000
Ayu: "And I want you to know that Hiroki will never be happy if you keep him here against his will! That is not what love is!"

3686
04:44:32,000 --> 04:44:38,000
Ayu: "If you want him to return your feelings fully, you need to let him make his own decisions!"

3687
04:44:38,000 --> 04:44:43,000
Ayu: "You have to free him! Free all of us, and then learn how to share!"

3688
04:44:43,000 --> 04:44:51,000
Ayu: "You're not a little child any more, and you can't always have your own way! Sometimes, you have to make concessions!"

3689
04:44:51,000 --> 04:44:54,000
Yue: "Well, I never! S-Such impudence...!"

3690
04:44:54,000 --> 04:45:03,000
*Yue raises her arm. I think she means to strike Ayu. I think Ayu does, too, because she squeezes her eyes shut and looks down at the floor.*

3691
04:45:03,000 --> 04:45:07,000
*Time passes. It stretches and elongates, swirling around me.*

3692
04:45:07,000 --> 04:45:11,000
*The atmosphere is tense. I can feel sweat beading on my palms.*

3693
04:45:11,000 --> 04:45:16,000
*I wait, breath bated, for Yue's palm to connect with Ayu's cheek, but...*

3694
04:45:16,000 --> 04:45:17,000
Yue: "..."

3695
04:45:17,000 --> 04:45:18,000
*Yue pauses.*

3696
04:45:18,000 --> 04:45:20,000
*It looks like she's reconsidering.*

3697
04:45:20,000 --> 04:45:24,000
*Then, with a heavy sigh, Yue finally lets her arm drop.*

3698
04:45:24,000 --> 04:45:29,000
Yue: "...I did not want to admit it, but perhaps you do have a point."

3699
04:45:29,000 --> 04:45:30,000
Ayu: "M-My lady...!"

3700
04:45:30,000 --> 04:45:35,000
*Ayu's eyes snap open. She stares at Yue, hands clasped at her front.*

3701
04:45:35,000 --> 04:45:38,000
Ayu: "A-Are you willing to consider what I said?!"

3702
04:45:38,000 --> 04:45:41,000
Yue: "I will give it some thought, yes."

3703
04:45:41,000 --> 04:45:50,000
Yue: "You might think me a tyrant, but I am not completely unreasonable. I don't want to make Hiroki unhappy, and I have worried..."

3704
04:45:50,000 --> 04:45:55,000
*Yue glances at me over Ayu's shoulder. Our eyes meet, and her own soften.*

3705
04:45:55,000 --> 04:45:59,000
Yue: "Do you truly want to leave this place, Hiroki?"

3706
04:45:59,000 --> 04:46:00,000
Ayu: "E-Eh? Hiroki?!"

3707
04:46:00,000 --> 04:46:12,000
*Ayu whips about, her long pigtails almost striking her in her face. Her stricken expression is so exaggerated I find myself snorting, despite the severity of the situation.*

3708
04:46:12,000 --> 04:46:15,000
Hiroki: "Hey, Ayu. It's good to see you."

3709
04:46:15,000 --> 04:46:17,000
Ayu: "Wh-What? Why, you..."

3710
04:46:17,000 --> 04:46:19,000
*Ayu grits her teeth together.*

3711
04:46:19,000 --> 04:46:22,000
Ayu: "How long have you been standing here?!"

3712
04:46:22,000 --> 04:46:23,000
Hiroki: "Long enough."

3713
04:46:23,000 --> 04:46:26,000
Ayu: "Then, um... D-Did you hear everything I said?"

3714
04:46:26,000 --> 04:46:32,000
*Now, this is an interesting sight. I've never seen Ayu blush quite this much before.*

3715
04:46:32,000 --> 04:46:38,000
*Part of me wants to spare her feelings, but another part of me feels like having a bit of fun.*

3716
04:46:38,000 --> 04:46:39,000
*What should I say?*

3717
04:46:39,000 --> 04:46:41,000
*Spare Ayu's feelings.":

3718
04:46:41,000 --> 04:46:45,000
*Teasing her sounds like a very attractive prospect...*

3719
04:46:45,000 --> 04:46:49,000
*But, after some deliberation, I decide to go easy on her.*

3720
04:46:49,000 --> 04:46:51,000
*I don't want to upset her.*

3721
04:46:51,000 --> 04:46:54,000
Hiroki: "Don't worry. I didn't hear all that much."

3722
04:46:54,000 --> 04:46:57,000
Hiroki: "Your secrets are still safe."

3723
04:46:57,000 --> 04:46:59,000
Ayu: "Really? Thank goodness..."

3724
04:46:59,000 --> 04:47:00,000
*Ayu sighs, relieved.*

3725
04:47:00,000 --> 04:47:03,000
Ayu: "I said some pretty sappy stuff back there."

3726
04:47:03,000 --> 04:47:10,000
Ayu: "If you'd heard all that, I'd have no choice but to quit my job as an idol and live on an alpaca farm!"

3727
04:47:10,000 --> 04:47:12,000
Hiroki: "Why an alpaca farm?"

3728
04:47:12,000 --> 04:47:15,000
Ayu: "Why not? Alpacas are cute and fluffy!"

3729
04:47:15,000 --> 04:47:18,000
Hiroki: "I guess you've got a point..."

3730
04:47:18,000 --> 04:47:22,000
*Though how idols are related to alpacas, I couldn't say.*

3731
04:47:22,000 --> 04:47:23,000
*Tease Ayu.":

3732
04:47:23,000 --> 04:47:26,000
*After some deliberation, my inner sadist wins out.*

3733
04:47:26,000 --> 04:47:33,000
*I'm sorry, Ayu! After being toyed with all these sultry succubi, sometimes I want to do the toying myself!*

3734
04:47:33,000 --> 04:47:34,000
*I smirk, then say...*

3735
04:47:34,000 --> 04:47:40,000
Hiroki: "You mean, the stuff about you loving me? Yeah, I heard it. It was very sweet."

3736
04:47:40,000 --> 04:47:45,000
Hiroki: "I didn't know you felt so strongly about me, Ayu. I'm flattered."

3737
04:47:45,000 --> 04:47:46,000
Ayu: "U-Urgh...!"

3738
04:47:46,000 --> 04:47:51,000
*Ayu winds her arms about her stomach, her expression twisting in agony.*

3739
04:47:51,000 --> 04:47:57,000
*Yue didn't strike her, but it looks like she's in genuine physical pain all the same.*

3740
04:47:57,000 --> 04:48:06,000
Ayu: "Y-You're such a jerk, Hiroki! I-If I'd known you were here, I never would've said all those things! I-I didn't want you to know..."

3741
04:48:06,000 --> 04:48:12,000
Hiroki: "Well, now I do - and I'm glad to hear you say that. I love you a lot, too."

3742
04:48:12,000 --> 04:48:14,000
Ayu: "Ah! You, um... Y-You do?"

3743
04:48:14,000 --> 04:48:20,000
Hiroki: "I do. You can be hard to love at times, but your soft side is utterly adorable."

3744
04:48:20,000 --> 04:48:22,000
*I smile at her consolingly.*

3745
04:48:22,000 --> 04:48:31,000
Hiroki: "Besides, isn't it a good thing you said all that? If you hadn't, I don't think you would have been able to change Yue's mind."

3746
04:48:31,000 --> 04:48:35,000
Ayu: "Well, um... I-I guess that's a good point, yes..."

3747
04:48:35,000 --> 04:48:42,000
*Ayu pokes the tips of her fingers together shyly. Her face is beet red, but she looks no less adorable.*

3748
04:48:42,000 --> 04:48:45,000
*Ayu is always at her cutest when she's flustered.*

3749
04:48:45,000 --> 04:48:50,000
*She looks so cute I kinda wanna pinch her cheeks... but I'll refrain for now.*

3750
04:48:50,000 --> 04:48:54,000
Hiroki: "Anyway... To answer your previous question, Yue... Ahem."

3751
04:48:54,000 --> 04:48:55,000
*I clear my throat.*

3752
04:48:55,000 --> 04:49:00,000
Hiroki: "I don't mean to make you feel bad, but this place really isn't my home."

3753
04:49:00,000 --> 04:49:07,000
Hiroki: "I don't think it matters how long I stay here. I'll never really belong. That's why I can't stay here."

3754
04:49:07,000 --> 04:49:08,000
Yue: "I see..."

3755
04:49:08,000 --> 04:49:10,000
*Yue sighs. She looks despondent.*

3756
04:49:10,000 --> 04:49:19,000
Yue: "Well, I suppose I should have expected that answer. You have taken no pains to hide your real feelings during the last few weeks."

3757
04:49:19,000 --> 04:49:30,000
Yue: "You told me when you first came here that you did not feel like you belonged. You have told me over and over again, in fact, but I was too stubborn to listen to you."

3758
04:49:30,000 --> 04:49:34,000
Yue: "I was certain you would change your mind in due course..."

3759
04:49:34,000 --> 04:49:36,000
Yue: "But perhaps I was wrong."

3760
04:49:36,000 --> 04:49:38,000
Yue: "Some lover I am."

3761
04:49:38,000 --> 04:49:42,000
Yue: "I should have listened to you. I treated you very poorly."

3762
04:49:42,000 --> 04:49:50,000
Yue: "Perhaps I had no real right to tell you that I loved you in the first place, if my love was so cumbersome."

3763
04:49:50,000 --> 04:49:58,000
Hiroki: "N-No, that isn't true! You were my first girlfriend, Yue, and you'll always have a special place in my heart!"

3764
04:49:58,000 --> 04:50:05,000
Hiroki: "You've inconvenienced me a bit, sure, but I'm still fond of you! I might even love you, too!"

3765
04:50:05,000 --> 04:50:06,000
Yue: "Y-You do?"

3766
04:50:06,000 --> 04:50:07,000
Hiroki: "Yeah!"

3767
04:50:07,000 --> 04:50:10,000
Yue: "B-But you love so many other women already..."

3768
04:50:10,000 --> 04:50:11,000
*Yue glances at Ayu.*

3769
04:50:11,000 --> 04:50:15,000
Yue: "Is there enough room in your heart for me, too?"

3770
04:50:15,000 --> 04:50:21,000
Hiroki: "Of course there is. Love isn't a finite resource. I have a lot of it to go around."

3771
04:50:21,000 --> 04:50:24,000
Hiroki: "I love Ayu... but I love you, too."

3772
04:50:24,000 --> 04:50:27,000
Hiroki: "You just need to learn how to share."

3773
04:50:27,000 --> 04:50:37,000
Yue: "Sharing, hmm? It's not something I considered myself, but... maybe I can try it, just this once, if you feel so passionately about this."

3774
04:50:37,000 --> 04:50:47,000
*Yue's eyes narrow with newfound determination. She holds her arms out, palms raised, then declares in the flinty and unwavering tones of a queen...*

3775
04:50:47,000 --> 04:50:50,000
Yue: "Let us all love one another, then."

3776
04:50:50,000 --> 04:50:59,000
Yue: "If I am to be a real queen, I need to learn to listen to my people. I have to grow and change, and I must stop being so set in my ways."

3777
04:50:59,000 --> 04:51:05,000
Yue: "This is all very new to me, a-and it's a bit embarrassing, but I will do my best."

3778
04:51:05,000 --> 04:51:08,000
Yue: "I just want to make you happy, Hiroki."

3779
04:51:08,000 --> 04:51:12,000
Yue: "Hmm... Perhaps this isn't so very bad after all."

3780
04:51:12,000 --> 04:51:22,000
*Yue cuddles up to me on the bed, her arm linked through mine. She's on one side of me, Ayu the other, their heads both resting upon my shoulders.*

3781
04:51:22,000 --> 04:51:27,000
*Yue's breathing is uneven, and her eyes are droopy with exhaustion.*

3782
04:51:27,000 --> 04:51:35,000
*I think she might fall asleep at any moment... but the small smile upon her lips doesn't waver, at the very least.*

3783
04:51:35,000 --> 04:51:40,000
*She looks utterly contented, like a cat stretched out in the sunshine.*

3784
04:51:40,000 --> 04:51:43,000
*I don't think I've ever seen her happier.*

3785
04:51:43,000 --> 04:51:48,000
Yue: "I had a few doubts about "sharing", but this experience has swayed my mind."

3786
04:51:48,000 --> 04:51:52,000
Yue: "It felt... far better than I imagined it would."

3787
04:51:52,000 --> 04:51:54,000
Ayu: "Heh. What did I tell you?"

3788
04:51:54,000 --> 04:51:55,000
*Ayu grins.*

3789
04:51:55,000 --> 04:52:00,000
Ayu: "It's nice making the people you care about feel good, isn't it?"

3790
04:52:00,000 --> 04:52:09,000
Ayu: "I'm a selfish girl myself, at heart... but sometimes, a bit of collaboration is the easiest option for everyone involved."

3791
04:52:09,000 --> 04:52:14,000
Ayu: "That's something I figured out for myself, after becoming an idol."

3792
04:52:14,000 --> 04:52:16,000
Hiroki: "Hmm? What do you mean?"

3793
04:52:16,000 --> 04:52:19,000
Ayu: "It's kind of complicated, but... Well."

3794
04:52:19,000 --> 04:52:27,000
Ayu: "My fans might look up to me, since I'm the person they see on stage, but all my concerts are collaborative efforts."

3795
04:52:27,000 --> 04:52:32,000
Ayu: "I have choreographers, costumers, composers, lyricists, and my producer."

3796
04:52:32,000 --> 04:52:39,000
Ayu: "Then, there are the cameramen, the lighting engineers, and all the people who arrange my concerts."

3797
04:52:39,000 --> 04:52:46,000
Ayu: "I'm the "face" of Ayu-Ayu, but a whole bunch of work goes into each and every one of my performances."

3798
04:52:46,000 --> 04:52:50,000
Ayu: "I couldn't reach so many people's hearts on my own."

3799
04:52:50,000 --> 04:52:57,000
Ayu: "That's why I think it's a good thing to work together. It makes it easier to spread the love around."

3800
04:52:57,000 --> 04:53:02,000
Ayu: "Nobody's truly isolated - not even a princess like you, Lady Yue."

3801
04:53:02,000 --> 04:53:03,000
Yue: "Is that so...?"

3802
04:53:03,000 --> 04:53:08,000
*Yue exhales. I feel her cool breath against my neck, and I shiver.*

3803
04:53:08,000 --> 04:53:12,000
Yue: "It is true, I have felt very alone for quite some time."

3804
04:53:12,000 --> 04:53:20,000
Yue: "It is not much fun living in the succubus realm, where little changes, and as I am a ruler many of my subjects fear me."

3805
04:53:20,000 --> 04:53:25,000
Yue: "They do not talk to me as a friend. They prefer to keep their distance."

3806
04:53:25,000 --> 04:53:30,000
Yue: "For a long time, I thought Hifumi was the only person I could trust."

3807
04:53:30,000 --> 04:53:38,000
Yue: "That's why I was so determined to keep Hiroki for myself. He was a small sliver of happiness I could cling to."

3808
04:53:38,000 --> 04:53:46,000
Yue: "I wanted him for myself, and myself alone. I feared he would be tainted if I let other girls get their hands on him..."

3809
04:53:46,000 --> 04:53:49,000
Yue: "But now I think I was being paranoid."

3810
04:53:49,000 --> 04:53:50,000
*Yue shakes her head.*

3811
04:53:50,000 --> 04:53:52,000
Yue: "I was such a fool."

3812
04:53:52,000 --> 04:53:56,000
Yue: "Hiroki and Hifumi aren't the only people who care for me."

3813
04:53:56,000 --> 04:54:03,000
Yue: "I think you must care for me too, Ayu, in your own way - and Hazel, and Cosmos, and maybe even Marina."

3814
04:54:03,000 --> 04:54:07,000
Yue: "We all care for one another... and we all care for Hiroki."

3815
04:54:07,000 --> 04:54:11,000
Yue: "That being the case, why shouldn't we care for one another?"

3816
04:54:11,000 --> 04:54:14,000
Yue: "Your passion has reached me, Ayu. Thank you."

3817
04:54:14,000 --> 04:54:16,000
Ayu: "Ehehe. It's no problem~"

3818
04:54:16,000 --> 04:54:22,000
Ayu: "I'm the cute idol Ayu-Ayu, and I'm always happy to help! You can depend on me!"

3819
04:54:22,000 --> 04:54:24,000
*Ayu winks cutely, and Yue giggles.*

3820
04:54:24,000 --> 04:54:27,000
Yue: "Well, I'm not so sure about that."

3821
04:54:27,000 --> 04:54:33,000
Hiroki: "You're laying it on a little thick, Ayu. You don't need to pretend when you're with us."

3822
04:54:33,000 --> 04:54:36,000
Ayu: "Who said I was pretending, huh?"

3823
04:54:36,000 --> 04:54:37,000
*Ayu pouts.*

3824
04:54:37,000 --> 04:54:40,000
Ayu: "I really am that cute! I'm totally cute!"

3825
04:54:40,000 --> 04:54:43,000
Hiroki: "Sure, sure. You're adorable."

3826
04:54:43,000 --> 04:54:47,000
Ayu: "F-For some reason, that doesn't sound very sincere..."

3827
04:54:47,000 --> 04:54:49,000
Ayu: "Now I'm getting pissed off!"

3828
04:54:49,000 --> 04:54:53,000
Hiroki: "Why? Because I complimented you? I don't get it."

3829
04:54:53,000 --> 04:54:57,000
Hiroki: "You seemed happy enough a few minutes ago, when you were-"

3830
04:54:57,000 --> 04:55:05,000
Ayu: "Th-That's in the past! L-Let's not talk about it any more, OK? It'll ruin my image as a pure, adorable idol!"

3831
04:55:05,000 --> 04:55:10,000
Hiroki: "I don't think there's anything all that "pure" about you..."

3832
04:55:10,000 --> 04:55:18,000
Ayu: "I am pure! I'm totally pure! Purer than driven snow! I-It's not my fault I get all excited when I'm with you!"

3833
04:55:18,000 --> 04:55:22,000
Ayu: "You ought to take some responsibility, you jerk!"

3834
04:55:22,000 --> 04:55:26,000
Yue: "Ehehe... You're both so funny. You must get along well."

3835
04:55:26,000 --> 04:55:30,000
Ayu: "W-Well, it's not like I like him or anything! Hmph!"

3836
04:55:30,000 --> 04:55:34,000
Yue: "I know you don't like Hiroki. You love him, don't you?"

3837
04:55:34,000 --> 04:55:37,000
Yue: "You must love him as much as I do, in fact..."

3838
04:55:37,000 --> 04:55:44,000
*Yue nuzzles her head against the crook of my shoulder and inhales. Her dark eyelashes fall shut.*

3839
04:55:44,000 --> 04:55:49,000
*I think she's on the brink of sleep. Any second now, she's going to pass out.*

3840
04:55:49,000 --> 04:55:53,000
*Before Yue succumbs to slumber, however, she speaks up.*

3841
04:55:53,000 --> 04:56:00,000
*Her voice is soft and almost inaudible, but as she's leaning upon me for support I hear her nonetheless.*

3842
04:56:00,000 --> 04:56:07,000
Yue: "I've decided. I'm going to make an announcement tomorrow. I'll let you all know what I've decided then."

3843
04:56:07,000 --> 04:56:13,000
Yue: "I thought I would be happy if I kept Hiroki to myself, but... now I'm not so sure."

3844
04:56:13,000 --> 04:56:17,000
Yue: "Love is much more complicated than I imagined."

3845
04:56:17,000 --> 04:56:18,000
*The next day...*

3846
04:56:18,000 --> 04:56:25,000
Yue: "Now, everybody. You are probably wondering why I summoned you to the throne room so early in the morning."

3847
04:56:25,000 --> 04:56:30,000
Hazel: "Oh, no! Not at all, your ladyship! I'd do anythin' for you! I love you!"

3848
04:56:30,000 --> 04:56:35,000
Marina: "Goodness. Could you be any more transparent with your treachery?"

3849
04:56:35,000 --> 04:56:37,000
Hazel: "Treachery? What treachery?"

3850
04:56:37,000 --> 04:56:45,000
Hazel: "I would never, ever betray milady, or upset her, or make her cry! She's adorable, and I live to serve her!"

3851
04:56:45,000 --> 04:56:48,000
Marina: "That is precisely what I mean."

3852
04:56:48,000 --> 04:56:54,000
Marina: "You said you loved Hiroki, but you were awfully quick to turn your back on him."

3853
04:56:54,000 --> 04:56:57,000
Marina: "It's like you don't care about him at all!"

3854
04:56:57,000 --> 04:56:59,000
Cosmos: "Hazel is very fickle."

3855
04:56:59,000 --> 04:57:03,000
Hazel: "H-Hey, now...! I'm not fickle! It's the exact opposite!"

3856
04:57:03,000 --> 04:57:09,000
Hazel: "Sure, I like Hiroki, but milady is my queen, an' I live to serve her. I love her!"

3857
04:57:09,000 --> 04:57:17,000
Hazel: "I mean, just look at her! She has such smooth, perfect skin... Such long, black, glossy hair... Such pale blue eyes..."

3858
04:57:17,000 --> 04:57:20,000
Hazel: "And she smells really good, too!"

3859
04:57:20,000 --> 04:57:22,000
Hazel: "Who couldn't love her?!"

3860
04:57:22,000 --> 04:57:31,000
Marina: "So, you abandoned your feelings for Hiroki already? How shameless of you. And you call yourself a member of his harem!"

3861
04:57:31,000 --> 04:57:38,000
Cosmos: "Hazel is very shameless. Her succubus outfit is more revealing than mine, and I'm a RapidPound model."

3862
04:57:38,000 --> 04:57:43,000
Cosmos: "I make a living showing pictures of myself half-naked online..."

3863
04:57:43,000 --> 04:57:45,000
Cosmos: "But even I wear panties."

3864
04:57:45,000 --> 04:57:53,000
Hazel: "Wh-What's wrong with not wearin' panties? They're chafing! It's not like I do it for attention or anythin'!"

3865
04:57:53,000 --> 04:57:57,000
Cosmos: "Well, if you don't love Hiroki any more, that's fine."

3866
04:57:57,000 --> 04:58:03,000
Cosmos: "That means there's one less person trying to steal my boyfriend from me, hehehe..."

3867
04:58:03,000 --> 04:58:06,000
Yue: "Ahem! If you're quite finished!"

3868
04:58:06,000 --> 04:58:11,000
*Yue glowers at the assembled succubi, her arms folded across her chest.*

3869
04:58:11,000 --> 04:58:15,000
Yue: "I believe I said I had something important to announce."

3870
04:58:15,000 --> 04:58:19,000
Hazel: "Oh, yes! I'm sorry, Lady Yue! I didn't mean to interrupt!"

3871
04:58:19,000 --> 04:58:24,000
Hazel: "Please, say what it is you want, whenever you're ready! I'll listen!"

3872
04:58:24,000 --> 04:58:26,000
Yue: "See to it that you do. Now."

3873
04:58:26,000 --> 04:58:32,000
Yue: "I know I said I was prepared to keep Hiroki in the succubus realm, all to myself..."

3874
04:58:32,000 --> 04:58:35,000
*Yue's cool blue eyes fall upon mine.*

3875
04:58:35,000 --> 04:58:39,000
Yue: "...but, as of late, I have had a... change of heart."

3876
04:58:39,000 --> 04:58:46,000
Yue: "I do not like admitting such things, but in this case, at least, I think I might have been wrong."

3877
04:58:46,000 --> 04:58:47,000
Hazel: "What?!"

3878
04:58:47,000 --> 04:58:49,000
*Hazel steps back, aghast.*

3879
04:58:49,000 --> 04:58:54,000
Hazel: "But you're never wrong, milady! Your judgment is impeccable!"

3880
04:58:54,000 --> 04:59:03,000
Yue: "It is sweet you would say that, Hazel, but I must disagree. In the end, I am only a succubus, like the rest of us, and I can err, too."

3881
04:59:03,000 --> 04:59:10,000
Yue: "Hifumi tried to show me the error of my ways, but I was stubborn and selfish and refused to listen."

3882
04:59:10,000 --> 04:59:13,000
Yue: "I have been thinking, though..."

3883
04:59:13,000 --> 04:59:18,000
Yue: "And I've come to the realization that my love for Hiroki was oppressive."

3884
04:59:18,000 --> 04:59:26,000
Yue: "I did not think about his wants or needs. I acted cruelly and unfairly towards him, and the rest of you, too."

3885
04:59:26,000 --> 04:59:28,000
Yue: "For that, I must apologize."

3886
04:59:28,000 --> 04:59:31,000
Marina: "So, you're actually apologizing to us?"

3887
04:59:31,000 --> 04:59:33,000
*Marina raises an eyebrow.*

3888
04:59:33,000 --> 04:59:37,000
Marina: "That's a first. I never would have expected it from you."

3889
04:59:37,000 --> 04:59:43,000
Yue: "It is unlike me, I know. You may gloat all you want, but that will not change how I feel."

3890
04:59:43,000 --> 04:59:53,000
Yue: "I now know I cannot, in good faith, keep Hiroki trapped here. He is not a pet. He is the man I love, and I want him to live a fulfilling life."

3891
04:59:53,000 --> 04:59:55,000
Yue: "I must let him go free..."

3892
04:59:55,000 --> 04:59:58,000
Yue: "And the same applies to the rest of you."

3893
04:59:58,000 --> 05:00:07,000
Yue: "I no longer wish to punish you. You may leave the succubus realm, and you are free to continue your prior relations with Hiroki."

3894
05:00:07,000 --> 05:00:14,000
Yue: "If that makes him happy, I cannot object. I love him, and I want him to live his life to the fullest."

3895
05:00:14,000 --> 05:00:17,000
Cosmos: "Ah... We can still love Hiroki?"

3896
05:00:17,000 --> 05:00:18,000
Yue: "Yes, you may."

3897
05:00:18,000 --> 05:00:21,000
Cosmos: "Waah... Thank you, Lady Yue!"

3898
05:00:21,000 --> 05:00:28,000
*Cosmos darts towards me. She winds her arm around mine and looks up at me, her face flushed with happiness.*

3899
05:00:28,000 --> 05:00:34,000
Cosmos: "We can be together again! You can be my boyfriend, and I'll be your girlfriend!"

3900
05:00:34,000 --> 05:00:37,000
Cosmos: "We'll finally have a happily ever after!"

3901
05:00:37,000 --> 05:00:41,000
Ayu: "Hmph. You be careful, Cosmos. Don't be too wild with him."

3902
05:00:41,000 --> 05:00:49,000
Ayu: "Hiroki might be your boyfriend, but he's still my cameraman. He's very important to me, and I want him in one piece!"

3903
05:00:49,000 --> 05:00:55,000
Hifumi: "My, my. This is wonderful news. Now I can be with my dear husband once more..."

3904
05:00:55,000 --> 05:00:58,000
Hifumi: "Thank you very much, Lady Yue."

3905
05:00:58,000 --> 05:01:00,000
*Hifumi drops Yue a neat curtsy.*

3906
05:01:00,000 --> 05:01:10,000
Hifumi: "Thank you for listening to my words of advice. I did not think you would heed them, but I suppose I should have had more faith in you."

3907
05:01:10,000 --> 05:01:20,000
Hifumi: "You aren't the little girl you used to be. You've grown into quite the fine, mature woman over the years - before I even realized it!"

3908
05:01:20,000 --> 05:01:23,000
Hifumi: "I am impressed at your selflessness."

3909
05:01:23,000 --> 05:01:26,000
Hifumi: "Truly, you are a wonderful princess."

3910
05:01:26,000 --> 05:01:30,000
Hazel: "O-Oh, yes, um... Th-This is great news! Really great!"

3911
05:01:30,000 --> 05:01:34,000
Hazel: "Aren't you glad we can be together again, Hiroki?"

3912
05:01:34,000 --> 05:01:41,000
Hazel: "I mean, it's not like I ever turned my back on you or betrayed you or anythin'... Hehehe..."

3913
05:01:41,000 --> 05:01:47,000
Hazel: "I loved you all along, just as much as Cosmos and Ayu and the others - really, I did!"

3914
05:01:47,000 --> 05:01:48,000
Marina: "Hmm..."

3915
05:01:48,000 --> 05:01:51,000
*Marina purses her lips together, her arms folded.*

3916
05:01:51,000 --> 05:01:54,000
Marina: "Well, I'm not so sure about that..."

3917
05:01:54,000 --> 05:02:02,000
Marina: "In any case, this is quite the change. I did not expect you to reverse your stance on Hiroki's captivity so quickly."

3918
05:02:02,000 --> 05:02:05,000
Marina: "Hifumi is right. You have grown, Yue."

3919
05:02:05,000 --> 05:02:12,000
Yue: "Oh, spare me the flattery. I know you can't stand me, Marina, and I did not do this for you."

3920
05:02:12,000 --> 05:02:15,000
Yue: "I couldn't care at all about your happiness."

3921
05:02:15,000 --> 05:02:21,000
*Yue pouts cutely, her cheeks flushed pink, as she toys with a few strands of her hair.*

3922
05:02:21,000 --> 05:02:28,000
*I think she might be quite pleased about Marina's praise deep down, but she doesn't say that aloud.*

3923
05:02:28,000 --> 05:02:35,000
*No matter how self-possessed Yue acts, I think she might be quite bad at being true to her feelings.*

3924
05:02:35,000 --> 05:02:38,000
*In that sense, she's quite like Ayu.*

3925
05:02:38,000 --> 05:02:42,000
*Is that why she and Ayu were able to come to an understanding?*

3926
05:02:42,000 --> 05:02:50,000
Yue: "I'm only doing this for Hiroki's sake. To be quite honest, it still upsets me that you five are so in love with him."

3927
05:02:50,000 --> 05:02:54,000
Yue: "Seeing Cosmos cling to my Hiroki turns my stomach."

3928
05:02:54,000 --> 05:02:57,000
Yue: "I don't want him to date anybody but me...!"

3929
05:02:57,000 --> 05:03:03,000
*Yue's fingers, which hitherto were clenched about the armrests of her throne, now relax.*

3930
05:03:03,000 --> 05:03:06,000
*Folding one leg over the other, she says...*

3931
05:03:06,000 --> 05:03:13,000
Yue: "But if that makes him happy, I must let him do as he wishes. I would hate to make my beloved unhappy."

3932
05:03:13,000 --> 05:03:15,000
Yue: "I adore him, after all."

3933
05:03:15,000 --> 05:03:21,000
Hiroki: "I'm still not sure if I'm worthy of your feelings, Yue, but... Thank you."

3934
05:03:21,000 --> 05:03:24,000
Hiroki: "I'm rather fond of you, too."

3935
05:03:24,000 --> 05:03:26,000
Yue: "Just "fond", hmm?"

3936
05:03:26,000 --> 05:03:28,000
*Yue raises an eyebrow.*

3937
05:03:28,000 --> 05:03:37,000
Yue: "We'll have to work on that later. I hope, in due time, you'll be able to love me as openly and unreservedly as you love my subjects."

3938
05:03:37,000 --> 05:03:41,000
Yue: "You have known me longer than them, after all."

3939
05:03:41,000 --> 05:03:45,000
Yue: "Am I not the most worthy of your love in the room?"

3940
05:03:45,000 --> 05:03:47,000
Yue: "Do you not desire me?!"

3941
05:03:47,000 --> 05:03:51,000
Hiroki: "Well, you are pretty cute. I can't deny that much."

3942
05:03:51,000 --> 05:04:03,000
Hiroki: "I wasn't a fan of the whole "trapping me in the succubus realm against my will" thing, but if you're going to go back on that I don't see any reason why I can't love you."

3943
05:04:03,000 --> 05:04:06,000
Hiroki: "We just need to give it some time."

3944
05:04:06,000 --> 05:04:09,000
Yue: "And that is precisely what we shall do."

3945
05:04:09,000 --> 05:04:14,000
Yue: "I don't mind if you want to spend time with your harem, Hiroki..."

3946
05:04:14,000 --> 05:04:18,000
*Yue gets to her feet, her eyes burning with passion.*

3947
05:04:18,000 --> 05:04:21,000
Yue: "...but I want to join in the fun, too!"

3948
05:04:21,000 --> 05:04:26,000
Yue: "I love you a lot, and that will never change! I'm being serious about this!"

3949
05:04:26,000 --> 05:04:34,000
Yue: "I'll continue to ply you with my love and affection, until the day arrives that you can look at me, and only me!"

3950
05:04:34,000 --> 05:04:36,000
Yue: "Please remember, all of you!"

3951
05:04:36,000 --> 05:04:40,000
*Yue casts a gaze at the succubi assembled in her throne room.*

3952
05:04:40,000 --> 05:04:46,000
Yue: "I'll let you cuddle and kiss Hiroki as much as you want, but he still belongs to me!"

3953
05:04:46,000 --> 05:04:47,000
Yue: "I love him..."

3954
05:04:47,000 --> 05:04:52,000
Yue: "And one day, I'll steal him away from you, right beneath your noses!"

3955
05:04:52,000 --> 05:04:58,000
Yue: "Prepare yourselves! The battle isn't over yet! The one to capture his heart shall be I!"

3956
05:04:58,000 --> 05:04:59,000
Yue: "Ufufu!"

3957
05:04:59,000 --> 05:05:01,000
Hiroki: "Nn... What...?"

3958
05:05:01,000 --> 05:05:03,000
*It's dark when I finally awake.*

3959
05:05:03,000 --> 05:05:10,000
*I blink, sitting upright, then press a hand to my head. My temple is throbbing dully, and my vision skews.*

3960
05:05:10,000 --> 05:05:11,000
Hiroki: "Urgh..."

3961
05:05:11,000 --> 05:05:15,000
*I don't feel too good. Maybe I'm coming down with a fever?*

3962
05:05:15,000 --> 05:05:19,000
*I must have been in the succubus realm for too long.*

3963
05:05:19,000 --> 05:05:22,000
*I ought to ask Yue when - or if - I can leave.*

3964
05:05:22,000 --> 05:05:28,000
*Surely being here for such a protracted period of time can't be good for my constitution?*

3965
05:05:28,000 --> 05:05:36,000
*I let my hand fall from my head. My fingertips brush against something - but it isn't the smooth, silken sheets of Yue's bed.*

3966
05:05:36,000 --> 05:05:37,000
*Where am I...?*

3967
05:05:37,000 --> 05:05:43,000
*Something rough prickles my fingertips. It's a strange sensation, but it isn't unpleasant.*

3968
05:05:43,000 --> 05:05:45,000
*In fact, it's nostalgic.*

3969
05:05:45,000 --> 05:05:46,000
*I remember it.*

3970
05:05:46,000 --> 05:05:47,000
*This is...*

3971
05:05:47,000 --> 05:05:48,000
Hiroki: "Tatami?"

3972
05:05:48,000 --> 05:05:49,000
*My brow furrows.*

3973
05:05:49,000 --> 05:05:59,000
*This is all very odd. Yue's palace, as far as I can recall, is decorated in a Western manner. The floors are all plush carpet or smooth, cold marble.*

3974
05:05:59,000 --> 05:06:01,000
*There shouldn't be any tatami mats.*

3975
05:06:01,000 --> 05:06:07,000
*If this really is tatami, I must be back in Japan, and if I am in Japan that means...*

3976
05:06:07,000 --> 05:06:15,000
*I reach above my head, groping for a light switch. I catch it between my fingers and pull, and the room floods with light.*

3977
05:06:15,000 --> 05:06:19,000
*It's so bright, I have to blink white spots from my eyes.*

3978
05:06:19,000 --> 05:06:23,000
*My head continues to throb, but it's a dull ache now.*

3979
05:06:23,000 --> 05:06:25,000
*I glance around, and...*

3980
05:06:25,000 --> 05:06:26,000
Hiroki: "Ah..."

3981
05:06:26,000 --> 05:06:28,000
*A small gasp falls from my lips.*

3982
05:06:28,000 --> 05:06:32,000
*It's as I expected. I'm back in Japan, in my own apartment.*

3983
05:06:32,000 --> 05:06:35,000
Hiroki: "I'm back... I'm really back..."

3984
05:06:35,000 --> 05:06:37,000
Hiroki: "I can't believe it!"

3985
05:06:37,000 --> 05:06:42,000
*This must be how Dorothy felt when she finally got back to Kansas.*

3986
05:06:42,000 --> 05:06:53,000
*My apartment's small and cruddy, yeah, but at least it's mine. I pay for my lodgings with my own wages, and within these walls nobody can tell me what to do.*

3987
05:06:53,000 --> 05:06:54,000
*I'm free!*

3988
05:06:54,000 --> 05:07:02,000
*I shake the worst of my fatigue off, then rise to my feet. I stretch, then cross the room to look out the window.*

3989
05:07:02,000 --> 05:07:06,000
*The sky is full of stars, and the moon is round and full.*

3990
05:07:06,000 --> 05:07:11,000
*I can see the roofs of houses in the distance, and trees swaying in the breeze.*

3991
05:07:11,000 --> 05:07:17,000
*The gray sidewalk looks dark, almost black, and the street lamps flicker, attracting flies.*

3992
05:07:17,000 --> 05:07:23,000
*I don't live in the prettiest area of Tokyo, but my heart swells to see it all the same.*

3993
05:07:23,000 --> 05:07:25,000
Hiroki: "I'm finally home..."

3994
05:07:25,000 --> 05:07:28,000
Hiroki: "There really is no place like it."

3995
05:07:28,000 --> 05:07:36,000
*I open the window, letting the cool air caress my face. It feels good, after the stifling environment of the succubus realm.*

3996
05:07:36,000 --> 05:07:39,000
*Now I'm so worked up, I can't sleep.*

3997
05:07:39,000 --> 05:07:44,000
*I ponder what to do for a few moments, all while enjoying the air, when...*

3998
05:07:44,000 --> 05:07:45,000
*Knock, knock, knock.*

3999
05:07:45,000 --> 05:07:46,000
Hiroki: "Huh?"

4000
05:07:46,000 --> 05:07:49,000
*I come away from the window, my brow furrowing.*

4001
05:07:49,000 --> 05:07:52,000
*Somebody's rapping upon my bedroom door - but who?*

4002
05:07:52,000 --> 05:07:56,000
*It seems strange I would have any guests at this hour.*

4003
05:07:56,000 --> 05:08:02,000
*I exit my bedroom, then walk through the kitchen. Gingerly, I open the front door, and...*

4004
05:08:02,000 --> 05:08:06,000
???: "It took you long enough! I've been so, so worried about you!"

4005
05:08:06,000 --> 05:08:08,000
???: "How dare you make a lady wait?"

4006
05:08:08,000 --> 05:08:10,000
???: "Hiroki, you idiot!!!"

4007
05:08:10,000 --> 05:08:11,000
Hiroki: "Oof...!"

4008
05:08:11,000 --> 05:08:16,000
*Something very pink and frilly bowls into me the moment I open the door.*

4009
05:08:16,000 --> 05:08:19,000
*I stagger back, winded, and gasp for breath.*

4010
05:08:19,000 --> 05:08:24,000
*While I struggle to maintain my balance, the door slams shut behind me.*

4011
05:08:24,000 --> 05:08:32,000
*I'm alone in my apartment with this interloper. It clings to me, fingers fisting against the front of my shirt.*

4012
05:08:32,000 --> 05:08:37,000
*When I look down, my gaze is met with a pair of large, violet eyes.*

4013
05:08:37,000 --> 05:08:38,000
*It's...*

4014
05:08:38,000 --> 05:08:39,000
Hiroki: "A-Ayu?"

4015
05:08:39,000 --> 05:08:43,000
Ayu: "Who else did you think it would be, you dummy?!"

4016
05:08:43,000 --> 05:08:44,000
*Ayu pouts.*

4017
05:08:44,000 --> 05:08:49,000
*She's wearing the regalia of an idol, complete with the little hat.*

4018
05:08:49,000 --> 05:08:54,000
*Her body feels warm against mine; perhaps because her face is so flushed.*

4019
05:08:54,000 --> 05:09:01,000
*Her forehead beads with perspiration, despite the coolness of the night. She doesn't pause to brush it away.*

4020
05:09:01,000 --> 05:09:03,000
*She sounds out of breath.*

4021
05:09:03,000 --> 05:09:05,000
*Did she run all the way here?*

4022
05:09:05,000 --> 05:09:06,000
Hiroki: "Hey, Ayu..."

4023
05:09:06,000 --> 05:09:10,000
*I modulate my voice, hoping to make it sound gentle.*

4024
05:09:10,000 --> 05:09:17,000
*I don't know what, exactly, is wong with Ayu, but one thing is certain: she's in quite the state.*

4025
05:09:17,000 --> 05:09:19,000
Hiroki: "Are you alright?"

4026
05:09:19,000 --> 05:09:23,000
Ayu: "Of course I'm not alright! Do you even need to ask?!"

4027
05:09:23,000 --> 05:09:27,000
Ayu: "I was so worried about you, Hiroki, you idiot! You moron!"

4028
05:09:27,000 --> 05:09:28,000
Hiroki: "You were...?"

4029
05:09:28,000 --> 05:09:29,000
Ayu: "Yes!"

4030
05:09:29,000 --> 05:09:35,000
Ayu: "Yue might have promised to bring you back to the human realm, but I don't trust her!"

4031
05:09:35,000 --> 05:09:40,000
Ayu: "She's horribly clingy and jealous, and I know how much she loves you!"

4032
05:09:40,000 --> 05:09:49,000
Ayu: "I was terrified you would still be trapped there - only I would be here, in Japan, and I would no longer be able to help you!"

4033
05:09:49,000 --> 05:09:51,000
Hiroki: "Ah... I see..."

4034
05:09:51,000 --> 05:09:54,000
*I smile at Ayu, then wind my arms about her waist.*

4035
05:09:54,000 --> 05:09:58,000
*Holding her close, I peer into her eyes, and say...*

4036
05:09:58,000 --> 05:10:01,000
Hiroki: "Did you run all the way here to see me?"

4037
05:10:01,000 --> 05:10:04,000
Hiroki: "That must mean you care about me a lot."

4038
05:10:04,000 --> 05:10:07,000
Hiroki: "I'm really happy to hear that."

4039
05:10:07,000 --> 05:10:09,000
Ayu: "Wh-What? N-No...!"

4040
05:10:09,000 --> 05:10:18,000
*Ayu's face blushes furiously. She tries to take a step back, but my arms are still ensnared about her waist, thus preventing her escape.*

4041
05:10:18,000 --> 05:10:21,000
*Trembling from tip to toe, she glances away.*

4042
05:10:21,000 --> 05:10:29,000
*Her self-righteous anger begins to fade. Now, she looks embarrassed; her brow furrowed, her lips pulled into a pout.*

4043
05:10:29,000 --> 05:10:37,000
Ayu: "I-I didn't come here because I care about you! I just wanted to ensure that my hard work wasn't for nothing!"

4044
05:10:37,000 --> 05:10:46,000
Ayu: "I-It would be a pain if I put so much effort into trying to save you, only to have it thwarted by that double-crossing princess!"

4045
05:10:46,000 --> 05:10:49,000
Ayu: "That's really the only reason why I'm here."

4046
05:10:49,000 --> 05:10:53,000
Ayu: "My heart d-doesn't skip a beat when you hold me..."

4047
05:10:53,000 --> 05:10:56,000
Ayu: "A-And I certainly don't love you!"

4048
05:10:56,000 --> 05:10:59,000
Hiroki: "Oh yeah? Could've fooled me."

4049
05:10:59,000 --> 05:11:03,000
*I lean in closer to Ayu, until our lips are inches apart.*

4050
05:11:03,000 --> 05:11:08,000
Hiroki: "Well, maybe you don't love me... but I'm very fond of you."

4051
05:11:08,000 --> 05:11:13,000
Hiroki: "It's because of you that I was able to escape from the succubus realm."

4052
05:11:13,000 --> 05:11:19,000
Hiroki: "Without your quick thinking, I might still be trapped, so... thank you, Ayu."

4053
05:11:19,000 --> 05:11:21,000
Hiroki: "I really do appreciate it."

4054
05:11:21,000 --> 05:11:25,000
Ayu: "W-Well, of course you do. Th-That's how it should be!"

4055
05:11:25,000 --> 05:11:32,000
Ayu: "I-It isn't every day a popular idol like myself goes out of her way to help a peon like you!"

4056
05:11:32,000 --> 05:11:35,000
Ayu: "You should be kneeling and bowing at my feet!"

4057
05:11:35,000 --> 05:11:38,000
Hiroki: "Would you like it if I did that?"

4058
05:11:38,000 --> 05:11:42,000
*I grin, twining a few locks of her hair about my fingers.*

4059
05:11:42,000 --> 05:11:45,000
Hiroki: "Are you sure you wouldn't get embarrassed?"

4060
05:11:45,000 --> 05:11:48,000
Ayu: "M-Maybe that would be a bit too much, yeah..."

4061
05:11:48,000 --> 05:11:53,000
Ayu: "It'd be kind of gross, having an uncool guy like you writhe at my feet."

4062
05:11:53,000 --> 05:11:56,000
Ayu: "I-I guess, if you really want to thank me..."

4063
05:11:56,000 --> 05:11:59,000
Ayu: "I-It's fine if you hold me like this."

4064
05:11:59,000 --> 05:12:01,000
Ayu: "I-I can allow this much."

4065
05:12:01,000 --> 05:12:03,000
Ayu: "If you want, um..."

4066
05:12:03,000 --> 05:12:08,000
*Ayu glances down at her feet, her face an adorable shade of crimson.*

4067
05:12:08,000 --> 05:12:12,000
Ayu: "Y-You can even kiss me. I-I wouldn't be opposed to it."

4068
05:12:12,000 --> 05:12:19,000
Ayu: "I just, um... need to check whether this is really happening, and it isn't a dream, so, um..."

4069
05:12:19,000 --> 05:12:22,000
*She looks back at me, her eyelashes trembling.*

4070
05:12:22,000 --> 05:12:30,000
*Her body is pressed so close to mine, I can hear her heart beating in a short, sharp staccato inside her chest.*

4071
05:12:30,000 --> 05:12:33,000
*She's so cute she's going to make me blush!*

4072
05:12:33,000 --> 05:12:36,000
Ayu: "W-Would you mind k-k-kissing me?"

4073
05:12:36,000 --> 05:12:40,000
Hiroki: "Of course not. Your wish is my command, my princess."

4074
05:12:40,000 --> 05:12:45,000
*I tip Ayu's chin upwards with my index finger, then inch our lips even closer.*

4075
05:12:45,000 --> 05:12:48,000
Hiroki: "I'll kiss you as many times as you want."

4076
05:12:48,000 --> 05:12:50,000
Ayu: "O-Oh, Hiroki, mm..."

4077
05:12:50,000 --> 05:12:51,000
Ayu: "Aaah..."

4078
05:12:51,000 --> 05:12:53,000
*Ayu sighs as my lips meet hers.*

4079
05:12:53,000 --> 05:13:01,000
*Her body practically melts against my own. She offers no resistence, even when I nip her lower lip with my teeth.*

4080
05:13:01,000 --> 05:13:04,000
*Cute moans and sighs fall from Ayu's mouth.*

4081
05:13:04,000 --> 05:13:09,000
*She's being unusually pliant. It's a bit of a change to her usual attitude...*

4082
05:13:09,000 --> 05:13:11,000
*But it makes a welcome change.*

4083
05:13:11,000 --> 05:13:16,000
*When you get past her prickly outer exterior, Ayu really is adorable.*

4084
05:13:16,000 --> 05:13:18,000
Hiroki: "Thank you again, Ayu."

4085
05:13:18,000 --> 05:13:21,000
*I part my mouth from hers, then offer her a smile.*

4086
05:13:21,000 --> 05:13:23,000
Hiroki: "It's good to be back."

4087
05:13:23,000 --> 05:13:24,000
*A few days later...*

4088
05:13:24,000 --> 05:13:30,000
Hifumi: "Would anybody care for a drink? I can brew some tea, if anybody would like some."

4089
05:13:30,000 --> 05:13:33,000
Yue: "Tea sounds wonderful. Thank you, Hifumi."

4090
05:13:33,000 --> 05:13:36,000
Cosmos: "I prefer hot chocolate, though..."

4091
05:13:36,000 --> 05:13:37,000
Ayu: "Hot chocolate?"

4092
05:13:37,000 --> 05:13:39,000
*Ayu wrinkles her nose.*

4093
05:13:39,000 --> 05:13:41,000
Ayu: "What are you, a little kid?"

4094
05:13:41,000 --> 05:13:49,000
Cosmos: "No. I just have my own preferences, like all adults do. I know there are things you don't like either, Ayu."

4095
05:13:49,000 --> 05:13:58,000
Cosmos: "You always act like you're so mature, but I know you can't stand black coffee, and you don't like eating green peppers!"

4096
05:13:58,000 --> 05:13:59,000
Ayu: "Nggk..."

4097
05:13:59,000 --> 05:14:01,000
Hifumi: "My, my. Is that so?"

4098
05:14:01,000 --> 05:14:07,000
Hifumi: "You must learn to eat your peppers, Ayu, or you'll never be able to grow big and tall!"

4099
05:14:07,000 --> 05:14:14,000
Ayu: "I-I'm tall enough! It's not like I want to be a great hulking giantess like Marina, anyway!"

4100
05:14:14,000 --> 05:14:18,000
Ayu: "Now, where's my tea, woman? I'm parched! Chop, chop!"

4101
05:14:18,000 --> 05:14:21,000
Hifumi: "Ehehe~ I'll get right on it."

4102
05:14:21,000 --> 05:14:27,000
Yue: "Hmph. You shouldn't boss Hifumi around like that, Ayu. She is my advisor, not yours."

4103
05:14:27,000 --> 05:14:32,000
Yue: "As the ruler of the succubi, I am the only one who can issue orders."

4104
05:14:32,000 --> 05:14:38,000
Ayu: "Maybe that is true, in the succubus realm... but we're not there right now, are we?"

4105
05:14:38,000 --> 05:14:40,000
Yue: "...No. I suppose not."

4106
05:14:40,000 --> 05:14:41,000
*Yue relents.*

4107
05:14:41,000 --> 05:14:49,000
*This true enough. Ever since Yue let us leave the succubus realm, I've been trying to get back into the swing of things.*

4108
05:14:49,000 --> 05:14:57,000
*My boss was upset I missed a few days of work, but I was able to fob him off by saying I had some sort of illness.*

4109
05:14:57,000 --> 05:15:02,000
*I'm not sure if he bought it, but he didn't fire me, to my immense relief.*

4110
05:15:02,000 --> 05:15:12,000
*Since then, my days have passed in an ordinary, almost monotonous manner. A few weeks ago, I would have found the daily grind incredibly dull...*

4111
05:15:12,000 --> 05:15:15,000
*But I've since grown to appreciate it.*

4112
05:15:15,000 --> 05:15:25,000
*I've even enjoyed commuting to work on the cramped train - though being elbowed in the gut by random businessmen does take some of the fun out of it.*

4113
05:15:25,000 --> 05:15:30,000
*In a couple of days, I've been able to regain the normalcy I once lost.*

4114
05:15:30,000 --> 05:15:32,000
*I've been enjoying it...*

4115
05:15:32,000 --> 05:15:37,000
*But the scene in my apartment this evening is anything but normal.*

4116
05:15:37,000 --> 05:15:44,000
Hifumi: "Alright, I've made a few cups of tea. Here is your drink, Ayu - and this is for you, Hiroki."

4117
05:15:44,000 --> 05:15:46,000
Hiroki: "Thanks, Hifumi."

4118
05:15:46,000 --> 05:15:52,000
Hifumi: "I have another cup of tea for you, Yue, and this hot chocolate is for Cosmos, but..."

4119
05:15:52,000 --> 05:15:53,000
Cosmos: "Nnggh..."

4120
05:15:53,000 --> 05:15:54,000
Yue: "Rrrgh..."

4121
05:15:54,000 --> 05:16:00,000
Hifumi: "I don't know if either of you are able to accept any hot beverages just now!"

4122
05:16:00,000 --> 05:16:07,000
Hifumi: "I suppose I'll leave them here. You can drink them when you finish that little game of yours."

4123
05:16:07,000 --> 05:16:11,000
Hifumi: "I hope your drinks don't go cold in the meanwhile!"

4124
05:16:11,000 --> 05:16:19,000
*Ayu, Hifumi, Cosmos, Marina, Hazel, and Yue all came to my apartment this evening for a party. I think it was Marina's idea.*

4125
05:16:19,000 --> 05:16:27,000
*She said she wanted to celebrate our release from the succubus realm, and the newest addition to my harem: Yue.*

4126
05:16:27,000 --> 05:16:32,000
*Marina brought us snacks and drinks, and a bunch of silly party games to boot.*

4127
05:16:32,000 --> 05:16:37,000
*Cosmos and Yue are busy playing one such game. I think it's called "Twisted".*

4128
05:16:37,000 --> 05:16:44,000
*You're supposed to spin a wheel, then place your hand or foot on a colored circle on this white board.*

4129
05:16:44,000 --> 05:16:51,000
*Ayu and Hifumi have been taking it in turns spinning this spinner, then reading out the instructions.*

4130
05:16:51,000 --> 05:17:00,000
*Both Yue and Cosmos look pushed to their limits. Their bodies are contorted in strange ways, and their limbs are all tangled together.*

4131
05:17:00,000 --> 05:17:10,000
*At some point, they must have decided to remove their clothes. Perhaps they thought their outfits were too cumbersome to play such a precise game?*

4132
05:17:10,000 --> 05:17:16,000
*Yue's casual clothes, when she isn't in the succubus realm, are certainly cumbersome.*

4133
05:17:16,000 --> 05:17:22,000
*I call these clothes her "casual" clothes, but there's nothing really casual about them.*

4134
05:17:22,000 --> 05:17:28,000
*I guess Yue, being a ruler, wants to project that sort of image wherever she goes.*

4135
05:17:28,000 --> 05:17:35,000
*Even when she's masquerading as a human, she wants everybody to know how much influence she wields.*

4136
05:17:35,000 --> 05:17:37,000
Ayu: "Alright. Now, let's see..."

4137
05:17:37,000 --> 05:17:42,000
*Ayu takes a sip of her drink, then sets it to one side and spins the spinner.*

4138
05:17:42,000 --> 05:17:46,000
Ayu: "Cosmos, it's your turn now. Right foot to yellow."

4139
05:17:46,000 --> 05:17:48,000
Cosmos: "H-Huh? Yellow?!"

4140
05:17:48,000 --> 05:17:53,000
*Cosmos, who's pinned beneath Yue, stares at Ayu in wide-eyed horror.*

4141
05:17:53,000 --> 05:17:57,000
Cosmos: "I can't reach that far! I'll dislocate my leg!"

4142
05:17:57,000 --> 05:18:04,000
Ayu: "Your fans might like that. Then, you'll be able to take a lot more naughty pictures in complex poses."

4143
05:18:04,000 --> 05:18:10,000
Ayu: "You might even be able to put your legs behind your head, like a circus freak!"

4144
05:18:10,000 --> 05:18:15,000
Cosmos: "I don't want to put my legs behind my head, and I'm not a freak!"

4145
05:18:15,000 --> 05:18:18,000
Yue: "Now, Cosmos. Enough complaining."

4146
05:18:18,000 --> 05:18:29,000
Yue: "Ayu told you to put your right foot on a yellow circle. If you cannot do that, this victory shall be mine, and I shall have the pleasure of kissing Hiroki."

4147
05:18:29,000 --> 05:18:31,000
Hiroki: "Huh? Did you make a bet?"

4148
05:18:31,000 --> 05:18:32,000
Yue: "Maybe we did."

4149
05:18:32,000 --> 05:18:33,000
*Yue smiles.*

4150
05:18:33,000 --> 05:18:40,000
Yue: "It's rare I have a chance to leave the succubus realm, so I wanted to cut loose and have some fun."

4151
05:18:40,000 --> 05:18:45,000
Yue: "You don't mind being used as a bargaining chip, do you, my dear Hiroki?"

4152
05:18:45,000 --> 05:18:47,000
Hiroki: "I guess not..."

4153
05:18:47,000 --> 05:18:51,000
*It's not like it matters too much. This is all fun and games.*

4154
05:18:51,000 --> 05:19:02,000
*Yue might have a bit of a possessive streak (I saw her click her tongue when Hifumi handed me a cup of green tea), but I think she's trying to curb her jealousy.*

4155
05:19:02,000 --> 05:19:06,000
*She's working hard to change. It's impressive, really.*

4156
05:19:06,000 --> 05:19:09,000
Cosmos: "Urgh... Th-This isn't fair..."

4157
05:19:09,000 --> 05:19:13,000
Cosmos: "Hiroki is my boyfriend. I want to kiss him!"

4158
05:19:13,000 --> 05:19:17,000
Yue: "Then you'll have to beat me at this game, won't you?"

4159
05:19:17,000 --> 05:19:22,000
Yue: "Now, aren't you supposed to be putting your right foot on a yellow circle?"

4160
05:19:22,000 --> 05:19:25,000
Cosmos: "Urgh... Th-This is the worst..."

4161
05:19:25,000 --> 05:19:30,000
Cosmos: "I never thought I'd have to compete with Lady Yue, of all people!"

4162
05:19:30,000 --> 05:19:39,000
Cosmos: "I'm used to following your orders, milady. I don't want to risk upsetting you, but... I want you to kiss Hiroki even less!"

4163
05:19:39,000 --> 05:19:45,000
Cosmos: "He's my boyfriend, s-so I'm going to do anything it takes to win this competition!"

4164
05:19:45,000 --> 05:19:48,000
*Wow. She sure is taking this seriously.*

4165
05:19:48,000 --> 05:19:51,000
*I wonder which of them I should root for...*

4166
05:19:51,000 --> 05:19:53,000
*I want Cosmos to win, of course!":

4167
05:19:53,000 --> 05:19:57,000
*If it's a choice between Cosmos and Yue, then it's no contest.*

4168
05:19:57,000 --> 05:19:59,000
*I want Cosmos to win!*

4169
05:19:59,000 --> 05:20:02,000
*She's such a cutie, she deserves it!*

4170
05:20:02,000 --> 05:20:03,000
*Go, Cosmos!*

4171
05:20:03,000 --> 05:20:06,000
*I wouldn't mind kissing Yue again, though.":

4172
05:20:06,000 --> 05:20:11,000
*Cosmos might be my current girlfriend, but Yue was my first girlfriend.*

4173
05:20:11,000 --> 05:20:16,000
*If I have to pick between the pair of them, I should probably back Yue.*

4174
05:20:16,000 --> 05:20:21,000
*It's unusual to see her struggle like this, and I can't help but root for her.*

4175
05:20:21,000 --> 05:20:23,000
*Go, Yue! You can do it!!!*

4176
05:20:23,000 --> 05:20:27,000
Cosmos: "H-Here goes nothing! I'm going to give it my all!"

4177
05:20:27,000 --> 05:20:31,000
Hifumi: "Oh my. I didn't think she'd be able to do it."

4178
05:20:31,000 --> 05:20:33,000
Hifumi: "That is quite impressive!"

4179
05:20:33,000 --> 05:20:36,000
Hiroki: "Cosmos is pretty flexible, huh..."

4180
05:20:36,000 --> 05:20:41,000
Ayu: "Hmph. I suppose that's not too bad, for a whiny brat like her."

4181
05:20:41,000 --> 05:20:44,000
Ayu: "Now, for Lady Yue's next command..."

4182
05:20:44,000 --> 05:20:50,000
*Ayu flicks the spinner, while Hifumi and I watch on, nursing our cups of green tea.*

4183
05:20:50,000 --> 05:20:52,000
Hifumi: "Isn't this fun?"

4184
05:20:52,000 --> 05:21:00,000
Hifumi: "I'm relieved Lady Yue finally saw the error of her ways and let us return home. I was beginning to grow worried."

4185
05:21:00,000 --> 05:21:03,000
Ayu: "Heh! You can thank me for that!"

4186
05:21:03,000 --> 05:21:10,000
Ayu: "I'm the one who convinced her to let us go! It's because I have such a smooth, silver tongue!"

4187
05:21:10,000 --> 05:21:13,000
Ayu: "There's no better negotiator than Ikue Ayu!"

4188
05:21:13,000 --> 05:21:20,000
Hiroki: "Did you really negotiate, or did you kneel on the ground at Yue's feet until she took pity on you?"

4189
05:21:20,000 --> 05:21:21,000
Ayu: "Wh-Why, you!"

4190
05:21:21,000 --> 05:21:22,000
*Ayu scowls.*

4191
05:21:22,000 --> 05:21:28,000
Ayu: "Don't try to act cute with me! You know I did you a huge favor, stupid Hiroki!"

4192
05:21:28,000 --> 05:21:33,000
Ayu: "I didn't have to try and reason with milady, but I did all the same!"

4193
05:21:33,000 --> 05:21:36,000
Ayu: "I did all that 'cause I wanted to help you!"

4194
05:21:36,000 --> 05:21:45,000
Ayu: "If it weren't for me, you wouldn't be back at your apartment! You'd still be stuck in the succubus realm, where the sun never rises!"

4195
05:21:45,000 --> 05:21:49,000
Hiroki: "I know. I'm sorry, Ayu. I was only teasing."

4196
05:21:49,000 --> 05:21:53,000
*I set my drink to one side and ruffle the top of her head.*

4197
05:21:53,000 --> 05:21:57,000
Hiroki: "Thank you very much. I really do appreciate it."

4198
05:21:57,000 --> 05:22:02,000
Hifumi: "Ooh! I want to stroke Ayu's head, too. Her hair is so soft and silky!"

4199
05:22:02,000 --> 05:22:06,000
Ayu: "H-Hey, what are you two doing? I'm not a pet, y'know!"

4200
05:22:06,000 --> 05:22:10,000
*Ayu knocks Hifumi's hand away and steps back, pouting.*

4201
05:22:10,000 --> 05:22:13,000
Ayu: "You ought to treat me with some respect!"

4202
05:22:13,000 --> 05:22:16,000
Hifumi: "Now you sound like Lady Yue. Ehehe..."

4203
05:22:16,000 --> 05:22:19,000
*Hifumi giggles and cups her cheek with her palm.*

4204
05:22:19,000 --> 05:22:25,000
Hifumi: "Perhaps that is why Lady Yue listened to you. You are quite similar in many respects."

4205
05:22:25,000 --> 05:22:27,000
Hifumi: "Really, though..."

4206
05:22:27,000 --> 05:22:35,000
Hifumi: "I never thought I would be able to spend such a peaceful time with Lady Yue. She's always been so aloof and distant."

4207
05:22:35,000 --> 05:22:39,000
Hifumi: "I feared she would never be able to make any friends..."

4208
05:22:39,000 --> 05:22:45,000
Hifumi: "But it looks like she's getting on rather well with you, Ayu - and Cosmos, too."

4209
05:22:45,000 --> 05:22:52,000
Hifumi: "I hope we can continue to stay like this. It would make me very happy if we could all become friends."

4210
05:22:52,000 --> 05:22:57,000
Hiroki: "Me too. I like Yue a lot, but I think I like being with all of you more."

4211
05:22:57,000 --> 05:22:58,000
*Speaking of which...*

4212
05:22:58,000 --> 05:23:04,000
Hiroki: "Where are Marina and Hazel, anyway? They didn't go home already, did they?"

4213
05:23:04,000 --> 05:23:05,000
Hifumi: "Oh, no..."

4214
05:23:05,000 --> 05:23:08,000
*Hifumi's smile takes on a slightly pained edge.*

4215
05:23:08,000 --> 05:23:14,000
Hifumi: "They're still here. I believe Marina said she wanted to make use of your bedroom."

4216
05:23:14,000 --> 05:23:16,000
Hiroki: "My bedroom? But why?"

4217
05:23:16,000 --> 05:23:17,000
Hifumi: "Well..."

4218
05:23:17,000 --> 05:23:22,000
Hazel: "M-M-Marina! I-It was, um, so lovely to see you today, a-at this party!"

4219
05:23:22,000 --> 05:23:28,000
Hazel: "I-It's been a while since we last had a proper talk, one-on-one, isn't it?"

4220
05:23:28,000 --> 05:23:36,000
Marina: "Oh, yes. It has been a long time. Far too long, in fact - though that was not for lack of trying on my part."

4221
05:23:36,000 --> 05:23:42,000
Marina: "I did try to speak to you while we were in the succubus realm, but you ignored me."

4222
05:23:42,000 --> 05:23:50,000
Marina: "Rather than trying to help Hiroki escape, you were perfectly content to follow Lady Yue around like a lovesick puppy!"

4223
05:23:50,000 --> 05:23:56,000
Marina: "I can't believe you could turn your back on Hiroki so easily, you useless bisexual!"

4224
05:23:56,000 --> 05:24:06,000
Hazel: "H-Hey, Marina, wait! I-I did want to help Hiroki, really, I did! It's just, when Lady Yue looks at me, I-I find it impossible to disobey her!"

4225
05:24:06,000 --> 05:24:14,000
Hazel: "Hiroki is handsome, but Lady Yue is utterly gorgeous! She has such a nice body, and those eyes of hers..."

4226
05:24:14,000 --> 05:24:16,000
Hazel: "You could drown in them!"

4227
05:24:16,000 --> 05:24:23,000
Hazel: "One look from her is enough to make me lose my senses! I get so enthralled, I can't think straight!"

4228
05:24:23,000 --> 05:24:28,000
Marina: "I know you can't think straight! That's part of your problem!"

4229
05:24:28,000 --> 05:24:33,000
Marina: "I think you need punishing! You've been a very naughty girl!"

4230
05:24:33,000 --> 05:24:34,000
Marina: "Take this!"

4231
05:24:34,000 --> 05:24:35,000
Hazel: "K-Kyaa...!"

4232
05:24:35,000 --> 05:24:39,000
Marina: "Oh? Why are you squealing? Don't you like this?"

4233
05:24:39,000 --> 05:24:43,000
Hazel: "Ah, nn... I-It... I-It doesn't feel bad, but..."

4234
05:24:43,000 --> 05:24:45,000
Hazel: "I-It kind of hurts, too..."

4235
05:24:45,000 --> 05:24:49,000
Hazel: "Aren't you squeezing me with a little too much force?"

4236
05:24:49,000 --> 05:24:51,000
Marina: "Oh, am I? Am I really?"

4237
05:24:51,000 --> 05:24:59,000
Marina: "My apologies, Hazel. It seems I don't know my own strength! I don't wish to harm you - truly, I don't! - but..."

4238
05:24:59,000 --> 05:25:03,000
Marina: "I very much would like to teach you a lesson."

4239
05:25:03,000 --> 05:25:04,000
Hazel: "A-A lesson?"

4240
05:25:04,000 --> 05:25:11,000
Marina: "Mm. A lesson in not being a coward, and turning your back on the man you supposedly love!"

4241
05:25:11,000 --> 05:25:19,000
Marina: "If you want to remain a member of Hiroki's harem then you ought to get down on your hands and knees and beg for it!"

4242
05:25:19,000 --> 05:25:26,000
Marina: "I'm surprised he even let you into his apartment! He's far too soft-hearted for his own good!"

4243
05:25:26,000 --> 05:25:32,000
Marina: "Well, he might have forgiven you for being utterly worthless, but I won't!"

4244
05:25:32,000 --> 05:25:41,000
Marina: "Prepare yourself, Hazel! I'm going to discipline you to your absolute limits, until you understand just how naughty you've been!"

4245
05:25:41,000 --> 05:25:43,000
Marina: "I'm not going to hold back!"

4246
05:25:43,000 --> 05:25:51,000
Hazel: "N-No, Marina, wait! I-I'm sorry! I already said I was sorry! I didn't mean to abandon Hiroki! I just, nn..."

4247
05:25:51,000 --> 05:25:56,000
Hazel: "A-Aah! St-Stop squeezin' so hard! If you keep doing that, I, aah..."

4248
05:25:56,000 --> 05:25:58,000
Hazel: "K-Kyaaaaaaaaa...!!!"

4249
05:25:58,000 --> 05:26:07,000
Hifumi: "Let's just say that Marina has a bone to pick with Hazel over how little she helped during our time in the succubus realm."

4250
05:26:07,000 --> 05:26:13,000
Hifumi: "I think she's quite angry with her for capitulating to Lady Yue so easily."

4251
05:26:13,000 --> 05:26:19,000
Hifumi: "She'll probably be venting her frustrations out on Hazel for quite some time."

4252
05:26:19,000 --> 05:26:29,000
Hifumi: "I believe it would be best to leave them be until Marina has calmed down. Otherwise, you might walk in on something rather... intimate."

4253
05:26:29,000 --> 05:26:33,000
Hiroki: "Alright, I get the gist. I'll keep that in mind..."

4254
05:26:33,000 --> 05:26:35,000
*I laugh and shake my head.*

4255
05:26:35,000 --> 05:26:42,000
*The walls of my apartment are pretty thin, and I think I can hear Marina and Hazel through them...*

4256
05:26:42,000 --> 05:26:44,000
*This is kind of awkward.*

4257
05:26:44,000 --> 05:26:47,000
*I can't help but feel sorry for Hazel.":

4258
05:26:47,000 --> 05:26:50,000
*I just hope Marina doesn't hurt Hazel too much...*

4259
05:26:50,000 --> 05:26:56,000
*Hazel might have taken Yue's side against mine, but I don't think she meant any ill by it.*

4260
05:26:56,000 --> 05:27:02,000
*She's such a cheery, bubbly girl, I doubt she has a single wicked bone in her body.*

4261
05:27:02,000 --> 05:27:10,000
*Rather than being outright malicious, it seems more likely she wasn't thinking about the consequences of her actions.*

4262
05:27:10,000 --> 05:27:12,000
*That is so like Hazel.*

4263
05:27:12,000 --> 05:27:17,000
*She'd be perfect, if only she could use that brain of hers a bit more.*

4264
05:27:17,000 --> 05:27:19,000
*But Hazel deserves to be punished.":

4265
05:27:19,000 --> 05:27:23,000
*While I feel bad for Hazel, she did bring this upon herself.*

4266
05:27:23,000 --> 05:27:30,000
*Marina's right to punish her. It seems only fitting, after she turned out to be such a turncoat.*

4267
05:27:30,000 --> 05:27:36,000
*I wouldn't want to upset Hazel myself, but I have no qualms with Marina doing it.*

4268
05:27:36,000 --> 05:27:41,000
*I'll just try to ignore the sounds I can hear through my bedroom walls.*

4269
05:27:41,000 --> 05:27:47,000
*That should be the best way to preserve my dwindling composure, alongside my sanity.*

4270
05:27:47,000 --> 05:27:51,000
Hiroki: "Well then. Shall we have a toast to our newfound freedom?"

4271
05:27:51,000 --> 05:27:53,000
Ayu: "That sounds like a good idea!"

4272
05:27:53,000 --> 05:27:57,000
*Ayu picks up her cup of green tea and holds it aloft.*

4273
05:27:57,000 --> 05:27:58,000
Ayu: "Cheers!"

4274
05:27:58,000 --> 05:27:59,000
Hifumi: "Cheers!"

4275
05:27:59,000 --> 05:28:02,000
Cosmos: "Ooh. Are we toasting to something?"

4276
05:28:02,000 --> 05:28:10,000
*Cosmos, who seems to have finished with the game of Twisted, dashes over to me and links her arms through mine.*

4277
05:28:10,000 --> 05:28:15,000
*Yue follows suit, adjusting her long, elegant gown as she does so.*

4278
05:28:15,000 --> 05:28:19,000
*Taking my other arm, she snuggles against me and says...*

4279
05:28:19,000 --> 05:28:21,000
Yue: "What is a toast?"

4280
05:28:21,000 --> 05:28:30,000
Hifumi: "It's when you drink to something. It's like a sort of celebration. People do it at birthdays, or engagement parties, or weddings...!"

4281
05:28:30,000 --> 05:28:35,000
Hifumi: "Ah... Thinking about weddings is making me feel excitement..."

4282
05:28:35,000 --> 05:28:36,000
Hifumi: "My, my, my!"

4283
05:28:36,000 --> 05:28:40,000
Ayu: "Geez. Trust Hifumi's thoughts to jump straight to marriage."

4284
05:28:40,000 --> 05:28:42,000
Cosmos: "She's so single-minded."

4285
05:28:42,000 --> 05:28:44,000
Yue: "What's this about marriage?"

4286
05:28:44,000 --> 05:28:46,000
*Yue squeezes my arm with her own.*

4287
05:28:46,000 --> 05:28:50,000
Yue: "You aren't going to get married, are you, Hiroki?"

4288
05:28:50,000 --> 05:28:59,000
Hiroki: "N-No! I don't have any plans for that. I couldn't, anyway, when I love all of you so much! It'd be impossible for me to decide!"

4289
05:28:59,000 --> 05:29:00,000
Yue: "Oh, Hiroki..."

4290
05:29:00,000 --> 05:29:03,000
*Yue smiles, placated, while Ayu whistles.*

4291
05:29:03,000 --> 05:29:05,000
Ayu: "Whew. Talk about a nice save."

4292
05:29:05,000 --> 05:29:08,000
Hifumi: "Hiroki is awfully suave, isn't he?"

4293
05:29:08,000 --> 05:29:11,000
Cosmos: "Of course he is. He's my boyfriend."

4294
05:29:11,000 --> 05:29:13,000
Yue: "No, he's my boyfriend!"

4295
05:29:13,000 --> 05:29:14,000
Cosmos: "Mine!"

4296
05:29:14,000 --> 05:29:21,000
Hiroki: "H-Hey, calm down, you two. There's enough of me to go around. You don't need to keep fighting."

4297
05:29:21,000 --> 05:29:30,000
Hiroki: "I can be both of your boyfriends - and I'll still be Ayu's cameraman, Hifumi's husband, Marina's darling, and Hazel's..."

4298
05:29:30,000 --> 05:29:35,000
Hiroki: "Well. I'm not sure what I am to Hazel, but I want to be with all of you."

4299
05:29:35,000 --> 05:29:36,000
Hifumi: "Me too!"

4300
05:29:36,000 --> 05:29:37,000
Cosmos: "And me."

4301
05:29:37,000 --> 05:29:41,000
Yue: "That... does sound satisfactory at the present, yes."

4302
05:29:41,000 --> 05:29:48,000
Ayu: "Th-This is really corny. It's not cool at all, but... Hmph. Fine. Let's drink to that, then."

4303
05:29:48,000 --> 05:29:51,000
*I drink my fragrant green tea, smiling as I do so.*

4304
05:29:51,000 --> 05:29:56,000
*For a while, I had a few doubts, but now I feel optimistic about the future.*

4305
05:29:56,000 --> 05:30:00,000
*It looks like I'm going to have a happy ending after all.*

4306
05:30:00,000 --> 05:30:03,000
*Time passes, and the party begins to wind down.*

4307
05:30:03,000 --> 05:30:10,000
*Hifumi, Marina, and Yue all had a lot to drink, and the three of them are all passed out in my bedroom.*

4308
05:30:10,000 --> 05:30:18,000
*As for Ayu, she's busy tending to them. She brushes her hands through Hifumi's tangled hair, pouting as she does so.*

4309
05:30:18,000 --> 05:30:21,000
Ayu: "And you call yourself a mature woman?"

4310
05:30:21,000 --> 05:30:27,000
Ayu: "How in the world did you think you could help Hiroki, when you're in such a sorry state?"

4311
05:30:27,000 --> 05:30:30,000
Ayu: "Honestly! You're all so incompetent!"

4312
05:30:30,000 --> 05:30:35,000
Ayu: "If it weren't for me, we'd all still be languishing in the succubus realm."

4313
05:30:35,000 --> 05:30:38,000
Ayu: "You really can't do a thing without me!"

4314
05:30:38,000 --> 05:30:42,000
*It's kind of cute to see Ayu doting on the others like that.*

4315
05:30:42,000 --> 05:30:47,000
*She might act grumpy, but her heart is full to bursting with kindness.*

4316
05:30:47,000 --> 05:30:50,000
*She really is a dyed in the wool tsundere.*

4317
05:30:50,000 --> 05:30:54,000
*I wish she'd show this sweet side of hers more often...*

4318
05:30:54,000 --> 05:30:59,000
*But I guess Ayu wouldn't be Ayu if she wasn't at least 80%% prickly.*

4319
05:30:59,000 --> 05:31:05,000
*Hazel, for her part, is curled up in a corner, her arms wrapped around her knees.*

4320
05:31:05,000 --> 05:31:13,000
*Her face is pallid, her eyes wide, and she keeps rocking back and forth, while mumbling things under her breath.*

4321
05:31:13,000 --> 05:31:16,000
*She looks like she's come back from a war.*

4322
05:31:16,000 --> 05:31:19,000
*That, or she's being haunted by a ghost.*

4323
05:31:19,000 --> 05:31:20,000
*Will she be OK?*

4324
05:31:20,000 --> 05:31:22,000
*I have some doubts...*

4325
05:31:22,000 --> 05:31:25,000
*But I don't get a chance to speak to her.*

4326
05:31:25,000 --> 05:31:29,000
*Cosmos approaches me, her arms looped behind her back.*

4327
05:31:29,000 --> 05:31:32,000
*Smiling gently, she surveys me, and says...*

4328
05:31:32,000 --> 05:31:35,000
Cosmos: "Hey, Hiroki. Did you have a good night?"

4329
05:31:35,000 --> 05:31:37,000
Hiroki: "...Yeah, I did."

4330
05:31:37,000 --> 05:31:40,000
*I return Cosmos's smile with one of my own.*

4331
05:31:40,000 --> 05:31:44,000
Hiroki: "It was kind of crazy, though. Everybody cut loose."

4332
05:31:44,000 --> 05:31:48,000
Hiroki: "I'm still not sure if Hazel will recover from... uh..."

4333
05:31:48,000 --> 05:31:51,000
Hiroki: "Whatever it was Marina did to her."

4334
05:31:51,000 --> 05:31:57,000
Cosmos: "I'm sure she'll be fine. Hazel is like rubber. She bounces back from all adversity."

4335
05:31:57,000 --> 05:32:02,000
Cosmos: "If she was that delicate, she wouldn't be able to go commando in public."

4336
05:32:02,000 --> 05:32:04,000
Cosmos: "That takes guts."

4337
05:32:04,000 --> 05:32:07,000
Hiroki: "Hahaha. Guess you're not wrong there."

4338
05:32:07,000 --> 05:32:12,000
Hiroki: "I'll pray to the lewd gods on high that she makes a full recovery."

4339
05:32:12,000 --> 05:32:14,000
Cosmos: "I shall pray, too."

4340
05:32:14,000 --> 05:32:17,000
*Cosmos claps her hands together and bows her head.*

4341
05:32:17,000 --> 05:32:19,000
Cosmos: "Namu amida butsu."

4342
05:32:19,000 --> 05:32:24,000
Hiroki: "Uh, Cosmos... That's the sort of thing you say after somebody's died."

4343
05:32:24,000 --> 05:32:25,000
Cosmos: "Huh?"

4344
05:32:25,000 --> 05:32:26,000
*Cosmos blinks.*

4345
05:32:26,000 --> 05:32:27,000
Cosmos: "It is?"

4346
05:32:27,000 --> 05:32:31,000
Hiroki: "Yeah. I'm starting to feel like I'm at a funeral..."

4347
05:32:31,000 --> 05:32:33,000
Cosmos: "Oh, right. I apologize."

4348
05:32:33,000 --> 05:32:36,000
Cosmos: "Would "rest in peace" be more appropriate?"

4349
05:32:36,000 --> 05:32:39,000
Hiroki: "No, I think that's even worse."

4350
05:32:39,000 --> 05:32:41,000
Cosmos: "Oh... I'm sorry."

4351
05:32:41,000 --> 05:32:43,000
*Cosmos bows her head.*

4352
05:32:43,000 --> 05:32:50,000
Cosmos: "I've lived in the human world for a while, but there's still a whole bunch I need to learn."

4353
05:32:50,000 --> 05:32:53,000
Cosmos: "Your customs remain unclear to me..."

4354
05:32:53,000 --> 05:32:56,000
Cosmos: "But I'm doing my best to understand them."

4355
05:32:56,000 --> 05:33:01,000
Cosmos: "I think, if I stay with you, I should be able to learn a lot."

4356
05:33:01,000 --> 05:33:05,000
Cosmos: "I'm looking forward to our future together, Hiroki."

4357
05:33:05,000 --> 05:33:08,000
Cosmos: "Let's make lots of good memories together!"

4358
05:33:08,000 --> 05:33:10,000
Hiroki: "Right back atcha."

4359
05:33:10,000 --> 05:33:16,000
*I ruffle the top of Cosmos's head with my palm. She leans into my touch, purring like a cat.*

4360
05:33:16,000 --> 05:33:19,000
*I guess those ears of hers aren't just for show.*

4361
05:33:19,000 --> 05:33:21,000
Cosmos: "Hey, Hiroki..."

4362
05:33:21,000 --> 05:33:24,000
*Cosmos blinks at me from beneath her eyelashes.*

4363
05:33:24,000 --> 05:33:29,000
Cosmos: "It's a bit stuffy in here. Would you mind going for a walk?"

4364
05:33:29,000 --> 05:33:34,000
Cosmos: "I think it would be very romantic to go stargazing with you."

4365
05:33:34,000 --> 05:33:37,000
Cosmos: "It's such a nice, clear night."

4366
05:33:37,000 --> 05:33:39,000
Hiroki: "Yeah? That sounds like fun."

4367
05:33:39,000 --> 05:33:47,000
Hiroki: "I don't know much about the stars, but I'd like to stretch my legs; 'specially with a cute girl like you on my arm."

4368
05:33:47,000 --> 05:33:49,000
Cosmos: "Then let's go!"

4369
05:33:49,000 --> 05:33:55,000
*Cosmos takes my hand in her own, our fingers twining together, and pulls me along.*

4370
05:33:55,000 --> 05:34:04,000
*I feel a bit bad about leaving Ayu here, to deal with three useless drunks and one shellshocked, potentially mentally scarred war victim...*

4371
05:34:04,000 --> 05:34:08,000
*But it's been a while since I enjoyed any alone time with Cosmos.*

4372
05:34:08,000 --> 05:34:10,000
*I think I owe her this much.*

4373
05:34:10,000 --> 05:34:18,000
*The two of us exit my apartment. We descend the stairs that fringe the edge of the building, then step out onto the street.*

4374
05:34:18,000 --> 05:34:25,000
*It's dark outside, save for the flickering street lamps, and a few lights on in various apartment windows.*

4375
05:34:25,000 --> 05:34:31,000
*It's quiet, too. I can't hear any cars, and it's so late all the trains have stopped running.*

4376
05:34:31,000 --> 05:34:37,000
*A cool breeze runs through my hair. It feels good, and it procures from me a soft sigh.*

4377
05:34:37,000 --> 05:34:39,000
*Smiling, I turn to Cosmos.*

4378
05:34:39,000 --> 05:34:43,000
Hiroki: "So, what do you think? It's pretty atmospheric, huh?"

4379
05:34:43,000 --> 05:34:44,000
Cosmos: "Mm."

4380
05:34:44,000 --> 05:34:45,000
*Cosmos nods.*

4381
05:34:45,000 --> 05:34:49,000
Cosmos: "It's nice. The stars up above look so bright..."

4382
05:34:49,000 --> 05:34:51,000
Cosmos: "I should take some photos."

4383
05:34:51,000 --> 05:34:53,000
Hiroki: "For your fans?"

4384
05:34:53,000 --> 05:34:57,000
Cosmos: "No, for me. I always want to remember this day."

4385
05:34:57,000 --> 05:35:02,000
Cosmos: "I'm glad we were able to escape from the succubus realm..."

4386
05:35:02,000 --> 05:35:05,000
Cosmos: "And I'm glad I can be with you, Hiroki."

4387
05:35:05,000 --> 05:35:12,000
*Cosmos takes her phone from her pocket. She points it up at the sky, then begins to take snapshots.*

4388
05:35:12,000 --> 05:35:15,000
*I watch her, my hands in my pockets.*

4389
05:35:15,000 --> 05:35:21,000
*Cosmos is concentrating hard. Her tongue pokes out from her mouth, her brow furrowed.*

4390
05:35:21,000 --> 05:35:23,000
*Her determination is adorable.*

4391
05:35:23,000 --> 05:35:30,000
*The stars are pretty, sure, but Cosmos shines way more than they do. I can't look away from her.*

4392
05:35:30,000 --> 05:35:32,000
Cosmos: "Hey, Hiroki..."

4393
05:35:32,000 --> 05:35:36,000
*Cosmos turns to me, after she's taken several photos.*

4394
05:35:36,000 --> 05:35:39,000
Cosmos: "Can we take a snapshot together, too?"

4395
05:35:39,000 --> 05:35:43,000
Hiroki: "Sure, I don't see why not. How'd you want me to stand?"

4396
05:35:43,000 --> 05:35:47,000
Cosmos: "Next to me, please. Let's take a couple's selfie."

4397
05:35:47,000 --> 05:35:50,000
Hiroki: "You promise you won't post it online?"

4398
05:35:50,000 --> 05:35:54,000
Cosmos: "No, I won't. I don't want to cause any problems for you."

4399
05:35:54,000 --> 05:35:58,000
Cosmos: "My fans would be upset if they knew we were dating..."

4400
05:35:58,000 --> 05:36:04,000
Cosmos: "And, to be honest, sharing you wtih my succubus sisters is hard enough for me."

4401
05:36:04,000 --> 05:36:08,000
Cosmos: "I don't want anybody else to know about you."

4402
05:36:08,000 --> 05:36:10,000
Hiroki: "Possessive much?"

4403
05:36:10,000 --> 05:36:11,000
*I grin.*

4404
05:36:11,000 --> 05:36:14,000
Hiroki: "Well, that's fine. It's nice being wanted."

4405
05:36:14,000 --> 05:36:19,000
Cosmos: "I do want you. I want you more than I've ever wanted anybody."

4406
05:36:19,000 --> 05:36:22,000
Cosmos: "That's why I'm going to stay with you..."

4407
05:36:22,000 --> 05:36:24,000
Cosmos: "Provided you still want me?"

4408
05:36:24,000 --> 05:36:28,000
Hiroki: "Of course I do. That should go without saying."

4409
05:36:28,000 --> 05:36:29,000
Cosmos: "Hehe. Good."

4410
05:36:29,000 --> 05:36:30,000
*Cosmos smiles.*

4411
05:36:30,000 --> 05:36:34,000
Cosmos: "OK. Look at the camera. I'm going to take our photo now."

4412
05:36:34,000 --> 05:36:36,000
Cosmos: "Say "cheese"."

4413
05:36:36,000 --> 05:36:37,000
Hiroki: "Che-"

4414
05:36:37,000 --> 05:36:39,000
*I open my mouth obligingly...*

4415
05:36:39,000 --> 05:36:40,000
Hiroki: "Mmph?"

4416
05:36:40,000 --> 05:36:44,000
*But my words are soon silenced by a soft, warm sensation.*

4417
05:36:44,000 --> 05:36:49,000
*Cosmos's body is pushed against my own, and her lips are overlapping mine.*

4418
05:36:49,000 --> 05:36:52,000
*Sh-She's kissing me - and on the mouth, no less!*

4419
05:36:52,000 --> 05:36:53,000
Hiroki: "...?!"

4420
05:36:53,000 --> 05:36:55,000
*Wait, wait, wait. Back up a sec.*

4421
05:36:55,000 --> 05:37:01,000
*She said she wanted us to take a selfie together, but she never said she was gonna kiss me!*

4422
05:37:01,000 --> 05:37:09,000
*She's still holding her cell phone in one hand. It's angled down, pointed at our faces, her finger resting on the button.*

4423
05:37:09,000 --> 05:37:11,000
*She clicks it once, then twice.*

4424
05:37:11,000 --> 05:37:16,000
*H-How many pictures is she planning to take like this?! Isn't one enough?!*

4425
05:37:16,000 --> 05:37:18,000
*Geez. Now my heart's racing.*

4426
05:37:18,000 --> 05:37:22,000
*This is pretty embarrassing, not to mention unexpected...*

4427
05:37:22,000 --> 05:37:23,000
*But I don't hate it.*

4428
05:37:23,000 --> 05:37:28,000
*I could never take offence at being kissed by a pretty girl like Cosmos.*

4429
05:37:28,000 --> 05:37:30,000
Hiroki: "Mm... Nn, aah..."

4430
05:37:30,000 --> 05:37:32,000
*I sigh into the kiss, enraptured.*

4431
05:37:32,000 --> 05:37:38,000
*Cosmos must take this as affirmation, because her kisses get more and more demanding.*

4432
05:37:38,000 --> 05:37:45,000
*She slides her tongue into my mouth, her eyes half-lidded, while she continues to take photo after photo.*

4433
05:37:45,000 --> 05:37:47,000
*This is starting to get steamy...*

4434
05:37:47,000 --> 05:37:49,000
*Does this count as exhibitionism?*

4435
05:37:49,000 --> 05:37:50,000
Hiroki: "C-Cosmos..."

4436
05:37:50,000 --> 05:37:55,000
*I gasp her name as she finally breaks the kiss, my lips damp from her saliva.*

4437
05:37:55,000 --> 05:37:59,000
Hiroki: "Do you have any fetishes I should know about?"

4438
05:37:59,000 --> 05:38:00,000
Cosmos: "Fetishes?"

4439
05:38:00,000 --> 05:38:02,000
*Cosmos tips her head to one side.*

4440
05:38:02,000 --> 05:38:03,000
Cosmos: "Like what?"

4441
05:38:03,000 --> 05:38:08,000
Hiroki: "I mean, like... do you get off on taking intimate photos of us?"

4442
05:38:08,000 --> 05:38:10,000
Cosmos: "Ehehe, well..."

4443
05:38:10,000 --> 05:38:12,000
*Cosmos giggles coyly.*

4444
05:38:12,000 --> 05:38:19,000
Cosmos: "I can't deny that I like to look at photos of us together. They make me feel all warm and tingly."

4445
05:38:19,000 --> 05:38:21,000
Cosmos: "It's a nice feeling."

4446
05:38:21,000 --> 05:38:22,000
*Ah-ha. I knew it.*

4447
05:38:22,000 --> 05:38:27,000
Cosmos: "But, even if I am a lewd girl, my feelings for you are pure."

4448
05:38:27,000 --> 05:38:32,000
Cosmos: "I love you, Hiroki. That's why I want to take photos of us together."

4449
05:38:32,000 --> 05:38:36,000
Cosmos: "It proves that my feelings for you are real."

4450
05:38:36,000 --> 05:38:37,000
Cosmos: "Do you mind?"

4451
05:38:37,000 --> 05:38:42,000
Hiroki: "It'd be nice if you could give me some sort of warning next time, but..."

4452
05:38:42,000 --> 05:38:48,000
Hiroki: "It's fine, yeah - so long as you don't show anybody else our private pics."

4453
05:38:48,000 --> 05:38:53,000
Hiroki: "I was kinda surprised, though. My heart was racing a mile a minute!"

4454
05:38:53,000 --> 05:38:57,000
Hiroki: "If you're not careful, you'll give me a heart attack!"

4455
05:38:57,000 --> 05:38:58,000
Cosmos: "Oh no!"

4456
05:38:58,000 --> 05:39:01,000
*Cosmos's eyes widen to comic proportions.*

4457
05:39:01,000 --> 05:39:05,000
Cosmos: "I-I'm sorry, Hiroki! I don't want to hurt you!"

4458
05:39:05,000 --> 05:39:08,000
Hiroki: "It's fine. There are worse ways to go..."

4459
05:39:08,000 --> 05:39:12,000
Hiroki: "But I'm sure I'll build a resistence to it, over time."

4460
05:39:12,000 --> 05:39:18,000
Hiroki: "We're going to stay together, you and me... and I hope I can keep making you happy."

4461
05:39:18,000 --> 05:39:20,000
Cosmos: "You do, Hiroki!"

4462
05:39:20,000 --> 05:39:24,000
Cosmos: "Nobody makes me happier than you. I really do love you!"

4463
05:39:24,000 --> 05:39:26,000
Hiroki: "And I love you, too."

4464
05:39:26,000 --> 05:39:30,000
*I don't yet know what my future holds, but one thing is certain.*

4465
05:39:30,000 --> 05:39:34,000
*I love all the succubi I've met, and I want to stay with them.*

4466
05:39:34,000 --> 05:39:39,000
*I might be one man, but I'll do my best to meet all their expectations.*

4467
05:39:39,000 --> 05:39:41,000
*We'll stay together...*

4468
05:39:41,000 --> 05:39:45,000
*And I hope, in time, we're able to make each other happy.*

4469
05:39:45,000 --> 05:39:47,000
*There's nothing I want more.*

4470
05:39:47,000 --> 05:39:50,000
*Time passes, and the party winds to a close.*

4471
05:39:50,000 --> 05:39:59,000
*Hifumi and Yue, spurred on by Marina, had a bit too much to drink. Now, all three of them are collapsed on the floor, fast asleep.*

4472
05:39:59,000 --> 05:40:04,000
*Cosmos and Ayu, meanwhile, are busy taking a bunch of photos together...*

4473
05:40:04,000 --> 05:40:09,000
*Well, to be more precise, Cosmos is taking a bunch of photos of her and Ayu.*

